 m<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ejAh-3PK?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ejAh-3PK</a> ","time":"3w","title":"National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice"},{"date":"2025-11-10T20:31:58.971Z","likes_count":10,"post_id":"7392565244901888001","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/latinainstitute_our-medicaid-policy-brief-is-making-the-news-activity-7392565244901888001-1XE_","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Our Medicaid policy brief is making the news! 🗞️ Check out this article from State Newsroom that highlights some key facts from the policy brief & details exactly what Medicaid – and cuts to this program – mean for our Latine communities! http://bit.ly/4opThOM","text_html":"Our Medicaid policy brief is making the news! &#x1F5DE;&#xFE0F; Check out this article from State Newsroom that highlights some key facts from the policy brief &amp; details exactly what Medicaid &#x2013; and cuts to this program &#x2013; mean for our Latine communities! <a class="link" href="http://bit.ly/4opThOM?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>http://bit.ly/4opThOM</a>","time":"1mo","title":"National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice"},{"date":"2025-11-10T20:31:58.975Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEPgTU9e3lucQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZow2mm9GYAw-/0/1761756212526?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=bvNPAFstEJupdFDWB3vbAd2l1qSYHfQurPpLLJTw90I","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEyLHu15zC4dQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZow2mnrKMA0-/0/1761756212756?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=2V_ZL07dSTtkiIGaQq5x1rEceFjfcNYlMFXZX8k52tU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFFEFOwY54ATQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZow2mn3GcAw-/0/1761756212739?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=MWnQ16FyhwgWBdk4xefbaKrOt3wix6S0vq9bcup2MHc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHuWeX5GpC7ZQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZow2moaGoAw-/0/1761756212786?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=GeIvXLY0h9skJRSIZ8QCDxfs3SLdpaAnD4EYFqzeIHI"],"likes_count":9,"post_id":"7389341137989312514","post_url":"https://es.linkedin.com/posts/latinainstitute_our-executive-director-lupe-m-r-speaks-activity-7389341137989312514-M3JD","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Our Executive Director Lupe M. R. speaks on our latest policy brief, “Medicaid: A Lifeline for Latines and Immigrants,” and what cuts to Medicaid would mean for the health, safety, and dignity of our communities. Our policy brief, which was just released earlier this week and is available in both English and Spanish, highlights the importance of Medicaid for Latines across the country. With Medicaid's precarious status, we examine the current barriers to Medicaid, the impact of the "One Big Beautiful Bill" on the program and our communities, and ways Congress and civil society can engage to safeguard and advance Medicaid. Read our full report here: https://lnkd.in/eGMF7WmH Nuestra directora ejecutiva, @lupemrodriguez, habla sobre nuestro nuevo informe de políticas, ‘Medicaid: Un salvavidas para latinos e inmigrantes", y sobre lo que los recortes a Medicaid significarán para la salud, dignidad y justicia de nuestras comunidades. Nuestro informe, publicado a principios de esta semana y disponible en inglés y español, destaca la importancia de Medicaid para la comunidad latine en todo el país. A través de la situación precaria de Medicaid, analizamos las barreras actuales para acceder al programa, el impacto de la Ley de Reforma de Medicaid (conocida como "One Big Beautiful Bill") en el programa y nuestras comunidades, y las maneras en que el Congreso y la sociedad civil pueden colaborar para proteger y fortalecer Medicaid. https://lnkd.in/eGWzbphp","text_html":"Our Executive Director <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/lupe-m-rodr%C3%ADguez?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lupe M. R.</a> speaks on our latest policy brief, &#x201C;Medicaid: A Lifeline for Latines and Immigrants,&#x201D; and what cuts to Medicaid would mean for the health, safety, and dignity of our communities. 

Our policy brief, which was just released earlier this week and is available in both English and Spanish, highlights the importance of Medicaid for Latines across the country. 

With Medicaid&apos;s precarious status, we examine the current barriers to Medicaid, the impact of the &quot;One Big Beautiful Bill&quot; on the program and our communities, and ways Congress and civil society can engage to safeguard and advance Medicaid.

Read our full report here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eGMF7WmH?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eGMF7WmH</a> 

Nuestra directora ejecutiva, @lupemrodriguez, habla sobre nuestro nuevo informe de pol&#xED;ticas, &#x2018;Medicaid: Un salvavidas para latinos e inmigrantes&quot;, y sobre lo que los recortes a Medicaid significar&#xE1;n para la salud, dignidad y justicia de nuestras comunidades.

Nuestro informe, publicado a principios de esta semana y disponible en ingl&#xE9;s y espa&#xF1;ol, destaca la importancia de Medicaid para la comunidad latine en todo el pa&#xED;s.

A trav&#xE9;s de la situaci&#xF3;n precaria de Medicaid, analizamos las barreras actuales para acceder al programa, el impacto de la Ley de Reforma de Medicaid (conocida como &quot;One Big Beautiful Bill&quot;) en el programa y nuestras comunidades, y las maneras en que el Congreso y la sociedad civil pueden colaborar para proteger y fortalecer Medicaid.

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eGWzbphp?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eGWzbphp</a> ","time":"1mo","title":"National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice"},{"date":"2025-11-10T20:31:58.977Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEJnCiJlFil0w/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoodXjZKYAg-/0/1761615388934?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=iIDeZq_BISFldSrua7IsRgQKYA8oJE245CaqAnlbjrI","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFRz2uto_YzUg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoodXjsHgAg-/0/1761615388877?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=WiRblCgXKgYDHiMHVw9l95CesWq4i7XcdeVllxqS4Ik","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEwu-5LOhcWvw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoodXj7KMAg-/0/1761615389399?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3fvTBW6yajEZmTP5pq7ELyCXbHa7ThnKDlF528SAQQ0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEZfD8ZylW-dw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoodXkyIMAg-/0/1761615389196?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=TlBv-kq1h5PxeffqqKKaUlKMlR7mgoKSsdDoc2dcPkM","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQE2GAG-xMKr5g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoodXk8KkAg-/0/1761615389124?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=dIwjTgWRciCXMXdDMOe-KdEyYPVQJspx5iRTZSZaSkQ"],"likes_count":21,"post_id":"7388750484607606784","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/latinainstitute_medicaid-is-a-critical-program-that-provides-activity-7388750484607606784-LKCB","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Medicaid is a critical program that provides access to care for millions, especially Latines, who make up nearly 1/3 of Medicaid enrollees. It’s also especially important for pregnant people and is the largest payer of reproductive health care services. Translation: cuts to Medicaid mean cuts to care, endangering our health and lives. Today, we released a groundbreaking new policy brief outlining exactly how critical Medicaid is for our Latine communities as a whole and within Latina Institute’s field bases. Wondering how you can get involved in the fight to save Medicaid? We want to hear your story of how Medicaid has helped you. And we also encourage you to share this post so others can also tell their stories! Head to our website to read our full report and share your Medicaid story. 🔗 https://lnkd.in/eGMF7WmH","text_html":"Medicaid is a critical program that provides access to care for millions, especially Latines, who make up nearly 1/3 of Medicaid enrollees. It&#x2019;s also especially important for pregnant people and is the largest payer of reproductive health care services. Translation: cuts to Medicaid mean cuts to care, endangering our health and lives.

Today, we released a groundbreaking new policy brief outlining exactly how critical Medicaid is for our Latine communities as a whole and within Latina Institute&#x2019;s field bases. 

Wondering how you can get involved in the fight to save Medicaid? We want to hear your story of how Medicaid has helped you. And we also encourage you to share this post so others can also tell their stories! 

Head to our website to read our full report and share your Medicaid story. &#x1F517;

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eGMF7WmH?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eGMF7WmH</a>  ","time":"1mo","title":"National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-11-10T20:31:58.981Z","likes_count":53,"post_id":"7384296555308138496","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/latinainstitute_request-for-proposals-affordable-healthcare-activity-7384296555308138496-1MQf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We are searching for an experienced campaign consultant/firm to create a campaign to make affordable health care for immigrant families a reality! National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice and National Asian Pacific American Women's Forum (NAPAWF) have released this request for proposals for a talented campaign strategist. Please send far and wide! Proposals are due on October 22, 2025. Questions and proposals should be emailed to RFP@NAPAWF.ORG with the subject line IMMIGRANT FAMILIES RFP. The RFP document can be viewed here on LinkedIn or accessed on the NAPAWF website at https://lnkd.in/eU5kZ8N6","text_html":"We are searching for an experienced campaign consultant/firm to create a campaign to make affordable health care for immigrant families a reality!

National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/napawf?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>National Asian Pacific American Women&apos;s Forum (NAPAWF)</a> have released this request for proposals for a talented campaign strategist. Please send far and wide! 

