From our Spain offices, we celebrated the upcoming Christmas holidays together, a moment to look back on everything we&#x2019;ve achieved together this year, appreciating the effort, dedication, and unity that define us&#x1F384;&#x1F4AB;

This year, our Xmas Hampers come through our collaboration with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pekata?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Pekata</a>, a company that works closely with Special Employment Centres (CEE) and has an agreement with Grupo SIFU. These initiatives are aligned with our commitment to creating a positive impact.

Wishing you all a Merry Christmas and a joyful holiday season! &#x1F381;&#x1F499;

