Read more about how Anthony and other Disneyland cast members create happiness every day: <a class="link" href="http://di.sn/6042C85lm?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>http://di.sn/6042C85lm</a> &#x2728; ","time":"2w","title":"Disneyland Resort"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-12-12T11:30:57.807Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQGpEKL8y0zsGg/image-shrink_800/B56ZsN_TPFIkAg-/0/1765466257056?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=V7gUU9CAZ3iDgjElVsRdV3P-tEW1a14UC7dpyP1k74o"],"likes_count":452,"post_id":"7404927957686923265","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/disneyland-resort_working-at-disney-has-been-an-absolute-dream-activity-7404927957686923265-X3bf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"“Working at Disney has been an absolute dream come true! When I was little and found out my mom had worked here growing up, I knew I’d want to follow in her footsteps, and this past year has been a full-circle moment! I’ve met so many amazing people and have grown so much! I love interacting with the guests and always try to add a little more magic to their day! Spreading kindness and positivity is one of my favorite parts! I truly can’t wait to see what my future holds here at Disney and what could come next!”✨ 📸: Lyrik, Attractions Cast members, submit your photos for a chance to be featured! http://di.sn/6048C8eYe🤳","text_html":"&#x201C;Working at Disney has been an absolute dream come true! When I was little and found out my mom had worked here growing up, I knew I&#x2019;d want to follow in her footsteps, and this past year has been a full-circle moment! I&#x2019;ve met so many amazing people and have grown so much! I love interacting with the guests and always try to add a little more magic to their day! Spreading kindness and positivity is one of my favorite parts! I truly can&#x2019;t wait to see what my future holds here at Disney and what could come next!&#x201D;&#x2728;

&#x1F4F8;: Lyrik, Attractions

Cast members, submit your photos for a chance to be featured! <a class="link" href="http://di.sn/6048C8eYe&#x1F933;?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>http://di.sn/6048C8eYe&#x1F933;</a>","time":"3w","title":"Disneyland Resort"},{"date":"2025-12-12T11:30:57.808Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQFQniInC-KT2g/image-shrink_1280/B4EZsJGpQvHEAM-/0/1765384296218?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=OcjbQaJk3qMDwvA4LL04dSykeJGxUZuXW3zpjg47G8A"],"likes_count":137,"post_id":"7404565577878364160","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/disneyland-resort_disneycastlife-activity-7404565577878364160-b4mJ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Cast member Evamaria: Then & Now! ✨ Kicking off her journey with the Disney College Program in 2013, Evamaria found joy in creating happiness for guests from around the world, inspiring her to continue her Disney career. Following her program, she transitioned to Outdoor Vending, leading and training her fellow cast members while serving iconic sweet treats. She also helped introduce new cast members to the magic as a Traditions facilitator. Today, she continues to support behind-the-scenes as a content specialist on the Global Documentation team, where she helps to develop and maintain cast member online training programs. Evamaria shares, “I am excited to see what the future holds and what other ways I can make magic for our guests and fellow cast members.” 💜 #DisneyCastLife","text_html":"Cast member Evamaria: Then &amp; Now! &#x2728; Kicking off her journey with the Disney College Program in 2013, Evamaria found joy in creating happiness for guests from around the world, inspiring her to continue her Disney career. Following her program, she transitioned to Outdoor Vending, leading and training her fellow cast members while serving iconic sweet treats. She also helped introduce new cast members to the magic as a Traditions facilitator. Today, she continues to support behind-the-scenes as a content specialist on the Global Documentation team, where she helps to develop and maintain cast member online training programs.

Evamaria shares, &#x201C;I am excited to see what the future holds and what other ways I can make magic for our guests and fellow cast members.&#x201D; &#x1F49C; <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdisneycastlife&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DisneyCastLife</a>","time":"3w","title":"Disneyland Resort"}]

