Will has just wrapped up his second year as a Heavy Duty Diesel Mechanic in our Mackay component rebuild workshop. 

He earned this award through his strong commitment to safety, pride in his workmanship, and a can-do attitude that sees him step up to every challenge.

Will joined us as a mature-aged apprentice after starting his career at Bunnings &#x2013; and the talent clearly runs in the family, with his dad working in our Brisbane office as a Maintenance Specialist.

Well done, Will, and congratulations to all our incredible apprentices across Australia.","time":"3w","title":"Emeco Group"}]

[{"date":"2025-12-23T18:54:38.679Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQG4TLP791jhZg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZsmsKEdIYAo-/0/1765880670506?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=rKeoeurVVAkQJlYn4foXHj2C3uv2NeyirJubgurBsS8"],"likes_count":30,"post_id":"7408771241609924609","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sky-czech-republic_lifeatskyczech-skyczechrepublic-streamingtech-activity-7408771241609924609-rbsI","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"At Sky Czech Republic, we build streaming tech that never stops. But we do. 🎄 Behind every buffer-free stream is a team that logs off, recharges, and spends time with the people who matter most. Thanks to everyone who shipped features, squashed bugs, and kept things running this year. Wishing you a holiday filled with connection: the offline kind. See you in 2026. 😎 #LifeAtSkyCzech #SkyCzechRepublic #StreamingTech #DevelopersOfSky","text_html":"At Sky Czech Republic, we build streaming tech that never stops. But we do. &#x1F384;

Behind every buffer-free stream is a team that logs off, recharges, and spends time with the people who matter most.

Thanks to everyone who shipped features, squashed bugs, and kept things running this year. Wishing you a holiday filled with connection: the offline kind.

See you in 2026. &#x1F60E;

