gged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"New traditions have to start somewhere. For Sky Czech Republic, it started with Maria Zghurska and her team last Thursday. 🎁 Our first Secret Santa brought home-baked treats, real conversations, and gifts that actually landed. Maria built a webapp to guide the gift-giving—but Oleh had his own ideas, ignoring Jan Panáček 's directions entirely and nailing it anyway. The lesson? Sometimes the best gifts come from knowing people, not algorithms. Here's to the teammates who make work feel less like work. #LifeAtSkyCzech #TeamCulture #SecretSanta","text_html":"New traditions have to start somewhere. For Sky Czech Republic, it started with <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/maria-zghurska-649358297?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Maria Zghurska</a> and her team last Thursday. &#x1F381;

Our first Secret Santa brought home-baked treats, real conversations, and gifts that actually landed. Maria built a webapp to guide the gift-giving&#x2014;but Oleh had his own ideas, ignoring <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/jpanacek?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jan Pan&#xE1;&#x10D;ek</a>&apos;s directions entirely and nailing it anyway.

The lesson? Sometimes the best gifts come from knowing people, not algorithms.

Here&apos;s to the teammates who make work feel less like work.

