<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flifeatskyczech&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LifeAtSkyCzech</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftechcommunity&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TechCommunity</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fczpodcast&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CZPodcast</a>&#xA0;","time":"2w","title":"Sky Czech Republic"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-16T18:54:38.694Z","likes_count":35,"post_id":"7404805122696069120","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sky-czech-republic_lifeatskyczech-techcommunity-czpodcast-activity-7404805122696069120-mTtG","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Some moments are just too good not to replay. 🎥 Last Thursday, our office turned into a podcast studio for the CZPodcast Christmas edition. Roman Pichlik and Jiri Fabian hosted nearly three hours of AI conversations with Marek Paris , Marek Jalovec , Dusan Kovacic , Vojta Rocek , and our own Jan Špitálník and we thought you'd want a sneak peek. This is just a glimpse of what went down: the packed room, the honest debates, the moments that got everyone laughing. The full episode is coming soon, but here's a taste of why we're still talking about this evening a week later. #LifeAtSkyCzech #TechCommunity #CZPodcast","text_html":"Some moments are just too good not to replay. &#x1F3A5;

Last Thursday, our office turned into a podcast studio for the CZPodcast Christmas edition. <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/romanpichlik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Roman Pichlik</a> and <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/jirifabian?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jiri Fabian</a> hosted nearly three hours of AI conversations with <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/marekparis?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Marek Paris</a>, <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/marekjalovec?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Marek Jalovec</a>, <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/kovacicdusan?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dusan Kovacic</a>, <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/vojtarocek?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Vojta Rocek</a>, and our own <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/spitalnik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jan &#x160;pit&#xE1;ln&#xED;k</a> and we thought you&apos;d want a sneak peek.

This is just a glimpse of what went down: the packed room, the honest debates, the moments that got everyone laughing. The full episode is coming soon, but here&apos;s a taste of why we&apos;re still talking about this evening a week later.

