ed_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"The best part of any team? The people! Monday night was our Sky Czech Christmas party, a chance to step away from screens, celebrate together, and yes, watch colleagues throw fake casino money in the air for the perfect photo 📸 🎬 💸 Behind every release, code review, and late-night bug fix are the people in these photos bringing energy, expertise, and genuine teamwork to everything we build. #LifeAtSkyCzech #TeamCulture #ChristmasParty","text_html":"The best part of any team? The people!

Monday night was our Sky Czech Christmas party, a chance to step away from screens, celebrate together, and yes, watch colleagues throw fake casino money in the air for the perfect photo &#x1F4F8; &#x1F3AC; &#x1F4B8; 

Behind every release, code review, and late-night bug fix are the people in these photos bringing energy, expertise, and genuine teamwork to everything we build.

