ought together Marek Paris , Marek Jalovec , Dusan Kovacic , Vojta Rocek , and our very own Jan Špitálník for discussions that were insightful, honest, and at times properly entertaining. The room was packed, people were clearly enjoying themselves, and the energy was exactly what we hoped for. Watching these voices from the CZ tech scene share their perspectives and challenge each other's thinking that's the kind of evening we love hosting. Thanks to everyone who came over and made it such a great night! #LifeAtSkyCzech #TechCommunity #AI #CzechTech","text_html":"Last Thursday night, our office turned into a podcast studio for the Christmas edition of the legendary CZPodcast. &#x1F384;

<a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/romanpichlik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Roman Pichlik</a> and <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/jirifabian?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jiri Fabian</a> absolutely nailed it as hosts and almost three hours of conversations about AI felt effortless and engaging. They brought together <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/marekparis?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Marek Paris</a>, <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/marekjalovec?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Marek Jalovec</a>, <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/kovacicdusan?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dusan Kovacic</a>, <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/vojtarocek?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Vojta Rocek</a>, and our very own <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/spitalnik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jan &#x160;pit&#xE1;ln&#xED;k</a> for discussions that were insightful, honest, and at times properly entertaining.

The room was packed, people were clearly enjoying themselves, and the energy was exactly what we hoped for. Watching these voices from the CZ tech scene share their perspectives and challenge each other&apos;s thinking that&apos;s the kind of evening we love hosting.

Thanks to everyone who came over and made it such a great night!

