followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["Engineering Manager at Sky"],"repost_id":"7401921913658216448","repost_text":"🎉 Welcome to the Team, Adam! 🤝 Big news this week: we officially welcomed a new member to the Sky Czech Republic team. Time for a team lunch! 🥳 We chose to host the team lunch right here in the office, ensuring a calm and comfortable environment. It was the perfect opportunity to relax, enjoy good food, and properly introduce ourselves to Adam. Welcome to the team, Adam Weinzettl ! We are excited to build the future of Sky with you. Let the adventures begin. 🚀 #LifeAtSkyCzech #DevelopersOfSky #TeamCulture","repost_title":"Martin Petrus","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://cz.linkedin.com/company/sky-czech-republic?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Sky Czech Republic"}],"tagged_users":[{"link":"https://cz.linkedin.com/in/adamweinzettl?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Adam Weinzettl"}],"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Love seeing the team making the most of our office space! Nothing beats a cozy newcomer welcome lunch in the homezone – good food, great company, and the perfect way to kick off someone's journey with us 😊 #LifeAtSkyCzech #OfficeLife #Newcomer","text_html":"Love seeing the team making the most of our office space! Nothing beats a cozy newcomer welcome lunch in the homezone &#x2013; good food, great company, and the perfect way to kick off someone&apos;s journey with us &#x1F60A;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flifeatskyczech&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LifeAtSkyCzech</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fofficelife&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#OfficeLife</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnewcomer&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Newcomer</a>","time":"3w 3w","title":"Sky Czech Republic"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-03-18T18:54:38.716Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQG5DXARmDUCEg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZrVqnj6I8Ag-/0/1764521313693?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eDPsl9bdjmJXnWsyZndkPjpgFky1kXzIKVHcMWZKahs"],"likes_count":17,"post_id":"7401614568197861376","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sky-czech-republic_lifeatskyczech-techleadership-learning-activity-7401614568197861376-wAEq","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQG5DXARmDUCEg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZrVqnj6I8Ag-/0/1764521313693?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eDPsl9bdjmJXnWsyZndkPjpgFky1kXzIKVHcMWZKahs"],"repost_date":"2025-11-30T18:54:38.716Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["Senior Engineering Manager| Getting things done | Engineering & automation | AWS | Azure | Architecture | Networking | GenAI | DevOps | Kubernetes | Application Integration | Analytics & BI"],"repost_id":"7400938807656841216","repost_text":"After 16 months of study, I’m happy to share that I’ve completed the Digital MBA with CTO Academy. For years I thought my next step would be an Executive MBA at a big-name university like Cambridge – that’s always been a dream. But when I looked at the time commitment (onsite and offsite) and the cost, it didn’t feel right for me now. I also knew I wanted something very close to technology and CTO-level work, not a general business program. With many years of experience in tech & leadership, I could relate to most of the topics in the Digital MBA. It pushed me to learn, unlearn and relearn how I think about organisations, strategy and execution. The content is strongly anchored in technology leadership, and each module connected to real situations a CTO or senior tech leader faces. Almost every week there was a session with an industry leader, covering topics from legal and finance to product, people and strategy, which made the theory very practical. The community was just as valuable as the lectures. Peer discussions, active Slack channels and 1:1 conversations with other members created real networking, even online. The mentors at CTO Academy were generous with their time and questions, helping me see blind spots and think more clearly about my next steps. Even though it’s an online program, it still required serious commitment: 16 months to complete the 9 modules with 250 lectures, and I’ll likely spend another 6–8 months going through all the reference materials, white papers, newsletters and case studies. The content stays very close to current industry trends and challenges, which is essential for tech leaders making decisions across product, engineering and the wider business. Going forward, I’m looking forward to staying active in the CTO Academy community and sharing what I’ve learned with other tech leaders in the Prague TechExec community. Huge thanks to the entire CTO Academy team, Lecturers, the mentors and my fellow participants for building and supporting such a relevant and practical program. #CTOAcademy - Andrew Weaver & Jason Noble Julian Costley Lucy-Rose Walker Sanjay Mistry Gus Power Dianna Pieper, MSc.","repost_title":"Venkatesh Durai, MBA","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":[{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com/in/andrewweaver66?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Andrew Weaver"},{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com/in/noblejason?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Jason Noble"},{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com/in/juliancostley?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Julian Costley"},{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com/in/lucyrosewalker?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Lucy-Rose Walker"},{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com/in/sanjaymistry42?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Sanjay Mistry"},{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com/in/guspower?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Gus Power"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/diannapieper?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Dianna Pieper, MSc."}],"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Proud to see our colleague Venkatesh Durai investing in his growth and completing the Digital MBA with CTO Academy. 👏 At Sky Czech Republic, this kind of curiosity and tech-focused leadership helps us grow stronger teams and a more vibrant tech community in Prague and beyond. #LifeAtSkyCzech #TechLeadership #Learning","text_html":"Proud to see our colleague <a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/venkateshd1?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Venkatesh Durai</a> investing in his growth and completing the Digital MBA with CTO Academy. &#x1F44F;

At Sky Czech Republic, this kind of curiosity and tech-focused leadership helps us grow stronger teams and a more vibrant tech community in Prague and beyond.

