f engineer every team wants. He ships solid work, brings fresh ideas, and steps up when it matters most. His F1 multicams Hackathon prototype? That was pure creativity in action. Most recently, Roman led the NBA Scorecard launch from start to finish. When requirements shifted mid-project, he stayed composed. When teams needed coordinating, he made it happen. The result? A smooth, on-time delivery that the whole team is proud of. Roman's reliability, initiative, and expanding end-to-end ownership have made a real difference. We couldn't be prouder. Huge congratulations, Roman. Here's to everything you'll build next. 🚀 #LifeAtSkyCzech #DevelopersOfSky #TeamCulture","text_html":"<a class="link" href="https://cz.linkedin.com/in/romanauersvald?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Roman Auersvald</a> is the kind of engineer who makes things happen consistently, calmly, and with real ownership. And now, we&apos;re celebrating his promotion to Developer on our Apple TV Byte Club team &#x1F389;

Since joining us, Roman has grown into exactly the kind of engineer every team wants. He ships solid work, brings fresh ideas, and steps up when it matters most.

His F1 multicams Hackathon prototype? That was pure creativity in action.
Most recently, Roman led the NBA Scorecard launch from start to finish. When requirements shifted mid-project, he stayed composed. When teams needed coordinating, he made it happen. The result? A smooth, on-time delivery that the whole team is proud of.

Roman&apos;s reliability, initiative, and expanding end-to-end ownership have made a real difference. We couldn&apos;t be prouder.

Huge congratulations, Roman. Here&apos;s to everything you&apos;ll build next. &#x1F680;

