join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fencchildhunger&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EncChildHunger</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmakeadifference&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MakeADifference</a>","time":"1w","title":"Mary's Meals"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-26T13:32:29.277Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHBagA3LrtPfw/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZtGrvZBIwAw-/0/1766417431037?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=DqEBn_Ig9sQOth_1F_VboiZpI8T89nwY2GS4dNyQtbc"],"likes_count":47,"post_id":"7408891699948638209","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/mary%27s-meals_today-wed-like-to-highlight-one-of-our-exciting-activity-7408891699948638209-Mpjk","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Today we’d like to highlight one of our exciting partnerships between Q for Quinn and Mary's Meals Canada ! Q for Quinn is a family-owned Canadian 🍁 brand that makes safer, softer basics. They believe that what we wear should support the health of the person wearing it, the makers who create it, and the planet we all share.🌎 With this partnership, Q for Quinn has pledged to donate 1 school meal for every pair of socks 🧦 purchased! This year, through their Giving Sale they were able to donate 30,000 school meals. This remarkable achievement brings the total amount of school meals donated through this partnership to over 509,000! The founder, Melita Cyril shares her motivations for supporting Mary’s Meals: "Growing up in Sri Lanka, where poverty is widespread, has helped me truly appreciate how fortunate my children and I are. My children will never learn or understand what it means to go to school hungry, or not be able to go to school at all. What they can learn is the importance of giving back to other children that are less fortunate." 🩵 Thank you to Q for Quinn for your support, we are incredibly grateful for your commitment to the children we serve together. 🩵 Everyone can have a role to play in achieving our vision that every child receives one daily meal in a place of education. Interested in setting up a partnership with Mary’s Meals? Click the link below to learn more! https://bit.ly/4j6ld8C","text_html":"Today we&#x2019;d like to highlight one of our exciting partnerships between <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/q-for-quinn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Q for Quinn</a> and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/marys-meals-canada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mary&apos;s Meals Canada</a>! Q for Quinn is a family-owned Canadian &#x1F341; brand that makes safer, softer basics. They believe that what we wear should support the health of the person wearing it, the makers who create it, and the planet we all share.&#x1F30E;

With this partnership, Q for Quinn has pledged to donate 1 school meal for every pair of socks &#x1F9E6; purchased! This year, through their Giving Sale they were able to donate 30,000 school meals. This remarkable achievement brings the total amount of school meals donated through this partnership to over 509,000!

The founder, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/melitacyril?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Melita Cyril</a> shares her motivations for supporting Mary&#x2019;s Meals: &quot;Growing up in Sri Lanka, where poverty is widespread, has helped me truly appreciate how fortunate my children and I are. My children will never learn or understand what it means to go to school hungry, or not be able to go to school at all. What they can learn is the importance of giving back to other children that are less fortunate.&quot;

&#x1FA75; &#xA0;Thank you to <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/q-for-quinn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Q for Quinn</a> for your support, we are incredibly grateful for your commitment to the children we serve together. &#x1FA75;

Everyone can have a role to play in achieving our vision that every child receives one daily meal in a place of education. Interested in setting up a partnership with Mary&#x2019;s Meals? Click the link below to learn more!

