z2o4kY3RxwmgEw3XU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQF2gXcS0ys7sg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4DZsx5OFkIgAg-/0/1766068654045?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Z-a79XDlFsIE0TW6sCrgwuMwKQHbPmxjyalcphls5jk"],"likes_count":611,"post_id":"7407428831617208320","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/phoenixgroupse_phoenix-group-christmas-townhall-2025-activity-7407428831617208320-0qrA","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🎄 PHOENIX group Christmas Townhall 2025 🎄 How do you celebrate a successful year with colleagues across 29 countries? By coming together — virtually and in person — to share success stories, gratitude for your colleagues, and a clear way ahead for 2026. Yesterday, we hosted our traditional Christmas Townhall, live from our HQ in Mannheim, and it was truly special. The strong participation of colleagues from across Europe showed that at PHOENIX - whether working in a warehouse, a pharmacy, or an office - we enjoy celebrating our collective achievements together. A big thank you to our Executive Board members Sven Seidel , Dr. Carsten Sauerland , Steve Anderson , and Stefan Herfeld for their insightful updates and for answering questions from colleagues near and far.","text_html":"&#xA0;
&#x1F384;&#xA0;PHOENIX group Christmas Townhall 2025 &#x1F384;
&#xA0;
How do you celebrate a successful year with colleagues across 29 countries?
By coming together &#x2014; virtually and in person &#x2014; to share success stories, gratitude for your colleagues, and a clear way&#xA0;ahead for 2026.
&#xA0;
Yesterday, we hosted our traditional Christmas Townhall, live from our HQ in Mannheim, and it was truly special. The strong participation of colleagues from across Europe showed that at PHOENIX - whether working in a warehouse, a pharmacy, or an office - we enjoy celebrating our&#xA0;collective achievements together.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
A big thank you to our Executive Board members <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/sven-seidel-4a1842112?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sven Seidel</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/dr-carsten-sauerland-2888a990?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dr. Carsten Sauerland</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/steve-anderson-b85aa115?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Steve Anderson</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/stefan-herfeld-8044a422?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stefan Herfeld</a>&#xA0;for their insightful updates and for answering questions from colleagues near and far.","time":"2w","title":"PHOENIX group - Integrated Healthcare Provider"},{"date":"2025-12-19T11:43:57.781Z","likes_count":71,"post_id":"7406996611580469248","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/phoenixgroupse_celebrating-excellence-in-pharmaceutical-activity-7406996611580469248-FppQ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Celebrating Excellence in Pharmaceutical Research! 🏆 For the 28th time, PHOENIX has presented the PHOENIX Pharmaceutical Science Award – one of the most prestigious honors for pharmaceutical research in the German-speaking countries. With a total prize value of €40,000, the award recognizes outstanding scientific achievements from Germany, Austria, and Switzerland. This year’s laureates represent excellence across all major fields of pharmaceutical science, from biology and chemistry to pharmacology and technology. 👏 Congratulations to our 2025 award winners: 🥇 Prof. Dr. Dr. Achim Schmidtko – Goethe University Frankfurt 🥇 Prof. Dr. Alexander Weng – Freie Universität Berlin 🥇 Prof. Dr. Gisbert Schneider – ETH Zurich 🥇 JunProf. Dr. Philipp Uhl – Heidelberg University Our jury visited each university to present the awards in person, accompanied by a film crew that captured exclusive insights into the researchers’ groundbreaking work. 🎥 🎥 Watch the video directly in this post!","text_html":"Celebrating Excellence in Pharmaceutical Research!&#xA0;&#x1F3C6; 

For the 28th time, PHOENIX has presented the PHOENIX Pharmaceutical&#xA0;Science Award &#x2013; one of the most prestigious honors for pharmaceutical research in the German-speaking countries. With a total prize value of &#x20AC;40,000, the award recognizes outstanding scientific achievements from Germany, Austria, and Switzerland. 

This year&#x2019;s laureates&#xA0;represent&#xA0;excellence across all major fields of pharmaceutical science, from biology and chemistry to pharmacology and technology. 

&#x1F44F;&#xA0;Congratulations to our 2025 award winners:&#xA0;
&#x1F947;&#xA0;Prof. Dr. Dr. Achim Schmidtko &#x2013; Goethe University Frankfurt&#xA0;
&#x1F947;&#xA0;Prof. Dr. Alexander Weng &#x2013; Freie Universit&#xE4;t Berlin&#xA0;
&#x1F947;&#xA0;Prof. Dr. Gisbert Schneider &#x2013; ETH Zurich&#xA0;
&#x1F947;&#xA0;JunProf. Dr. Philipp Uhl &#x2013; Heidelberg University&#xA0;
Our jury visited each university to present the awards in person, accompanied by a film crew that captured exclusive insights into the researchers&#x2019; groundbreaking work.&#xA0;&#x1F3A5; 

