ed_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🌟 Celebrating LEAN Excellence Across Borders! 🌍 Congratulations to our colleagues in the Netherlands and in Belgium for winning a national Kaizen Award! The recognition is part of the Global Kaizen Awards framework and celebrates excellence in applying lean principles and embracing continuous improvement. 🏆 🎉 The external awards mark another milestone on PHOENIX’ LEAN journey we began two years ago. ✨Having already won the PHOENIX internal LEAN Award, our Dutch Brocacef colleagues also took home the “Excellence in Growth Award” at the Kaizen Awards Netherlands. They were awarded for applying the LEAN principles and linking this to tangible results. Kaizen praised the proactive management of challenges, the LEAN mindset of continuous improvement, and the implementation of smarter processes that result in better service for our customers. ✨ PHOENIX Pharma Belgium also leads by example. 🇧🇪➡️🇫🇷 As there is no award ceremony in Belgium, they participated and won the Kaizen Award for “Warehouse Performance” in France. 🏆 This achievement makes us particularly proud. The work of our Belgian colleagues is now recognised even across borders. Following their honourable mention at the PHOENIX internal LEAN Award, the team has truly taken operational excellence to the next level. 👏 Well done team Brocacef and team PHOENIX Pharma Belgium . Everybody, Everyday, Everywhere! 🌟","text_html":"&#x1F31F; Celebrating LEAN Excellence Across Borders! &#x1F30D;

Congratulations to our colleagues in the Netherlands and in Belgium for winning a national Kaizen Award! The recognition is part of the Global Kaizen Awards framework and celebrates excellence in applying lean principles and embracing continuous improvement. &#x1F3C6; 

&#x1F389; The external awards mark another milestone on PHOENIX&#x2019; LEAN journey we began two years ago.

&#x2728;Having already won the PHOENIX internal LEAN Award, our Dutch <a class="link" href="https://nl.linkedin.com/company/brocacef?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Brocacef</a> colleagues also took home the &#x201C;Excellence in Growth Award&#x201D; at the Kaizen Awards Netherlands. They were awarded for applying the LEAN principles and linking this to tangible results. Kaizen praised the proactive management of challenges, the LEAN mindset of continuous improvement, and the implementation of smarter processes that result in better service for our customers.

&#x2728;<a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/phoenixpharmabelgium?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>PHOENIX Pharma Belgium</a> also leads by example. &#x1F1E7;&#x1F1EA;&#x27A1;&#xFE0F;&#x1F1EB;&#x1F1F7; 
As there is no award ceremony in Belgium, they participated and won the Kaizen Award for &#x201C;Warehouse Performance&#x201D; in France. &#x1F3C6; This achievement makes us particularly proud. The work of our Belgian colleagues is now recognised even across borders. Following their honourable mention at the PHOENIX internal LEAN Award, the team has truly taken operational excellence to the next level.

&#x1F44F; Well done team <a class="link" href="https://nl.linkedin.com/company/brocacef?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Brocacef</a> and team <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/phoenixpharmabelgium?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>PHOENIX Pharma Belgium</a>. Everybody, Everyday, Everywhere! &#x1F31F;
