ities performed on-site. 👏 We are excited about what is ahead 🚀 and look forward to sharing more updates from CTS as we continue to grow and innovate across Europe. 🌟","text_html":"&#x1F30D;&#xA0;One Source. 29 Markets. Collective Power.

We just came across these pictures from the recent opening of our Clinical Trial Services hub&#xA0;in Ede, the Netherlands&#xA0;&#x1F1F3;&#x1F1F1;.&#xA0;We are proud to look back on a successful start and how much has already been achieved since then:

&#x1F48A;PHOENIX&#xA0;CTS&#xA0;supports customers across Europe with comprehensive services in comparator sourcing and ancillary supply, GMP repackaging and labelling, depot and distribution, pharmacy services, and patient recruitment. Through our CTS Hub, customers benefit from greater efficiency, reliable delivery, and full GDP/GMP compliance across 29 European markets.&#xA0;&#x1F91D;

A special thank you goes to&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/stefan-herfeld-8044a422?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stefan Herfeld</a>, who recently visited the CTS Hub and was particularly impressed by the GMP activities performed on-site.&#xA0;&#x1F44F;
We are excited about what is ahead&#xA0;&#x1F680;&#xA0;
and look forward to sharing more updates from&#xA0;CTS&#xA0;as we continue to grow and innovate across Europe.&#xA0;&#x1F31F;","time":"1mo Edited","title":"PHOENIX group - Integrated Healthcare Provider"},{"comments_count":4,"date":"2025-12-03T11:43:57.799Z","likes_count":151,"post_id":"7394685622474665984","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7394685622474665984/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"✨ A powerful moment of community: Our hybrid autumn Town Hall brought together hundreds of IT colleagues from across Europe. Together, we showcased cross-country collaboration, digital expertise, and passion for driving healthcare transformation. This time, we focused on three key areas shaping our digital roadmap: 🚀 Increasing our operational excellence through the rollout of LEAN in IT, with first teams already conducting value stream analyses to improve workflows and enhance collaboration. 🏗️ Strengthening our foundation by modernising the tech landscape that powers our business operations, ensuring reliability and readiness for innovation. 💡Unlocking new business opportunities through smart solutions like the conversational AI by gesund.de , showing how intelligent automation can create real value for patients and partners. A big thank you to Kerstin Bechtold , Peter Schreiner , Lutz Schütte , André Egerer , Sebastian Ring , Joern Grahl , Tobias Bucher , Antimo Giulio D'Amato , and their teams for their outstanding contributions. And heartfelt appreciation to all colleagues who joined us! 🙌 I am already looking forward to our next Town Hall in December, a perfect opportunity to celebrate our shared successes and continue building the digital future of PHOENIX group - Integrated Healthcare Provider . #wePHOENIX #DigitalTransformation #LEAN #Innovation #HealthcareIT","text_html":"&#x2728; A powerful moment of community:

Our hybrid autumn Town Hall brought together hundreds of IT colleagues from across Europe. Together, we showcased cross-country collaboration, digital expertise, and passion for driving healthcare transformation.

This time, we focused on three key areas shaping our digital roadmap:

&#x1F680; Increasing our operational excellence through the rollout of LEAN in IT, with first teams already conducting value stream analyses to improve workflows and enhance collaboration.

&#x1F3D7;&#xFE0F; Strengthening our foundation by modernising the tech landscape that powers our business operations, ensuring reliability and readiness for innovation.

&#x1F4A1;Unlocking new business opportunities through smart solutions like the conversational AI by <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/showcase/gesund.de/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>gesund.de</a>, showing how intelligent automation can create real value for patients and partners.

A big thank you to <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/kerstin-bechtold-002b0666?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kerstin Bechtold</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/peter-schreiner-18423323?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Peter Schreiner</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/lutzs1?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lutz Sch&#xFC;tte</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/andr%C3%A9-egerer-91a483bb?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Andr&#xE9; Egerer</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/sebastian-ring-02233910a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sebastian Ring</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/joern-grahl-analytics?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Joern Grahl</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/tobiasbucher?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Tobias Bucher</a>, <a class="link" href="https://it.linkedin.com/in/antimo-giulio-d-amato-22766b8?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Antimo Giulio D&apos;Amato</a>, and their teams for their outstanding contributions. And heartfelt appreciation to all colleagues who joined us! &#x1F64C;

I am already looking forward to our next Town Hall in December, a perfect opportunity to celebrate our shared successes and continue building the digital future of <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/phoenixgroupse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>PHOENIX group - Integrated Healthcare Provider</a>.

