&#x394;&#x3B5;&#x3AF;&#x3C4;&#x3B5; &#x3C0;&#x3CE;&#x3C2; &#x3B1;&#x3BB;&#x3BB;&#x3AC;&#x3B6;&#x3B5;&#x3B9; &#x3B7; &#x3C0;&#x3CC;&#x3BB;&#x3B7; &#x3B1;&#x3C0;&#x3CC; &#x3BC;&#x3AD;&#x3C3;&#x3B1; &#x3C0;&#x3C1;&#x3BF;&#x3C2; &#x3C4;&#x3B1; &#x3AD;&#x3BE;&#x3C9;.","time":"2w","title":"EYDAP","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5605AQHc50DgUcUHeA/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B56ZswRM.mJ8CI-/0/1766041398053?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=f3yu44inbkE11VgI0DfgaLEI3P_GxjMLYvy6VTn2_aM","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5605AQHc50DgUcUHeA/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B56ZswRM.mJ8Bw-/0/1766041389856?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ght6gWn3CVK78yAVvSDEBA4F67Xo4O5MOBZFfGKlmbc"]},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-19T11:50:45.999Z","likes_count":48,"post_id":"7406988867590848512","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7406988867590848512/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Athens is turning to advanced water technology to build resilience in the face of climate pressures. A new decentralised sewer mining unit, developed with EYDAP and the National Technical University of Athens, treats wastewater directly within the urban environment. The system filters and disinfects up to 25 m³ of water per day for safe reuse in irrigation, aquifer recharge and other non-potable applications. It operates autonomously with solar power and is built using recyclable and natural materials. What makes the approach even more powerful is its integration with a regional digital twin of Attica. Sensor data flows from the unit into this high-resolution 3D model, allowing real-time monitoring, scenario testing and long-term planning for climatic pressures. Together, these technologies demonstrate how circular water systems and digital innovation can support sustainable resource management, not only for Athens but for regions across Europe. To learn more, watch our latest video explaining this technology. Our partners: Eurecat - Technology Centre | Athens University of Economics and Business | EYDAP | Berliner Wasserbetriebe | Institute for Renewable Energy – Eurac Research | Institute for Regional Development – Eurac Research | ESCI - European Science Communication Institute | GCF - Global Climate Forum e.V. | IUCN | Kompetenzzentrum Wasser Berlin | KWR Water Research Institute | Lobelia Earth | CIHEAM-Chania | Hellenic Ministry of Environment and Energy | Mantis Beyond Innovation | Waterjade | Mountain Research Initiative (MRI) | Nelen & Schuurmans | National Technical University of Athens | Athens University of Economics and Business | Senatsverwaltung für Mobilität, Verkehr, Klimaschutz und Umwelt | Sustainable Development Solutions Network | Thetis S.p.a. | UiT- The Arctic University of Norway | Universitat Rovira i Virgili | Universitat de Girona | Water & Energy Intelligence BV | Zemgale Planning Region","text_html":"Athens&#xA0;is&#xA0;turning&#xA0;to&#xA0;advanced&#xA0;water&#xA0;technology&#xA0;to build&#xA0;resilience&#xA0;in the face of&#xA0;climate&#xA0;pressures.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
A new&#xA0;decentralised&#xA0;sewer&#xA0;mining&#xA0;unit,&#xA0;developed&#xA0;with EYDAP and the National Technical University of&#xA0;Athens,&#xA0;treats&#xA0;wastewater&#xA0;directly&#xA0;within&#xA0;the urban&#xA0;environment. The system filters and&#xA0;disinfects&#xA0;up to 25 m&#xB3; of water per day for safe&#xA0;reuse&#xA0;in&#xA0;irrigation,&#xA0;aquifer&#xA0;recharge&#xA0;and&#xA0;other&#xA0;non-potable&#xA0;applications.&#xA0;It&#xA0;operates&#xA0;autonomously&#xA0;with solar power and&#xA0;is&#xA0;built&#xA0;using&#xA0;recyclable&#xA0;and&#xA0;natural&#xA0;materials.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
What&#xA0;makes the&#xA0;approach&#xA0;even&#xA0;more&#xA0;powerful&#xA0;is&#xA0;its&#xA0;integration&#xA0;with a&#xA0;regional&#xA0;digital&#xA0;twin of Attica. Sensor data flows from the&#xA0;unit&#xA0;into&#xA0;this&#xA0;high-resolution&#xA0;3D model,&#xA0;allowing&#xA0;real-time monitoring, scenario testing and long-term&#xA0;planning for&#xA0;climatic&#xA0;pressures.&#xA0;
