UnDNE6ZQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZUAUXzMHcAw-/0/1739467099946?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=TPy4sWo2xi2KwY--7_YZ4dqBwp6WsOH37BQV2dg-cos","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHQqTVpexKM_A/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZUAUXyqGgAg-/0/1739467096328?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=PD1LLd5LDO3IcbRQdkpCXbAQEopjr1MaemE8EXHJg6M"],"likes_count":23,"post_id":"7295853848802283520","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/nationwide-studios_legacystudios-nationwidestudios-schools-activity-7295853848802283520--96T","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Legacy Studios is all about leveling up! 📸 Last week, our National Training Team, Eric and Karen, led an intensive two-day training in Dallas-Fort Worth, bringing together our talented photographers from the Dallas-Fort Worth and Houston areas. This is just the beginning! Next stop: Mid-Atlantic. We’re committed to sharpening our skills, growing as a team, and delivering top-tier photography experiences—because great photos start with great training! 🏫 Schools and administrators—partner with a photography team that’s always learning, evolving, and dedicated to making Picture Day seamless and stress-free. Reach out to see how Legacy Studios can support your school! #LegacyStudios #NationwideStudios #Schools #PhotographyExcellence #LevelUp #ProfessionalGrowth #DallasFortWorth #Houston #PictureDayMadeEasy","text_html":"<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/legacy-studios?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Legacy Studios</a> is all about leveling up! &#x1F4F8; Last week, our National Training Team, Eric and Karen, led an intensive two-day training in Dallas-Fort Worth, bringing together our talented photographers from the Dallas-Fort Worth and Houston areas.

This is just the beginning! Next stop: Mid-Atlantic. We&#x2019;re committed to sharpening our skills, growing as a team, and delivering top-tier photography experiences&#x2014;because great photos start with great training!

&#x1F3EB; Schools and administrators&#x2014;partner with a photography team that&#x2019;s always learning, evolving, and dedicated to making Picture Day seamless and stress-free. Reach out to see how Legacy Studios can support your school!


