n.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmiddleeast&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#middleeast</a>","time":"3w Edited","title":"Liebherr Aerospace and Transportation"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-12T09:36:54.315Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQGpCWRJYmiZbg/image-shrink_800/B56ZsODnKfI0Ak-/0/1765467387174?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=5eHyb2ssMz63TwIUl-4-4VNiGoJj4fFfZ85JzZUNYwE"],"likes_count":191,"post_id":"7404906934484656128","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/liebherr-aerospace-and-transportation_liebherr-liebherraerospace-solutionprovider-activity-7404906934484656128-ywwi","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"What an inspiring event organized by IHK Region Stuttgart – their very first Aviation and Space Congress. 👏 Philipp Walter, Managing Director of our Liebherr-Aerospace site in Lindenberg (Germany), delivered a keynote speech on “Sustainable European aviation: market opportunities for a climate-neutral future – perspectives of an international Tier-1 system supplier” to a broad audience of representatives from aerospace and other industries, from R&D, and politics. ✈️ 💬 “Together, we are all in a position to transform the aviation industry. However, this transformation will not happen automatically and requires courage, decisive action, and a willingness to abandon familiar ways of thinking. The central pillars are innovation, digitalization, and sustainable value creation. If we invest, network, and act courageously now, Europe can not only help shape the future of aviation, but also lead the way." It was an exciting event with many opportunities for discussion, exchange, and collaboration. We are confident that the congress provided plenty of inspiration on how to shape these opportunities. Thank you, IHK Region Stuttgart , for the invitation and for the excellent cooperation. 👍 #liebherr #liebherraerospace #solutionprovider #aviation","text_html":"What an inspiring event organized by <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/ihk-stuttgart?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>IHK Region Stuttgart</a> &#x2013; their very first Aviation and Space Congress. &#x1F44F;

Philipp Walter, Managing Director of our Liebherr-Aerospace site in Lindenberg (Germany), delivered a keynote speech on &#x201C;Sustainable European aviation: market opportunities for a climate-neutral future &#x2013; perspectives of an international Tier-1 system supplier&#x201D; to a broad audience of representatives from aerospace and other industries, from R&amp;D, and politics. &#x2708;&#xFE0F;

&#x1F4AC; &#x201C;Together, we are all in a position to transform the aviation industry. However, this transformation will not happen automatically and requires courage, decisive action, and a willingness to abandon familiar ways of thinking. The central pillars are innovation, digitalization, and sustainable value creation. If we invest, network, and act courageously now, Europe can not only help shape the future of aviation, but also lead the way.&quot;

It was an exciting event with many opportunities for discussion, exchange, and collaboration. We are confident that the congress provided plenty of inspiration on how to shape these opportunities.

Thank you, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/ihk-stuttgart?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>IHK Region Stuttgart</a>, for the invitation and for the excellent cooperation. &#x1F44D;

