tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Shaping the future of our IT at Liebherr-Aerospace and Transportation Systems! 🌐 ➡️ A core team of our IT experts headed by Murat Cakal , Director Information Systems, recently met near Vienna (Austria). The team tackled the packed agenda with lots of energy and dedication. From deep dives into network and infrastructure to exploring development, data labs, artificial intelligence and business intelligence, strengthening IT governance (cybersecurity, enterprise architecture), as well as enhancing end-user support and service delivery: each workshop was insightful and provided new perspectives. Shoutout and a big thank you to everyone who made this event a success! 💛 #liebherr #solutionprovider #IT #digitaltransformation #innovation","text_html":"Shaping the future of our IT at Liebherr-Aerospace and Transportation Systems! &#x1F310;

&#x27A1;&#xFE0F; A core team of our IT experts headed by <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/murat-cakal-4927481a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Murat Cakal</a>, Director Information Systems, recently met near Vienna (Austria). 

The team tackled the packed agenda with lots of energy and dedication. From deep dives into network and infrastructure to exploring development, data labs, artificial intelligence and business intelligence, strengthening IT governance (cybersecurity, enterprise architecture), as well as enhancing end-user support and service delivery: each workshop was insightful and provided new perspectives. 

Shoutout and a big thank you to everyone who made this event a success! &#x1F49B;

