:"7401228768691847170","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/liebherr-aerospace-and-transportation_liebherr-solutionprovider-customerservice-activity-7401228768691847170-RZ7-","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Liebherr-Aerospace in Dubai (UAE): new location, extended services, many advantages 🛫 ➡️ We are currently developing our new service center in the Middle East for the maintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO) of air management components for aviation. Located within the Mohammed bin Rashid Aerospace Hub (MBRAH) in Dubai South (UAE), the new facility will accompany and support the Middle East's growing demand for aftermarket repair capacity for our products on board a wide variety of commercial aircraft, business jets, and helicopters. Covering an area of around 2,400 m2, a wide range of service activities will be carried out directly on site in the future – which brings numerouse advantages for our customers: ✔️ Proximity: Located at Mohammed Bin Rashid Aerospace Hub, right next to Al Maktoum International Airport. ✔️ Shorter turnaround times: Local MRO services with full OEM quality standards. ✔️ Tailored support to the needs of customers: Customized solutions for regional operators, including digital monitoring and spare parts pooling. ✔️ Environmental impact REACH-compliant processes and reduced CO₂ emissions through shorter transport routes. 👉 Want to get deeper insights? Read the full story here: https://lnkd.in/efbhXwx2 #liebherr #solutionprovider #customerservice #customers #advantages #middleeast","text_html":"Liebherr-Aerospace in Dubai (UAE): new location, extended services, many advantages &#x1F6EB;

&#x27A1;&#xFE0F; We are currently developing our new service center in the Middle East for the maintenance, repair and overhaul (MRO) of air management components for aviation. 

Located within the Mohammed bin Rashid Aerospace Hub (MBRAH) in Dubai South (UAE), the new facility will accompany and support the Middle East&apos;s growing demand for aftermarket repair capacity for our products on board a wide variety of commercial aircraft, business jets, and helicopters. 

Covering an area of around 2,400 m2, a wide range of service activities will be carried out directly on site in the future &#x2013; which brings numerouse advantages for our customers:

&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Proximity: Located at Mohammed Bin Rashid Aerospace Hub, right next to Al Maktoum International Airport.

&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Shorter turnaround times: Local MRO services with full OEM quality standards.

&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Tailored support to the needs of customers: Customized solutions for regional operators, including digital monitoring and spare parts pooling.

&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Environmental impact  
REACH-compliant processes and reduced CO&#x2082; emissions through shorter      transport routes.

