<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fliebherr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#liebherr</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsolutionprovider&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#solutionprovider</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcustomerservice&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#customerservice</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcustomers&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#customers</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fadvantages&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#advantages</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmiddleeast&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#middleeast</a>","time":"1mo","title":"Liebherr Aerospace and Transportation"},{"date":"2025-12-03T09:36:54.328Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQGZOOMT4oFiQg/image-shrink_800/B4EZqm5AmQIUAc-/0/1763736554666?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=_IRssKIwd4xDVvZpKZxKT20x0mVu3Q1ejHBMEIHqUL0"],"likes_count":52,"post_id":"7397647303110524929","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/liebherr-aerospace-and-transportation_pam2025-liebherr-solutionprovider-activity-7397647303110524929-QgFO","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"What a great Predictive Aircraft Maintenance Conference (PAM) 2025 in Dublin (Ireland)! As always, the event was a very good opportunity for us to showcase our Liebherr Analytics solutions and the latest updates on our customer service capabilities. 🙌 ✈️ Pierre Escudier-Donnadieu , Jose Ribeiro and Anton Straub presented our newly developed predictive maintenance models for Airbus A320 aircraft, created with real-time airline data. They showcased how real-world operational feedback accelerated model accuracy, enabling earlier fault detection, optimized maintenance planning, and increased aircraft availability. 🔎 Pierre and other representatives of member companies of Digital Alliance shared in a panel discussion an update on how Digital Alliance is providing reliable predictive maintenance solutions to ensure stable and cost-effective operations. A greate opportunity to report on how Digital Alliance is developing and what next steps the partners are taking. Always on their mind: develop nose-to-tail solutions. 🛩️ It was great to meet a lot of industry experts at #PAM2025 , to exchange views on customer service and to highlight the importance of collaboration between market players. Let's take maintenance to the next level! ⚙️🛫 #liebherr #solutionprovider #customerservice #maintenance #analytics #aerospace","text_html":"What a great <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/showcase/predictive-aircraft-maintenance-conference-pam/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Predictive Aircraft Maintenance Conference (PAM)</a> 2025 in Dublin (Ireland)!

As always, the event was a very good opportunity for us to showcase our Liebherr Analytics solutions and the latest updates on our customer service capabilities. &#x1F64C;

&#x2708;&#xFE0F; <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/pierre-escudier-donnadieu?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Pierre Escudier-Donnadieu</a>, <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/jose-ribeiro-384518152?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jose Ribeiro</a> and <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/anton-straub-66334a244?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Anton Straub</a> presented our newly developed predictive maintenance models for Airbus A320 aircraft, created with real-time airline data. They showcased how real-world operational feedback accelerated model accuracy, enabling earlier fault detection, optimized maintenance planning, and increased aircraft availability.

&#x1F50E; Pierre and other representatives of member companies of Digital Alliance shared in a panel discussion an update on how Digital Alliance is providing reliable predictive maintenance solutions to ensure stable and cost-effective operations. A greate opportunity to report on how Digital Alliance is developing and what next steps the partners are taking. Always on their mind: develop nose-to-tail solutions. &#x1F6E9;&#xFE0F;

It was great to meet a lot of industry experts at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpam2025&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#PAM2025</a>, to exchange views on customer service and to highlight the importance of collaboration between market players.

Let&apos;s take maintenance to the next level! &#x2699;&#xFE0F;&#x1F6EB;

