ount":2,"date":"2025-12-03T09:36:54.331Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQHFdkr8Ms6uuQ/image-shrink_800/B4EZqmZJnbHEAc-/0/1763728203032?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0opa0iqKx6QkuCHWC6ME89yHvm-dvHndJY2b94_L5_w","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQFeO-vPHOhXjw/image-shrink_800/B4EZqmZJlAKcAg-/0/1763728203036?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=VaeilqQL3FTSi90HxAVUJ048TFyjVfJtfjOFxi_kfcA"],"likes_count":94,"post_id":"7397612296589434880","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/liebherr-aerospace-and-transportation_liebherr-liebherraerospace-activity-7397612296589434880-OJZZ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Happy anniversary: 20 years of Bauhaus Luftfahrt – what a journey! 💐 At this year’s Bauhaus Luftfahrt Symposium our CTO, Dr. Klaus Schneider, delivered the keynote. He reflected on the path the institution had taken so far and on its existence as an independent, interdisciplinary think tank — a partner that has consistently inspired us to think beyond current development cycles and to shape the long-term future of aviation. ✈️ As Dr. Schneider emphasized, the path to sustainable aviation will require strong collaborations between industry and research, a shared commitment to new energy systems, and the courage to pursue bold ideas. These principles reflect exactly what Bauhaus Luftfahrt has stood for over the past two decades — and why this partnership remains so valuable to us. 🤝 The symposium delivered also a clear message: achieving climate-neutral aviation is not only a technological challenge, but also an economic one. Discussions spanned ultra-efficient aircraft designs, AI-supported engineering, and the financial frameworks required to accelerate innovation in our sector. Sebastian Ziehm , Head of Program Management Technology Development at Liebherr-Aerospace in Lindenberg, contributed during the symposium as well to the exchange on future aviation technologies. We congratulate Bauhaus Luftfahrt on 20 years of visionary work and on an inspiring symposium! We look forward to continuing our joint efforts to shape the future of aviation! 🛫 #liebherr #liebherraerospace","text_html":"Happy anniversary: 20 years of <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/bauhaus-luftfahrt-e.v.?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bauhaus Luftfahrt</a> &#x2013; what a journey! &#x1F490;

At this year&#x2019;s Bauhaus Luftfahrt Symposium our CTO, Dr. Klaus Schneider, delivered the keynote. He reflected on the path the institution had taken so far and on its existence as an independent, interdisciplinary think tank &#x2014; a partner that has consistently inspired us to think beyond current development cycles and to shape the long-term future of aviation. &#x2708;&#xFE0F;

As Dr. Schneider emphasized, the path to sustainable aviation will require strong collaborations between industry and research, a shared commitment to new energy systems, and the courage to pursue bold ideas. These principles reflect exactly what Bauhaus Luftfahrt has stood for over the past two decades &#x2014; and why this partnership remains so valuable to us. &#x1F91D;

The symposium delivered also a clear message: achieving climate-neutral aviation is not only a technological challenge, but also an economic one. 

Discussions spanned ultra-efficient aircraft designs, AI-supported engineering, and the financial frameworks required to accelerate innovation in our sector.

<a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/sebastian-ziehm-a583a495?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sebastian Ziehm</a>, Head of Program Management Technology Development at Liebherr-Aerospace in Lindenberg, contributed during the symposium as well to the exchange on future aviation technologies.

We congratulate Bauhaus Luftfahrt on 20 years of visionary work and on an inspiring symposium! 
We look forward to continuing our joint efforts to shape the future of aviation! &#x1F6EB;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fliebherr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#liebherr</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fliebherraerospace&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#liebherraerospace</a>","time":"1mo Edited","title":"Liebherr Aerospace and Transportation"}]

