 through seasonal drops, the first dropping July 10th. The launch event will take place in the heart of Paris on June 21, in conjunction with the famous music celebration, Fête de la Musique. This isn’t just a product launch - it’s a creative renaissance.","text_html":"K-Swiss partners with the legendary Anwar Carrots as Creative Director to launch K-Swiss Racquet Club (KSRC). Anwar, known for his distinctive streetwear brand Carrots by Anwar Carrots, elevates K-Swiss&#x2019; Heritage, Tennis, and California pillars through this powerful collaboration. KSRC will roll out through seasonal drops, the first dropping July 10th. 

The launch event will take place in the heart of Paris on June 21, in conjunction with the famous music celebration, F&#xEA;te de la Musique. 

This isn&#x2019;t just a product launch - it&#x2019;s a creative renaissance.&#xA0;
