ttps://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFYQK5gJlemig/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZdf6TMtHcAs-/0/1749660817118?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=iDhLSUogHccQZKNrXrohSpxy-imwIcTa4p16DXGd2-I","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGdLYz4pqTEAA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZdf6TPCG4As-/0/1749660818254?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0CjnPtASVJPoSJP6dagZi0_gL0fMq81XWmj91UVz97s","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGgpbGbA4h6Ag/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZdf6TOsH0Ag-/0/1749660816761?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=9tnr-wb-aT8eeSwv9BWUHUm6kgLQtCfTULytdjPLRrI","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGgT_Ceib078Q/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZdf6TOgH0As-/0/1749660817045?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=xgtp2cH2VH5HrFyzYRmFVwzh7w7F1K_nErevxnGmS2M","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEKAnJK7kz1gw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZdf6TNsGwAs-/0/1749660816678?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=XYBGJx2zQSOclDIXZGAXyZZsI1RdHkthxtSG22uAN74"],"likes_count":42,"post_id":"7338614762521436160","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ksgb_k-swiss-threw-a-party-in-las-fashion-district-activity-7338614762521436160-g_1o","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"K-Swiss threw a party in LA’s fashion district to kick off our collaboration with the multi-faceted Rakeem Miles. The Family & Friends event not only announced the drop of our limited edition Marina RMX shoe, but also showcased our commitment to Rakeem’s core pillars of music, fashion, and self-discovery. Thank you to the 2,000 people who showed up to celebrate with us, the team who put in the hard work to make this happen, and to our sponsors @Pac Sun, @Tequila Mandala, @Uniqlo, @Ezze Live, and Ramune.","text_html":"K-Swiss threw a party in LA&#x2019;s fashion district to kick off our collaboration with the multi-faceted Rakeem Miles. The Family &amp; Friends event not only announced the drop of our limited edition Marina RMX shoe, but also showcased our commitment to Rakeem&#x2019;s core pillars of music, fashion, and self-discovery.

Thank you to the 2,000 people who showed up to celebrate with us, the team who put in the hard work to make this happen, and to our sponsors @Pac Sun, @Tequila Mandala, @Uniqlo, @Ezze Live, and Ramune.","time":"6mo","title":"K-Swiss Global Brands"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-06-06T11:41:44.564Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEXjaeu9BO4Lw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zcd.YoTHoAs-/0/1748554595140?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qKSUpPyGog8-ytVsLCxsq4oSFTVurgRSr200r9pdlHY","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQE6zeG93Qtj-Q/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zcd.YnsGQAo-/0/1748554593468?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=pzTTX7-2t13m3-BfxXTH_uGATDcQfJKUj0j9wjyZH0I","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGIWfm04lRVCQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zcd.YozHgAo-/0/1748554595598?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=hdBKPUAhDPfPMAHGtV18HiArgY0sSXWOMQNeAgrFj8M","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEUGpe2Tt6XQA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zcd.Yn6HgAg-/0/1748554593042?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=L8rii2Cpo-S8fMeRAWSe4Bi9pJoYvStWkqf2uMsvwoo"],"likes_count":72,"post_id":"7334368029796913152","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/ksgb_k-swiss-x-rakeem-miles-presents-get-me-out-activity-7334368029796913152-nDd6","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"K-Swiss x Rakeem Miles presents Get Me Out The Woods. “Growing up in foster care, one of my first gifts during my adoption was a pair of orange K-Swiss shoes…the brand represents a meaningful part of my childhood and journey.” - Rakeem Miles Rakeem Miles is more than an artist—he's a catalyst for change in his community. Through creative outreach, youth mentorship, and grassroots initiatives, Rakeem uses his platform to uplift and inspire the next generation. Whether hosting workshops, supporting local causes, or simply showing up for his hometown, he brings authenticity, positivity, and purpose to everything he touches. His commitment to giving back reflects the same passion that drives his music-bold, genuine, and deeply rooted in connection. Introducing the first drop from the collab, the Marina RMX. It combines Miles’ visionary aesthetic and legendary K-Swiss, to feature wilderness visuals, unique embroidery, and affirmative messages that redefine identity and confront mental health. Stream Rakeem’s new single, Stand for Something, releasing on all platforms today.","text_html":"K-Swiss x Rakeem Miles presents Get Me Out The Woods.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
&#x201C;Growing up in foster care, one of my first gifts during my adoption was a pair of orange K-Swiss shoes&#x2026;the brand represents a meaningful part of my childhood and journey.&#x201D; - Rakeem Miles
&#xA0;
Rakeem Miles is more than an artist&#x2014;he&apos;s a catalyst for change in his community. Through creative outreach, youth mentorship, and grassroots initiatives, Rakeem uses his platform to uplift and inspire the next generation. Whether hosting workshops, supporting local causes, or simply showing up for his hometown, he brings authenticity, positivity, and purpose to everything he touches. His commitment to giving back reflects the same passion that drives his music-bold, genuine, and deeply rooted in connection.
&#xA0;
Introducing the first drop from the collab, the Marina RMX. It combines Miles&#x2019; visionary aesthetic and legendary K-Swiss, to feature wilderness visuals, unique embroidery, and affirmative messages that redefine identity and confront mental health.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
Stream Rakeem&#x2019;s new single, Stand for Something, releasing on all platforms today.","time":"7mo","title":"K-Swiss Global Brands"}]

