up assessments, and let us know why you'd be a great addition to our Legal Department. 💼 What We Offer: • An initial 6-month internship • Full-time hours from 9:00 to 18:00 📆 Save the Date: 04 December 2025 📍 Location: Milan, Italy Click the link below to apply: https://lnkd.in/dK2zMPFA Our Talent Acquisition Team will contact you if you’re application will be successful! #TalentsDay #InternshipOpportunity #CorporateAffairs #AutomotiveIndustry #Milan #CareerDevelopment #NewGraduates #JoinOurTeam","text_html":"Are You Ready to Drive Your Career Forward in the Automotive Industry? Join Our Talents Day!&#xA0;&#x1F697;
&#xA0;
Are you a recent graduate with a Master&apos;s degree in law looking for an exciting opportunity to start your career in our Corporate Affairs Function?
&#xA0;
Pirelli is thrilled to invite recent graduates to our Talents Day at our Milan headquarters!
&#xA0;
&#x1F31F; What We&apos;re Looking For:
&#x2022;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Master&apos;s degree in Law
&#x2022;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Fluency in English
&#x2022;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Proactivity, Curiosity, and the Desire to Make a Difference
&#x2022;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#x2714;&#xFE0F; Passion for the Automotive World (a plus!)
&#xA0;
