e>Adolfo Urso</a>, Minister of Enterprises and Made in&#xA0;Italy, visited Pirelli&#x2019;s Research &amp; Development Center at the company&#x2019;s Milan HQ, where the cutting-edge technologies that distinguish the Group are developed.

