At the heart of the Group&#x2019;s <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finnovation&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#innovation</a>, the Research &amp; Development Center at the Milan HQ coordinates the activities of Pirelli&#x2019;s other 12 R&amp;D centers worldwide, employing more than 2,100 people in total.","time":"1mo","title":"Pirelli"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-11-03T13:53:32.603Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQED8xXYHQlVRA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZo04j.vJMA4-/0/1761823834970?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=lhqwNLPs_ay6B_--CS1UaPt-uYHb7SlkNMz5dAb1iQU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQG_8i0MeuPpCA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZo04j.eGQAs-/0/1761823834763?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Vzvzu_L77TdvOrawQxO5475NvWLE1u6Fv7Y-u7Y_OfI"],"likes_count":133,"post_id":"7389624766942416896","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/pirelli_behind-every-great-story-lies-a-world-built-activity-7389624766942416896-KDVG","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Behind every great story lies a world built with vision and precision. Oscar-nominated production designer Suzie Davies shares how collaboration, curiosity, and attention to detail turn scripts into cinematic realities — a creative philosophy that mirrors Pirelli’s own pursuit of excellence. Read the full article: https://lnkd.in/d3UKeZz5 All the pictures are courtesy of Suzie Davies.","text_html":"Behind every great story lies a world built with vision and precision.

