ng, and fan-first mindset that shapes every idea that comes out of the Taco Bell Test Kitchen. Proud to see Liz and our Food Innovation Team recognized for the work that keeps us ahead of the curve and always rooted in what fans crave most. Thank You Heather Haddon for capturing it all so well! Take a look at the full story here: https://lnkd.in/gzp5rjG7 #FoodInnovation #GOAT #Menu","text_html":"If you know <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/elizabeth-matthews-a922362a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Elizabeth Matthews</a>, you know her creativity, curiosity, and fearless leadership are unmatched. So, it&#x2019;s no surprise <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-wall-street-journal?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Wall Street Journal</a> has spotlighted her as the &#x201C;GOAT of new product ideas&#x201D; in a feature exploring Taco Bell&#x2019;s innovation engine. &#x1F410;&#x1F49C;
&#xA0;
This story celebrates the collective effort, intentionality, bold thinking, and fan-first mindset that shapes every idea that comes out of the Taco Bell Test Kitchen. Proud to see Liz and our Food Innovation Team recognized for the work that keeps us ahead of the curve and always rooted in what fans crave most.
&#xA0;
Thank You <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/heather-haddon-33a6a614?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Heather Haddon</a> for capturing it all so well! Take a look at the full story here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gzp5rjG7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gzp5rjG7</a>

