[{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-11-03T13:20:06.227Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFQBdxjaZ7UOg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpJRNgTHUAk-/0/1762165901260?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=JON24KzX5Qq8LJAiXomfqQE-tDK3MD72jD6Offa81i8","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHQ3yFQQ-1E7w/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpJRNiFIIAg-/0/1762165917944?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=LrciPZ32DZQ5UXCnqD6FU3ABl8O7KCvqVW1MCwyXGt4","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFyqy4HQPPBWw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZpJRNVoKoAw-/0/1762165855129?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Xwvc9kD0F-V6TxS8nThnkI3tbvcvMZvF9POTrmky4oo","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG6h7M97on9fg/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZpJRNbDHcA4-/0/1762165884083?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=AMB1Zn8wZVdsyc5d0wUF7QxpMMyrjdms_bt7J63wtkE","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGBfcNNsiWsSg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpJRNWGIIAg-/0/1762165860884?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qi-e69RMlMEes9GBG6meXuo2fUBKF-VYTvwZerMxN9I"],"likes_count":35,"post_id":"7391059875654688768","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/betfair_betfair-sticktocricket-theashes-activity-7391059875654688768-FfAm","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"When your day at work includes David Lloyd breaking down The Ashes and Scott Melvin sharing the secrets of content creation… you know you’re in the right place. 🏏✨ Our recent Ashes Preview & Stick to Cricket Showcase brought colleagues across Flutter UK & Ireland together for an afternoon of insight, banter and serious inspiration with an incredible guest panel - all guided by the brilliant Kenzie Benali . From behind-the-scenes Ashes stories to lessons in business, content creation and the importance of preparation, the panel gave us more than just cricket talk, it was a reminder of the passion and purpose that drives everything we do at Betfair . 💛 Thank you to all involved in making it happen and those who came along on the day! #Betfair #StickToCricket #TheAshes","text_html":"When your day at work includes David Lloyd breaking down The Ashes and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/scott-melvin-331071a7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Scott Melvin</a> sharing the secrets of content creation&#x2026; you know you&#x2019;re in the right place.&#xA0;&#x1F3CF;&#x2728;

Our recent Ashes Preview &amp; Stick to Cricket Showcase brought colleagues across <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/flutter-uk-ireland?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Flutter UK &amp; Ireland</a> together for an afternoon of insight, banter and serious inspiration with an incredible guest panel - all guided by the brilliant <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/kenzie-benali-28830815b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kenzie Benali</a>. 

From behind-the-scenes Ashes stories to lessons in business, content creation and the importance of preparation, the panel gave us more than just cricket talk, it was a reminder of the passion and purpose that drives everything we do at <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/betfair?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Betfair</a>. &#x1F49B;

Thank you to all involved in making it happen and those who came along on the day!

