n.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7326617330388541440/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"At Flutter UK & Ireland , our colleagues continue to show what it means to Do More Together. Across our region, colleagues have been rolling up their sleeves and making a real difference. ❤️ 💫 Betfair and Flutter UKI teams in Dublin and London gave their time to two brilliant causes. In Dublin, they cooked meals for families staying at Ronald McDonald House Charities , while in London, they joined the London Soup Kitchen to support those experiencing homelessness. 🛝 Paddy Power colleagues have been getting hands-on with London Play Design , restoring local playgrounds and creating safe, fun spaces for kids to play and explore. (They've also taken part in a recent Flutter charity footy match alongside Betfair in aid of the National Maternity Hospital Foundation !) 🏁 Sky Betting & Gaming have recently concluded the incredible Every Minute Matters Relay. Covering over 4,000km in 28 days, teams visited all 72 EFL clubs to raise awareness for CPR training with the British Heart Foundation . A powerful reminder that knowing CPR can save lives — and it only takes 15 minutes with the RevivR tool: https://lnkd.in/eXtxmMdv We're so proud to see the Flutter Entertainment Positive Impact Plan and our UKI values brought to life across our brands and local communities. A big well done and thank you to all of our colleagues who have been taking the time to Do More Together and making it all possible! 👏 #FlutterUKI #PositiveImpactPlan #DoMore #WinTogether #EveryMinuteMatters #RevivR #Volunteering #CPRSavesLives","text_html":"At <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/flutter-uk-ireland?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Flutter UK &amp; Ireland</a>, our colleagues continue to show what it means to Do More Together. Across our region, colleagues have been rolling up their sleeves and making a real difference. &#x2764;&#xFE0F; 

&#x1F4AB;  <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/betfair?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Betfair</a> and Flutter UKI teams in Dublin and London gave their time to two brilliant causes. In Dublin, they cooked meals for families staying at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ronaldmcdonaldhouse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ronald McDonald House Charities</a>, while in London, they joined the London Soup Kitchen to support those experiencing homelessness.

&#x1F6DD; <a class="link" href="https://ie.linkedin.com/company/paddypower?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Paddy Power</a> colleagues have been getting hands-on with <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/londonplaydesign?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>London Play Design</a>, restoring local playgrounds and creating safe, fun spaces for kids to play and explore. (They&apos;ve also taken part in a recent Flutter charity footy match alongside <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/betfair?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Betfair</a> in aid of the <a class="link" href="https://ie.linkedin.com/company/nmh-foundation?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>National Maternity Hospital Foundation</a>!) 

&#x1F3C1; <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/sky-betting-and-gaming?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sky Betting &amp; Gaming</a> have recently concluded the incredible Every Minute Matters Relay. Covering over 4,000km in 28 days, teams visited all 72 EFL clubs to raise awareness for CPR training with the <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/british-heart-foundation?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>British Heart Foundation</a>.  A powerful reminder that knowing CPR can save lives &#x2014; and it only takes 15 minutes with the RevivR tool: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eXtxmMdv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eXtxmMdv</a>

We&apos;re so proud to see the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/flutter-entertainment?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Flutter Entertainment</a> Positive Impact Plan and our UKI values brought to life across our brands and local communities. 

A big well done and thank you to all of our colleagues who have been taking the time to Do More Together and making it all possible! &#x1F44F; 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fflutteruki&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FlutterUKI</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpositiveimpactplan&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#PositiveImpactPlan</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdomore&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DoMore</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwintogether&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WinTogether</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Feveryminutematters&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EveryMinuteMatters</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frevivr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#RevivR</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvolunteering&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Volunteering</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcprsaveslives&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CPRSavesLives</a>","time":"7mo","title":"Flutter UK & Ireland"},{"comments_count":8,"date":"2025-05-07T13:20:06.247Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHhWdmY0HUSMA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZZEFo3UGYAk-/0/1744899054926?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=e3ddFHamhXy6RIiNGHkC3SPyWKlY6o0zqd4o19Ixpsg","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEAm4UpeYRxSg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZZEFo4vG0Ag-/0/1744899055226?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=wWgvQaHZOHA2pJjTZIp8ssYt4r2bru5Fp4cvS1xhbQ0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGnaZXZFYinzA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZZEFo4CHMAw-/0/1744899053974?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=O_ESWMIBNTLOyLttxNLVqV4cYXSh3gYrfjfSwzNfG5o","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFLUwvCOOnSbA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZZEFo4nHcAo-/0/1744899053953?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=LU1z19kfIalyDR0Kyua_Yx10Kb-d6Mgu9nEbaz0ibeo","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGnTvhwmOAVIQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZZEFo4ZHEAo-/0/1744899053949?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=kxpUQ9csgjrYKtxtk2VqNSXS8VVq4eAvqHB6X0MYEV8"],"likes_count":116,"post_id":"7320355705981394946","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/betfair_domore-domore-positiveimpact-activity-7320355705981394946-BbcJ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Recently, colleagues at Betfair across the Flutter UK & Ireland region got involved in something truly special! 💛 As part of the Flutter Entertainment global volunteering initiative, #DoMore , and our Positive Impact Plan, colleagues across Dublin and London came together to give back. 🌍✨ 👨🍳 In Dublin, the team spent the day at Ronald McDonald House Charities , cooking and serving home-made meals 🍲 for families staying close to their children in hospital. 🥪 Over in London, the crew volunteered at the London Soup Kitchen – making sandwiches, packing food bags with fruit, snacks, and drinks 🍎🥤, then heading out to share them with those experiencing homelessness in central London. Both teams described the day as rewarding and inspiring – and we’re not stopping here! Another fantastic group of volunteers is set to get involved in the coming weeks. 🙌 #DoMore #PositiveImpact #TeamBetfair #Volunteering #GivingBack","text_html":"Recently, colleagues at <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/betfair?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Betfair</a> across the <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/flutter-uk-ireland?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Flutter UK &amp; Ireland</a> region got involved in something truly special! &#x1F49B; 

As part of the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/flutter-entertainment?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Flutter Entertainment</a> global volunteering initiative, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdomore&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DoMore</a>, and our Positive Impact Plan, colleagues across Dublin and London came together to give back. &#x1F30D;&#x2728;

&#x1F468;&#x1F373; In Dublin, the team spent the day at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ronaldmcdonaldhouse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ronald McDonald House Charities</a>, cooking and serving home-made meals &#x1F372; for families staying close to their children in hospital.

&#x1F96A; Over in London, the crew volunteered at the London Soup Kitchen &#x2013; making sandwiches, packing food bags with fruit, snacks, and drinks &#x1F34E;&#x1F964;, then heading out to share them with those experiencing homelessness in central London.

Both teams described the day as rewarding and inspiring &#x2013; and we&#x2019;re not stopping here! Another fantastic group of volunteers is set to get involved in the coming weeks. &#x1F64C;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdomore&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DoMore</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpositiveimpact&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#PositiveImpact</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fteambetfair&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TeamBetfair</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvolunteering&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Volunteering</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgivingback&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GivingBack</a> ","time":"8mo","title":"Betfair"}]

