In our latest blog interview, <a class="link" href="https://at.linkedin.com/in/andreas-schild-66449943?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Andreas Schild</a>, Head of Investment Finance Sales, shares insights on sustainable financing trends and practical solutions for businesses.&#xA0;&#x1F64C;
From green loans to subsidies and guarantees, discover how we support
companies on their journey toward a <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsustainable&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#sustainable</a> economy.&#xA0;&#x1F331;

&#x1F449;&#xA0;Read the full interview here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e_GtAiMm?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e_GtAiMm</a>","time":"4d","title":"Raiffeisen Bank International AG"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-26T10:41:16.984Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGyVZckM2icEg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZtFOIrgGcAk-/0/1766392895034?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=18BrIB-9WENS0-t9rgVMwBihcX7aFw39RbbZ_TYAV60"],"likes_count":91,"post_id":"7408788790099673089","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/raiffeisen-bank-international_eutaxonomy-sustainablefinance-esg-activity-7408788790099673089-9DNB","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Creating green values together 🤝🌱 Vienna’s largest inner‑city development, Village im Dritten, shows how partnership turns the #EUTaxonomy from challenge into opportunity. Our EU‑taxonomy‑aligned use‑of‑proceeds financing also contributed to the project — unlocking better terms and a smoother path to compliance. From ÖGNI/DGNB and klimaaktiv certifications to Austria’s largest geothermal energy network, this almost car‑free neighborhood is built for long‑term value—for residents, investors, and the city. Read the interview including our experts Arnold Czabaun and Klaus Michal here: https://lnkd.in/eHVZgnTG #SustainableFinance #ESG","text_html":"Creating green values together&#xA0;&#x1F91D;&#x1F331; 

Vienna&#x2019;s largest inner&#x2011;city development, Village&#xA0;im&#xA0;Dritten, shows how partnership turns the&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Feutaxonomy&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EUTaxonomy</a> from challenge into opportunity.&#xA0;Our&#xA0;EU&#x2011;taxonomy&#x2011;aligned use&#x2011;of&#x2011;proceeds financing&#xA0;also contributed to the project&#xA0;&#x2014; unlocking&#xA0;better terms and a smoother path to compliance. 

From &#xD6;GNI/DGNB and&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://at.linkedin.com/company/klimaaktiv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>klimaaktiv</a>&#xA0;certifications to Austria&#x2019;s largest geothermal energy network, this&#xA0;almost&#xA0;car&#x2011;free neighborhood is built for long&#x2011;term value&#x2014;for residents, investors, and the city. 

