upervisory authority approval. We would like to sincerely thank Johann Strobl for his strong leadership over the past eight years, guiding us through challenging times and positioning us for sustainable #success . 👏","text_html":"<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fleadership&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Leadership</a> Update&#xA0;&#x1F514;

