Michael H&#xF6;llerer brings more than 20 years of international banking experience and deep knowledge of our Group. He currently serves as CEO of <a class="link" href="https://at.linkedin.com/company/raiffeisenlandesbank-niederoesterreich-wien?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Raiffeisenlandesbank Nieder&#xF6;sterreich-Wien AG</a> and has held several senior leadership roles across our organization. His&#xA0;appointment is subject to supervisory authority approval. 

