helped save the day! 🦸♂️ Patrick had just witnessed a vehicle rollover in front of him, in a severe winter storm ❄️ impacted area, that had no cell-phone reception. He turned around to render aid and realized it was one of his customers. Patrick positioned his vehicle upstream to protect the accident scene and any traffic that could have further been involved. He assisted the victim until others arrived, at which point he coordinated with them to attend to the victim while he moved to a point where he could call for help. 📞 ☎️ Patrick’s action to secure the scene, protect the public, get her family and help on the way, is an outstanding example of a FedEx employee stepping into a situation and doing an act of outstanding public service. Learn more about our career opportunities at: careers.fedex.com and create your own superhero moment. ⚡️🦸♂️💪📦✨","text_html":"We&#x2019;re excited to share how some of our team members, we call Purple Heroes, have helped save the day! &#x1F9B8;&#x2642;&#xFE0F;

Patrick had just witnessed a vehicle rollover in front of him, in a severe winter storm &#x2744;&#xFE0F; impacted area, that had no cell-phone reception. He turned around to render aid and realized it was one of his customers. Patrick positioned his vehicle upstream to protect the accident scene and any traffic that could have further been involved. He assisted the victim until others arrived, at which point he coordinated with them to attend to the victim while he moved to a point where he could call for help. &#x1F4DE; &#x260E;&#xFE0F; 

Patrick&#x2019;s action to secure the scene, protect the public, get her family and help on the way, is an outstanding example of a FedEx employee stepping into a situation and doing an act of outstanding public service.

