[{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-12-31T13:03:00.762Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG2cD_CFnHdIA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZtv2WPRKkAw-/0/1767108078464?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=kfjBwepJxuZdgz4I9GpkfZBMvCKfaxTRxi8us58dljo"],"likes_count":117,"post_id":"7412024728413966336","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/solvay_solvaylife-transformation-essentialchemistry-activity-7412024728413966336-qd0h","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"As 2025 comes to a close, we look back on a year defined by significant transformation. Change feels different for everyone - for some, it has been a period of rapid adaptation; for others, a window into an exciting new future. Through every challenge we have shown commitment. This journey has strengthened Solvay's resilience and nurtured a culture of courage, collaboration, and care. Our milestones represent more than industrial growth; they are the "For Generations" roadmap in action: 🌍 Acting on the Transition: We didn't just talk; we acted by launching our first Green Hydrogen hub and hitting coal phase-out milestones. 🔋 Powering Sustainable Mobility: We’ve solidified our role in the EV revolution, ensuring the responsible production of Rare Earths and circular silica for a more sustainable future. 📈 Agile by Design: In a complex market, our focus on operational excellence has built a leaner, more resilient Solvay that is ready for 2026. To our employees, partners, and customers: thank you for walking this path with us. There is immense pride in the progress achieved and in our collective ability to reinvent the essential, time and again. As we step into 2026, we do so with a renewed sense of purpose. We look forward to a year of new possibilities, continuous learning, and shared success as we continue shaping the future of essential chemistry together. Happy New Year! ✨ #SolvayLife #Transformation #EssentialChemistry #2026Ready #Collaboration","text_html":"As 2025 comes to a close, we look back on a year defined by significant transformation.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
Change feels different for everyone - for some, it has been a period of rapid adaptation; for others, a window into an exciting new future. Through every challenge we have shown commitment. This journey has strengthened Solvay&apos;s resilience and nurtured a culture of courage, collaboration, and care.
&#xA0;
Our milestones represent more than industrial growth; they are the &quot;For Generations&quot; roadmap in action:
&#xA0;
&#x1F30D; Acting on the Transition: We didn&apos;t just talk; we acted by launching our first Green Hydrogen hub and hitting coal phase-out milestones.
&#xA0;
&#x1F50B; Powering Sustainable Mobility: We&#x2019;ve solidified our role in the EV revolution, ensuring the responsible production of Rare Earths and circular silica for a more sustainable future.
&#xA0;
&#x1F4C8; Agile by Design: In a complex market, our focus on operational excellence has built a leaner, more resilient Solvay that is ready for 2026.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
To our employees, partners, and customers: thank you for walking this path with us. There is immense pride in the progress achieved and in our collective ability to reinvent the essential, time and again.
&#xA0;
As we step into 2026, we do so with a renewed sense of purpose. We look forward to a year of new possibilities, continuous learning, and shared success as we continue shaping the future of essential chemistry together.
&#xA0;
Happy New Year! &#x2728;
&#xA0;
