lsafety-safetyculture-leadbyexample-activity-7410318588126846976-WURs","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"In Rosignano, Italy, Mariam Massri is changing the way we think about industrial safety. It’s easy to focus on the technical side of being a Chemical Engineer, but Mariam chooses to focus on the people. By building a dedicated Leadership Team of 30+ managers and working hand-in-hand with union representatives, she has bridged the gap between the Steering Committee and the factory floor. She believes that when you lead by example and stay present, you don't just enforce rules - you inspire a culture of collaboration where everyone looks out for one another. 💬 “True safety is achieved not by mandate, but through support, empowerment, and leading by example.” #IndustrialSafety #SafetyCulture #LeadByExample #WorkplaceWellbeing","text_html":"In Rosignano, Italy, Mariam Massri is changing the way we think about industrial safety.

It&#x2019;s easy to focus on the technical side of being a Chemical Engineer, but Mariam chooses to focus on the people. By building a dedicated Leadership Team of 30+ managers and working hand-in-hand with union representatives, she has bridged the gap between the Steering Committee and the factory floor.

She believes that when you lead by example and stay present, you don&apos;t just enforce rules - you inspire a culture of collaboration where everyone looks out for one another.

&#x1F4AC; &#x201C;True safety is achieved not by mandate, but through support, empowerment, and leading by example.&#x201D;

