He views his team and Solvay as one interconnected entity, moving beyond the traditional client-contractor dynamic to embrace a unified vision where every action influences the collective well-being.

Andrea&#x2019;s philosophy is simple: safety is not a burden&#x2014;it&#x2019;s a virtuous habit. He believes that treating safety as a source of pride and satisfaction creates a social culture that elevates the work experience and strengthens collaboration for everyone on-site.

&#x1F44F; We&#x2019;re proud to feature Andrea&#x2019;s commitment to making safety a lived value every day. Stay tuned as we continue to highlight the professionals who keep our global sites safe.

