tions for electric mobility, greener tires, sustainable glass, and advanced electronics. Behind every molecule is a team committed to making the transition real. The technology exists. The people are ready. Now it’s about speed and simplicity. By fast-tracking permits and securing affordable low-carbon energy, we can turn the energy transition into a true industrial renaissance. 2026 can be the year we accelerate. #IndustrialRenaissance 👉 What does a “diverse energy future” mean to you? #ConferenceofParis2025 #OECD #EnergyTransition #ClimateAction OECD - OCDE 📷 International Economic Forum of the Americas","text_html":"No Sustainable Economy without Essential Chemistry: Solvay CEO <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/philippe-kehren?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philippe Kehren</a> at the Conference of Paris.

Solvay is proud to represent essential chemistry at the International Economic Forum of the Americas today, hosted at the OECD. This is where global policy meets industrial strategy.

During the &quot;Toward a Diverse Energy Future&quot; panel, Philippe delivered a fundamental truth: When industry has access to a mix of solutions - renewables, electrification, and reliable low-carbon energies - it can keep innovating, keep jobs secure, and keep moving toward a cleaner future.

At Solvay, we&#x2019;re proud to play our part: turning essential chemistry into solutions for electric mobility, greener tires, sustainable glass, and advanced electronics. Behind every molecule is a team committed to making the transition real.

The technology exists. The people are ready. Now it&#x2019;s about speed and simplicity. By fast-tracking permits and securing affordable low-carbon energy, we can turn the energy transition into a true industrial renaissance.

2026 can be the year we accelerate. <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Findustrialrenaissance&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#IndustrialRenaissance</a>

&#x1F449; What does a &#x201C;diverse energy future&#x201D; mean to you?

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fconferenceofparis2025&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ConferenceofParis2025</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foecd&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#OECD</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fenergytransition&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EnergyTransition</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fclimateaction&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ClimateAction</a> <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/organisation-eco-cooperation-development-organisation-cooperation-developpement-eco?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>OECD - OCDE</a> 
&#x1F4F7; <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/international-economic-forum-of-the-americas?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>International Economic Forum of the Americas</a>","time":"2w Edited","title":"Solvay"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-19T13:03:00.783Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQEKb4bJRllqNw/image-shrink_800/B56ZsoIyhbGkAg-/0/1765904952808?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=4kk4TOVliowQ_j8AcgY28MlksSt3y2yAIzvJ8WNTteU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQGb2LlgHnjcRw/image-shrink_800/B56ZsoI1ZLKIAg-/0/1765904964425?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=fep6HKarXI80VqC0G9u6_4x8xs78bKcAF8E-SmSfopg","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQG3jKPPHKLHKA/image-shrink_800/B56ZsoI4XdGgAc-/0/1765904977980?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=48hWxPYo6VPmrLpQuit14HSul-WybRXK8aZ0VLaL6vY"],"likes_count":178,"post_id":"7406755001261387777","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/solvay_chemday2025-chemday-sustainablechemistry-activity-7406755001261387777-R2Dv","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Recap: "Chemistry is an essential part of the solution for a sustainable future," emphasized our CEO, Philippe Kehren , TODAY at #ChemDay2025 . We are delivering on our promise to redefine performance and circularity. Here is a glimpse of the concrete solutions proving Solvay is leading the fundamental shift to a resilient global industry: 1. Our Rare Earths project in La Rochelle, France, is essential to secure the value chain of clean mobility and clean energy. 2. SOLVAir® solutions guarantee >99% acid gas compliance while delivering economic profitability. 3. Circular silica: Key driver currently helping tire manufacturers achieve tangible step toward greater sustainability. Thank you to France Chimie for the platform! Let's continue the conversation we started at #ChemDay and explore how Solvay is building a more sustainable and resilient economy for Europe. #SustainableChemistry #Innovation","text_html":"Recap: &quot;Chemistry is an essential part of the solution for a sustainable future,&quot; emphasized our CEO, <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/philippe-kehren?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philippe Kehren</a>, TODAY at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fchemday2025&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ChemDay2025</a>.

We are delivering on our promise to redefine performance and circularity. Here is a glimpse of the concrete solutions proving Solvay is leading the fundamental shift to a resilient global industry:
1. Our Rare Earths project in La Rochelle, France, is essential to secure the value chain of clean mobility and clean energy. 
2. SOLVAir&#xAE; solutions guarantee &gt;99% acid gas compliance while delivering economic profitability.
3. Circular silica: Key driver currently helping tire manufacturers achieve tangible step toward greater sustainability. 

Thank you to <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/francechimie?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>France Chimie</a> for the platform! Let&apos;s continue the conversation we started at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fchemday&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ChemDay</a> and explore how Solvay is building a more sustainable and resilient economy for Europe. 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsustainablechemistry&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SustainableChemistry</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finnovation&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Innovation</a>","time":"2w Edited","title":"Solvay"},{"date":"2025-12-19T13:03:00.788Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQEecRbN16LjIQ/image-shrink_800/B4EZsTgVM3GUAc-/0/1765558802071?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=fz4rScLJd9S2y2yn8Omlxrz6G7OHznMkgmFrC-PjYoc"],"likes_count":156,"post_id":"7405290390309871616","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/solvay_criticalrawmaterials-europeansovereignty-activity-7405290390309871616-Q7lI","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Did you know that Rare Earth Elements are absolutely essential for the technologies powering the Green Transition and European Industrial Sovereignty? These materials are critical to securing Europe’s #CriticalRawMaterials supply chain. This pivotal role was the focus of our recent discussion with Benjamin Haddad , Minister Delegates for Europe, during his visit to Solvay La Rochelle. Europe currently faces critical dependencies for these materials. That's why the capabilities of sites like Solvay La Rochelle are vital: - Unique asset: We are the only facility outside of Asia capable of separating all rare earth elements, making us a key asset for the EU's Critical Raw Materials Act. - Commitment: Solvay is helping to build a resilient supply chain, aiming to cover up to 30% of European rare earth oxide needs for permanent magnets by 2030. - Expanded focus: NdPr is already in production, with Samarium, Dysprosium, and Terbium set for 2026. To realize this vision and compete globally, Europe must operationalize ReSourceEU by focusing on: 1️⃣ Faster permitting and regulatory alignment for circularity within the EU. 2️⃣ Competitive, low-carbon energy. 3️⃣ Stronger incentives to Buy European materials. 4️⃣ Simple procedures to access public/private funding to provide a floor price for European materials. 5️⃣ Supporting strong international partnerships to secure rare earth materials for EU industry and Europe’s transition. Europe + Industry = Sovereignty and Energy Transition. Let's build a stronger, more independent supply chain together! #EuropeanSovereignty #RareEarths #MadeInEurope","text_html":"Did you know that Rare Earth Elements are absolutely essential for the technologies powering the Green Transition and European Industrial Sovereignty? These materials are critical to securing Europe&#x2019;s <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcriticalrawmaterials&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CriticalRawMaterials</a> supply chain.

This pivotal role was the focus of our recent discussion with <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/benjamin-haddad-49a4b220?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Benjamin Haddad</a>, Minister Delegates for Europe, during his visit to Solvay La Rochelle.

Europe currently faces critical dependencies for these materials. That&apos;s why the capabilities of sites like Solvay La Rochelle are vital:
- Unique asset: We are the only facility outside of Asia capable of separating all rare earth elements, making us a key asset for the EU&apos;s Critical Raw Materials Act.
- Commitment: Solvay is helping to build a resilient supply chain, aiming to cover up to 30% of European rare earth oxide needs for permanent magnets by 2030.
- Expanded focus: NdPr is already in production, with Samarium, Dysprosium, and Terbium set for 2026.

To realize this vision and compete globally, Europe must operationalize ReSourceEU by focusing on:
1&#xFE0F;&#x20E3; Faster permitting and regulatory alignment for circularity within the EU.
2&#xFE0F;&#x20E3; Competitive, low-carbon energy.
3&#xFE0F;&#x20E3; Stronger incentives to Buy European materials.
4&#xFE0F;&#x20E3; Simple procedures to access public/private funding to provide a floor price for European materials. 
5&#xFE0F;&#x20E3; Supporting strong international partnerships to secure rare earth materials for EU industry and Europe&#x2019;s transition.

Europe + Industry = Sovereignty and Energy Transition. 

Let&apos;s build a stronger, more independent supply chain together!

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Feuropeansovereignty&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EuropeanSovereignty</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Frareearths&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#RareEarths</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmadeineurope&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MadeInEurope</a>","time":"2w Edited","title":"Solvay"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-12T13:03:00.790Z","likes_count":95,"post_id":"7404897893981171712","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/solvay_a-throwback-to-our-2025-hr-accomplishments-activity-7404897893981171712-lN6m","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Our end-of-year wrap-up is here, and it’s all about our people! 📊 Every figure reflects how our talents choose to grow with us every day. 👉 Swipe to see the story our numbers tell this year (spoiler: we're especially proud of the last one). #ThrowbackThursday","text_html":"Our end-of-year wrap-up is here, and it&#x2019;s all about our people!

&#x1F4CA; Every figure reflects how our talents choose to grow with us every day.
&#x1F449; Swipe to see the story our numbers tell this year (spoiler: we&apos;re especially proud of the last one).

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fthrowbackthursday&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ThrowbackThursday</a>","time":"3w","title":"Solvay"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-12T13:03:00.793Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D10AQHJkN2hHdcWAA/image-shrink_1280/B4DZsDxhM1J4AQ-/0/1765294871709?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=KEROo7hrubWsBds9SKCz5oheX_JpriB2fwsRWdAS6HA"],"likes_count":46,"post_id":"7404263578347925504","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/solvay_semiconductor-chemicalmechanicalplanarization-activity-7404263578347925504-UiAc","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"To meet the stringent precision demands of #semiconductor line widths, we developed Zenus®, a next-generation colloidal ceria abrasive that directly resolves critical defectivity and scratch risks inherent in traditional Chemical Mechanical Polishing materials, ensuring a flawless surface for advanced nodes. What makes Zenus® different? - Optimal Performance: Its unique octahedral particle form provides optimal performance against defects. - Easy Implementation: A packaged, ready-to-formulate solution, no extra processing steps are required to produce final polishing slurry. - Predictable Results: The polishing slurry benefits from an even particle distribution, leading to lower defects and higher production yield. Zenus® delivers the precision and predictability you need to move your production into the next generation. For our connections in semiconductor manufacturing: When it comes to Chemical Mechanical Polishing, what's your biggest challenge—reducing defects while simplifying the slurry formulation process. #ChemicalMechanicalPlanarization #Microelectronics","text_html":"To meet the stringent precision demands of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsemiconductor&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#semiconductor</a> line widths, we developed Zenus&#xAE;, a next-generation colloidal ceria abrasive that directly resolves critical defectivity and scratch risks inherent in traditional Chemical Mechanical Polishing materials, ensuring a flawless surface for advanced nodes.

What makes Zenus&#xAE; different?
- Optimal Performance: Its unique octahedral particle form provides optimal performance against defects. 
- Easy Implementation: A packaged, ready-to-formulate solution, no extra processing steps are required to produce final polishing slurry.
- Predictable Results: The polishing slurry benefits from an even particle distribution, leading to lower defects and higher production yield.

Zenus&#xAE; delivers the precision and predictability you need to move your production into the next generation.

For our connections in semiconductor manufacturing: When it comes to Chemical Mechanical Polishing, what&apos;s your biggest challenge&#x2014;reducing defects while simplifying the slurry formulation process.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fchemicalmechanicalplanarization&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ChemicalMechanicalPlanarization</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmicroelectronics&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Microelectronics</a>","time":"3w","title":"Solvay"}]

