MA India and Confederation of Indian Industry awards, proving that dedication, quality, and teamwork really pay off! ✅ We’re proud of how far we’ve come... and more excited than ever about what comes next! 🚀 #WeAreTheMotor #OneTeamOneCompany #SEGAutomotiveIndia","text_html":"Closing the year with a milestone that fills us with pride:
