We&#x2019;ve officially (and quite literally) launched our first &#x1D5D7;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F2; &#x1D5E0;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D601;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D600; &#x1D5F3;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FF; &#x1D5EE;&#x1D5F4;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D602;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D601;&#x1D602;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5F9; &#x1D5F1;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D600;!

Our eBike motors are already on the road - and this marks our next entry into advanced <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Felectric&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#electric</a> propulsion beyond the automotive sector.

We&#x2019;re also proud to have received our first Letter of Intent from <a class="link" href="https://in.linkedin.com/company/nextleap-aeronautics?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NextLeap Aeronautics</a>, marking a strong validation of our capabilities and the potential of this new product line.

And this is only the beginning: &#x1D601;&#x1D5F5;&#x1D5F2; &#x1D601;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5F5;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F4;&#x1D606; &#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FD;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D600; &#x1D5F1;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D600; &#x1D601;&#x1D5FC; &#x1D5F3;&#x1D602;&#x1D601;&#x1D602;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F2; &#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FD;&#x1D5FD;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D601;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D600; such as power line servicing, high-rise maintenance, solar panel cleaning, and logistics.

More (exciting) news about this project are coming in 2026... &#x1F929; 

