nks":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"𝗘𝗹𝗲𝗰𝘁𝗿𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 𝗶𝗻 𝗔𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: 𝗛𝗶𝗴𝗵-𝗩𝗼𝗹𝘁𝗮𝗴𝗲 𝗲-𝗗𝗿𝗶𝘃𝗲𝘀 𝗳𝗿𝗼𝗺 𝗜𝗻𝗱𝗶𝗮 🎬 India’s #mobility landscape is transforming at an incredible pace – and the need for efficient, reliable #electric drive solutions has never been greater. We’re proud to help power this shift: watch the video for a closer a look at how SEG Automotive is powering this #transformation with high-voltage #emachines developed and produced at our #Hosur plant. This is part of our evolution from a hardware manufacturer to a true #mechatronics company, which includes this scalable #Edrive solution for buzzling Asian cities. It reflects the best of both worlds: Indian ingenuity paired with German #engineering standards ✅ #WeAreTheMotor #Electrification #AutomotiveInnovation #AutomotiveIndustry #SustainableMobility #Hosur #SEGAutomotive","text_html":"&#x1D5D8;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D601;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F3;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D601;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB; &#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FB; &#x1D5D4;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D601;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB;: &#x1D5DB;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F4;&#x1D5F5;-&#x1D5E9;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D601;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5F4;&#x1D5F2; &#x1D5F2;-&#x1D5D7;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D603;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D600; &#x1D5F3;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FA; &#x1D5DC;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F1;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5EE; &#x1F3AC;
India&#x2019;s <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmobility&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#mobility</a> landscape is transforming at an incredible pace &#x2013; and the need for efficient, reliable <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Felectric&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#electric</a> drive solutions has never been greater.
&#xA0;
We&#x2019;re proud to help power this shift:&#xA0;watch the video for a closer a look at how SEG Automotive is powering this <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftransformation&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#transformation</a> with high-voltage <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Femachines&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#emachines</a> developed and produced at our <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhosur&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Hosur</a> plant.
&#xA0;
This is part of our evolution from a hardware manufacturer to a true <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmechatronics&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#mechatronics</a> company, which includes this scalable <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fedrive&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Edrive</a> solution for buzzling Asian cities. It reflects the best of both worlds: Indian ingenuity paired with German <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fengineering&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#engineering</a> standards &#x2705; 
&#xA0;
