edin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsegautomotive&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SEGAutomotive</a>","time":"4w","title":"SEG Automotive","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQHN6odfecZy7A/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4DZrpQktCJ4CE-/0/1764850043201?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3kHdchC1XNHWhMPiyRCzHDjYvS9OVRmAzC6KCVBmlII","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQHN6odfecZy7A/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4DZrpQktCJ4Bs-/0/1764850060698?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ikBb8nM2oYmO6UDGUnGVgGpsQ-htN_q_BIV29N4xLz0"]},{"comments_count":14,"date":"2025-12-03T13:22:51.694Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHgxJeXHO6KwQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZrkNAEzH0As-/0/1764765205645?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=MRsX44TqOxUGjt-JBlBtzDtGJMLAdjHT3iqnS8FPYIA","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQG9KVjtE3lEpA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZrkNAGHIgAs-/0/1764765205279?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=4wnAbmkRj8fHOqEAb7G_9pOyvDbKNTl2PqYZ2zioGbU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHhDxOe9Av_jA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZrkNAFXKQAs-/0/1764765205256?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=lb2fQ10yjjqTOy39fjU2Anv-nK9Q1VVgLmeNo4odWoQ"],"likes_count":191,"post_id":"7401961766957678592","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/segautomotive_segautomotivespain-treto-takingresponsibility-activity-7401961766957678592-hyqu","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We are proud to share that Inaki Calvo , Director of #SEGAutomotiveSpain , has been recognized with the "Director of the Year – Supplier Award 2025", featured in AutoRevista ! 👏 With more than 30 years of experience – including key leadership roles in Germany and Hungary – Iñaki has built a long and impactful career closely linked to our #Treto plant. He has guided the site through major transformations, cultural shifts, and industry changes, always focusing on people, performance, and being a reliable partner to our customers. His leadership reflects our SEG Automotive DNA, championing values such as #TakingResponsibility , #ForwardThinking , and #SustainabilityMindset . This mindset has been instrumental in Treto’s evolution – from achieving TÜV SÜD ’s #zerowaste certification to expanding our technological capabilities, including the clean room for #electronics assembly, a key milestone in our transformation for the future of #mobility . Congratulations, Inaki , and thank you for your dedication to our teams, customers, and the industry! 👏 ➡️ Click on the link in the comment below to read Iñaki's full interview (available in English and Spanish). 📰 #WeAreTheMotor #AutomotiveIndustry #Leadership #Cantabria #SEGAutomotive","text_html":"We are proud to share that <a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/in/inaki-calvo-976a3054?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Inaki Calvo</a>, Director of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsegautomotivespain&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SEGAutomotiveSpain</a>, has been recognized with the &quot;Director of the Year &#x2013; Supplier Award 2025&quot;, featured in <a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/company/autorevista?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>AutoRevista</a>! &#x1F44F; 
&#xA0;
With more than 30 years of experience &#x2013; including key leadership roles in Germany and Hungary &#x2013; I&#xF1;aki has built a long and impactful career closely linked to our <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftreto&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Treto</a> plant.

He has guided the site through major transformations, cultural shifts, and industry changes, always focusing on people, performance, and being a reliable partner to our customers. His leadership reflects our SEG Automotive DNA, championing values such as <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftakingresponsibility&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TakingResponsibility</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fforwardthinking&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ForwardThinking</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsustainabilitymindset&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SustainabilityMindset</a>.
&#xA0;
This mindset has been instrumental in Treto&#x2019;s evolution &#x2013; from achieving <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/tuvsud?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>T&#xDC;V S&#xDC;D</a>&#x2019;s <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fzerowaste&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#zerowaste</a> certification to expanding our technological capabilities, including the clean room for <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Felectronics&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#electronics</a> assembly, a key milestone in our transformation for the future of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmobility&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#mobility</a>.
&#xA0;
Congratulations, <a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/in/inaki-calvo-976a3054?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Inaki</a>, and thank you for your dedication to our teams, customers, and the industry! &#x1F44F; 

