lities, and let’s explore how we can support your operations. 📍 France Pavilion – Stand 640C Looking forward to seeing you there! GIFAS - Groupement des Industries Françaises Aéronautiques et Spatiales #event #Sabenatechnics #DAS2025","text_html":"[EVENT] Day 2 at the <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/company/dubai-airshow?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dubai Airshow</a> 2025! &#x2708;&#xFE0F;

