Eurowings has presented its very first award for outstanding maintenance performance during the Winter 2024/25 season to Sabena technics. This recognition celebrates the exceptional dedication, technical expertise, and teamwork of our Perpignan site, whose continuous commitment ensures the highest level of safety and reliability for our customers. “Customer satisfaction is at the heart of our values. This award reflects the everyday commitment of our teams to deliver reliable, top-quality maintenance solutions. We are proud of this recognition and warmly congratulate our colleagues in Perpignan.” — Hervé Grandjean , President of Sabena technics. “This award reflects the strong partnership and outstanding performance of the Sabena technics team in Perpignan. We truly value this cooperation and look forward to continuing our successful journey together.” — Matthias Gruber , Vice President Technical Fleet Management Eurowings & Managing Director Eurowings Technik . We sincerely thank Eurowings for their trust and partnership and extend our heartfelt congratulations to all the teams involved for making this achievement possible. #Eurowings #Sabenatechnics #AircraftMaintenance #Aviationatheart #CustomerSatisfaction","text_html":"[NEWS] A proud moment for Sabena technics! &#x2708;&#xFE0F;

We are delighted to share that <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/eurowings-aviation-gmbh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Eurowings</a> has presented its very first award for outstanding maintenance performance during the Winter 2024/25 season to Sabena technics.

This recognition celebrates the exceptional dedication, technical expertise, and teamwork of our Perpignan site, whose continuous commitment ensures the highest level of safety and reliability for our customers.

&#x201C;Customer satisfaction is at the heart of our values. This award reflects the everyday commitment of our teams to deliver reliable, top-quality maintenance solutions. We are proud of this recognition and warmly congratulate our colleagues in Perpignan.&#x201D;
&#x2014; <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/herv%C3%A9-grandjean-7bb0021?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Herv&#xE9; Grandjean</a>, President of Sabena technics.

&#x201C;This award reflects the strong partnership and outstanding performance of the Sabena technics team in Perpignan. We truly value this cooperation and look forward to continuing our successful journey together.&#x201D; &#x2014; <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/matthias-gruber?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Matthias Gruber</a>, Vice President Technical Fleet Management Eurowings &amp; Managing Director <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/eurowingstechnik?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Eurowings Technik</a>.

We sincerely thank Eurowings for their trust and partnership and extend our heartfelt congratulations to all the teams involved for making this achievement possible.

