kedin.com/posts/sabena-technics_mroeurope-aviationatheart-event-activity-7384152108138201088-glNl","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"[EVENT] Greetings from London! 🇬🇧✈️ MRO Europe 2025 is now open! Our Sabena technics team is excited to welcome you at Stand #1205 to present our wide range of aviation solutions, including: 🔹 Airframe & component MRO 🔹 Modifications & cabin upgrades 🔹 Engineering services 🔹 Painting & livery solutions 🔹 Aircraft transition support Let’s connect and discuss how we can help you keep your fleet flying safely and efficiently. See you at #MROEurope ! Aviation Week Events #Aviationatheart #event","text_html":"[EVENT] Greetings from London! &#x1F1EC;&#x1F1E7;&#x2708;&#xFE0F;

MRO Europe 2025 is now open!
Our Sabena technics team is excited to welcome you at Stand #1205 to present our wide range of aviation solutions, including:

&#x1F539; Airframe &amp; component MRO
&#x1F539; Modifications &amp; cabin upgrades
&#x1F539; Engineering services
&#x1F539; Painting &amp; livery solutions
&#x1F539; Aircraft transition support

