7Y","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEwpgVIWCCOaQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZsTLs1dIwAw-/0/1765553395411?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-SnXW3LiTqNMf_YZzKfI6naQt6WHsjAudVPqhZYYmOo","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQH-eJTlEGqRlQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZsTLs1sGYAw-/0/1765553394407?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=BSndwVeoVuWtxviaElEOYHQdiK_oE-X8hT6PStkAVhU"],"likes_count":117,"post_id":"7405267676182323200","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/deepwellservices_did-you-know-deep-well-services-and-ev-activity-7405267676182323200-P-Nb","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Did you know? 🤔 Deep Well Services and EV have partnered to introduce Video While Fishing (VWF), a first-of-its-kind service that brings high-definition visual intelligence directly into fishing operations. VWF merges EV’s Optis downhole camera with DWS’s patented HCU and BoreSite® Technology, delivering: 🔍 Clear visualization of the fish 📏 Accurate measurement of size, position, and orientation ⚙️ Insight to optimize the BHA ⏱️ Increased retrieval efficiency and reduced NPT Earlier this month, we completed a full system test at our Training Center in PA, validating the workflow, data clarity, and operational readiness of the VWF service. ✅ We’re proud to bring this new capability to the industry, helping operators eliminate guesswork, reduce risk, and bring wells back online faster. 🚀 Want to learn more? businessdevelopment@deepwellservices.com Enersol Energy Solutions","text_html":"Did you know? &#x1F914;
Deep Well Services and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/ev?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>EV</a> have partnered to introduce Video While Fishing (VWF), a first-of-its-kind service that brings high-definition visual intelligence directly into fishing operations.
&#xA0;
VWF merges EV&#x2019;s Optis downhole camera with DWS&#x2019;s patented HCU and BoreSite&#xAE; Technology, delivering:
&#x1F50D; Clear visualization of the fish
&#x1F4CF; Accurate measurement of size, position, and orientation
&#x2699;&#xFE0F; Insight to optimize the BHA
&#x23F1;&#xFE0F; Increased retrieval efficiency and reduced NPT
&#xA0;
Earlier this month, we completed a full system test at our Training Center in PA, validating the workflow, data clarity, and operational readiness of the VWF service. &#x2705;
&#xA0;
We&#x2019;re proud to bring this new capability to the industry, helping operators eliminate guesswork, reduce risk, and bring wells back online faster. &#x1F680;
&#xA0;
