 تطبيق أفضل الممارسات العالمية في تقنية التجميد والإرجاع للأجنة المجمدة Vitrification . وقد جاء الإعلان عن هذا الفوز خلال فعاليات مؤتمر الخصوبة للشرق الأوسط، الذي استضافته مدينة دبي خلال الفترة من 2 إلى 6 ديسمبر 2025، بمشاركة واسعة من خبراء وتقنيات الإخصاب من مختلف دول العالم. Dr. Sulaiman Al Habib Medical Group is proud to announce that its IVF Laboratories for Infertility and Assisted Reproduction have been awarded the Best Practice Recognition Award in Vitrification 2025. This recognition makes the Group the first healthcare institution in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia to receive this prestigious international award. The achievement reflects the laboratories’ excellence in applying global best practices in embryo freezing and thawing (Vitrification), and reinforces the Group’s commitment to advancing reproductive medicine and delivering high-quality healthcare services. The award was announced during the Middle East Fertility Conference, held in Dubai from December 2 to 6, 2025, with the participation of leading experts and specialists in fertility and reproductive technologies from around the world.","text_html":"&#x643;&#x623;&#x648;&#x644; &#x645;&#x646;&#x634;&#x623;&#x629; &#x635;&#x62D;&#x64A;&#x629; &#x628;&#x627;&#x644;&#x645;&#x645;&#x644;&#x643;&#x629;

