Dr. Sulaiman Al Habib Medical Group is proud to announce that its IVF Laboratories for Infertility and Assisted Reproduction have been awarded the Best Practice Recognition Award in Vitrification 2025.

This recognition makes the Group the first healthcare institution in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia to receive this prestigious international award.

The achievement reflects the laboratories&#x2019; excellence in applying global best practices in embryo freezing and thawing (Vitrification), and reinforces the Group&#x2019;s commitment to advancing reproductive medicine and delivering high-quality healthcare services.

