This community represents the next evolution of professional education: a space where science-backed learning, expert-led insights, and peer-to-peer connection come together. Built to support professionals at every stage of their career, the IDI Community enables members to stay current, sharpen their expertise, and connect with a worldwide network of like-minded practitioner&#x2019;s and retail associates.

As the foundation of the Dermalogica education ecosystem, this launch reinforces our long-standing commitment to elevating the profession through credibility, innovation, and meaningful connection.
The future of professional skin health is collaborative, and it starts here.

