Check out NewBeauty&#x2019;s coverage of Dermalogica PRO&apos;s latest milestone in skin health innovation:

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gRT_UQEy?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gRT_UQEy</a> ","time":"3mo","title":"Dermalogica"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-10-04T04:03:09.946Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/sync/v2/D4E27AQHiWqU37SuK2Q/articleshare-shrink_1280_800/B4EZkzgkNgKQAQ-/0/1757505799324?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=OupMZrBC6rHO15KgN-sUmNahyfX96ihY8AFht5QAF3E"],"likes_count":230,"post_id":"7371573229121028096","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/dermalogica_dermalogica-pro-secures-fda-510k-clearance-activity-7371573229121028096-_SFf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Major milestone achieved. ✅ We have officially secured FDA 510(k) clearance for the next generation of our Pro Pen Microneedling System. This milestone underscores our commitment to advancing skin health through science-backed innovation. Achieving clearance required a rigorous approach that combined precise regulatory planning, scientifically robust clinical studies, and strong alignment with FDA requirements. As consumer preference rises for less invasive, evidence-backed treatments and in-office solutions that deliver results without compromise, the PRO Pen Microneedling System positions us at the forefront of next-generation medical aesthetics. This clearance reinforces the brand’s role not only as a global authority in professional skincare, but a natural progression rooted in education, trust, and clinical excellence as a medical device innovator. Additional details on features, training, protocols, and availability will be shared early next year. For more details please read our official press release. https://lnkd.in/gP69fC9E","text_html":"Major milestone achieved. &#x2705;
&#xA0;
We have officially secured FDA 510(k) clearance for the next generation of our Pro Pen Microneedling System.
&#xA0;
This milestone underscores our commitment to advancing skin health through science-backed innovation. Achieving clearance required a rigorous approach that combined precise regulatory planning, scientifically robust clinical studies, and strong alignment with FDA requirements.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
As consumer preference rises for less invasive, evidence-backed treatments and in-office solutions that deliver results without compromise, the PRO Pen Microneedling System positions us at the forefront of next-generation medical aesthetics. This clearance reinforces the brand&#x2019;s role not only as a global authority in professional skincare, but a natural progression rooted in education, trust, and clinical excellence as a medical device innovator.
&#xA0;
Additional details on features, training, protocols, and availability will be shared early next year. For more details please read our official press release.

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gP69fC9E?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gP69fC9E</a> ","time":"3mo","title":"Dermalogica"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-09-04T04:03:09.950Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/sync/v2/D4D27AQEgf7tf-VUB9w/articleshare-shrink_1280_800/B4DZhnvy2lGsAQ-/0/1754087239577?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=MnKxht_GYu32dqsEq-IrwQc6RfG0q_i0wzYFti8h9U8"],"likes_count":127,"post_id":"7358889631959932929","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/dermalogica_the-hottest-skincare-launches-disrupting-activity-7358889631959932929-u3qV","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Professional-grade innovation isn’t a buzzword - it’s our blueprint. That’s why we’re honored to see Exo Booster featured in BeautyMatter’s roundup of “The Hottest Skincare Launches Disrupting the Industry.” More than recognition, this moment reflects our ongoing commitment to developing advanced solutions that both push boundaries and elevate skin health. Powered by cutting-edge bacterial and our exclusive pro-resolution technology, Exo Booster introduces a first-of-its-kind bacteria exosome complex derived from Lactobacillus—delivering 10 billion exosomes per session to visibly enhance skin vitality, texture, and elasticity. Designed to accelerate skin recovery post advanced treatment and deliver amplified results, Exo Booster is part of how we continue pushing what’s possible in professional skin treatments—for our partners, for their clients, and for the future of the industry. #DermalogicaPro #SkinHealth #ProfessionalSkincare #BeautyMatterAwards #InnovationInSkincare https://lnkd.in/gE4ZCNS2","text_html":"Professional-grade innovation isn&#x2019;t a buzzword - it&#x2019;s our blueprint. That&#x2019;s why we&#x2019;re honored to see Exo Booster featured in BeautyMatter&#x2019;s roundup of &#x201C;The Hottest Skincare Launches Disrupting the Industry.&#x201D;

More than recognition, this moment reflects our ongoing commitment to developing advanced solutions that&#xA0;both push boundaries and elevate skin health. Powered by cutting-edge bacterial and our exclusive pro-resolution technology, Exo Booster introduces a first-of-its-kind&#xA0;bacteria exosome complex derived from Lactobacillus&#x2014;delivering 10 billion exosomes per session to visibly enhance skin vitality, texture, and elasticity.

Designed to accelerate skin recovery post advanced treatment and deliver amplified results, Exo Booster is part of how we continue pushing what&#x2019;s possible in professional skin treatments&#x2014;for our partners, for their clients, and for the future of the industry.

