efending the Digital Economy&#x201D; in NYC to discuss the evolving cybersecurity landscape and what it will take to strengthen digital resilience in an increasingly connected world.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
AI significantly amplifies both opportunity and risk, requiring security to evolve through stronger foundational hygiene, AI-powered defenses, and a resilient security culture. As AI introduces entirely new classes of attacks, defenders must also leverage AI&#x2014;failure to do so will only widen the imbalance in favor of attackers.
&#xA0;
Thank you to <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/timsteno?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Tim Stenovec</a> for a thoughtful and energizing fireside chat, and to <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/bloomberglive?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bloomberg Live</a> for convening such an important conversation.
