This role supports the global Source to Pay organization and plays a key part in shaping legal strategy across sourcing, procurement, and complex operational workflows.

As Senior Legal Counsel, you will advise on regulatory and compliance risks, support revenue impacting transactions, and partner with teams across Sales, Finance, Procurement, Marketing, Engineering, and Business Units. Your expertise will guide high impact decisions in a fast paced collaborative environment.

If you are looking for an opportunity where your legal insight drives strategy and supports global operations, this role offers a meaningful way to make an impact.

&#x1F517; Apply today: <a class="link" href="https://adobe.ly/3MZNr8W?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://adobe.ly/3MZNr8W</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fadobelife&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AdobeLife</a>","time":"2w","title":"Adobe"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-12-22T00:02:18.594Z","likes_count":86,"post_id":"7406498438776786944","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/adobe_employee-spotlight-on-jeff-wee-activity-7406498438776786944-ILr1","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Ever wondered what it’s like to move from being a customer to stepping into a vendor role? 🤔 Jeff Wee , FSI Solutions Consultant based in our Singapore office, shares what it has been like to shift from the agency side to a customer-facing role at Adobe. He talks about how moving from managing many clients at once to partnering deeply with complex organizations changed the way he solves problems, collaborates with teams, and supports long-term digital transformation. He also reflects on what surprised him about vendor roles, what stayed the same, and where he has found the most room to grow. If you’re exploring a transition into consulting, customer solutions work, or the broader vendor ecosystem, Jeff’s perspective offers a grounded look at how these roles create impact across industries and shape the future of digital experiences. Want to stay connected with opportunities at Adobe? Join our Talent Community! 🔗 https://adobe.ly/3YrTbeb #AdobeLife","text_html":"Ever wondered what it&#x2019;s like to move from being a customer to stepping into a vendor role? &#x1F914;

<a class="link" href="https://sg.linkedin.com/in/jeffwee?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jeff Wee</a>, FSI Solutions Consultant based in our Singapore office, shares what it has been like to shift from the agency side to a customer-facing role at Adobe.

He talks about how moving from managing many clients at once to partnering deeply with complex organizations changed the way he solves problems, collaborates with teams, and supports long-term digital transformation. He also reflects on what surprised him about vendor roles, what stayed the same, and where he has found the most room to grow.

If you&#x2019;re exploring a transition into consulting, customer solutions work, or the broader vendor ecosystem, Jeff&#x2019;s perspective offers a grounded look at how these roles create impact across industries and shape the future of digital experiences.

Want to stay connected with opportunities at Adobe? Join our Talent Community!

&#x1F517; <a class="link" href="https://adobe.ly/3YrTbeb?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://adobe.ly/3YrTbeb</a>

