cking project. We’re carefully taking down, relocating, and reinstalling racking at the client’s new location. Big shoutout to our crew for keeping everything running smoothly and efficiently! 💪 #AnchorSolutions #WarehouseInstallation #PalletRacking #RackingProject #NeenahWI #TeamAnchor","text_html":"&#x1F4BC; It&#x2019;s Been a Busy November!

Our team is hard at work in Neenah, WI on a multi-phase, large-scale pallet racking project. We&#x2019;re carefully taking down, relocating, and reinstalling racking at the client&#x2019;s new location.

Big shoutout to our crew for keeping everything running smoothly and efficiently! &#x1F4AA;

