e celebrated our sixth annual Magic Awards&#x1FA84; &#x2014; a moment to honor the incredible talent fueling our business and inviting the world to come play with style. Inspired by our Imagine Better Values-Based Leadership Behaviors and the unique magic of the Old Navy brand, this year&#x2019;s awards spotlighted standout teams and exceptional individuals who bring their best, all year long. Our winners took the stage to standing ovations, big smiles, and plenty of well-deserved applause. &#x1F44F; &#x1F3C6; &#x1F499;  

