kedin.com/posts/gap-inc%2E-old-navy_gap-inc-q3-2025-earnings-are-out-and-old-activity-7397438829491761152-0E8w","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Gap Inc. Q3 2025 earnings are out, and Old Navy delivered another strong performance with comparable sales up 6%, marking our two-year trend of market share gains, driven by great product, clear storytelling, and the joy that only our brand can bring! The quarter was fueled by a robust back-to-school season, along with continued strength in Denim and Activewear. We also launched a new collection of Handbags, expanded our Beauty offering, and debuted our first-ever designer collaboration with fashion legend Anna Sui – all while continuing to focus on value, style, and accessibility! Thank you to the teams across our stores, headquarters and distribution centers for your creativity, dedication, and focus on bringing our brand to life for our customers. “The progress we’re making belongs to you – you bring our purpose to life every single day. I’m proud of what we’ve accomplished together and excited for what’s ahead.” – Haio Barbeito, Old Navy CEO","text_html":"<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/gap-inc-?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Gap Inc.</a> Q3 2025 earnings are out, and Old Navy delivered another strong performance with comparable sales up 6%, marking our two-year trend of market share gains, driven by great product, clear storytelling, and the joy that only our brand can bring!

The quarter was fueled by a robust back-to-school season, along with continued strength in Denim and Activewear. We also launched a new collection of Handbags, expanded our Beauty offering, and debuted our first-ever designer collaboration with fashion legend <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/anna-sui?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Anna Sui</a> &#x2013; all while continuing to focus on value, style, and accessibility!
&#xA0;
Thank you to the teams across our stores, headquarters and distribution centers for your creativity, dedication, and focus on bringing our brand to life for our customers.
&#xA0;
&#x201C;The progress we&#x2019;re making belongs to you &#x2013; you bring our purpose to life every single day. I&#x2019;m proud of what we&#x2019;ve accomplished together and excited for what&#x2019;s ahead.&#x201D; &#x2013; Haio Barbeito, Old Navy CEO","time":"1mo","title":"Old Navy"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-12-03T12:36:42.867Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHEYLJJ03QtxA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZp.hshDGoAg-/0/1763059354721?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1dX7KuGP4Szc6L1iTBkY9j9ntE4pibooxnDsuejH_xE"],"likes_count":487,"post_id":"7394806909616435200","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/gap-inc%2E-old-navy_were-excited-to-announce-that-weve-teamed-activity-7394806909616435200-R4-R","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We’re excited to announce that we’ve teamed up with DoorDash to make shopping easier – just in time for the holidays! Shoppers nationwide can now get their favorites for the whole family, including denim, active wear, and Jingle Jammies, delivered right to their doors through DoorDash. From family matching to the latest trends (and everything in between!), Old Navy style is now just a tap away. “We like to meet customers where they are – on their terms. For us, that means removing friction and adding joy, making it easy for our customers and their families to get what they love, how and when they want it. Now, shopping for great style is as simple and accessible as ordering dinner or groceries.” -Haio Barbeito, Old Navy Brand President and CEO","text_html":"We&#x2019;re excited to announce that we&#x2019;ve teamed up with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/doordash?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>DoorDash</a> to make shopping easier &#x2013; just in time for the holidays! Shoppers nationwide can now get their favorites for the whole family, including denim, active wear, and Jingle Jammies, delivered right to their doors through DoorDash. From family matching to the latest trends (and everything in between!), Old Navy style is now just a tap away. 

&#x201C;We like to meet customers where they are &#x2013; on their terms. For us, that means removing friction and adding joy, making it easy for our&#xA0;customers and their families to get what they love, how and when they want it. Now, shopping for great style is as simple and&#xA0;accessible as ordering dinner or groceries.&#x201D;&#xA0;-Haio Barbeito, Old Navy Brand&#xA0;President and CEO","time":"1mo","title":"Old Navy"},{"comments_count":6,"date":"2025-11-03T12:36:42.868Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGbyfgFxEs4wg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZosRp_FG4Ag-/0/1761679418017?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1nOxoMC_SLikRvxFiFmIr9D9Awh2ZLdXqXBgDSxS0go","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFJnuPWZiHrDA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZosRp_jJ8Ag-/0/1761679418221?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mtMyy2YUdkPKYw5geEY_QF0GP2r0vtufwmfusBwPzLk","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHh3f4c08Ll_g/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZosRp_9JQAg-/0/1761679418069?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NiP4-5f3JEMVrNNI8cVXvHv__3XEX66PxiLRlzwIPnE"],"likes_count":355,"post_id":"7389019038099755008","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/gap-inc%2E-old-navy_let-joy-take-flight-we-teamed-up-with-activity-7389019038099755008-iCNw","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Let joy take flight 🦋 We teamed up with legendary designer Anna Sui for our first-ever designer collab. The exclusive limited-edition capsule is a celebration of bold style, self-expression, and joy for all generations. Bringing together romantic silhouettes, elevated denim, and Anna’s signature butterfly motif, the collection is a symbol of creativity and freedom brought to life by one of today’s hottest musical artists, PinkPantheress. Her bold fashion sense aligns perfectly with how our customers play with style confidently. “Anna is a true American icon - fun, joyful, rock ‘n’ roll, and with the coolest taste in fashion. She has infused this collection with everything the Old Navy community loves: energy, joy, and a spirit of fun. It’s the perfect balance for Old Navy, and we’re thrilled that she is our very first designer collaborator." - Zac Posen, Old Navy Chief Creative Officer Read more via Vogue: https://lnkd.in/gUfUVfQ7","text_html":"Let joy take flight &#x1F98B; We teamed up with legendary designer&#xA0;Anna Sui&#xA0;for our&#xA0;first-ever&#xA0;designer collab. The exclusive limited-edition capsule is a celebration of bold style, self-expression, and joy for all generations.

Bringing together romantic silhouettes, elevated denim, and Anna&#x2019;s signature butterfly motif, the collection is a symbol of creativity and freedom brought to life by one of today&#x2019;s hottest musical artists, PinkPantheress. Her bold fashion sense aligns perfectly with how our customers play with style confidently.&#xA0; 

&#x201C;Anna is a true American icon - fun, joyful, rock &#x2018;n&#x2019; roll, and with the coolest taste in fashion. She has infused this collection with everything the Old Navy community loves: energy, joy, and a spirit of fun. It&#x2019;s the perfect balance for Old Navy, and we&#x2019;re thrilled that she is our very first designer collaborator.&quot; - Zac Posen, Old Navy Chief Creative Officer 

Read more via Vogue: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gUfUVfQ7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gUfUVfQ7</a>","time":"2mo","title":"Old Navy"},{"comments_count":6,"date":"2025-10-04T12:36:42.869Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHPWYSUI8ghPg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZkxMIwBHcAg-/0/1757466889766?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=b4pG9c1M3tJwu_O3joxFXv0f7IdJc8uenKe1bB_KXqk","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFwHchgdKatqg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZkxMIv8J4Ak-/0/1757466890142?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=IzMm47wcbd3iE3m7cdoP39vNq3oYFBHQZ-v-ueyLeHs","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQF_guFDilddYA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZkxMIv6KwAg-/0/1757466889869?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=XkBJpQCzcDcp3ZTHlr0GQzv30pgchQu3ttamu9OJspY"],"likes_count":243,"post_id":"7371350412425310208","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/gap-inc%2E-old-navy_cue-the-compliments-a-new-era-of-handbags-activity-7371350412425310208-NuwB","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Cue the compliments - a new era of handbags has arrived at Old Navy! ✨ Our most stylish lineup yet features three distinct collections, blending trend-forward design with everyday functionality. 👜 The Carrie - a tribute to late fashion editor and longtime Old Navy campaign star Carrie Donovan 👝 The Preppy - polished and classic with a modern twist 👛 The Romantic - soft, feminine, and versatile “When looking to elevate Old Navy style for our customers, an accessory is an incredibly accessible way to attain a style. It doesn’t require fit. It can be a keepsake. It can be a pass-me-down. It can elevate the everyday outfit, and just give it that elevated zhuzh.” - Zac Posen, Chief Creative Officer Thoughtfully designed and endlessly wearable, each style is ready to meet you wherever life takes you - from morning drop-off to date night. Read more via WWD at the link below. 💙 https://lnkd.in/eu5zUdtD","text_html":"Cue the compliments - a new era of handbags has arrived at Old Navy! &#x2728; Our most stylish lineup yet features three distinct collections, blending trend-forward design with everyday functionality.

&#x1F45C; The Carrie - a tribute to late fashion editor and longtime Old Navy campaign star Carrie Donovan
&#x1F45D; The Preppy - polished and classic with a modern twist
&#x1F45B; The Romantic - soft, feminine, and versatile

&#x201C;When looking to elevate Old Navy style for our customers, an accessory is an incredibly accessible way to attain a style. It doesn&#x2019;t require fit. It can be a keepsake. It can be a pass-me-down. It can elevate the everyday outfit, and just give it that elevated zhuzh.&#x201D; - Zac Posen, Chief Creative Officer

Thoughtfully designed and endlessly wearable, each style is ready to meet you wherever life takes you - from morning drop-off to date night. Read more via WWD at the link below. &#x1F499;

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eu5zUdtD?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eu5zUdtD</a>","time":"3mo Edited","title":"Old Navy"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-09-04T12:36:42.871Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFtVqGIpdf5Qg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZjzD.ZUH8Ao-/0/1756424564946?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=CcRsg-_euGY0Mj1zP885DP8bhstzLXk7d7PMix8dEI8","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQH81mpA-o-qJQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZjzD.YUHAAg-/0/1756424563357?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=YrVFtsOrI-VF8JCy2OxGr9xv0bjV_z7vaf28DcVfR5g","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFANweLnliw_A/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZjzD.Y4G4Ao-/0/1756424563358?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=STrzHaNyBUjr1X_lwTUBJuFop7hCIGKdxqZ9UcQIX2U","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFLq6RJ_hJJ3w/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZjzD.Y.HUAk-/0/1756424563047?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=iEWoC27UyKXempuQB5YXXiSYxHXU7RyY5TGDL_lB9SU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHXmfsiDpXgEw/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZjzD.YkHIAo-/0/1756424565903?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0lrNX6gbvDnA3_uqrpVny7YXdGCTP2sVDOkordPq8lk"],"likes_count":450,"post_id":"7366982924597956608","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/gap-inc%2E-old-navy_q2-2025-earnings-for-gap-inc-are-out-and-activity-7366982924597956608-S37l","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Q2 2025 Earnings for Gap Inc. are out - and Old Navy has a lot to celebrate, including delivering +2% comparable sales, on top of +5% last year, fueling consistent, sustainable growth. We’re continuing to win with our customers by leaning into categories they love most - from trend-right baggy and wide-leg fits in denim, to a growing active business powered by “Old Navy, New Moves,” our first major active campaign in years. We’re also showing up in fresh and exciting ways for the whole family, including the launch of our limited-edition Disney Summer Americana collection. These efforts are resonating with our customers, with strong Net Promoter Scores at our stores. Congratulations, Team Old Navy, on another strong quarter. We’re proud of what we’ve built - and even more excited for what’s ahead!","text_html":"Q2 2025 Earnings for Gap Inc. are out - and Old Navy has a lot to celebrate, including delivering +2% comparable sales, on top of +5% last year, fueling consistent, sustainable growth.
&#xA0;
We&#x2019;re continuing to win with our customers by leaning into categories they love most - from trend-right baggy and wide-leg fits in denim, to a growing active business powered by &#x201C;Old Navy, New Moves,&#x201D; our first major active campaign in years. We&#x2019;re also showing up in fresh and exciting ways for the whole family, including the launch of our limited-edition Disney Summer Americana collection. These efforts are resonating with our customers, with strong Net Promoter Scores at our stores.
