ge/v2/D5622AQFHZGl69BoZdg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZfSdDttGoAg-/0/1751582534659?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jqUO6hwxwAlezRgQ818UkpK45kfr12g-kHxD9mcOFAc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFnmkw32tJq1w/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZfSdDulH8Ak-/0/1751582534868?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=U8EZYKiwz3frDb8lTdURwufriDH5h7XES-hqMyb5Ch8"],"likes_count":328,"post_id":"7346669640875462657","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/gap-inc%2E-old-navy_onflc25-oldnavy-activity-7346669640875462657-7ojN","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We’re still riding high from the 2025 Field Leadership Conference! Last week, 1,500 field leaders from 1,200+ stores came together in Las Vegas for a jam-packed few days of inspiration, connection, and celebration. From main stage moments to breakout brilliance, we leveled up our skills, led with heart, and kept our customers front and center. Huge shoutout to our incredible store leaders—the heartbeat of our brand—who show up every day to bring joy to our customers and each other. #ONFLC25 #OldNavy","text_html":"We&#x2019;re still riding high from the 2025 Field Leadership Conference! Last week, 1,500 field leaders from 1,200+ stores came together in Las Vegas for a jam-packed few days of inspiration, connection, and celebration. From main stage moments to breakout brilliance, we leveled up our skills, led with heart, and kept our customers front and center. 

Huge shoutout to our incredible store leaders&#x2014;the heartbeat of our brand&#x2014;who show up every day to bring joy to our customers and each other. 

