2657","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/siriinfo_20yearsofexcellence-siriinfo-anniversarycelebration-activity-7407811889914822657-NUnw","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Celebrating 20 Years of Trust. Talent. Transformation! 🎊🎉 Today marks a proud milestone as Siriinfo turns 20! Over the past two decades, we’ve delivered impactful staffing solutions, built lasting partnerships, and helped shape countless careers. This achievement is made possible by the trust of our clients, the dedication of our incredible team, and the strong relationships we’ve built along the way. We are truly grateful to each and every one of you. 🙌 As we celebrate this moment, we’re excited for what lies ahead continuing to connect exceptional talent, drive innovation, and create success stories together. 🤝🚀 Here’s to the next chapter of growth, collaboration, and impact! 🎊 🎉 #20YearsOfExcellence #Siriinfo #AnniversaryCelebration #Trust #Talent #Transformation #StaffingSuccess #Partnerships #Grateful #FutureReady","text_html":"Celebrating 20 Years of Trust. Talent. Transformation! &#x1F38A;&#x1F389;

