 Grill is known for being in the heart of Jeddah. A sincere thank you to everyone involved in bringing this location to life. We look forward to welcoming our guests and becoming part of Jeddah’s vibrant dining scene. #AzadeaGroup #TheButcherShopAndGrill #NowOpen #JeddahVibes #KSA","text_html":"We&#x2019;re happy to open the doors of&#xA0;The Butcher Shop &amp; Grill at Jeddah Vibes.
Expanding into Jeddah marks an important chapter for us&#x2014;bringing our signature cuts, flavors, and dining experience to one of the city&#x2019;s most exciting new destinations.

This opening reflects months of collaboration, planning, and passion from our teams, all working toward one goal: delivering the quality and hospitality The Butcher Shop &amp; Grill is known for being in the heart of Jeddah.

A sincere thank you to everyone involved in bringing this location to life. We look forward to welcoming our guests and becoming part of Jeddah&#x2019;s vibrant dining scene.

