M, Ayush for being true partners in this journey. Onwards and upwards! 🚀✨ #ProudMoment #AZADEA #CRMLeadership #LifecycleMarketing #RetentionMarketing #CustomerEngagement #TeamExcellence #MoEngage","text_html":"We did it! &#x1F3C6;&#x2728;

Winning the Lifecycle &amp; Retention Marketing Excellence Award 2025 at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/moengage?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>MoEngage</a> is a proud milestone for our journey at <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/company/azadea-group?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Azadea Group</a>. 

What matters most to me is the people behind this win, an incredible team that shows up every day with passion, resilience, and excellence: <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/aishwarya-soman-marketing-specialist?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Aishwarya</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/amanace?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Gur</a>, <a class="link" href="https://lb.linkedin.com/in/lara-nassif?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lara</a>, <a class="link" href="https://lb.linkedin.com/in/ziad-rawas?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ziad</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/fatima-elamin-a006b1348?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Fatima</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/reuel-pereira-2413431ba?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Reuel</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/mubeen-rafeeque-b13223195?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mubeen</a>, <a class="link" href="https://lb.linkedin.com/in/amalboustany?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Amal</a>

Grateful to all teams supporting and collaborating with CRM across AZADEA.

A heartfelt thank you to <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/sajbhojani?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mohammed Sajjad</a> &amp; <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/shaheer-usmani-a03a2040?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Shaheer Usmani</a> for the continued trust and for empowering the CRM function to create real impact. We couldn&#x2019;t have done this without your support.

Grateful to <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/moengage?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>MoEngage</a> and our CSM, <a class="link" href="https://ae.linkedin.com/in/ayushpandey3?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ayush</a> for being true partners in this journey.

Onwards and upwards! &#x1F680;&#x2728;

