<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdaimlertruck&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DaimlerTruck</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffuso&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FUSO</a> | <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/fuso-europe?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>FUSO Europe</a>","time":"3d","title":"Daimler Truck AG"},{"comments_count":95,"date":"2025-12-29T14:04:50.927Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFgwy2Dr4RoBw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZtpLmOoIMAg-/0/1766996209508?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=UZ6-g7sNEjEh1MHE-EtXcWPvK8MPdKgabI8Xa6bWkDQ"],"likes_count":1460,"post_id":"7411319275405144064","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/daimlertruckag_communications-daimlertruck-globalcommunications-activity-7411319275405144064-BWjv","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"All the best, Jörg Howe ! Our Head of Global Communications & External Affairs is about to enter his well-deserved retirement. 🚛🚌👋 👉️ Jörg, on board since October 2008, has shaped #Communications at the former Daimler AG and later at Daimler Truck AG like no one else, and always from the front row. 👉️ Karin Rådström , President & CEO of Daimler Truck: “On behalf of the entire Board, I would like to thank Jörg for his dedication and his invaluable contribution to Daimler Truck over the past years. With his passion for communication, he has strengthened Daimler Truck’s reputation and supported our organization through pivotal changes. We wish Jörg all the best for this new chapter in his life.” 👉️ Did you know? Andy Johnson , currently Head of Corporate Communications at Daimler Truck North America , will succeed Jörg Howe as Head of Global Communications & External Affairs Daimler Truck as of January 1, 2026. #DaimlerTruck #GlobalCommunications #ExternalAffairs","text_html":"All the best, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/j%C3%B6rg-howe-ab0354183?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>J&#xF6;rg Howe</a>! Our Head of Global Communications &amp; External Affairs is about to enter his well-deserved retirement. &#x1F69B;&#x1F68C;&#x1F44B;

&#x1F449;&#xFE0F; J&#xF6;rg, on board since October 2008, has shaped <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcommunications&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Communications</a> at the former Daimler AG and later at <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/daimlertruckag?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daimler Truck AG</a> like no one else, and always from the front row.

&#x1F449;&#xFE0F; <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/karin-r%C3%A5dstr%C3%B6m-524524?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Karin R&#xE5;dstr&#xF6;m</a>, President &amp; CEO of Daimler Truck: &#x201C;On behalf of the entire Board, I would like to thank J&#xF6;rg for his dedication and his invaluable contribution to Daimler Truck over the past years. With his passion for communication, he has strengthened Daimler Truck&#x2019;s reputation and supported our organization through pivotal changes. We wish J&#xF6;rg all the best for this new chapter in his life.&#x201D;

&#x1F449;&#xFE0F; Did you know? <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/andy-johnson-2ba8b59?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Andy Johnson</a>, currently Head of Corporate Communications at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/daimlertrucknorthamerica?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daimler Truck North America</a>, will succeed J&#xF6;rg Howe as Head of Global Communications &amp; External Affairs Daimler Truck as of January 1, 2026.

