y-nhc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NHC</a>&#xA0;since 2017. Together, we&#x2019;ve supported the development of major digital platforms like&#xA0;Sakani&#xA0;and&#xA0;Ejar, helping transform housing services across Saudi Arabia.
It&#x2019;s great to see NHC&#x2019;s CEO <a class="link" href="https://sa.linkedin.com/in/mohammad-albuty-1b11946?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mohammad Albuty</a> featured on CNN - a testament to NHC&#x2019;s leadership and the impact of its digital vision. Looking forward to continuing our shared journey in building innovative, citizen-centric solutions. &#x1F680;

