/sa.linkedin.com/company/cst_ksa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Communications, Space &amp; Technology Commission (CST)</a> highlighted as a success case in the Partner Connect side-event with the IT Infrastructure Director Ahmad Alshehri sharing his insights of their transformation project. <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foivan&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Oivan</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgooglecloudsummit&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GoogleCloudSummit</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgooglecloudsummitsaudi&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GoogleCloudSummitSaudi</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgcp&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GCP</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdigitaltransformation&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#DigitalTransformation</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsaudiarabia&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SaudiArabia</a>","time":"1mo","title":"Tapio Äijälä"},{"date":"2025-12-03T12:41:45.990Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQEXli7a7tba9g/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZpxnu0PIgAw-/0/1762842838015?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=AEwLYuGujWkq8IrNflMTFv8_tZ3QSvd8PG58U5nJXX0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHRoqZUFWLT7g/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZpxnu0THwA0-/0/1762842837869?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=AsQUQN4dMonp4rhlmLRETfAET64hwl4XLS9_gB9oCwk"],"likes_count":26,"post_id":"7393898774605209601","post_url":"https://ae.linkedin.com/posts/oivan_oivan-gbuilder-cityscape-activity-7393898774605209601-IiPZ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"The future of real estate is here — and we’re bringing it to life at Cityscape! Oivan, in partnership with GBuilder, is redefining the entire homebuyer journey — from sales to handover and beyond — through one powerful digital platform built on BIM technology. Smarter. Faster. More human. Join us at Cityscape and see how we’re transforming the way real estate and construction connect people, data, and experiences. Contact us to arrange a meeting : mai.hassan@oivan.com مستقبل العقار يبدأ من هنا… في سيتي سكيب! أويفان (Oivan) بالشراكة مع جي بيلدر (GBuilder) يعيدان تعريف تجربة مشتري العقار — من المبيعات إلى التسليم وما بعدها — عبر منصة رقمية متكاملة مبنية على تقنية BIM. تجربة أذكى، أسرع، وأقرب للإنسان. زورونا في سيتي سكيب واكتشفوا كيف نربط الأشخاص والبيانات والتجارب في رحلة عقارية رقمية متكاملة. تواصل معنا : mai.hassan@oivan.com #Oivan #GBuilder #Cityscape #Innovation #PropTech #DigitalTransformation #FutureOfRealEstate","text_html":"The future of real estate is here &#x2014; and we&#x2019;re bringing it to life at&#xA0;Cityscape!

Oivan, in partnership with&#xA0;GBuilder, is redefining the entire homebuyer journey &#x2014; from sales to handover and beyond &#x2014; through one powerful digital platform built on&#xA0;BIM technology.

Smarter. Faster. More human.

Join us at&#xA0;Cityscape&#xA0;and see how we&#x2019;re transforming the way real estate and construction connect people, data, and experiences.

