ngtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Oivan had the pleasure of hosting our valued partner, NHC Innovation, at our Vietnam office recently! 🇻🇳 🤝 🇸🇦 NHC Innovation is the digital arm of Saudi Arabia’s National Housing Company (NHC) — a key enabler of the Kingdom’s Vision 2030 and the driving force behind digital transformation in housing services such as Sakani.The visit was a fantastic opportunity to strengthen our collaboration, exchange knowledge, and plan future initiatives for 2026 and beyond. It was also wonderful for our teams to meet in person and reinforce the long-term partnership between Oivan and NHCI.Together, we’re shaping the future of digital housing solutions in Saudi Arabia. #NHCInnovation #Sakani #SaudiVision2030 #Housing #RealEstate #DigitalTransformation .","text_html":"Oivan had the pleasure of hosting our valued partner, NHC Innovation, at our Vietnam office recently!&#xA0;&#x1F1FB;&#x1F1F3; &#x1F91D; &#x1F1F8;&#x1F1E6; 

NHC Innovation is the digital arm of Saudi Arabia&#x2019;s National Housing Company (NHC) &#x2014; a key enabler of the Kingdom&#x2019;s Vision 2030 and the driving force behind digital transformation in housing services such as Sakani.The visit was a fantastic opportunity to strengthen our collaboration, exchange knowledge, and plan future initiatives for 2026 and beyond. It was also wonderful for our teams to meet in person and reinforce the long-term partnership between Oivan and NHCI.Together, we&#x2019;re shaping the future of digital housing solutions in Saudi Arabia.

