ud services. A passion for driving high-impact projects that shape the future. Ready to make your mark? Find out more and apply for the role that best fits your expertise: ➡️ Applications: https://lnkd.in/dtafgru3 #Hiring #Oivan #Jobs #Riyadh #SaudiArabia #KSA #GovTech #Vision2030 #SalesJobs #TechSales #SalesManager #SalesLeadership #DigitalTransformation #Oivan #ITSales #BusinessDevelopment","text_html":"Oivan is expanding in Riyadh! 

We are seeking two exceptional sales professionals to join our sales team and play a pivotal role in Saudi Arabia&apos;s digital transformation, in line with Vision 2030.&#xA0;As a leading digitalization and software consultancy, we are looking for a technical visionary and a strategic sales leader to drive our growth.

Explore our open positions:

1. Technical Sales Manager (GovTech)&#xA0;
This role is for the hands-on technical expert. You will be the bridge between our government and private clients and our delivery teams, translating complex needs into powerful technical solutions.

You are a great fit if you excel at:
&#x2705; Engaging with government and private clients to capture detailed requirements.
&#x2705; Translating customer needs into technical proposals for software projects.
&#x2705; Developing concept-level solution architectures to support your offers.

2. Senior Sales Manager (GovTech)&#xA0;
This is a leadership role for a seasoned sales professional. You will lead our sales strategy, mentor a high-performing team, and take ownership of closing major deals.

You are a great fit if you excel at:
&#x2705;  Leading the full sales cycle, from prospecting to negotiation and closing deals.
&#x2705; Managing, mentoring, and supporting a sales team to achieve their targets.
&#x2705; Taking ownership of sales planning, forecasting, and pipeline management.

Both roles require:
Native Arabic speaker with a strong network in the Saudi GovTech sector.
Proven experience in government account management and a deep understanding of software, AI solutions and cloud services.
A passion for driving high-impact projects that shape the future.

Ready to make your mark? Find out more and apply for the role that best fits your expertise: 

&#x27A1;&#xFE0F;&#xA0;Applications: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dtafgru3?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dtafgru3</a>

