rtnerships. 🫶 Today's purpose-driven talk connected us to a global sisterhood, and celebrated the power of empathy, action, and shared stories. We heard real accounts of resilience and launched an inspiring Message to My Sister campaign - a global movement inviting people to share messages of hope and solidarity with women rebuilding their lives after war. THANK YOU to Team Tilbury for showing up in full force to celebrate kindness and connection. Already, we’ve received so many heartfelt Messages to My Sister - proof that our community is eager to spread hope and solidarity. 🤝 ❤️ From heartfelt conversations to shared breakfasts, the morning reminded us that kindness is more than a gesture - it’s a force for change.💌 #WorldKindnessDay #MessageToMySister #CharlotteTilbury #WomenForWomenInternational #KindnessMatters","text_html":"&#x1F496; WORLD KINDNESS DAY &#x1F496;

This morning, we came together at our London Magic Office for our Message to My Sister Coffee Morning &#x2615;, hosted by <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/elisabeth-phillips-4a81a01a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Elisabeth Phillips</a> and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/julia-vieyres-bb659896?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Julia Vieyres</a> from <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/women-for-women-international?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Women for Women International</a>, one of our amazing Purpose Partnerships. &#x1FAF6; 

Today&apos;s purpose-driven talk connected us to a global sisterhood, and celebrated the power of empathy, action, and shared stories. We heard real accounts of resilience and launched an inspiring Message to My Sister campaign - a global movement inviting people to share messages of hope and solidarity with women rebuilding their lives after war. 

THANK YOU to Team Tilbury for showing up in full force to celebrate kindness and connection. Already, we&#x2019;ve received so many heartfelt Messages to My Sister - proof that our community is eager to spread hope and solidarity.&#xA0;&#x1F91D; &#x2764;&#xFE0F; 

From heartfelt conversations to shared breakfasts, the morning reminded us that kindness is more than a gesture - it&#x2019;s a force for change.&#x1F48C;

