Moments like these remind us how lucky we are to be surrounded by such passionate, creative, and supportive colleagues! &#x2728; At <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/charlotte-tilbury-beauty-ltd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Charlotte Tilbury Beauty</a>, we believe in the power of connection - and celebrations like this help us continue to grow stronger as a DREAM team. &#x1F4AB;

&#x1F496; If you&#x2019;d love to be part of the MAGIC at Charlotte Tilbury, explore our latest opportunities and join Team Tilbury!

Happy Halloween! &#x1F47B;&#x1FA84;&#x2728;

