share-shrink_800/B4EZo1WulqHgAg-/0/1761831746249?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ZouNnHemPoV-MnTqxGAHZIH2TwDE5e4C94SUEF9Xcy4","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG17MUcSXqN7g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZo1Wuq9GoAk-/0/1761831749938?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0-qWrqisp-5m6Pirj4WLwDFU08TeyIMXM2QXJbwS8bU"],"likes_count":1626,"post_id":"7389657967911923712","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/charlotte-tilbury-beauty-ltd_charlottetilbury-beautywonderland-carnabystreet-activity-7389657967911923712-DC9q","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"✨ CARNABY MAGIC IS HERE! ✨ We’re SO EXCITED to unveil a landmark moment in our global retail journey: the grand opening of our first-ever Charlotte Tilbury Beauty Wonderland on London’s legendary Carnaby Street! 💖 This immersive new space is more than a store - it’s a dynamic destination for artistry, education, and inspiration. Created to champion the next generation of professional makeup artists, students, and beauty lovers, our Carnaby Street Beauty Wonderland includes a dedicated training and masterclass studio, purpose-built to foster community, connection, and credibility in the artistry world. 🗨️ “Darlings, I am so excited to open my first-ever Beauty Wonderland on London’s iconic Carnaby Street… fully dedicated to empowering, educating, and inspiring the next generation of pro artists. It is the ultimate hub for artistry magic!” - Charlotte Tilbury MBE Let the magic begin… 💋 #CharlotteTilbury #BeautyWonderland #CarnabyStreet #TeamTilbury #RetailInnovation","text_html":"&#x2728; CARNABY MAGIC IS HERE! &#x2728;
&#xA0;
We&#x2019;re SO EXCITED to unveil a landmark moment in our global retail journey: the grand opening of our first-ever Charlotte Tilbury Beauty Wonderland on London&#x2019;s legendary Carnaby Street! &#x1F496; 
&#xA0;
This immersive new space is more than a store - it&#x2019;s a dynamic destination for artistry, education, and inspiration. Created to champion the next generation of professional makeup artists, students, and beauty lovers, our Carnaby Street Beauty Wonderland includes a dedicated training and masterclass studio, purpose-built to foster community, connection, and credibility in the artistry world.
&#xA0;
&#x1F5E8;&#xFE0F; &#x201C;Darlings, I am so excited to open my first-ever Beauty Wonderland on London&#x2019;s iconic Carnaby Street&#x2026; fully dedicated to empowering, educating, and inspiring the next generation of pro artists. It is the ultimate hub for artistry magic!&#x201D;
 - Charlotte Tilbury MBE
&#xA0;
Let the magic begin&#x2026; &#x1F48B; 

