/B4EZoMM7bEKYAk-/0/1761141315377?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1CxpQIN_yf592CGqykyx96RGHvXnssZDVy-v6Kxs1WM","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHUBm1R0dLdKA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoMM7XAKcAg-/0/1761141308965?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NQGj8O8Z-U0JnKzZ8x-RkW7i5vcLP6_EJV2ju0ym_eA","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEoNnrNH_glvA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZoMM7cJHoAg-/0/1761141311457?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=dhLi29QNZ_-ShD-3u3Xgm-W2jpng79PVNnOPHBPVu_g","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGcGygdxz7zaA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZoMM7WvHgAw-/0/1761141307976?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=WSSH1XhLvTsIkegIM-GJrFabHm2FOyWM15_-HmFJnRk"],"likes_count":445,"post_id":"7386762074082734080","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/charlotte-tilbury-beauty-ltd_charlottetilburycareers-jointhemagic-tilburyteam-activity-7386762074082734080-S5iy","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"💫 Engaging with Talent – The Tilbury Way 💫 Last week, our dazzling Talent Acquisition team brought the magic to the London Job Show at Westfield London - and what a show it was! 💖✨ From CV support to career conversations, we were thrilled to meet so many brilliant individuals and share the empowering opportunities waiting at Charlotte Tilbury Beauty 💄🌟 Whether you're passionate about beauty, driven by innovation or ready to shape iconic moments in the world of Tilbury magic, we’re here to help you unlock your full potential. A heartfelt THANK YOU to everyone who stopped by to sprinkle a little Tilbury sparkle with us. And to the fabulous organisers at the London Job Show for curating such an inspiring event 💕 We left feeling energised, inspired and even more excited about the future of talent at Charlotte Tilbury. Your next iconic chapter starts here - explore our career opportunities and be part of the Tilbury magic! 👉 https://lnkd.in/eufh9Myq 💼💫 #CharlotteTilburyCareers #JoinTheMagic #TilburyTeam #TalentAcquisition #LondonJobShow #DreamTeam","text_html":"&#x1F4AB; Engaging with Talent &#x2013; The Tilbury Way &#x1F4AB;
&#xA0;
Last week, our dazzling Talent Acquisition team brought the magic to the <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/the-london-job-show?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>London Job Show</a> at <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/westfield?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Westfield</a> London - and what a show it was! &#x1F496;&#x2728;
&#xA0;
From CV support to career conversations, we were thrilled to meet so many brilliant individuals and share the empowering opportunities waiting at <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/charlotte-tilbury-beauty-ltd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Charlotte Tilbury Beauty</a>&#x1F484;&#x1F31F; Whether you&apos;re passionate about beauty, driven by innovation or ready to shape iconic moments in the world of Tilbury magic, we&#x2019;re here to help you unlock your full potential.
&#xA0;
A heartfelt THANK YOU to everyone who stopped by to sprinkle a little Tilbury sparkle with us. And to the fabulous organisers at the <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/the-london-job-show?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>London Job Show</a> for curating such an inspiring event &#x1F495; We left feeling energised, inspired and even more excited about the future of talent at Charlotte Tilbury.
&#xA0;
Your next iconic chapter starts here - explore our career opportunities and be part of the Tilbury magic!
