[{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-12-24T01:31:54.661Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGjSb6yhLjsqw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56ZsvWJgAJ4A0-/0/1766025894635?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mao1LhKHJtI1whgRCiGSjUjW8dQfQOeyJ2uqKbX94h0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFpK6K5h6LmsA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56ZsvWJhkJ8Aw-/0/1766025898278?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Eua0ziYZT-HLxKGnXWERiaKWemcp-l53opWgty2cSIs","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHYSlu8L1fMKQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZsvWJhJGkAg-/0/1766025897928?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=flQYlDq1_Gp36paxpQoInD1E39cdKM2tmSegycYCeWw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQF5Dvoz6v-_gw/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZsvWJhUHsAg-/0/1766025895210?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=XOfXRYlERTfsrGnZQGZ_X88_LrU2cZO5cqyOtlq700E"],"likes_count":13,"post_id":"7408649982242721792","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/nx-blue-recruit_snowy2-nxbluerecruit-futuregenerationjv-activity-7408649982242721792-Kkv5","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🎉Celebrating 2,000 Days No Lost Time at Polo Flat Precast Yard, Snowy 2.0🎉 NX Blue was proud to join the Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV and the Polo Flat Precast team to celebrate an incredible milestone, 2,000 days with no Lost Time Injuries. A truly outstanding achievement and a testament to what can be accomplished when safety is genuinely prioritised at every level. Held at the Cooma Bowling Club, the afternoon was filled with connection, reflection and celebration, recognising the collective effort of everyone involved in maintaining a strong safety culture on site. We were pleased to hear from Peter Papanicolaou , NX Blue Recruit , Executive Director, Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV Generation and Snowy Hydro Representatives, who all reinforced the importance of leadership, accountability, and shared responsibility in achieving and sustaining Zero Harm outcomes. This milestone exemplifies NX Blue Recruit 's unwavering commitment to Zero Harm, and our continued focus on partnering with clients who place safety, wellbeing, and people at the centre of everything they do. Congratulations to Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV and the entire Polo Flat Precast team on this outstanding achievement, we look forward to continuing this journey together, safely on the Snowy 2.0 Project. #Snowy2 .0 #NXBlueRecruit #FutureGenerationJV #ZeroHarm #SafetyFirst #NoLostTime #SafetyCulture #Partnership","text_html":"&#x1F389;Celebrating 2,000 Days No Lost Time at Polo Flat Precast Yard, Snowy 2.0&#x1F389;
NX Blue was proud to join the <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/future-generation-joint-venture-fgjv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV</a>  and the Polo Flat Precast team to celebrate an incredible milestone, 2,000 days with no Lost Time Injuries. A truly outstanding achievement and a testament to what can be accomplished when safety is genuinely prioritised at every level.

Held at the Cooma Bowling Club, the afternoon was filled with connection, reflection and celebration, recognising the collective effort of everyone involved in maintaining a strong safety culture on site.

We were pleased to hear from <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/in/peter-papanicolaou-0b3a231b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Peter Papanicolaou</a>, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a>, Executive Director, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/future-generation-joint-venture-fgjv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV</a> Generation and <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/snowyhydro?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Snowy Hydro</a> Representatives, who all reinforced the importance of leadership, accountability, and shared responsibility in achieving and sustaining Zero Harm outcomes.

This milestone exemplifies <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a>&apos;s unwavering commitment to Zero Harm, and our continued focus on partnering with clients who place safety, wellbeing, and people at the centre of everything they do.
Congratulations to <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/future-generation-joint-venture-fgjv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV</a> and the entire Polo Flat Precast team on this outstanding achievement, we look forward to continuing this journey together, safely on the Snowy 2.0 Project. 

