&#xA0;
As part of this commitment, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a> has partnered with <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/assure-programs?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Assure</a>
Programs, offering all employees and their immediate families access to free, confidential support 24/7 through our Employee Assistance Program (EAP).
&#xA0;
This partnership reflects our ongoing investment in the wellbeing, safety, and success of every member of the <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a> team.
