post_hangtags":["241,425 followers"],"repost_id":"7376238916858777600","repost_text":"🎉 Resmed has been named one of TIME ’s World’s Top HealthTech Companies of 2025. This recognition reflects our commitment to designing life-changing health technologies that people love and delivering them in ways that are effective, personal, and easy to access. At Resmed, we’re on a mission to improve 500 million lives by 2030 through better sleep and breathing, with care delivered in the home. And every day, we get one step closer — thanks to our team and the incredible people behind our technology. We’re proud to be recognized alongside global leaders in health tech, reinforcing Resmed’s place at the forefront of digital health and connected care innovation. Learn more about the recognition: https://lnkd.in/gr6mCuZy Interested in joining our team? Check out open roles here: https://lnkd.in/g-58KAnz #Resmed #DigitalHealth #HealthTech #Innovation #BetterSleep #ConnectedCare","repost_title":"Resmed","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/time?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"TIME"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Congratulations to Resmed on being named one of TIME ’s World’s Top HealthTech Companies of 2025! As a proud partner supporting Resmed in Australia, NX Blue Recruit is thrilled to see their incredible work recognised on a global stage. Resmed ’s commitment to improving lives through better sleep, breathing, and connected care continues to inspire, and we’re proud to contribute to their journey. #Resmed #NXBlueRecruit #HealthTech #Innovation #DigitalHealth #ConnectedCare","text_html":"Congratulations to <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/resmed?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Resmed</a> on being named one of <