is milestone brings us one step closer to delivering the Sydney Metro West – Western Tunnelling Package, a key part of Australia’s biggest public transport project. Over the course of tunnelling between Sydney Olympic Park and Westmead, the GLC team managed to maintain an average advance rate of 200 metres per week, installing around 30,000 precast concrete segments and operating more than 790,000 tonnes of excavated material. What’s next for Betty? The 1,200-tonne TBM will be dismantled and transported from Westmead. Key components will be refurbished and reused on other TBM projects, with the remaining parts recycled. #Gamuda #GamudaAustralia #SydneyMetro #Tunnelling #LaingORourke","repost_title":"Gamuda Australia","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://au.linkedin.com/company/sydney-metro?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Sydney Metro"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A major milestone for Gamuda Australia , with TBM Betty as she successfully reached the end of her journey after carving through 9 km between Sydney Olympic Park and Westmead, installing around 30,000 precast concrete segments. NX Blue Recruit is proud to support this achievement as a labour hire provider for the Gamuda Precast Segment Yard, supplying the skilled workforce behind the production of these vital segments. Congratulations to the Gamuda Australia team on this incredible milestone! #GamudaAustralia #NXBlueRecruit #SydneyMetro #Tunnelling #Infrastructure #Engineering #LaingORourke","text_html":"A major milestone for <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/gamuda-australia?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Gamuda Australia</a>, with TBM Betty as she successfully reached the end of her journey after carving through 9 km between Sydney Olympic Park and Westmead, installing around 30,000 precast concrete segments.
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a> is proud to support this achievement as a labour hire provider for the Gamuda Precast Segment Yard, supplying the skilled workforce behind the production of these vital segments.
&#xA0;
