n_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flaingorourke&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LaingORourke</a>","time":"2mo Edited 3mo","title":"NX Blue Recruit"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-10-02T01:31:54.714Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGvuPGaET0BQg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zl0DA70KIAg-/0/1758588572343?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=dylSvnuqZZhRkRjlhLdf9lqZQm13Nwys8YWW9VtAwCM","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFH5JkqewtX4Q/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zl0DA73KAAw-/0/1758588572023?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qYFE7wASkxBbU8ZM-vdIp_kxse13vPtufxLuV2YDVWI","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGXjI1PALhtkA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zl0DA7zG0Aw-/0/1758588572231?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=k4udNgDBx7Rzx_b3O6Kl8bzNMwP0rWvEzcxuczWkYwo"],"likes_count":20,"post_id":"7376055090664845312","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/nx-blue-recruit_sbat-snowyhydro-snowy2-activity-7376055090664845312--emY","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🌟 Congratulations to our 2025 SBAT Graduates 🌟 Last week, we marked the completion of the School-Based Apprenticeships and Traineeships (SBAT) program, for our most recent cohort of students as they successfully finished their training journey. Eight Year 12 students from Monaro High School achieved the Certificate II in Supply Chain Operations, the first time this qualification has been delivered through the SBAT pathway. Alongside their school commitments, they gained paid, hands-on industry experience, preparing them with practical skills for their future careers. Since its launch in 2021, NX Blue Recruit has supported around 30 local students to take part in the SBAT program across a range of qualifications. Many graduates have already moved into full-time roles, contributing directly to the Snowy 2.0 project and the wider industry. In July, the students’ achievements were celebrated at the Snowy 2.0 Concrete Segment Factory in Cooma by Steve Whan, Member for Monaro and NSW Minister for Skills, together with representatives from Snowy Hydro , Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV , TAFE NSW , NX Blue Recruit , and the NSW Department of Education . We extend our sincere thanks to Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV , as the principal contractor delivering the Snowy Hydro , for creating meaningful pathways through placements and mentorship. Their commitment has given students the chance to gain valuable real-world experience while shaping the next generation of the workforce. We also thank Monaro High School for their vital support in facilitating the program. At NX Blue Recruit , we are proud to contribute to initiatives that open pathways for young people and strengthen the workforce of the future. Congratulations once again to all graduates — this is only the beginning. #SBAT #SnowyHydro #Snowy2 #FGJV #WeBuild #Clough #NXBlue #CivilConstruction #TAFENSW #CareerPathways #SkillsForTheFuture","text_html":"&#x1F31F; Congratulations to our 2025 SBAT Graduates &#x1F31F;

Last week, we marked the completion of the School-Based Apprenticeships and Traineeships (SBAT) program, for our most recent cohort of students as they successfully finished their training journey.

Eight Year 12 students from Monaro High School achieved the Certificate II in Supply Chain Operations, the first time this qualification has been delivered through the SBAT pathway. Alongside their school commitments, they gained paid, hands-on industry experience, preparing them with practical skills for their future careers.

Since its launch in 2021, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a> has supported around 30 local students to take part in the SBAT program across a range of qualifications. Many graduates have already moved into full-time roles, contributing directly to the Snowy 2.0 project and the wider industry.

In July, the students&#x2019; achievements were celebrated at the Snowy 2.0 Concrete Segment Factory in Cooma by Steve Whan, Member for Monaro and NSW Minister for Skills, together with representatives from <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/snowyhydro?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Snowy Hydro</a>, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/future-generation-joint-venture-fgjv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV</a>, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/school/tafe-nsw/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>TAFE NSW</a>, <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a>, and the <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nsw-department-of-education?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NSW Department of Education</a>. 

We extend our sincere thanks to <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/future-generation-joint-venture-fgjv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Future Generation Joint Venture - FGJV</a>, as the principal contractor delivering the <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/snowyhydro?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Snowy Hydro</a>, for creating meaningful pathways through placements and mentorship. Their commitment has given students the chance to gain valuable real-world experience while shaping the next generation of the workforce. We also thank Monaro High School for their vital support in facilitating the program.

At <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/nx-blue-recruit?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NX Blue Recruit</a>, we are proud to contribute to initiatives that open pathways for young people and strengthen the workforce of the future. Congratulations once again to all graduates &#x2014; this is only the beginning.

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsbat&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SBAT</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsnowyhydro&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SnowyHydro</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsnowy2&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Snowy2</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffgjv&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FGJV</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwebuild&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WeBuild</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fclough&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Clough</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnxblue&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#NXBlue</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcivilconstruction&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CivilConstruction</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftafensw&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TAFENSW</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcareerpathways&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CareerPathways</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fskillsforthefuture&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SkillsForTheFuture</a>","time":"3mo","title":"NX Blue Recruit"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-10-02T01:31:54.719Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFJtS5yMqV1kQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56ZlU_ygHG4Aw-/0/1758067633255?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=268Y1wWrImRSFE-93CAsc2E0HsgkEWRfF9xGchTu9Vc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEoufZrXXi8Rg/feedshare-shrink_1280/B56ZlU_yfGJoAs-/0/1758067633670?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=snO-1njdkWiTrud-W0JAsktG8TxxKHosFoBvwjre2_k","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHEVZqToUgYqg/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56ZlU_ygbHMAw-/0/1758067634397?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=5r9AGkgubJyTBfqBKMZMyabA05h49XV0hvS4kB5gBz8"],"likes_count":23,"post_id":"7373870119338323968","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/nx-blue-recruit_ruokday-nxblue-manufacturing-activity-7373870119338323968-0jAk","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A simple question can change everything. 💛 Last week, employees across NX Blue joined our clients in marking R U OK? Day, taking a moment to connect, share a laugh, and check in. NX Blue and Pax Australia Pty Ltd teamed up to offer fresh fruit during each shift break, creating opportunities for meaningful conversations about mental well-being and suicide prevention. Over 400 people joined us throughout the day, serving as a powerful reminder of the importance of connection. We never truly know what someone might be carrying. That’s why asking “R U OK?” shouldn’t be saved for one day a year. You don’t need all the answers, just the care to ask and the time to listen. Let’s keep showing up for each other. #RUOKDay #NXBlue #Manufacturing #WorkplaceWellbeing #TeamEngagement #CivilConstruction","text_html":"A simple question can change everything. &#x1F49B;

Last week, employees across NX Blue joined our clients in marking R U OK? Day, taking a moment to connect, share a laugh, and check in.

NX Blue and <a class="link" href="https://au.linkedin.com/company/pax-australia-pty-ltd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Pax Australia Pty Ltd</a> teamed up to offer fresh fruit during each shift break, creating opportunities for meaningful conversations about mental well-being and suicide prevention. Over 400 people joined us throughout the day, serving as a powerful reminder of the importance of connection.

We never truly know what someone might be carrying. That&#x2019;s why asking &#x201C;R U OK?&#x201D; shouldn&#x2019;t be saved for one day a year.

You don&#x2019;t need all the answers,  just the care to ask and the time to listen.

Let&#x2019;s keep showing up for each other.

