Did you have an Arby&#x2019;s Jamocha Shake summer? Check out the lineup here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/efMK8TBc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/efMK8TBc</a>","time":"3mo","title":"Inspire"},{"comments_count":7,"date":"2025-10-04T11:41:37.312Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFTadJ1ZR_LcA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZmCNwa5KgA0-/0/1758826268752?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=HIYPJNj1wu4DJLRKissHXwwd5JAyaAg79MD3oWJ_jLM"],"likes_count":387,"post_id":"7377052165317566464","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7377052058199281664-T2BN","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🎙️ Hear from our Co-Founder and CEO Paul Brown on the latest episode of David Novak’s podcast, How Leaders Lead . “Here’s how you think about brand management: you go straight at it. You actually sell what you sell, right? Well, that’s exactly how ‘We Have The Meats’ came up at Arby's . We were in our restaurants looking at the food we served. This is what you have – sell what you sell. We went straight at it.” – Paul Brown 🎧 Listen now: Spotify: https://lnkd.in/ettTiiE6 Apple Podcasts: https://lnkd.in/enwXy84F","text_html":"&#x1F399;&#xFE0F; Hear from our Co-Founder and CEO <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brownpaulj?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Paul Brown</a> on the latest episode of David Novak&#x2019;s podcast, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/how-leaders-lead?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>How Leaders Lead</a>.
&#xA0;
&#x201C;Here&#x2019;s how you think about brand management: you go straight at it. You actually sell what you sell, right? Well, that&#x2019;s exactly how &#x2018;We Have The Meats&#x2019; came up at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/arby&apos;s?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Arby&apos;s</a>. We were in our restaurants looking at the food we served. This is what you have &#x2013; sell what you sell. We went straight at it.&#x201D; 
&#x2013; Paul Brown
&#xA0;
&#x1F3A7; Listen now:
 Spotify: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ettTiiE6?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ettTiiE6</a>
Apple Podcasts: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/enwXy84F?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/enwXy84F</a>","time":"3mo","title":"Inspire"},{"comments_count":8,"date":"2025-10-04T11:41:37.314Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHK1ESjQ0cmyQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZkqsNn7IQAg-/0/1757357858466?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=E3rBcrD838T-wGifHo6FsgiVgtzU-2R2k8oG2W10BcY","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQH_BoVTSeBwbg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZkqsNjjGcAg-/0/1757357857472?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=l-wWhNoMUnzWYdQL7guoBx37XWyr5tBbd1vZ_P1FCe4","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGXvWPxOPS-Gw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZkqsNjrKQAw-/0/1757357857601?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=K-GEaLikSmBEqrQO9lAu8A_KG7M-JqESFtwcHY--ZzA"],"likes_count":216,"post_id":"7371154827155755008","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7371154827155755008/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"“I always felt like I belonged at Arby’s, and by joining Inspire, I feel like I’m back. People I hired and developed are still here. Meeting them again felt like coming home.” Meet Kent Dawdy, a SONIC Regional Vice President who oversees restaurants across Alabama and Georgia. His 30+ year career in foodservice began with a role at Arby's that “springboarded” his love for training and developing team members. Learn more here: https://lnkd.in/egNtdJty","text_html":"&#x201C;I always felt like I belonged at Arby&#x2019;s, and by joining Inspire, I feel like I&#x2019;m back. People I hired and developed are still here. Meeting them again felt like coming home.&#x201D;&#xA0;&#xA0; 

Meet Kent Dawdy, a <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/sonic-drive-in?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>SONIC</a> Regional Vice President who oversees restaurants across Alabama and Georgia. His 30+ year career in foodservice began with a role at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/arby&apos;s?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Arby&apos;s</a> that &#x201C;springboarded&#x201D; his love for training and developing team members. 

Learn more here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/egNtdJty?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/egNtdJty</a>","time":"3mo","title":"Inspire"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-10-04T11:41:37.316Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFT8J-JIvyfjg/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZkPu3qdHoAs-/0/1756905569532?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=aaaWmmN2FHQfaeoFDvJHI1SeFDXuwJGuDQYZV5KLRDM"],"likes_count":31,"post_id":"7369740634565353473","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7369353562855743491-IIcC","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Arby’s Make a Difference Campaign officially kicked off this week and it’s time to meat the moment. Grab lunch, do good, repeat. 🥪➡️💙 Head to your local Arby's today (or everyday😋) between now and September 28. Simply donate $1 and together we will Make A Difference help transform communities across America for the better. #Arbys #MakeADifference #GiveBack #WeHaveTheMeats","text_html":"Arby&#x2019;s Make a Difference Campaign officially kicked off this week and it&#x2019;s time to meat the moment. Grab lunch, do good, repeat.
