 <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Farbys&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Arbys</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmakeadifference&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MakeADifference</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgiveback&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GiveBack</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwehavethemeats&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WeHaveTheMeats</a>","time":"3mo","title":"Inspire Foundation"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-09-04T11:41:37.318Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFnQVevEEk_jA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZkL4s5rIkA4-/0/1756841038287?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=y94sApI_UdcRBUR09izLrOxmAtJS_E-ySMGU0427hes","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHFglTYB2-LLQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZkL4s6lGcAw-/0/1756841038320?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=IoApteyHTxSJhXMr1nVTig5qWCQRXDh7xzeyppme4Ac"],"likes_count":187,"post_id":"7368997554082070528","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7368997554082070528/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Arby's is answering the call of meat-loving fans everywhere with the return of its beloved Loaded Italian Sandwich. To celebrate, Jersey Shore stars Jenni “JWoww” Farley and Nicole “Snooki” Polizzi revive an iconic scene from their 2000s reality show. However, this time their hunt for a “loaded Italian” ends when they come across the real deal in Arby’s iconic sandwich. Learn more here: https://lnkd.in/eahpRqc6","text_html":"<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/arby&apos;s?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Arby&apos;s</a> is answering the call of meat-loving fans everywhere with the return of its beloved Loaded Italian Sandwich. 

To celebrate, Jersey Shore stars&#xA0;Jenni &#x201C;JWoww&#x201D; Farley&#xA0;and&#xA0;Nicole &#x201C;Snooki&#x201D; Polizzi revive an iconic scene from their 2000s reality show. However, this time their hunt for a &#x201C;loaded Italian&#x201D; ends when they come across the real deal in Arby&#x2019;s iconic sandwich.&#xA0; 

Learn more here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eahpRqc6?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eahpRqc6</a>","time":"4mo","title":"Inspire"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-08-05T11:41:37.320Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG5IMNOt17Onw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZg_.0qeGoAk-/0/1753420093567?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=6Fih_XiRJuOOW8U0jHYJmUu0UmFvvidvHrtq1vV1zfk","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFf6LrmnznG4w/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZg_.0pmGcAg-/0/1753420090445?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NiJJvBFL0MGk21m-1msEmMUvzI_wsA9hhRpmNSMPaZE","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG1cBetAQ4fdA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZg_.0qaHoAs-/0/1753420092946?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=gEd2g5LFYPPtLLwjtadzCH3eXRL6HKX95OdlcvBFRXI"],"likes_count":89,"post_id":"7358196345792258049","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7358196345792258049/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"“Hurricane Helene caused so much heartbreak. When we heard about Elderflower, we knew we had an opportunity to make a difference.” When the Elderflower Community Care Center in Asheville, NC was destroyed by Hurricane Helene last year, Elderflower Board President Ellen Raffel Miller – daughter of Arby's co-founder Forrest Raffel – immediately reached out to local franchisee Brumit Restaurant Group for help. Together, they partnered with the Arby’s Foundation to donate $150,000 to rebuild. Today, Elderflower has successfully reopened its doors, providing mental and physical support to dementia patients and their families, bringing joy and healing to those who need it most. Learn more about the Arby’s Foundation and Elderflower here: https://lnkd.in/eu5fiSbn","text_html":"&#x201C;Hurricane Helene caused so much heartbreak. When we heard about Elderflower, we knew we had an opportunity to make a difference.&#x201D; 

When the Elderflower Community Care Center in Asheville, NC was destroyed by Hurricane Helene last year, Elderflower Board President Ellen Raffel Miller &#x2013; daughter of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/arby&apos;s?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Arby&apos;s</a> co-founder Forrest Raffel &#x2013; immediately reached out to local franchisee <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/brumit-restaurant-group?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Brumit Restaurant Group</a> for help. Together, they partnered with the Arby&#x2019;s Foundation to donate $150,000 to rebuild.

Today, Elderflower has successfully reopened its doors, providing mental and physical support to dementia patients and their families, bringing joy and healing to those who need it most. 

Learn more about the Arby&#x2019;s Foundation and Elderflower here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eu5fiSbn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eu5fiSbn</a>","time":"5mo","title":"Inspire"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-08-05T11:41:37.321Z","likes_count":196,"post_id":"7351253166987927554","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7351253166987927554/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Friday or FRYday? Rebecca Black is celebrating both at Arby's for National Fry Day on July 11 – and Arby’s Rewards members can, too. Today and tomorrow, grab a Free Large Curly Fry with Purchase ($5 Min), only in the app.","text_html":"Friday or FRYday? Rebecca Black is celebrating both at&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/arby&apos;s?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Arby&apos;s</a> for National Fry Day on July 11 &#x2013; and Arby&#x2019;s Rewards members can, too. Today and tomorrow,&#xA0;grab a Free Large Curly Fry with Purchase ($5 Min), only in the app.","time":"5mo Edited","title":"Inspire","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQESUXp46YdyzA/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZf5lW.LHwBw-/0/1752239045946?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Mdmx_U9hvFe8z8hcaC4jsioy3iMfLep07s2MB-5ylbM","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQESUXp46YdyzA/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZf5lW.LHwBs-/0/1752239051225?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=JcJP0geQOKPPQzm3D5VfWuXFuff8cJLV2twLCcTw22Y"]}]

[{"comments_count":4,"date":"2025-11-29T20:01:17.231Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHSWqJ81IjTeA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZq7cMwqKoAk-/0/1764081323698?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=f9Ank6M5a3hZlPGykNuePxaJ5mpMAH0zsRxmoBGOAr0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFqQnDSJ2SRcA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZq7cMwXIQA0-/0/1764081323628?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=lhTa8utaKXbjxK2JiCMwLiQLuCHXWK7akP3okKqOhWI","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFBANJToUQJuQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZq7cMvRJgA0-/0/1764081323718?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=zGnVO5pHU3yeB5-mCD11K4oy9KoawqGAbhFf3xFt1JM","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGQTppSt_Wxog/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZq7cMvGIoAw-/0/1764081323602?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=oN7bcgxtuCQOMfV2qhXgAlstC0UtOE6r63qmX-tg1Uc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFfzP4NcNSKIw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZq7cMvgIUAo-/0/1764081323671?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=KgDjYwjgL1ZrtVP0ADCFitqTSOo9ySNMLfn6iNcL5lA"],"likes_count":39,"post_id":"7405233625232908288","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7405233625232908288/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🚀 We’re officially on sale - and what a launch 🚀! Following a phenomenal wave of excitement from our announcement, the Mundo Pixar Experience in London has achieved a record-breaking number of sign-ups and pre-sale ticket sales for any UK Disney exhibitions! The response has been nothing short of extraordinary, and we’re incredibly grateful to every fan who has shown their enthusiasm and support. Opening February 2026 in Wembley Park, this immersive exhibition will bring the unforgettable wonder of Pixar to life - from timeless classics to new favourites - in a way that invites guests to step inside the worlds they love. Huge thanks to the creators of the exhibition, Golden Peak Live Entertainment , presented in partnership with Proactiv Entertainment , SENBLA LTD and The Luna Entertainment Group . It’s an honour to be part of a project with The Walt Disney Company and Pixar Animation Studios , and delivering this experience to UK audiences is something we truly can’t wait for. ✨ London, we’re just getting started... See you in 2026 ✨ #MundoPixar #Pixar #Disney #LiveExperiences #LondonEvents #ImmersiveExperience","text_html":"&#x1F680; We&#x2019;re officially on sale - and what a launch &#x1F680;!
&#xA0;
Following a phenomenal wave of excitement from our announcement, the Mundo Pixar Experience in London has achieved a record-breaking number of sign-ups and pre-sale ticket sales for any UK Disney exhibitions! The response has been nothing short of extraordinary, and we&#x2019;re incredibly grateful to every fan who has shown their enthusiasm and support.
&#xA0;
Opening February 2026 in Wembley Park, this immersive exhibition will bring the unforgettable wonder of Pixar to life - from timeless classics to new favourites - in a way that invites guests to step inside the worlds they love.
&#xA0;
Huge thanks to the creators of the exhibition, <a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/company/golden-peak-live-entertainment?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Golden Peak Live Entertainment</a>, presented in partnership with <a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/company/proactiv-s.l.?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Proactiv Entertainment</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/senbla-ltd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>SENBLA LTD</a> and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/the-luna-entertainment-group?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Luna Entertainment Group</a>. It&#x2019;s an honour to be part of a project with&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-walt-disney-company?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Walt Disney Company</a>&#xA0;and&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pixar-animation-studios?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Pixar Animation Studios</a>,&#xA0;and delivering this experience to UK audiences is something we truly can&#x2019;t wait for.
&#xA0;
&#x2728; London, we&#x2019;re just getting started... See you in 2026 &#x2728;
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmundopixar&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MundoPixar</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpixar&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Pixar</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdisney&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Disney</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fliveexperiences&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LiveExperiences</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flondonevents&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LondonEvents</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fimmersiveexperience&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ImmersiveExperience</a>","time":"1mo","title":"RG Live"},{"date":"2025-12-15T20:01:17.236Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHLBgF40pxRKQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B56ZsOMI5SKAAw-/0/1765469623023?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=kIpcN5sPoNmISiZxGjFaxbJVfrunn_Pb3fjnKuqP97I","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGYc78o4Fgtlg/feedshare-shrink_1280/B56ZsOMI59IcAs-/0/1765469622852?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Y8EgCBXdxpsxO8yfjR82qUosKBZ5UrZIJzLWAdh1akI"],"likes_count":29,"post_id":"7404916312197632000","post_url":"https://es.linkedin.com/posts/golden-peak-live-entertainment_la-semana-pasada-fue-un-momento-muy-especial-activity-7404916312197632000-dGW7","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"La semana pasada fue un momento muy especial para Golden Peak Live 🤩🏆 Mundo Pixar Experience fue reconocido en el FIP Festival con cinco premios, incluyendo cuatro oros, entre ellos Innovación en eventos, Éxito Internacional y Productor de Eventos del Año. Estos premios son un reflejo del trabajo de un equipo enorme que puso corazón, detalle, creatividad y una obsesión absoluta por crear una experiencia que esté a la altura de las historias de Pixar y del cariño que millones de personas les tienen. Queremos agradecer profundamente: ✨Al FIP Festival, por valorar la visión y el esfuerzo detrás de este proyecto; ✨A todos los equipos de Golden Peak Live, en Europa y Latinoamérica, que hicieron posible llevar Mundo Pixar a una nueva escala; ✨A nuestros socios locales y técnicos, que dieron vida a cada sala, cada espacio y cada emoción; ✨y muy especialmente a Disney y Pixar, por confiarnos la responsabilidad de transformar sus universos en una experiencia inmersiva única. Jay Ward , Brian Tanaka, Catalina Hosokawa , Ella Delaiche, James Telling , Stuart Coles, Fiona Thomas , Ariana Fernandez y Martín Iraola. Este reconocimiento nos impulsa a seguir creciendo, explorando y creando experiencias que conecten generaciones. Lo que viene es aún más grande! _______ Last week marked a truly special moment for Golden Peak Live🤩🏆 Mundo Pixar Experience was honored at the FIP Festival with five awards, including four Golds — among them Event Innovation, International Success, and Event Producer of the Year. These awards reflect the dedication of an extraordinary team who poured their heart, attention to detail, creativity, and unwavering commitment into crafting an experience worthy of Pixar’s stories and the love millions of people have for them. A heartfelt thank you to: ✨ The FIP Festival, for recognizing the vision and effort behind this project; ✨The entire Golden Peak Live team, across Europe and Latin America, who made it possible to take Mundo Pixar to a new level; ✨Our local and technical partners, who brought every room, every detail, and every emotion to life; ✨And especially Disney and Pixar, for trusting us with the responsibility of transforming their beloved universes into a unique immersive experience. Jay Ward , Brian Tanaka, Catalina Hosokawa , Ella Delaiche, James Telling , Stuart Coles, Fiona Thomas , Ariana Fernandez and Martin Iraola. This recognition inspires us to keep growing, exploring, and creating experiences that connect generations. And what’s coming next is even bigger!","text_html":"La semana pasada fue un momento muy especial para Golden Peak Live &#x1F929;&#x1F3C6;&#xA0; 

Mundo Pixar Experience fue reconocido en el FIP Festival con cinco premios, incluyendo cuatro oros, entre ellos Innovaci&#xF3;n en eventos, &#xC9;xito Internacional y Productor de Eventos del A&#xF1;o.

Estos premios son un reflejo del trabajo de un equipo enorme que puso coraz&#xF3;n, detalle, creatividad y una obsesi&#xF3;n absoluta por crear una experiencia que est&#xE9; a la altura de las historias de Pixar y del cari&#xF1;o que millones de personas les tienen.

Queremos agradecer profundamente:

&#x2728;Al FIP Festival, por valorar la visi&#xF3;n y el esfuerzo detr&#xE1;s de este proyecto;
&#x2728;A todos los equipos de Golden Peak Live, en Europa y Latinoam&#xE9;rica, que hicieron posible llevar Mundo Pixar a una nueva escala;
&#x2728;A nuestros socios locales y t&#xE9;cnicos, que dieron vida a cada sala, cada espacio y cada emoci&#xF3;n;
&#x2728;y muy especialmente a Disney y Pixar, por confiarnos la responsabilidad de transformar sus universos en una experiencia inmersiva &#xFA;nica.
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/misterjayward?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jay Ward</a>, Brian Tanaka, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/catalinanh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Catalina Hosokawa</a>, Ella Delaiche, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/james-telling-2b335a30?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>James Telling</a>, Stuart Coles, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fiona-thomas-1918407?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Fiona Thomas</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ar.linkedin.com/in/ariana5055?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ariana Fernandez</a> y Mart&#xED;n Iraola.

Este reconocimiento nos impulsa a seguir creciendo, explorando y creando experiencias que conecten generaciones.

Lo que viene es a&#xFA;n m&#xE1;s grande!

_______

Last week marked a truly special moment for Golden Peak Live&#x1F929;&#x1F3C6; 

Mundo Pixar Experience was honored at the FIP Festival with five awards, including four Golds &#x2014; among them Event Innovation, International Success, and Event Producer of the Year.

These awards reflect the dedication of an extraordinary team who poured their heart, attention to detail, creativity, and unwavering commitment into crafting an experience worthy of Pixar&#x2019;s stories and the love millions of people have for them.

A heartfelt thank you to:
&#x2728; The FIP Festival, for recognizing the vision and effort behind this project;
&#x2728;The entire Golden Peak Live team, across Europe and Latin America, who made it possible to take Mundo Pixar to a new level;
&#x2728;Our local and technical partners, who brought every room, every detail, and every emotion to life;
&#x2728;And especially Disney and Pixar, for trusting us with the responsibility of transforming their beloved universes into a unique immersive experience.
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/misterjayward?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jay Ward</a>, Brian Tanaka, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/catalinanh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Catalina Hosokawa</a>, Ella Delaiche, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/james-telling-2b335a30?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>James Telling</a> , Stuart Coles, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fiona-thomas-1918407?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Fiona Thomas</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ar.linkedin.com/in/ariana5055?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ariana Fernandez</a> and Martin Iraola.

