Swipe to discover a few things you probably didn&#x2019;t know about him","time":"3mo","title":"Golden Peak Live Entertainment"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-09-30T20:01:17.251Z","likes_count":17,"post_id":"7378439154424025090","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/golden-peak-live-entertainment_toy-story-30th-anniversary-at-comic-con-activity-7378439154424025090-W8wN","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🚀✨ Toy Story 30th Anniversary at Comic Con Málaga! ✨🚀 We traveled to Malaga to take part in Comic Con International – the very same legendary convention of San Diego now brings fans together all over the world 🌍. Disney Pixar presented the official Toy Story 30th Anniversary stand, celebrating three decades of a story that continues to inspire generations 💛. We are happy to be the production team behind this activation. We’re proud to showcase our creativity at such a global and iconic event 🙌 Thank you, Disney Spain María Suárez Ramos and Marta Kowalska for the opportunity and team work 🎥 This is Vlog 1.0 – stay tuned, more blogs are coming!","text_html":"&#x1F680;&#x2728; Toy Story 30th Anniversary at Comic Con M&#xE1;laga! &#x2728;&#x1F680;

We traveled to Malaga to take part in Comic Con International &#x2013; the very same legendary convention of San Diego now brings fans together all over the world &#x1F30D;.

Disney Pixar presented the official Toy Story 30th Anniversary stand, celebrating three decades of a story that continues to inspire generations &#x1F49B;. We are happy to be the production team behind this activation.

We&#x2019;re proud to showcase our creativity at such a global and iconic event &#x1F64C;

