[{"comments_count":4,"date":"2025-12-26T03:21:07.925Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGFw3Lbuz8plA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZtPWUteJ0Ag-/0/1766562817128?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=l7KFkfDLfD3UvriYOGBH5Pe_ysHu_pe-DmWwbWuoeoM","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGBLO0Czxz9oQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZtPWUtvGoAg-/0/1766562818318?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=OHoV1fEHkXGbJ9rJuTf5hrWXPWOljS7DDzeK4HS-nUQ"],"likes_count":80,"post_id":"7409501506363760640","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/akuh-pakistan_we-are-pleased-to-share-that-the-aga-khan-activity-7409501506363760640-8ojy","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We are pleased to share that the Aga Khan University Hospital has signed a Memorandum of Understanding with Sports In Pakistan (SIP) to support the upcoming marathon with comprehensive on site medical preparedness and emergency response. At AKUH, we believe that health extends beyond hospital walls. Community activities such as marathons encourage regular physical activity, which plays a vital role in preventing many avoidable health conditions and supporting long term wellbeing. This initiative reflects a shared commitment to promoting healthier lifestyles while prioritising participant safety and community wellbeing. We look forward to supporting an event that brings people together around fitness, resilience and a responsible sports culture. M Shahzad Shamim | Muhammad Saad Saboor","text_html":"We are pleased to share that the Aga Khan University Hospital has signed a Memorandum of Understanding with <a class="link" href="https://pk.linkedin.com/company/sportsinpakistan?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sports In Pakistan</a> (SIP) to support the upcoming marathon with comprehensive on site medical preparedness and emergency response.
&#xA0;
At AKUH, we believe that health extends beyond hospital walls. Community activities such as marathons encourage regular physical activity, which plays a vital role in preventing many avoidable health conditions and supporting long term wellbeing.
&#xA0;
This initiative reflects a shared commitment to promoting healthier lifestyles while prioritising participant safety and community wellbeing. We look forward to supporting an event that brings people together around fitness, resilience and a responsible sports culture.

<a class="link" href="https://pk.linkedin.com/in/m-shahzad-shamim-2335a24a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>M Shahzad Shamim</a> | <a class="link" href="https://pk.linkedin.com/in/saadsaboor?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Muhammad Saad Saboor</a>","time":"1w","title":"The Aga Khan University Hospital (Pakistan)"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-12-26T03:21:07.931Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHR9vUD0xUxSw/feedshare-shrink_1280/B56Zs1bRSOG4As-/0/1766127912210?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0RTGaH86J0ilCwEfQtMDzGz49mCNGYVzmm97PUaykJs","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEk-PQZD97F6A/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zs1bRStKAAw-/0/1766127911205?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=lzDv_4RGn0GxZvbcG_z2Fq7FL_8qyN-VtMrLiC-lvxc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEGhZMsrZwmEA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zs1bRTpIcAw-/0/1766127913030?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=OFJWXjDSn9-EZXrF6ezpkBEhoFDNbgBWYYw1Ri8J_ks","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEcXhc9ankOvQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zs1bRW8IkAg-/0/1766127944792?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=546_O4nc32Af74BjMBAw0Ri8iRdi6glrWBODuQCDnJQ","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFY7fjG44qsMQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zs1bRTzGgA0-/0/1766127914321?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=PFXA8zO9d19vpEXBbTquQbaESyecFWabdNwpVufLlP8"],"likes_count":235,"post_id":"7408053550255083520","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/akuh-pakistan_safecarelevel5-patientsafety-akuh-activity-7408053550255083520-ne7i","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Celebrating another year of excellence in patient safety and quality care. All four AKUH Off-Campus Hospitals (Garden, Karimabad, Kharadar, and Hyderabad) have once again achieved the 𝗦𝗮𝗳𝗲𝗖𝗮𝗿𝗲 𝗟𝗲𝘃𝗲𝗹 𝟱 𝗰𝗲𝗿𝘁𝗶𝗳𝗶𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻, a globally renowned benchmark for healthcare quality and patient safety. This recertification followed a rigorous, two-week-long evaluation by international SafeCare assessors, utilising the latest SafeCare Standards v5.0. The assessment confirmed that our hospitals not only met but outperformed the stringent requirements across 13 Service Elements and 760 measurable criteria, with impressive scores ranging from 96 to 98. A heartfelt thank you to our dedicated teams for their hard work and commitment to continuous improvement. #SafeCareLevel5 #PatientSafety #AKUH #QualityHealthcare","text_html":"Celebrating another year of excellence in patient safety and quality care.
&#xA0;
All four AKUH Off-Campus Hospitals (Garden, Karimabad, Kharadar, and Hyderabad) have once again achieved the &#x1D5E6;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5F3;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5D6;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F2; &#x1D5DF;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D603;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5F9; &#x1D7F1; &#x1D5F0;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D601;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F3;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D601;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB;, a globally renowned benchmark for healthcare quality and patient safety. 
&#xA0;
This recertification followed a rigorous, two-week-long evaluation by international SafeCare assessors, utilising the latest SafeCare Standards v5.0. The assessment confirmed that our hospitals not only met but outperformed the stringent requirements across 13 Service Elements and 760 measurable criteria, with impressive scores ranging from 96 to 98.
&#xA0;
A heartfelt thank you to our dedicated teams for their hard work and commitment to continuous improvement.
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsafecarelevel5&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SafeCareLevel5</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpatientsafety&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#PatientSafety</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fakuh&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AKUH</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fqualityhealthcare&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#QualityHealthcare</a>","time":"1w","title":"The Aga Khan University Hospital (Pakistan)"},{"comments_count":4,"date":"2025-12-03T03:21:07.933Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHFPslxfzTB3g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4DZrK3BTGKEAg-/0/1764340026470?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=dovwSYLnud_p4V1tY0-uJrhLQHtdq3M4R6qvWsVm2IE"],"likes_count":79,"post_id":"7400428305897824256","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/akuh-pakistan_stress-is-no-longer-just-an-individual-challenge-activity-7400428305897824256-_qb3","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Stress is no longer just an individual challenge; it has become a generational health concern. Chronic burnout affects not only one’s mental wellbeing but also their physical health, increasing the risk of anxiety, depression, heart disease, and diabetes. In this article, Dr Samiya Iqbal explores how burnout develops, its wide-ranging effects, and what can be done at individual, organisational, and societal levels to prevent it. Understanding burnout and recognising early signs can help you protect your and your teams’ health and future. Read the article to learn more: http://bit.ly/3XVUSAg","text_html":"Stress is no longer just an individual challenge; it has become a generational health concern. Chronic burnout affects not only one&#x2019;s mental wellbeing but also their physical health, increasing the risk of anxiety, depression, heart disease, and diabetes.
&#xA0;
In this article, Dr Samiya Iqbal explores how burnout develops, its wide-ranging effects, and what can be done at individual, organisational, and societal levels to prevent it. Understanding burnout and recognising early signs can help you protect your and your teams&#x2019; health and future.
&#xA0;
Read the article to learn more: <a class="link" href="http://bit.ly/3XVUSAg?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>http://bit.ly/3XVUSAg</a> ","time":"1mo","title":"The Aga Khan University Hospital (Pakistan)"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-12-03T03:21:07.939Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQED8cR0nJiTLA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZq_nWL8IkA0-/0/1764151364397?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=tQ6p9yYVQGdxRL8sZqBeSV2aGRVxrjiSuTqY870WwJA","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFEjvD7HnUPSQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZq_nWMCGsAw-/0/1764151363482?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=rpEcvk_kV9lctBexGD1g4_egZ0tdkHAfQ91jLBVbVsw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHk6KG_5A_UjA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZq_nWNMGQAw-/0/1764151364848?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=w1Txg0SITm_0E8H9pCipO_jjeLDdH0rxK1DfD4GBMUE","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQGVIbwyFpuhAg/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZq_nWMdJIAw-/0/1764151364244?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=XY8CcFLMLt1l--1-fV2rGeWOs8V2vujjPOmJfAouDmw"],"likes_count":90,"post_id":"7399387132970057728","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/akuh-pakistan_worldchildrensday-akuh-childrensrights-activity-7399387132970057728-uCh5","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A vibrant week filled with colour, creativity, and inspiring young voices at AKUH! In honour of World Children’s Day, our teams led a joyful Walk for Children’s Rights and organised fun, meaningful activities across our paediatric wards, outpatient clinics, and off-campus hospitals. From play therapy sessions and student debates to hands-on life-saving demonstrations for young learners, every moment celebrated children’s imagination, creativity, and courage. Together, we remain committed to creating safe, inclusive, and joyful spaces for every child. #WorldChildrensDay #AKUH #ChildrensRights #Paediatrics #ChildHealth","text_html":"A vibrant week filled with colour, creativity, and inspiring young voices at AKUH!
&#xA0;
In honour of World Children&#x2019;s Day, our teams led a joyful Walk for Children&#x2019;s Rights and organised fun, meaningful activities across our paediatric wards, outpatient clinics, and off-campus hospitals. 

From play therapy sessions and student debates to hands-on life-saving demonstrations for young learners, every moment celebrated children&#x2019;s imagination, creativity, and courage.
&#xA0;
Together, we remain committed to creating safe, inclusive, and joyful spaces for every child.
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fworldchildrensday&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WorldChildrensDay</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fakuh&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AKUH</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fchildrensrights&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ChildrensRights</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpaediatrics&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Paediatrics</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fchildhealth&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ChildHealth</a>","time":"1mo","title":"The Aga Khan University Hospital (Pakistan)"},{"date":"2025-12-03T03:21:07.944Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQGdHuhi5car7g/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZq15l3UIMAs-/0/1763988376180?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=i4VnmAtWWUa72LpoQXcl1gvLD4Czkr-6MORAsaBy9k4","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFL-EpKOO5Ecw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZq15l_5IEAw-/0/1763988378745?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=6Jq0RN16tHPIiCiO7V41c1GTya7WkC8CdHsinh0DqFU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQExh96i2viPtA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZq15l47G8A0-/0/1763988378218?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=7nlOOUVXkLtGVDZlTYmdBI2jy45BtDYsukguoefKfJg","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFRWw7ZcnuthA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZq15l5RH4A0-/0/1763988377812?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=kUWKJzR-p4DKS5HdQfwJCdTdQSqnvM2oofvu455Lz-Y"],"likes_count":64,"post_id":"7398706978841083904","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/akuh-pakistan_worldcopdday-lunghealth-stronglungs-activity-7398706978841083904-Mssa","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Delighted to see such strong community engagement at our World COPD Day awareness session, “Keeping Lungs Healthy and Strong.” The session brought together respiratory care experts and community members for an interactive programme focused on practical ways to improve and protect lung health. Participants gained evidence-based guidance through expert talks, Q&A, free lung assessments, spirometry counselling, inhaler-use demonstrations, smoking cessation support, and more. Our goal remains clear: to equip people with the knowledge and tools they need to safeguard their respiratory health and reduce the risk of chronic lung disease. Thank you to everyone who attended, asked questions, and helped drive this important conversation forward. #WorldCOPDDay #LungHealth #StrongLungs #AKUH","text_html":"Delighted to see such strong community engagement at our World COPD Day awareness session, &#x201C;Keeping Lungs Healthy and Strong.&#x201D;
&#xA0;
The session brought together respiratory care experts and community members for an interactive programme focused on practical ways to improve and protect lung health. Participants gained evidence-based guidance through expert talks, Q&amp;A, free lung assessments, spirometry counselling, inhaler-use demonstrations, smoking cessation support, and more.
&#xA0;
Our goal remains clear: to equip people with the knowledge and tools they need to safeguard their respiratory health and reduce the risk of chronic lung disease.
&#xA0;
Thank you to everyone who attended, asked questions, and helped drive this important conversation forward.
&#xA0;
