x1D5F6;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5EF;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5F9; &#x1D5E5;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D600;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D600;&#x1D601;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5F2; (&#x1D5D4;&#x1D5E0;&#x1D5E5;)
&#xA0;
As we mark World AMR Awareness Week, we came together for a meaningful celebration to recognise the dedication of our staff in this vital global health effort.
&#xA0;
Antimicrobial Resistance, when germs become strong enough to resist the medicines meant to eliminate them, is one of the most urgent challenges in modern healthcare. Our hospital leadership reaffirmed our commitment to addressing this threat through responsible antibiotic use, strong infection prevention practices, and continuous staff education.
&#xA0;
We extend our heartfelt appreciation to our frontline teams&#x2014;our Doctors, Pharmacists, Nurses, and all healthcare professionals&#x2014;whose vigilance and expertise help safeguard our patients every day. Their efforts ensure antibiotics remain effective for generations to come.
&#xA0;
