&#xA0;
The event was a success, offering attendees practical, actionable insights on diabetes management and prevention. We covered everything from expert clinical discussions and live exercise demonstrations to Pakistani palate-friendly dietary guidance. 
&#xA0;
We strongly believe that simple, consistent lifestyle changes are key to managing and preventing diabetes. Thank you to everyone who participated!
&#xA0;
Let&apos;s continue to track, treat, and thrive as a community dedicated to health and well-being.
&#xA0;
