age/v2/D4D22AQEHfkSGHRHwig/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZqL645XGkAw-/0/1763284078116?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=PQ5yMj4DEbWV3L6eLVYScCIQxsqX321N8VgsMHpqqnc"],"likes_count":251,"post_id":"7395749472309334016","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/akuh-pakistan_akuh-earlychildhooddevelopment-parentingsupport-activity-7395749472309334016-QixI","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We are excited to celebrate the 5th Anniversary of our 𝗘𝗮𝗿𝗹𝘆 𝗖𝗵𝗶𝗹𝗱𝗵𝗼𝗼𝗱 𝗣𝗮𝗿𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗖𝗹𝗶𝗻𝗶𝗰 (𝗢𝗕𝗚𝗬𝗡), a trusted resource empowering parents and caregivers through the critical early years. Led by Dr Shelina Bhamani, Ph.D. and her team, with valuable support from our Nursing Education Services, the clinic has become a cornerstone for families, providing expert guidance and a supportive space for parents and caregivers. From conception to age eight, the clinic equips families with the knowledge and tools to nurture their child's growth – because investing in our children’s early years is the most powerful investment we can make. We were honoured to commemorate this milestone alongside Dr Farhat Abbas, CEO of the AKUH Health System Pakistan; Dr Karim Damji, Dean of the Medical College; Dr Lumaan Sheikh, Chair of OBGYN; and Samira Lakhani, representing Nursing Services, in recognition of the clinic’s vital impact on families and communities. Together, we are shaping brighter beginnings for the next generation. 🔗 Learn more: https://lnkd.in/dHUjqefp #AKUH #EarlyChildhoodDevelopment #ParentingSupport #ChildDevelopment #HealthcareExcellence","text_html":"We are excited to celebrate the 5th Anniversary of our &#x1D5D8;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D606; &#x1D5D6;&#x1D5F5;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D5F1;&#x1D5F5;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F1; &#x1D5E3;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D601;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F4; &#x1D5D6;&#x1D5F9;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5F0; (&#x1D5E2;&#x1D5D5;&#x1D5DA;&#x1D5EC;&#x1D5E1;), a trusted resource empowering parents and caregivers through the critical early years.
&#xA0;
Led by Dr <a class="link" href="https://pk.linkedin.com/in/shelina-bhamani-ph-d-33512b34?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Shelina Bhamani, Ph.D.</a> and her team, with valuable support from our Nursing Education Services, the clinic has become a cornerstone for families, providing expert guidance and a supportive space for parents and caregivers. From conception to age eight, the clinic equips families with the knowledge and tools to nurture their child&apos;s growth &#x2013; because investing in our children&#x2019;s early years is the most powerful investment we can make.
&#xA0;
We were honoured to commemorate this milestone alongside Dr Farhat Abbas, CEO of the AKUH Health System Pakistan; Dr Karim Damji, Dean of the Medical College; Dr Lumaan Sheikh, Chair of OBGYN; and Samira Lakhani, representing Nursing Services, in recognition of the clinic&#x2019;s vital impact on families and communities.

Together, we are shaping brighter beginnings for the next generation.
&#xA0;
