D%97%B0%F0%9D%97%AE%F0%9D%97%BF%F0%9D%97%B2-%F0%9D%9F%B0%F0%9D%9F%AC-%F0%9D%98%86%F0%9D%97%B2%F0%9D%97%AE%F0%9D%97%BF%F0%9D%98%80-activity-7393943707458199552-cOTU","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"𝟰𝟬 𝘆𝗲𝗮𝗿𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝗰𝗮𝗿𝗲. 𝟰𝟬 𝘆𝗲𝗮𝗿𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝗰𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝘀𝘀𝗶𝗼𝗻. 𝟰𝟬 𝘆𝗲𝗮𝗿𝘀 𝗼𝗳 𝘁𝗼𝘂𝗰𝗵𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗹𝗶𝘃𝗲𝘀. ❤ Today, we proudly celebrate the 40th Anniversary of the Aga Khan University Hospital, Karachi, which first opened its doors at the Stadium Road campus on 11 November 1985. On that day, our founder and first Chancellor, Prince Karim Aga Khan IV, inaugurated the Hospital, beginning a journey of care, compassion, and innovation that has helped redefine healthcare in Pakistan. For four decades, we have strived to deliver excellence and build trust with our patients and families whom we serve. Thank you for being part of our story. Here’s to the past we honour and the future we continue to build, together. 𝗛𝗮𝗽𝗽𝘆 𝟰𝟬𝘁𝗵 𝗔𝗻𝗻𝗶𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘀𝗮𝗿𝘆, 𝗔𝗞𝗨𝗛! 🎉","text_html":"&#x1D7F0;&#x1D7EC; &#x1D606;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D600; &#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F3; &#x1D5F0;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D5F2;. &#x1D7F0;&#x1D7EC; &#x1D606;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D600; &#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F3; &#x1D5F0;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FA;&#x1D5FD;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D600;&#x1D600;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D5FB;. &#x1D7F0;&#x1D7EC; &#x1D606;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D5EE;&#x1D5FF;&#x1D600; &#x1D5FC;&#x1D5F3; &#x1D601;&#x1D5FC;&#x1D602;&#x1D5F0;&#x1D5F5;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D5FB;&#x1D5F4; &#x1D5F9;&#x1D5F6;&#x1D603;&#x1D5F2;&#x1D600;. &#x2764; 

Today, we proudly celebrate the 40th Anniversary of the Aga Khan University Hospital, Karachi, which first opened its doors at the Stadium Road campus on 11 November 1985.

On that day, our founder and first Chancellor, Prince Karim Aga Khan IV, inaugurated the Hospital, beginning a journey of care, compassion, and innovation that has helped redefine healthcare in Pakistan.

For four decades, we have strived to deliver excellence and build trust with our patients and families whom we serve.

Thank you for being part of our story. Here&#x2019;s to the past we honour and the future we continue to build, together.

