ions unfold. David Lusby | Kathy Doyle | Paul Rodgers | Ally McCaffrey | John O'Loughlin","text_html":"Tariff shock. Trade war. Then hard&#x2011;won deals.&#xA0;&#xA0;
&#xA0;&#xA0;
In 2025, US policy forced a global reset&#x2014;disrupted supply chains, higher&#xA0;costs&#xA0;and rapid strategy shifts.&#xA0;&#xA0;
&#xA0;&#xA0;
As 2026 approaches, the C&#x2011;suite needs action: diversify sourcing, tighten&#xA0;compliance&#xA0;and align tax, legal, finance and HR.&#xA0;&#xA0;
