-activity-7406970161720709120-q1S1","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Across industries, the rules of the game are changing. As economic headwinds, EU regulations, and talent shortages converge with transformative technologies like AI, incremental change won’t cut it anymore. In our latest insight, we explore why reinvention matters and how leaders can act decisively to build resilience and growth. Because standing still is the riskiest move of all. Read our insight here: https://lnkd.in/dTbeNAAj","text_html":"Across industries, the rules of the game are changing.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
As&#xA0;economic headwinds, EU regulations, and talent shortages&#xA0;converge&#xA0;with transformative technologies like AI, incremental change&#xA0;won&#x2019;t&#xA0;cut it anymore.&#xA0;
