ally essential. &#x1F4A7;

Our techs work in some extraordinary places, including the Silvan Reservoir, which carries over half of Melbourne&#x2019;s water.

Built in the 1920s, Silvan&#x2019;s deep tunnels weren&#x2019;t designed for modern connectivity, making life tough for crews working 40+ meter below the waterline.

So last week, two of our techs headed down to install a comms solution where it matters most. Their &#x201C;office&#x201D; included long underground passages, tight inspection tunnels, and a 40-meter ladder climb &#x2699;&#xFE0F;&#x1F526;

We&#x2019;re incredibly proud of our people who keep Victoria&#x2019;s essential services running, often in places most of us will never see. &#x1F44F;","time":"1mo","title":"Telstra"}]

