<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbiotech&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Biotech</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhealthcare&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Healthcare</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fconference&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Conference</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finvesting&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Investing</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbusinessdevelopment&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BusinessDevelopment</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbreakingbarriers&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BreakingBarriers</a>","time":"1w 1mo","title":"Vect-Horus"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-12-24T23:16:49.431Z","likes_count":36,"post_id":"7407329326930702336","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/vect-horus-s-a-s-_yearinreview-partnership-businessdevelopment-activity-7407329326930702336-mNSL","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"It has been another busy year at Vect-Horus – with a lot of highlights to look back on. Our partnerships with Novo Nordisk Ionis Pharmaceuticals, Inc. and Radiomedix, Inc. continued to progress strongly, and we concluded several new strategic research collaborations including with Secarna Pharmaceuticals . We have significantly strengthened our company leadership with a number of appointments. These include Carole Imbert as CFO, and Jerome Berger , and Philippe MASSET as new members of the Board of Directors. Our research was published in leading periodicals, including Journal of Controlled Release, Elifesciences, Nature Communications, bioRxiv and medRxiv. Furthermore, we held talks or presented posters at several meetings including the 21st Annual Meeting of the Oligonucleotide Therapeutics Society (OTS), the 4th Annual mRNA-Based Therapeutics Summit Europe and at the TIDES USA conference. Last but not least, we were honoured to receive a prestigious European Enterprise Award by EU Business News, as one of the Pharma & Biotech Innovators of the Year 2024. As we look ahead to the new year, we would like to thank all our employees, investors, partners and other stakeholders for your continuing efforts and support. #YearInReview #Partnership #BusinessDevelopment #Biotech #Healthcare #BreakingBarriers","text_html":"It has been another busy year at Vect-Horus &#x2013; with a lot of highlights to look back on.
&#xA0;
Our partnerships with <a class="link" href="https://dk.linkedin.com/company/novo-nordisk?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Novo Nordisk</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ionis-pharmaceuticals?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ionis Pharmaceuticals, Inc.</a> and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/radiomedix-inc-?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Radiomedix, Inc.</a> continued to progress strongly, and we concluded several new strategic research collaborations including with <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/secarna-pharmaceuticals?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Secarna Pharmaceuticals</a>.
&#xA0;
We have significantly strengthened our company leadership with a number of appointments. These include <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/carole-imbert?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Carole Imbert</a> as CFO, and <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/jerome-berger-a221a7168?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jerome Berger</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/philippe-jean-masset?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philippe MASSET</a> as new members of the Board of Directors.
&#xA0;
Our research was published in leading periodicals, including Journal of Controlled Release, Elifesciences, Nature Communications, bioRxiv and medRxiv. Furthermore, we held talks or presented posters at several meetings including the 21st Annual Meeting of the Oligonucleotide Therapeutics Society (OTS), the 4th Annual mRNA-Based Therapeutics Summit Europe and at the TIDES USA conference. 
&#xA0;
&#xA0;
Last but not least, we were honoured to receive a prestigious European Enterprise Award by EU Business News, as one of the&#x202F;Pharma &amp; Biotech Innovators of the Year 2024.
&#xA0;
As we look ahead to the new year, we would like to thank all our employees, investors, partners and other stakeholders for your continuing efforts and support. 
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fyearinreview&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#YearInReview</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpartnership&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Partnership</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbusinessdevelopment&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BusinessDevelopment</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbiotech&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Biotech</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhealthcare&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Healthcare</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbreakingbarriers&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BreakingBarriers</a>","time":"1w","title":"Vect-Horus"},{"date":"2025-12-01T23:16:49.437Z","likes_count":44,"post_id":"7396419406240608256","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/vect-horus-s-a-s-_biotech-healthcare-markets-activity-7396419406240608256-4Bwm","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"The blood-brain barrier (BBB) has long been a roadblock for treating neurological diseases, cancers, and other conditions – but at Vect-Horus, we’re changing that barrier into a bridge. For Vect-Horus CEO Alexandre Tokay , an experienced investment banker and biotech industry veteran who co-founded the company with Michel Khrestchatisky , the technology and its potential to transform treatment for many diseases puts us in a unique position. And today, as we approach our 20th anniversary, that progress continues to be underpinned by our talented and dedicated team. As Alexandre says: “With our strong pipeline and IP protection, Vect-Horus has a strong position to unlock treatments and markets that were once out of reach – bringing the future of CNS drug delivery into the present.” The VECTrans® platform changes the game by using molecular vectors that bind to natural receptors, and its potential has been validated by our strategic licensing deals including with Novo Nordisk , Ionis Pharmaceuticals, Inc. and Radiomedix, Inc. The technology can address large and visible markets, such as neurodegenerative diseases, motor neurone diseases and brain cancers. The market is now at an important inflection point, as major pharmaceutical companies are increasingly integrating CNS delivery technologies, for example AbbVie acquisition of Aliada and most recently, Novartis agreement to acquire Avidity Biosciences, Inc. #Biotech #Healthcare #Markets #M &A #BusinessDevelopment #Investing #BreakingBarriers","text_html":"The blood-brain barrier (BBB) has long been a roadblock for treating neurological diseases, cancers, and other conditions &#x2013; but at Vect-Horus, we&#x2019;re changing that barrier into a bridge.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
For Vect-Horus CEO <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/alexandre-tokay-0592b88?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Alexandre Tokay</a>, an experienced investment banker and biotech industry veteran who co-founded the company with <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/michel-khrestchatisky-4560236b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michel Khrestchatisky</a>, the technology and its potential to transform treatment for many diseases puts us in a unique position. And today, as we approach our 20th anniversary, that progress continues to be underpinned by our talented and dedicated team.&#xA0;&#xA0;
&#xA0;
As Alexandre says: &#x201C;With our strong pipeline and IP protection, Vect-Horus has a strong position to unlock treatments and markets that were once out of reach &#x2013; bringing the future of CNS drug delivery into the present.&#x201D;&#xA0;
&#xA0;
The VECTrans&#xAE; platform changes the game by using molecular vectors that bind to natural receptors, and its potential has been validated by our strategic licensing deals including with <a class="link" href="https://dk.linkedin.com/company/novo-nordisk?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Novo Nordisk</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/ionis-pharmaceuticals?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ionis Pharmaceuticals, Inc.</a> and&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/radiomedix-inc-?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Radiomedix, Inc. </a>
&#xA0;
The technology can address large and visible markets, such as neurodegenerative diseases, motor neurone diseases and brain cancers.&#xA0;&#xA0;
&#xA0;
The market is now at an important inflection point, as major pharmaceutical companies are increasingly integrating CNS delivery technologies, for example <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/abbvie?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>AbbVie</a> acquisition of Aliada and most recently, <a class="link" href="https://ch.linkedin.com/company/novartis?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Novartis</a> agreement to acquire <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/avidity-biosciences-llc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Avidity Biosciences, Inc.</a>&#xA0;&#xA0;
