nering opportunities and scientific collaboration. Feel free to get in touch to arrange a meeting! 🤝 Looking forward to seeing you there! #Biotech #Partnering #Conference #Oligonucleotides #Vectors","text_html":"&#x1F3AF; We&#x2019;re looking forward to OTS 2025, taking place October 19-22 in Budapest, Hungary.&#xA0;
