&#x1F9E0; At OTS, <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/guillaume-jacquot-9780b6b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Guillaume Jacquot</a>, Program Director, Brain &amp; Tissue Targeting of Oligonucleotides will hold a talk on &quot; VECTrans&#xAE; platform achieves potent RNAi in the deep brain in NHP at minimal systemic dose&#x201D;. This takes place on 20 October 15:45-16:00, in Session III: Pre-Clinical II (Late Stage).&#xA0;
&#xA0;
&#x1F469;&#x1F52C; <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/in/emmanuelle-bettendorf?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Emmanuelle Bettendorf</a>, Business Developer &amp; Alliance Management, will also be on site and available for discussions around partnering opportunities and scientific collaboration. Feel free to get in touch to arrange a meeting!&#xA0;
