","time":"1mo 2mo","title":"Hooibeekhoeve"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2024-02-08T08:27:15.242Z","likes_count":11,"post_id":"7379043992363089920","post_url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/posts/onderzoekscentrum-hooibeekhoeve_bodem-watermanagement-duurzamelandbouw-activity-7379043992363089920-Qb2O","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":"2025-09-30T08:27:15.242Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["337 followers"],"repost_id":"7378689009016827904","repost_text":"🚀 Our animated video is out! Across Europe, climate change and water scarcity are putting farms at risk. Farmers face uncertainty as fields dry out and soils lose vitality. But action is underway. This short #animation explains how 12 Operational Groups and our network of Ambassadors will work to bridge the gap between research and practice. The first YouTube video on our channel tells the story and journey of the AQUAGRI-KNOW project. 👉 Watch the English version of the animation here 👉 Versions are also available in #Spanish , #Catalan , #Polish , #Italian , #Greek , and #Dutch – choose your language and share with your community! - https://lnkd.in/dQKEX37q 💦 Step by step, the land begins to breathe again. #SustainableAgriculture #WaterManagement #Innovation #ClimateSmartAgriculture #animation","repost_title":"AQUAGRI-KNOW","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/aquagri-know?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"AQUAGRI-KNOW"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQHnSPqX4-vhxg/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4DZmZeJG9GQBg-/0/1759216541110?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Ydjr3VAI0y9tsuP1X6dIeJgn5KcA0AdE_5UwZSAQ4jw","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQHnSPqX4-vhxg/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4DZmZeJG9GQBk-/0/1759216541968?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=gT9ifrdI3YAMMxXm8qNCuPU7qG5mjuTi99jzumh2aB4"]},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Sinds 1 februari is Hooibeekhoeve projectpartner van AQUAGRI-K