e are so grateful for that partnership. Thank you for your generosity, your heart, and for reminding all of us what the true spirit of Christmas is about. 🎁✨ #Gratitude #ChristmasSpirit #CommunityPartners #TransitionsOfCare #AsburyParkFamily #HealthcareWithHeart ProHealth Home Care Inc","text_html":"&#x1F384;&#x2728; A Christmas Surprise We&#x2019;ll Never Forget &#x2728;&#x1F384;

We want to extend our deepest gratitude to the incredible team at Pro Health for spending part of their Christmas Day with us at Asbury Park and bringing a gifts to our long-term care residents. &#x1F381;
Our residents were deeply touched, and our dedicated staff working that day felt the love and Christmas spirit!
Moments like these remind us why what we do matters so much. &#x2764;&#xFE0F;

We also want to take a moment to sincerely thank Pro Health for the exceptional work they do all year long. They are a trusted partner in transitions of care, known to our team for consistent communication, compassion, and service excellence. 
Pro Health is a team we can always count on and we are so grateful for that partnership.

Thank you for your generosity, your heart, and for reminding all of us what the true spirit of Christmas is about. &#x1F381;&#x2728;
