nother memorable Asbury Park Holiday Party &#x2728;

It&#x2019;s always about the people. What makes this team so special is the genuine care, first and foremost for our residents, and just as importantly, for one another.

That love, teamwork, and heart are what truly set Asbury Park apart.

Wishing everyone a very happy holiday season from all of us in the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/asbury-park-nursing-rehabilitation-center?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Asbury Park Nursing &amp; Rehabilitation Center</a> family &#x1F384;&#x2B50;&#xFE0F;","time":"2w","title":"Alicia Portela","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5605AQECjfPzrHFRKw/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B56Zsi0zMSIACI-/0/1765815834933?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ZzPoOewA9V9cN3ufPqHYKl5NOru6Ve-ZbL0C0utMB_g","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5605AQECjfPzrHFRKw/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B56Zsi0zMSIABw-/0/1765815834933?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=gWl7TC4Ac0AtsnOI5-xi26MH6H_jt7bF-i0Gri_3p94"]},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-15T20:41:45.894Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQG__FK8_N341g/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZsD4bLrJcAk-/0/1765296681976?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ikuF51TY8QczfpphZP7KYx_6CTFL9MSqmnCtvH4YwI8","https://static.licdn.com/aero-v1/sc/h/dur0ryw0e9uscxa9b6zqvgvfs"],"likes_count":21,"post_id":"7404190941600845824","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/asbury-park-nursing-rehabilitation-center_as-we-move-through-the-holiday-season-we-activity-7404190941600845824-3AWc","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"As we move through the holiday season, we’re reminded how meaningful it is to serve our residents, support our families, and work alongside dedicated teams and partners who show up with compassion every single day. Wishing everyone a wonderful holiday season filled with warmth, joy, and moments of peace. ✨","text_html":"As we move through the holiday season, we&#x2019;re reminded how meaningful it is to serve our residents, support our families, and work alongside dedicated teams and partners who show up with compassion every single day.

Wishing everyone a wonderful holiday season filled with warmth, joy, and moments of peace. &#x2728;","time":"2w","title":"Asbury Park Nursing & Rehabilitation Center"},{"comments_count":20,"date":"2025-12-08T20:41:45.897Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHqQSoj6XXCiw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4DZrlDKyCJAAg-/0/1764779404632?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=N1Gf65IxDhpzfDuuboCTrOMb2mMcdNZObcJmaAS4IMs"],"likes_count":118,"post_id":"7402030831957114881","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7402021322400337921-Oy7c","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Cheers to loving what we do⭐️💫 My first journey with Asbury Park Nursing & Rehabilitation Center lasted 11 years, and after exploring other areas of healthcare, Home Health, Hospice, Infusion, and 2 other skilled nursing facilities, nothing ever felt the way Asbury Park feels to me. Now I’m back for another 7 years and everyday feels like day 1! Asbury Park gives me a true sense of purpose. This work allows me to make a meaningful difference in the lives of a vulnerable population, and I truly believe that’s what we are all meant to do: give back, serve others, and make a difference however we can.❤️ I’m deeply grateful for the leaders who shaped my path and believed in me. I began my skilled nursing journey right out of high school in Oakland, California, and I loved this work from day one. We all know this field isn’t for everyone and definitely not for the weak! You need grit, heart, and a whole lot of passion to thrive in Post-Acute Care. Today, I can truly say I have never been happier or more supported in my career. I am especially grateful for my administrator, Alicia Portela , who never lets a day pass without reminding me that I’m appreciated, valued, and making a difference. Her leadership inspires me every single day. Alicia genuinely cares about our mission and the impact we are making. I am now honored to support three incredible facilities! Asbury Park, Woodside Healthcare Center, and Pioneer House, and I look forward to the years ahead as we continue providing excellence, compassion, and dignity to those we serve. Here’s to purpose. Here’s to growth. And here’s to the privilege of making a difference. 💙✨","text_html":"Cheers to loving what we do&#x2B50;&#xFE0F;&#x1F4AB;

My first journey with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/asbury-park-nursing-rehabilitation-center?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Asbury Park Nursing &amp; Rehabilitation Center</a>  lasted 11 years, and after exploring other areas of healthcare, Home Health, Hospice, Infusion, and 2 other skilled nursing facilities, nothing ever felt the way Asbury Park feels to me.
Now I&#x2019;m back for another 7 years and everyday feels like day 1! 

Asbury Park gives me a true sense of purpose. This work allows me to make a meaningful difference in the lives of a vulnerable population, and I truly believe that&#x2019;s what we are all meant to do: give back, serve others, and make a difference however we can.&#x2764;&#xFE0F;

I&#x2019;m deeply grateful for the leaders who shaped my path and believed in me. 
I began my skilled nursing journey right out of high school in Oakland, California, and I loved this work from day one. We all know this field isn&#x2019;t for everyone and definitely not for the weak! You need grit, heart, and a whole lot of passion to thrive in Post-Acute Care.

Today, I can truly say I have never been happier or more supported in my career. I am especially grateful for my administrator, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alicia-portela-15884b149?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Alicia Portela</a>, who never lets a day pass without reminding me that I&#x2019;m appreciated, valued, and making a difference. Her leadership inspires me every single day. Alicia genuinely cares about our mission and the impact we are making. 

I am now honored to support three incredible facilities!
Asbury Park, Woodside Healthcare Center, and Pioneer House, and I look forward to the years ahead as we continue providing excellence, compassion, and dignity to those we serve.

Here&#x2019;s to purpose. Here&#x2019;s to growth. And here&#x2019;s to the privilege of making a difference. &#x1F499;&#x2728;","time":"3w","title":"Debi Moroles"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-11-29T20:41:45.899Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHEjrJl7SaX3g/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56ZrBfR6oI0Aw-/0/1764182798303?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-KSOU3b7lLjAf8X4H1BkSvBd-9jcNXU1tN4qBvVZ220","https://static.licdn.com/aero-v1/sc/h/dur0ryw0e9uscxa9b6zqvgvfs"],"likes_count":13,"post_id":"7399518969650655232","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/asbury-park-nursing-rehabilitation-center_wishing-everyone-a-day-of-abubundance-and-activity-7399518969650655232-wKGu","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Wishing everyone a day of abubundance and warmnth this Thanksgiving. From us all at Asbury Park🍂","text_html":"Wishing everyone a day of abubundance and warmnth this Thanksgiving.
