lthcare, the post-acute industry, and the communities we all serve. Your commitment to excellence, culture, education, and service continues to uplift providers and strengthen the support systems our patients and families rely on every day. We are proud to stand alongside you and look forward to continued partnership and collaboration. 💫 Nico Buan-Lagazo, DNP, RN, AGCNS-BC, NEA-BC, OCN Zyrene Marsh, DNP, APRN, FNP-C Alicia Portela JInky Bangayan Debi Moroles Sarah Mangus","text_html":"&#x2728; Honored to Support the 3rd Annual PNAC3 2025 Gala! &#x2728;

We were truly honored to attend and serve as proud sponsors of the 3rd Annual <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/philippine-nurses-association-california-capital-city-pnac3-9b20b4266?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philippine Nurses Association California Capital City (PNAC3)</a>  Fundraising Gala this year.

Thank you, PNAC3, for recognizing Asbury Park Nursing &amp; Rehabilitation Center and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/woodside-healthcare-center?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Woodside Healthcare Center</a> with Certificates of Appreciation. We are incredibly grateful for your dedication to healthcare, the post-acute industry, and the communities we all serve.

Your commitment to excellence, culture, education, and service continues to uplift providers and strengthen the support systems our patients and families rely on every day.

We are proud to stand alongside you and look forward to continued partnership and collaboration. &#x1F4AB;
