<a class="link" href="https://ch.linkedin.com/company/federal-department-of-defence-civil-protection-and-sports?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Eidgen&#xF6;ssisches Departement f&#xFC;r Verteidigung, Bev&#xF6;lkerungsschutz und Sport VBS</a>","time":"2w Edited","title":"armasuisse Wissenschaft und Technologie"},{"date":"2025-02-06T13:00:46.241Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEg3YCZvy_5Zw/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.hnK4Ag-/0/1764155453459?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=D7h0sZGeHd-FDmq_hF8lEfH027-ZT_k6_p861iOxQr0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHSJfrBDu5cKQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.nnI8Ag-/0/1764155455301?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=F7HQ3NE1wds1AfOaMgurdJAUmdoix5bmKduqzt4GSjw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFwi_ufuxKRmg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.q6J8Ag-/0/1764155461797?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=fdgly1es4PYduyzF0Do5Xb7d0jFhPrlQxKKroQ9NA0U","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEpJCAeKtPkjg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.n5HkAg-/0/1764155454516?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-FEAvUZ1uSCu5cmCEk9XKXC0XLaVOaJVTI1v9yco1SY","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHDMZthtxBMGA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.iGHIAg-/0/1764155453021?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=U3MO8yYc3jyk-gBR-VONPgHR3yo1MTwPrCfwYEF2ZVE"],"likes_count":11,"post_id":"7399752308970135553","post_url":"https://de.linkedin.com/posts/armasuisse_armasuisse-bedankt-sich-f%C3%BCr-den-besuch-vom-activity-7399752308970135553-ilkL","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEg3YCZvy_5Zw/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.hnK4Ag-/0/1764155453459?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=D7h0sZGeHd-FDmq_hF8lEfH027-ZT_k6_p861iOxQr0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHSJfrBDu5cKQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.nnI8Ag-/0/1764155455301?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=F7HQ3NE1wds1AfOaMgurdJAUmdoix5bmKduqzt4GSjw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFwi_ufuxKRmg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.q6J8Ag-/0/1764155461797?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=fdgly1es4PYduyzF0Do5Xb7d0jFhPrlQxKKroQ9NA0U","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEpJCAeKtPkjg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.n5HkAg-/0/1764155454516?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-FEAvUZ1uSCu5cmCEk9XKXC0XLaVOaJVTI1v9yco1SY","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHDMZthtxBMGA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zq_2.iGHIAg-/0/1764155453021?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=U3MO8yYc3jyk-gBR-VONPgHR3yo1MTwPrCfwYEF2ZVE"],"repost_date":"2025-12-03T13:00:46.241Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["21,889 followers"],"repost_id":"7399404316392030208","repost_text":"Bundesrat Martin Pfister - ein Departmentschef im Austausch 🔍 Seit Amtsantritt im April 2025 besucht Bundesrat Martin Pfister die verschiedenen Verwaltungseinheiten des VBS, um sich ein eigenes Bild von ihren Aufgaben und Abläufen zu machen. 🤝 Die Besuche zeigen, wie unterschiedlich die Herausforderungen in den einzelnen Bereichen sind. Manche Einheiten beobachten und analysieren Bedrohungen oder entwickeln technische Schutzmassnahmen, andere arbeiten an langfristigen sicherheitspolitischen Strategien, der Erstellung präziser Geodaten oder an Programmen für die nächste Generation von Sportlerinnen und Sportlern. Zusammen ergeben diese Tätigkeiten ein breites Aufgabenfeld, das weit über den militärischen Kern hinausreicht. 💬 Für den Bundesrat boten die Begegnungen die Möglichkeit, Fragen direkt an die Teams zu richten und unterschiedliche Perspektiven kennenzulernen. Bundesamt für Sport BASPO | Schweizer Armee | Bundesamt für Landestopografie swisstopo | National Cyber Security Centre Switzerland NCSC | Bundesamt für Rüstung armasuisse | Bundesamt für Bevölkerungsschutz BABS #VBS #Sicherheit #Verwaltungseinheiten #Besuch #Bundesrat #Austausch","repost_title":"Federal Department of Defence, Civil Protection and Sport DDPS","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/baspo-ofspo-ufspo?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Bundesamt für Sport BASPO"},{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/swiss-armed-forces?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Schweizer Armee"},{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/swisstopo?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Bundesamt für Landestopografie swisstopo"},{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/ncsc-ch?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"National Cyber Security Centre Switzerland NCSC"},{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/armasuisse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Bundesamt für Rüstung armasuisse"},{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/babs-ofpp-ufpp?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Bundesamt für Bevölkerungsschutz BABS"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"armasuisse bedankt sich für den Besuch vom Bundesrat Martin Pfister und das damit verbundene Interesse an unserer Arbeit 🤝","text_html":"armasuisse bedankt sich f&#xFC;r den Besuch vom Bundesrat Martin Pfister und das damit verbundene Interesse an unserer Arbeit &#x1F91D;","time":"1mo 1mo","title":"Federal Office for Defence Procurement armasuisse"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-02-06T13:00:46.248Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEhuALhQABo1g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqCokTWGYAg-/0/1763128264995?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=oxSkN-rB6oA0wLMf8rtxlZmpbwAT2kpWKX_uRD96XMU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGvhEDWVVk90A/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqCokT6GUAg-/0/1763128265226?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=xr_CJkuqXx0Vyb_jizIyhq12wUuvb2T71C9JzKFDU2s","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFfHal5CNRB1g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqCokVTHoAg-/0/1763128268737?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mv7bcB0ouWGEfCGshDuBNRNeVlu4ztZ3CBPBMgCy5PQ"],"likes_count":85,"post_id":"7396477922078793728","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/armasuisse_we-thank-diehl-defence-for-the-warm-welcome-activity-7396477922078793728-h3Wv","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEhuALhQABo1g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqCokTWGYAg-/0/1763128264995?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=oxSkN-rB6oA0wLMf8rtxlZmpbwAT2kpWKX_uRD96XMU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGvhEDWVVk90A/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqCokT6GUAg-/0/1763128265226?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=xr_CJkuqXx0Vyb_jizIyhq12wUuvb2T71C9JzKFDU2s","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFfHal5CNRB1g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqCokVTHoAg-/0/1763128268737?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mv7bcB0ouWGEfCGshDuBNRNeVlu4ztZ3CBPBMgCy5PQ"],"repost_date":"2025-12-03T13:00:46.248Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["86,366 followers"],"repost_id":"7395095958520340480","repost_text":"🔔 IRIS-T SLM for Switzerland - Start of program Today, Diehl Defence CPO Dr. Harald Buschek welcomed Dr. Urs Loher , National Armaments Director of Switzerland, at the companies premises in Überlingen. During the visit, Dr. Loher and Dr. Buschek signed the T0 declaration marking the official start of Switzerland’s IRIS‑T SLM procurement program. After Switzerland joined the European Sky Shield Initiative (ESSI), they signed a contract for the procurement of five IRIS‑T SLM air defence systems earlier this year. With these systems, the Swiss Armed Forces will strengthen their resilience to modern airborne threats. Dr. Harald Buschek and the Diehl Defence team would like to thank Dr. Urs Loher and armasuisse for the trustful cooperation and the visit in Überlingen. Bundesamt für Rüstung armasuisse #DiehlDefence #Armasuisse #AirDefence #IRIST #Switzerland","repost_title":"Diehl Defence","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://de.linkedin.com/company/diehl-defence?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Diehl Defence"},{"link":"https://ch.linkedin.com/company/armasuisse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Bundesamt für Rüstung armasuisse"}],"tagged_use