&#x1F4CC; Learn how to defend, document, and recover effectively: <a class="link" href="https://xerox.bz/4pbteKL?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://xerox.bz/4pbteKL</a>","time":"4d","title":"Xerox"},{"comments_count":14,"date":"2025-12-26T13:53:38.846Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQF3tQ4deB4rKg/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZs4OWdnKoAs-/0/1766174875995?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Kny7a1p2QAzjgxUWWygOQFbscXmuYB3qiwK30cN9GmM"],"likes_count":794,"post_id":"7407874953422913536","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/xerox_happy-holidays-from-xerox-and-thank-you-activity-7407874953422913536-tS81","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Happy Holidays from Xerox, and thank you to our clients, partners, and community for the trust that empowers our teams to drive innovation and momentum into 2026.","text_html":"Happy Holidays from Xerox, and thank you to our clients, partners, and community for the trust that empowers our teams to drive innovation and momentum into 2026.","time":"1w","title":"Xerox"},{"comments_count":4,"date":"2025-12-26T13:53:38.851Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEPiM-TzWPz9g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZs3y417IwAg-/0/1766167646205?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=dnDB5Ngu0-6N17EIKmUiPbuCOe7FYkD7DtX4usmMfNQ"],"likes_count":161,"post_id":"7407846069876867073","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7407844030186831872-_10u","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"As the year comes to a close, a common theme emerges from print teams everywhere: - You are doing more with fewer people. - You are wearing multiple hats every day. - You are running presses, fixing issues, handling files, talking to customers, and still trying to move the business forward. This is the current reality in the industry. Production print has evolved beyond just speed; it now emphasizes flexibility, workflow, and systems that support the teams on the floor. The Xerox Production Ecosystem is designed to meet this reality, helping teams keep jobs moving, reduce manual steps, and maintain productivity as work demands shift. I am grateful for the operators, managers, and leaders in print shops who consistently show up and push forward. Wishing everyone a happy holiday season and a strong year ahead. I'm also thankful for our Xerox leaders for helping our clients succeed now, and in the future. Sean Hickey , Terry Antinora , Steven Bandrowczak , Jacques-Edouard Gueden , John McBride , Kathy DiMaggio , Randy Baril , Merrill "Moisha" Clark , Billy Stojanovski , Kelly Leahy and many more! #Xerox #XeroxProduction #XeroxEcosystem #Automation #XeroxAI","text_html":"As the year comes to a close, a common theme emerges from print teams everywhere:

- You are doing more with fewer people.
- You are wearing multiple hats every day.
- You are running presses, fixing issues, handling files, talking to customers, and still trying to move the business forward.

This is the current reality in the industry. Production print has evolved beyond just speed; it now emphasizes flexibility, workflow, and systems that support the teams on the floor. The <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/xerox?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Xerox</a> Production Ecosystem is designed to meet this reality, helping teams keep jobs moving, reduce manual steps, and maintain productivity as work demands shift.

I am grateful for the operators, managers, and leaders in print shops who consistently show up and push forward. Wishing everyone a happy holiday season and a strong year ahead. 

I&apos;m also thankful for our Xerox leaders for helping our clients succeed now, and in the future.  <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sean-hickey-17038123?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sean Hickey</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/terryantinora?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Terry Antinora</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/steven-bandrowczak-51866a4?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Steven Bandrowczak</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacquesedouardgueden?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jacques-Edouard Gueden</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/john-d-mcbride?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>John McBride</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kathy-dimaggio-b5175514?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Kathy DiMaggio</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/randy-baril-a302a89?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Randy Baril</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/moisha?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card