&apos;re not alone.
&#xA0;
Online abuse can include:
&#xA0;
Image-based abuse (non-consensual intimate images)
Cyberbullying, trolling, online threats
Online/sexual harassment, grooming, or exploitation
AI deepfakes, manipulated content, or impersonation
Doxxing, stalking, or surveillance
Hate speech, targeted disinformation, and misogynistic networks
&#xA0;
If something feels off, it could be a red flag. Speak to someone confidentially before it escalates.
&#xA0;
&#x1F4DE;&#xA0;Lyra Wellbeing: 0800 611&#xA0;036
