nd words.

To everyone traveling and taking part in holiday activities: we&apos;re here for you, 24/7, anytime, anywhere. Please be safe. You can prepare by downloading and registering on the Netcare app today: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/d_UHQkxJ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/d_UHQkxJ</a>","time":"4w","title":"Craig Grindell"},{"date":"2025-12-05T08:45:58.904Z","likes_count":81,"post_id":"7401993480530477057","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/netcare_international-day-of-persons-with-disabilities-activity-7401993480530477057-qG37","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"At Netcare, our care is strengthened by unique perspectives, especially those shaped by lived experience. We’re committed to supporting and empowering our colleagues with disabilities. Creating a place where everyone can thrive isn’t an initiative, it’s who we are. It’s integral to our values and mission of creating an inclusive workplace of different abilities.","text_html":"At Netcare, our care is strengthened by unique perspectives, especially those shaped by lived experience. We&#x2019;re committed to supporting and empowering our colleagues with disabilities. Creating a place where everyone can thrive isn&#x2019;t an initiative, it&#x2019;s who we are. It&#x2019;s integral to our values and mission of creating an inclusive workplace of different abilities.","time":"4w Edited","title":"Netcare","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQFBXCH-uBtuxg/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4DZrkp0qDGQCI-/0/1764772763706?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=00EOtA9TtAGMPo-p1TUy2J9q86EskJ0AqmKzENFhwF8","h