[{"date":"2025-12-05T14:05:36.536Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEwSWA7fK_K0Q/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZrksCvIHEAk-/0/1764773342743?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=5HBjuhLMHaB8U1sNRP_6Zy4UCDoDD8yvBqiYItiSi9s","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEYHZ5ymg8wFQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZrksCwGKcAk-/0/1764773349474?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=JEWbOq2rxqcVGrtKJrFkSoxTgWApVl1dGqAgikKANg0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHpGj5O5IRONQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZrksCuLIUA0-/0/1764773342529?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Bn1A2ZuH0Qa2o0rGu5Db-mohYj90M47lYzjKYpKncow","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQF08OUxxcbolg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZrksCv0GYAw-/0/1764773346633?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jr2FXg-JVrE3fzpbOv8OZ2zLZN0AcpNcm-kiC4kMFhU"],"likes_count":24,"post_id":"7401995925159817216","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sunlife-uk_we-are-delighted-to-announce-that-we-have-activity-7401995925159817216-4p7_","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🏆We are delighted to announce that we have won Bronze at the DMA Awards in the Inclusive Marketing category!🏆 The award recognises the impact that our new brand platform – Everyday Confidence – has had on disrupting tired stereotypes, and showing over 50s as they are: diverse and unapologetically themselves. Huge thanks to DMA (Data & Marketing Association) UK for a wonderful awards ceremony, and congratulations to all the other worthy winners!","text_html":"&#x1F3C6;We are delighted to announce that we have won Bronze at the DMA Awards in the Inclusive Marketing category!&#x1F3C6;

The award recognises the impact that our new brand platform &#x2013; Everyday Confidence &#x2013; has had on disrupting tired stereotypes, and showing over 50s as they are: diverse and unapologetically themselves. 

Huge thanks to <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/data-and-marketing-association-uk-ltd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>DMA (Data &amp; Marketing Association) UK</a> for a wonderful awards ceremony, and congratulations to all the other worthy winners!&#xA0;","time":"4w","title":"SunLife UK"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-11-03T14:05:36.539Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQGuGE32AES8Vw/image-shrink_1280/B4EZoBujKXHMAM-/0/1760965571985?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-n5iEQ-uuiovuiJj-VuKXFH1oAX7zBcQHh2pX-LwfvI"],"likes_count":12,"post_id":"7386024945543458816","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sunlife-uk_dementia-friends-activity-7386024945543458816-Gdv8","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We've been lucky enough to take part in Alzheimer Society's Dementia Friends - an initiative that's all about increasing understanding of dementia and inspiring us all to make a difference. In our session, the amazing team at Alzheimer's Society explained: - Some of the different types of dementia - How it can change our behaviour and emotions - How to be more compassionate with someone who has dementia It's a big, important topic, but just one hour with Dementia Friends taught us so much 💙 A big thank you to the team at #alzheimerssociety for sharing their expertise with us here at SunLife. Find out about Dementia Friends here: https://brnw.ch/21wWLPh","text_html":"We&apos;ve been lucky enough to take part in Alzheimer Society&apos;s Dementia Friends - an initiative that&apos;s all about increasing understanding of dementia and inspiring us all to make a difference.

In our session, the amazing team at <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/alzheimer&apos;s-society?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Alzheimer&apos;s Society</a> explained:

- Some of the different types of dementia 
- How it can change our behaviour and emotions 
- How to be more compassionate with someone who has dementia

It&apos;s a big, important topic, but just one hour with Dementia Friends taught us so much &#x1F499;

A big thank you to the team at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Falzheimerssociety&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#alzheimerssociety</a> for sharing their expertise with us here at SunLife.

Find out about Dementia Friends here: <a class="link" href="https://brnw.ch/21wWLPh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://brnw.ch/21wWLPh</a>","time":"2mo Edited","title":"SunLife UK"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-11-03T14:05:36.541Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFvro8M1hGLEA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZnPIlxNIwAg-/0/1760116761413?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ygQK4Sv1eig5x871uxBVzqO0Yclb1nLCrErkD8MDmco"],"likes_count":37,"post_id":"7382464775903023104","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sunlife-uk_weve-been-shortlisted-following-a-rigorous-activity-7382464775903023104-eN7S","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We've been shortlisted! Following a rigorous 5-day judging process, we are delighted to announce that SunLife and TBWA\Worldwide have been shortlisted for a DMA (Data & Marketing Association) UK award in the Inclusive Marketing category, for our Redefining Ageing with Everyday Confidence campaign.","text_html":"We&apos;ve been shortlisted! 

Following a rigorous 5-day judging process, we are delighted to announce that SunLife and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/tbwa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>TBWA\Worldwide</a> have been shortlisted for a <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/data-and-marketing-association-uk-ltd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>DMA (Data &amp; Marketing Association) UK</a> award in the Inclusive Marketing category, for our Redefining Ageing with Everyday Confidence campaign.","time":"2mo","title":"SunLife UK"},{"date":"2025-11-03T14:05:36.543Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEp9U2ee5riZA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZnJl752J0As-/0/1760023789698?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=TY0kyNFpPZLlGwYWb5oO9OcHs3JJiOLTItLBqYlq41Q"],"likes_count":9,"post_id":"7382074830105509888","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sunlife-uk_maria-has-loved-playing-football-since-her-activity-7382074830105509888-cQzf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Maria has loved playing football since her childhood in Portugal, where she would play it secretly with her brother, as girls playing football was frowned upon. She’ll watch any team play in person, and loves to shout, complain, sing and get carried away with the atmosphere! Maria was diagnosed with dementia two years ago. This evening, she’s one of the 22 people with dementia who are walking out with the England and Wales players at Wembley Stadium – highlighting the power of sport to help us come together for a cause, and proudly representing SunLife’s hometown of Bristol 💙 Find out how you can join the team to help Alzheimer's Society beat dementia at https://lnkd.in/epkEPmGq .","text_html":"Maria has loved playing football since her childhood in Portugal, where she would play it secretly with her brother, as girls playing football was frowned upon. She&#x2019;ll watch any team play in person, and loves to shout, complain, sing and get carried away with the atmosphere! 

Maria was diagnosed with dementia two years ago. This evening, she&#x2019;s &#xA0;one of the 22 people with dementia who are walking out with the England and Wales players at Wembley Stadium &#x2013; highlighting the power of sport to help us come together for a cause, and proudly representing SunLife&#x2019;s hometown of Bristol &#x1F499;

Find out how you can join the team to help <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/alzheimer&apos;s-society?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Alzheimer&apos;s Society</a> beat dementia at <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/epkEPmGq?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/epkEPmGq</a>.","time":"2mo","title":"SunLife UK"},{"date":"2025-11-03T14:05:36.545Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFu7DE4JTwelA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZnJlaFdGcAw-/0/1760023651226?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=9-pt5vBqEGb6sSqzHM8jGTNDu7IwbqjohKd1ZB6veFw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGc86VXBTkeJg/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZnJlaFaKcAw-/0/1760023651586?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=4sN3e_-XluvQyFq8KWxVz6bDQe0FOmnUjxPXbdpdP20"],"likes_count":27,"post_id":"7382074249324429315","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sunlife-uk_meet-sue-a-football-fanatic-wholl-catch-activity-7382074249324429315-bYEg","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Meet Sue – a football fanatic who’ll catch any game she can. Her team is Bristol Rovers, meaning she’s a proud Gashead! She was diagnosed with frontotemporal dementia (FTD), and now visits schools to talk about her condition. Tonight, for the first time ever, Sue will be one of 22 football fans with dementia walking out side by side with the England and Wales players at Wembley Stadium. It’s her way of showing people that having dementia doesn’t mean you can’t have incredible experiences. What a wonderful representative to have for SunLife's hometown of Bristol 💙 Visit https://lnkd.in/epkEPmGq to find out more about how Alzheimer's Society are building a nationwide team to beat dementia.","text_html":"Meet Sue &#x2013; a football fanatic who&#x2019;ll catch any game she can. Her team is Bristol Rovers, meaning she&#x2019;s a proud Gashead! She was diagnosed with frontotemporal dementia (FTD), and now visits schools to talk about her condition.

Tonight, for the first time ever, Sue will be one of 22 football fans with dementia walking out side by side with the England and Wales players at Wembley Stadium. It&#x2019;s her way of showing people that having dementia doesn&#x2019;t mean you can&#x2019;t have incredible experiences. What a wonderful representative to have for SunLife&apos;s hometown of Bristol &#x1F499;

