nt to recognise one of the newest teams in our trust, Wisley Ward. Bringing together colleagues from Ewhurst and Elstead Wards, Wisley is now an additional ward dedicated to cancer care. From supporting patients through their treatment to making sure they get home as soon as they’re ready, this team has hit the ground running, receiving some lovely feedback from patients and their families. We’re very proud of this team. Thank you, Wisley Ward - your dedication and compassion make all the difference to our patients 👏","text_html":"&#x201C;We are proud of the fact that they have come together and worked as a team. They are passionate about providing safe and effective care for our oncology patients, and that really stands out.&#x201D; &#x2013; Sarah Etherington, Associate Director for Nursing for Oncology.

Before we head into the new year, we want to recognise one of the newest teams in our trust, Wisley Ward. Bringing together colleagues from Ewhurst and Elstead Wards, Wisley is now an additional ward dedicated to cancer care.

From supporting patients through their treatment to making sure they get home as soon as they&#x2019;re ready, this team has hit the ground running, receiving some lovely feedback from patients and their families.

We&#x2019;re very proud of this team. Thank you, Wisley Ward - your dedication and compassion make all the difference to our patients &#x1F44F;","time":"5d","title":"Royal Surrey NHS Foundation Trust"},{"date":"2025-12-27T14:48:07.679Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQE5zKHFbG7_og/image-shrink_1280/B4EZtfQNQpGcAc-/0/1766829643121?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NxTxQIgLRu_M2SvhogFkXny3M0o2lGItm-X47_RseBs"],"likes_count":20,"post_id":"7410620640056995840","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/rsch_congratulations-to-khelvin-jocson-advanced-activity-7410620640056995840-cU8Z","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Congratulations to Khelvin Jocson, Advanced Care Practitioner (ACP), who was named Access and Medicine Champion at our recent Royal Surrey Stars staff awards ✨ This recognises his dedication to our patients and his inspirational approach. As the first ACP in our cardiology department, Khelvin redesigned the referral criteria for the Rapid Access Chest Pain Clinic — ensuring patients with chest pain get timely, appropriate care when they need it most. This work also won a Best of the Best national award from the British Cardiovascular Society. Well done, Khelvin! 👏","text_html":"Congratulations to Khelvin Jocson, Advanced Care Practitioner (ACP), who was named Access and Medicine Champion at our recent Royal Surrey Stars staff awards &#x2728;

