There&apos;s something truly special about welcoming new life on Christmas Day. Today, every baby born at our hospital is receiving a festive bobble hat, lovingly hand-knitted by volunteers from our local community. 

A huge thank you to our wonderful knitters who have spent countless hours creating these precious gifts, and to our exceptional maternity team members who are with families on this most special of days. 

Wishing all our Christmas babies, their families, and our incredible staff a wonderful day.&#x2764;&#xFE0F;

