atients, families and staff spending the festive season with us. From the Grinch to the Polar Express, twinkling lights to lovingly handmade decorations, every ward has its own festive identity. Many of the themes tell a special story, whether celebrating our global team, symbols of hope, or journeys of recovery. A huge thank you to all our teams for the thought, effort and creativity that's gone into making our wards so special – it truly makes a difference to everyone spending Christmas in hospital. #ChristmasSpirit #NHS #RoyalSurrey #Christmas2025","text_html":"Deck the Wards! &#x2728;&#x1F384;

Walk through our hospitals this week and you&apos;ll find wards transformed into enchanted forests, winter wonderlands and even Narnia &#x2013; all bringing Christmas magic to patients, families and staff spending the festive season with us.

From the Grinch to the Polar Express, twinkling lights to lovingly handmade decorations, every ward has its own festive identity. Many of the themes tell a special story, whether celebrating our global team, symbols of hope, or journeys of recovery.

A huge thank you to all our teams for the thought, effort and creativity that&apos;s gone into making our wards so special &#x2013; it truly makes a difference to everyone spending Christmas in hospital. 

