null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Last week, BACB plc delivered a Treasury Training Program in Tunis, bringing together representatives from a wide group of Libyan financial institutions for a week of engagement and technical learning. Sharing our expertise with our partners in North Africa has always been a commitment we value greatly – and serves to build stronger and more resilient markets. We were pleased to support our clients and industry colleagues, discussing topics including the financial markets, interest rates, spot and forward exchange, fixed income products, derivatives and Shariah compliant products. Salim Abukhzaam , Head of Treasury Sales and Country Manager, Libya, and Steven Robinson , FX Dealer, led the training, moderated by Maitham Yousif-ACI Diploma Husain. #Treasury #FinancialMarkets #Training #Partnerships","text_html":"Last week, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/british-arab-commercial-bank?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>BACB plc</a> delivered a Treasury Training Program in Tunis, bringing together representatives from a wide group of Libyan financial institutions for a week of engagement and technical learning.
&#xA0;
Sharing our expertise with our partners in North Africa has always been a commitment we value greatly &#x2013; and serves to build stronger and more resilient markets. We were pleased to support our clients and industry colleagues, discussing topics including the financial markets, interest rates, spot and forward exchange, fixed income products, derivatives and Shariah compliant products.
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/salim-abukhzaam-49426b21b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Salim Abukhzaam</a>, Head of Treasury Sales and Country Manager, Libya, and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/steven-robinson-818127b7?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Steven Robinson</a>, FX Dealer, led the training, moderated by <a class="link" href="https://bh.linkedin.com/in/maitham-yousif-aci-diploma-76689a25?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Maitham Yousif-ACI Diploma</a> Husain. 
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftreasury&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Treasury</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffinancialmarkets&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FinancialMarkets</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftraining&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Training</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpartnerships&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Partnerships</a>","time":"2w","title":"BACB plc"},{"date":"2025-12-19T10:01:33.321Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/sync/v2/D4E27AQFchovOwyaddQ/articleshare-shrink_800/B4EZsil5RwIoAM-/0/1765811919580?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=g_hcveKv6TaRfM0UR5-01c7XIXgzuPo2q3Au7uuq_mk"],"likes_count":45,"post_id":"7406352283585789952","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/british-arab-commercial-bank_bacb-talks-trade-finance-digitalisation-at-activity-7406352283585789952-jZDW","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"“When the rhythm of the drum changes, the dancer has to change his steps.” This traditional African proverb opened a panel discussion on trade digitalisation at last month’s Global Trade Review (GTR) Africa London conference, featuring our own Patrick Baatz, CFA . Together with experts from across the industry, Patrick discussed the adoption of MLETR, and the benefits of trade digitalisation to banks and corporates across the continent. Read the key takeaways below. https://lnkd.in/eUqM9YeJ","text_html":"&#x201C;When the rhythm of the drum changes, the dancer has to change his steps.&#x201D; 
&#xA0;
This traditional African proverb opened a panel discussion on trade digitalisation at last month&#x2019;s <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/exporta?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Global Trade Review (GTR)</a> Africa London conference, featuring our own <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/patrick-baatz-cfa-376744148?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Patrick Baatz, CFA</a>. 
&#xA0;
Together with experts from across the industry, Patrick discussed the adoption of MLETR, and the benefits of trade digitalisation to banks and corporates across the continent. Read the key takeaways below. 

