ing-finance-activity-7393580185629122560-NaXq","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Together with Libyan Foreign Bank (LFB) , Aresbank and Banca UBAE S.p.A. , BACB plc is proud to be platinum sponsor of the 4th AlBaraka summit, taking place here in London on 18-19th November at the JW Marriott. We look forward to engaging with delegates and partners across the financial and banking sectors. The summit will provide an opportunity to strengthen relationships and exchange perspectives on the future of Islamic and international finance. #AlBarakaSummit #Banking #Finance #Partnerships","text_html":"Together with <a class="link" href="https://ly.linkedin.com/company/libyan-foreign-bank?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Libyan Foreign Bank (LFB)</a>, <a class="link" href="https://es.linkedin.com/company/bancoaresbank?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Aresbank</a> and <a class="link" href="https://it.linkedin.com/company/banca-ubae?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Banca UBAE S.p.A.</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/british-arab-commercial-bank?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>BACB plc</a> is proud to be platinum sponsor of the 4th AlBaraka summit, taking place here in London on 18-19th November at the JW Marriott. 

We look forward to engaging with delegates and partners across the financial and banking sectors.&#xA0;The summit will provide an opportunity to strengthen relationships and exchange perspectives on the future of Islamic and international finance.

