[{"comments_count":8,"date":"2025-12-31T10:02:10.797Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFlYUDxJqim2w/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZtwfCghIkAs-/0/1767118745280?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=fYCuc5r0rSR6NLKpJSn03ppo53b2RG9U1Cf3JvUWD5A"],"likes_count":62,"post_id":"7411833227478192128","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/best-menswear_tailorsofconfidence-bestmenswear-teambest-activity-7411833227478192128-wTMs","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Celebrating 22 years at Best Menswear 🎉 Last week marked an incredible milestone as our colleague Debs celebrated 22 years of working with us at Best Menswear! Based in our store in the Pavillions Shopping Centre, Swords, Debs is a valued suit specialist who has helped countless customers look and feel their confident best. Her knowledge, professionalism and genuine care shine through in every customer interaction. We’re sharing a great throwback photo of Debs with Simon Delaney, a lovely reminder of some of the memorable moments! Thank you Debs for your dedication, and we're proud to have you as part of the Best family! 👏 #tailorsofconfidence #bestmenswear #teambest #workanniversary","text_html":"Celebrating 22 years at Best Menswear &#x1F389; 

Last week marked an incredible milestone as our colleague Debs celebrated 22 years of working with us at Best Menswear!

Based in our store in the Pavillions Shopping Centre, Swords, Debs is a valued suit specialist who has helped countless customers look and feel their confident best. Her knowledge, professionalism and genuine care shine through in every customer interaction.

We&#x2019;re sharing a great throwback photo of Debs with&#xA0;Simon Delaney, a lovely reminder of some of the memorable moments!

Thank you Debs for your dedication, and we&apos;re proud to have you as part of the Best family! &#x1F44F; 

