iUQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZtSgFl_JEAg-/0/1766615705647?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=4EEnL-3Lg-PadhYeioUCaUHAZwh6MMg4ugjJOBvuPL8","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHqJb0aX8Eqcg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZtSgFmZJIAg-/0/1766615703346?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eyIZRFjMyIr5j6vbjO1tkrhu8WoKBeJ0MDqOeNeWgzI"],"likes_count":42,"post_id":"7409723339126276097","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/best-menswear_tailorsofconfidence-bestmenswear-activity-7409723339126276097-w7EF","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Merry Christmas from all of us at Best Menswear!🎄 ✨ As we wrap up another year, we’d like to take this opportunity to thank all of our customers for choosing Best Menswear. Your support and loyalty throughout the year has been truly appreciated by our entire team. We’re proud to serve our local communities and look forward to continuing to do so in the year ahead. We’d also like to thank our incredible teams across all 12 of our stores. Your hard work, commitment, and passion are what make everything we do possible, and we’re extremely grateful for the effort you put in day in, day out. For full details of our store opening hours over the Christmas and New Year period, please visit our website and check online before travelling. Wishing you all a very Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year from all of us at Best Menswear 💙 #tailorsofconfidence #bestmenswear","text_html":"Merry Christmas from all of us at Best Menswear!&#x1F384; &#x2728; 

As we wrap up another year, we&#x2019;d like to take this opportunity to thank all of our customers for choosing Best Menswear. Your support and loyalty throughout the year has been truly appreciated by our entire team.

We&#x2019;re proud to serve our local communities and look forward to continuing to do so in the year ahead.

We&#x2019;d also like to thank our incredible teams across all 12 of our stores. Your hard work, commitment, and passion are what make everything we do possible, and we&#x2019;re extremely grateful for the effort you put in day in, day out.

For full details of our store opening hours over the Christmas and New Year period, please visit our website and check online before travelling.

Wishing you all a very Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year from all of us at Best Menswear &#x1F499; 

