epost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Last month marked a major milestone as we opened our new flagship store in The Square Tallaght . As part of the launch, we ran a local out-of-home campaign across the centre and around the wider Tallaght area to spread the word. It was fantastic to see the campaign live across billboards, bus stops, luas stops, and in-centre placements.👏 It was a pleasure to work with Oliver Media and The Engine Room on the campaign - their support helped the planning and delivery of the campaign run smoothly from start to finish. #tailorsofconfidence #bestmenswear #outofhomeadvertising #localbusiness #menswear Laura Maher Siobhan Hearne Cait Maguire Grace McCleary (Ní Chléire) Lyndsey Clancy John Smith Izabela Lelic FCCA","text_html":"Last month marked a major milestone as we opened our new flagship store in <a class="link" href="https://ie.linkedin.com/company/thesqtallaght?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Square Tallaght</a>. 

As part of the launch, we ran a local out-of-home campaign across the centre and around the wider Tallaght area to spread the word. It was fantastic to see the campaign live across billboards, bus stops, luas stops, and in-centre placements.&#x1F44F; 

It was a pleasure to work with <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/oliver-media-dublin?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Oliver Media</a> and <a class="link" href="https://ie.linkedin.com/company/the-engine-room_2?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Engine Room</a> on the campaign - their support helped the planning and delivery of the campaign run smoothly from start to finish.

