Kervin first came to Ireland 19 years ago, back in 2006, and has been a central part of the Best Menswear family for 18 of those years. His journey is a true testament to dedication and commitment. 

Based in our Dundrum store, Kervin over the years has helped so many of you get suited up for the big moments in life - from weddings to graduations, important interviews to black-tie events. 
We are incredibly proud to celebrate this moment with him!

