.in/dzwwSH5e","text_html":"&#x201C;Power Perspective&#x201D; on Power 98.7 hosted a World AIDS Day roundtable with Criselda Kananda, Dr Kate Rees, and Ndivhuwo Rambau, reflecting on this year&#x2019;s theme:&#xA0;&#x201C;Overcoming Disruption: Transforming the AIDS Response.&#x201D;

