":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"South Africa remains at the epicentre of the HIV epidemic, but a game-changing tool is coming. Lenacapavir, the world’s first twice-yearly HIV prevention injection, has been approved by the South African Health Products Regulatory Authority (SAHPRA) — a major step toward making it available in public clinics from April 2026. #HIVprevention https://lnkd.in/dr8m93Q3","text_html":"South Africa remains at the epicentre of the HIV epidemic, but a game-changing tool is coming. Lenacapavir, the world&#x2019;s first twice-yearly HIV prevention injection, has been approved by the South African Health Products Regulatory Authority (SAHPRA) &#x2014; a major step toward making it available in public clinics from April 2026.

