Applications close 19 November 2025","time":"1mo","title":"Anova Health Institute"},{"comments_count":6,"date":"2024-03-13T11:42:38.300Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFe9sGV5TE1yQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zo5Gf0SHAA0-/0/1761894598021?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NqObrnatcShiMMnof4DoGUc8dh1LpDXFUzngg4JcpLA"],"likes_count":52,"post_id":"7389959069433913344","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/anova-health-institute_congratulations-nyeleti-chauke-activity-7389959069433913344-1Fuq","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFe9sGV5TE1yQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zo5Gf0SHAA0-/0/1761894598021?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NqObrnatcShiMMnof4DoGUc8dh1LpDXFUzngg4JcpLA"],"repost_date":"2025-11-03T11:42:38.301Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["2mo"],"repost_id":"7389921567301918720","repost_text":"🌟 My First Publication! 🌟 I’m incredibly excited and deeply grateful to share my very first publication as lead author in the Southern African Journal of HIV Medicine 🎉 Our paper, titled “Barriers and facilitators to HIV index contact testing in facility and community settings,” explores the experiences of healthcare workers implementing index contact testing in Johannesburg. This study highlights key challenges, such as stigma, intimate partner violence, and limited resources, while also showcasing innovative strategies like PrEP education and home-based testing that enhance HIV case finding and engagement. This milestone means a great deal to me, not just as a researcher but also as someone passionate about enhancing point-of-care testing and improving public health outcomes in South Africa. The process was both challenging and fulfilling, and I’m filled with gratitude for the guidance, collaboration, and mentorship that made it possible. A heartfelt thank you to my co-authors, Cathrine Chinyandura , fezile Buthelezi , Anele F.C Jiyane and Dr. Kate Rees , for their incredible teamwork and support. I also extend my gratitude to Anova Health Institute and USAID/PEPFAR for providing the platform and resources that made this research a reality. A special thanks to Dr Diana Mokoena for allowing me to spread my wings and paving the way for my growth and passion in research. Dr Kate Rees you are the best mentor anyone could ask for! Thank you for believing in my potential every step of the way. ✨ This is only the beginning of my research publication journey—and I look forward to contributing more toward strengthening point-of-care testing implementation and health systems research in South Africa. You can read the full article here: https://lnkd.in/gie95eyG #Research #HIVTesting #PublicHealth #ImplementationScience #AnovaHealthInstitute #SouthernAfricanJournalofHIVMedicine #Gratitude #FirstPublication #WomenInResearch #SouthAfrica","repost_title":"Nyeleti Chauke","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://za.linkedin.com/company/anova-health-institute?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Anova Health Institute"}],"tagged_users":[{"link":"https://fi.linkedin.com/in/cathrine-chinyandura-89841b9b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Cathrine Chinyandura"},{"link":"https://za.linkedin.com/in/fezile-buthelezi-b762929a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"fezile Buthelezi"},{"link":"https://za.linkedin.com/in/anele-f-c-jiyane-14937a104?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Anele F.C Jiyane"},{"link":"https://za.linkedin.com/in/kate-rees-01523b97?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Kate Rees"},{"link":"https://za.linkedin.com/in/diana-mokoena-b80b3029?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Diana Mokoena"},{"link":"https://za.linkedin.com/in/kate-rees-01523b97?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Kate Rees"}],"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Congratulations Nyeleti Chauke !","text_html":"Congratulations <a class="link" href="https://za.linkedin.com/in/nyeleti-chauke-444a37164?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nyeleti Chauke</a>! ","time":"2mo 2mo","title":"Anova Health Institute"}]

[{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-17T17:03:27.492Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQFFpBVu6QLW-g/image-shrink_800/B56ZsjRedeKQAc-/0/1765823344051?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=IyLnZBkS-kVSPFO3LJVHKLV_4Cjngd2b58JsRBeUCRU"],"likes_count":122,"post_id":"7406399918866804736","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sconza-candy-co%2E_teamsconza-uglysweaterseason-companyculture-activity-7406399918866804736-C0V2","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Ugly sweaters. Big smiles. Even bigger teamwork. 🎄🍫 Last week, our team came together for a little friendly competition, a lot of laughs, and a reminder of what makes Sconza special — the people behind the product. Moments like these matter. They build trust, strengthen collaboration, and fuel the care we bring to everything we do — from retail partnerships to private label and contract manufacturing. Grateful for this team and the culture we’re proud to grow, season after season. #TeamSconza #UglySweaterSeason #CompanyCulture #BitesOfJoy #ChocolateIndustry #BehindTheBrand","text_html":"Ugly sweaters. Big smiles. Even bigger teamwork. &#x1F384;&#x1F36B;

Last week, our team came together for a little friendly competition, a lot of laughs, and a reminder of what makes Sconza special &#x2014; the people behind the product.

Moments like these matter. They build trust, strengthen collaboration, and fuel the care we bring to everything we do &#x2014; from retail partnerships to private label and contract manufacturing.

Grateful for this team and the culture we&#x2019;re proud to grow, season after season.

