2025-07-30T17:03:27.501Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQE53wfFPYtyxg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZsThCZKJAAk-/0/1765558989046?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=CF0EstDr2D4sWX2MSuPeLEJfvlxr-CJdF4Bq0W1UQMA"],"likes_count":20,"post_id":"7405299185450676224","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sconza-candy-co%2E_leadership-salesstrategy-partnerships-activity-7405299185450676224-BqN7","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQE53wfFPYtyxg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZsThCZKJAAk-/0/1765558989046?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=CF0EstDr2D4sWX2MSuPeLEJfvlxr-CJdF4Bq0W1UQMA"],"repost_date":"2025-12-17T17:03:27.501Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["2w"],"repost_id":"7405291134375145473","repost_text":"One of my favorite moments from our recent Sales Summit at Sconza Candy Company : A simple but powerful reminder of why we do what we do — ✨ Provide an exceptional customer experience with uncompromising quality, innovation, and happiness. I love working for a company that keeps this at the center — not just on a slide, but in how we collaborate, create, and serve. We’ve got bold goals ahead, but it’s purpose like this that keeps the momentum (and the joy!) going. 💛🍫 #Leadership #Strategy #CustomerExperience #SalesSummit #SconzaChocolates #BitesOfJoy","repost_title":"Karen De Castro","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/sconza-candy-co.?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Sconza Candy Company"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Proud of the work our team put into this week’s Sales Summit. A few days of focused conversations around how we collaborate, create, and serve — across retail, private label, contract manufacturing, and brand partnerships. What stands out most isn’t just the ambition, but the alignment. When teams across sales, operations, marketing, and leadership come together around a shared purpose, it shows up in how we partner and how we execute. This is the kind of behind-the-scenes work that allows us to show up as a strong, reliable partner — with intention, clarity, and care. Grateful for the energy, honesty, and momentum coming out of this week. Onward. 🍫✨ #Leadership #SalesStrategy #Partnerships #ContractManufacturing #PrivateLabel #Retail #SconzaChocolates #BitesOfJoy","text_html":"Proud of the work our team put into this week&#x2019;s Sales Summit.

A few days of focused conversations around how we collaborate, create, and serve &#x2014; across retail, private label, contract manufacturing, and brand partnerships.

What stands out most isn&#x2019;t just the ambition, but the alignment. When teams across sales, operations, marketing, and leadership come together around a shared purpose, it shows up in how we partner and how we execute.

This is the kind of behind-the-scenes work that allows us to show up as a strong, reliable partner &#x2014; with intention, clarity, and care.

Grateful for the energy, honesty, and momentum coming out of this week. Onward. &#x1F36B;&#x2728;

