be able to give back together. ✨ #SconzaCares #CommunityImpact #Oakdale #GiveBack #HolidaySeason #TeamSconza #CorporateResponsibility","text_html":"Spreading warmth here in Oakdale &#x2744;&#xFE0F;&#x1F9E5;

One of our favorite traditions at Sconza is our annual Winter Coat &amp; Sweater Drive supporting the Children&#x2019;s Crisis Center and the Guardian House. Our team shows up every year with so much heart &#x2014; and this season is no different. &#x2764;&#xFE0F;

We&#x2019;re collecting new coats and sweaters for local kids, from newborn through age 18, to help make the holidays a little brighter for families in our community.

Community is a big part of who we are at Sconza, and we&#x2019;re grateful to be able to give back together. &#x2728;

