.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEME8zHalIbzA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZsnV5N_HoAk-/0/1765891615956?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=uzX3ZXC5gFMRR_z0RXwv6ao9roMU_RBZjLZBqZe70yc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHfGK1rSC2stQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZsnV5OBKgAk-/0/1765891614237?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=AKmi8JcXkDJbucV22uELw-ZYxwaKyCgg_oj-w105mxA","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGQWQsll6aRag/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZsnV5O0JgAg-/0/1765891615543?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1cXV8la6g9THIMi06kvWPTQq7TAXV9GJFCF8DJ_FK7A"],"repost_date":"2025-12-19T14:04:45.870Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["17,663 followers"],"repost_id":"7406686278630514688","repost_text":"skeyes is the most sustainable air traffic controller in the world ! ✈️💚 👏We are proud to announce that skeyes is the first air navigation service provider (ANSP) worldwide to achieve GreenATM Level 4, awarded by CANSO . ✅After earning Level 3 in 2023 and again in 2024, this new accreditation marks a significant milestone and confirms the progress that skeyes has made in a consistent and measurable way towards its climate and environmental objectives. 🌱 Thanks to improved flight procedures, better operational information, and strong #cooperation with partners, skeyes is contributing in a meaningful way to helping aircraft operating in its airspace, reduce fuel consumption and emissions. This Level 4 accreditation confirms our commitment: building the low-emission #aviation of tomorrow. More information in our press release ⤵️ https://lnkd.in/eqpCsrQe #GreenATM #AirTrafficManagement #skeyes #EnvironmentalImpact #Innovation #Belgium","repost_title":"skeyes","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://be.linkedin.com/company/skeyes?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"skeyes"},{"link":"https://be.linkedin.com/company/skeyes?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"skeyes"},{"link":"https://nl.linkedin.com/company/canso?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"CANSO"},{"link":"https://be.linkedin.com/company/skeyes?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"skeyes"},{"link":"https://be.linkedin.com/company/skeyes?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"skeyes"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Congratulations to skeyes on achieving CANSO GreenATM Level 4! ✈️ We’re delighted to celebrate skeyes’ remarkable achievement as the first ANSP worldwide to reach Level 4 of the GreenATM accreditation – part of a rigorous global benchmark for sustainable air navigation services that spans five levels. This achievement reflects skeyes’ consistent progress in reducing environmental impact through improved flight procedures, enhanced operational information, and strong collaboration with partners. The GreenATM assessment evaluates performance across 24 topics, covering governance, operational improvements, infrastructure, and community engagement – making this milestone a true testament to skeyes’ commitment to sustainability. Our teams at Egis are honoured to have supported skeyes on this journey. To our industry peers: GreenATM provides a practical framework for measurable environmental improvements. We encourage other ANSPs to follow in skeyes’ footsteps and accelerate aviation’s transition to reduced environmental impact. 👉 Learn more about the GreenATM programme and how we can help: https://lnkd.in/exBnaUyX","text_html":"Congratulations to <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/company/skeyes?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>skeyes</a> on achieving CANSO GreenATM Level 4!&#xA0;&#x2708;&#xFE0F;
&#xA0;
We&#x2019;re delighted to celebrate skeyes&#x2019; remarkable achievement as the first ANSP worldwide to reach Level 4 of the GreenATM accreditation &#x2013; part of a rigorous global benchmark for sustainable air navigation services that spans five levels.
&#xA0;
This achievement reflects skeyes&#x2019; consistent progress in reducing environmental impact through improved flight procedures, enhanced operational information, and strong collaboration with partners. The GreenATM assessment evaluates performance across 24 topics, covering governance, operational improvements, infrastructure, and community engagement &#x2013; making this milestone a true testament to skeyes&#x2019; commitment to sustainability.
&#xA0;
Our teams at Egis are honoured to have supported skeyes on this journey.
&#xA0;
To our industry peers: GreenATM provides a practical framework for measurable environmental improvements. We encourage other ANSPs to follow in skeyes&#x2019; footsteps and accelerate aviation&#x2019;s transition to reduced environmental impact.
&#xA0;
&#x1F449; Learn more about the GreenATM programme and how we can help:&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/exBnaUyX?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/exBnaUyX</a>","time":"1w 2w","title":"Egis"},{"comments_count":13,"date":"2025-12-19T14:04:45.871Z","likes_count":445,"post_id":"7406600228465971201","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/egis_celebrating-1-million-subscribers-on-linkedin-activity-7406600228465971201-uEm7","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"[Breaking news] Egis celebrates 1 million followers with a one-off video. 🎬 To mark this moment, our communication and marketing teams chose a creative and forward-looking approach, with a one-off video combining project imagery and AI-powered tools, reflecting the way we innovate in our projects as much as in how we communicate. We’re proud to gather such a great community, both in size and quality, that brings together clients, partners, peers and talents who share a common interest: shaping a more sustainable future with us. This milestone is not an end point for us. It’s a signal of growing engagement, dialogue and shared ambition. Special mention to the people who managed our page over the years and helped building it to today’s strength! Thank you for following us, for engaging with our content, and for being part of this journey.","text_html":"[Breaking news] Egis celebrates 1 million followers with a one-off video. &#x1F3AC;


