d_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"[New project 📢] Egis to provide multidisciplinary consulting for a new elderly care home in Hong Kong We are appointed by Helping Hand, a charity focused on the housing and care of the elderly, to provide multidisciplinary consulting services for a new government-funded Residential Care Home in Sai Kung, Hong Kong. The care home, set to open in 2028, will provide hundreds of beds and 24/7 care, alongside rehabilitation and community wellness amenities, emphasising sustainability. Led by Archiplus International Limited , our project team will utilise Egis’ expertise in Building Services, Environmental, and Sustainability consultancy, incorporating innovative Modular Integrated Construction (MiC) and Modular Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing (MiMEP) technologies. The signing ceremony occurred at the historic Old British Military Hospital, now Helping Hand’s head office, marking a significant step in expanding elderly care capacity in the region. This facility will be vital in meeting the needs of Hong Kong’s ageing population and enhancing care infrastructure in the Greater Bay Area (GBA) of China. Egis is dedicated to supporting impactful projects that promote sustainability and community well-being. Full press release: https://lnkd.in/ecEt2Avh Dr James, Jian Xiong | Philip Chan #HelpingHand #ElderlyCare #SocialImpact #Sustainability","text_html":"[New project &#x1F4E2;] Egis to provide multidisciplinary consulting for a new elderly care home in Hong Kong

We are appointed by Helping Hand, a charity focused on the housing and care of the elderly, to provide multidisciplinary consulting services for a new government-funded Residential Care Home in Sai Kung, Hong Kong.

The care home, set to open in 2028, will provide hundreds of beds and 24/7 care, alongside rehabilitation and community wellness amenities, emphasising sustainability.

Led by <a class="link" href="https://hk.linkedin.com/company/archiplus-international-limited?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Archiplus International Limited</a>, our project team will utilise Egis&#x2019; expertise in Building Services, Environmental, and Sustainability consultancy, incorporating innovative Modular Integrated Construction (MiC) and Modular Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing (MiMEP) technologies.

The signing ceremony occurred at the historic Old British Military Hospital, now Helping Hand&#x2019;s head office, marking a significant step in expanding elderly care capacity in the region.

This facility will be vital in meeting the needs of Hong Kong&#x2019;s ageing population and enhancing care infrastructure in the Greater Bay Area (GBA) of China. Egis is dedicated to supporting impactful projects that promote sustainability and community well-being.

Full press release: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ecEt2Avh?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ecEt2Avh</a>

<a class="link" href="https://hk.linkedin.com/in/dr-james-jian-xiong-3897b317?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Dr James, Jian Xiong</a> | <a class="link" href="https://hk.linkedin.com/in/philip-chan-a5830332?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philip Chan</a> 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhelpinghand&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#HelpingHand</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Felderlycare&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ElderlyCare</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsocialimpact&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SocialImpact</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsustainability&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Sustainability</a>","time":"3w","title":"Egis"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-12T14:04:45.901Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFSOAEAVgFaFA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4DZr.qTDfG0Aw-/0/1765209092908?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=cT8TZ5Bk_eEfV6J2WMjQy3kvIqpVpqSrBzysmxz8s_g"],"likes_count":87,"post_id":"7403823564048642048","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/egis_worldclimateday-activity-7403823564048642048-LYH8","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"[ #WorldClimateDay ] We don’t get to choose a world without infrastructure. But we do choose how to run it. 👇 Construction and mobility are often seen as part of the climate problem. At Egis, we see them as one of the biggest opportunities for solutions. On World Climate Day, we’re highlighting how we transform critical assets into resilient, low-carbon ones. In France, our teams helped decarbonise corrugated-board production in Nogent-sur-Marne by almost entirely replacing gas in steam generation, using biomass power from recycled wood and papermaking residues. In Portugal, 58% of road operations on motorway A24 now run on electric vehicles, while a full switch to LED lighting helps cutting electricity use by 20% year-on-year while electrifying our car fleet. And we continue progressing toward a fully electric fleet worldwide. In aviation, 11 airports where Egis is a shareholder and operating partner are now ACA-certified, 3 of them (Larnaka, Paphos, Abidjan) already at the highest 4+ level. From design to daily operations, our integrated approach shows one thing: the most sustainable future is the one where we improve the world we have already built. Discover more projects in our iconic projects book: https://bit.ly/48pgHhT","text_html":"[<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fworldclimateday&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WorldClimateDay</a>] We don&#x2019;t get to choose a world without infrastructure.
But we do choose how to run it. &#x1F447;
&#xA0;
Construction and mobility are often seen as part of the climate problem.
At Egis, we see them as one of the biggest opportunities for solutions.
&#xA0;
On World Climate Day, we&#x2019;re highlighting how we transform critical assets into resilient, low-carbon ones.
&#xA0;
In France, our teams helped decarbonise corrugated-board production in Nogent-sur-Marne by almost entirely replacing gas in steam generation, using biomass power from recycled wood and papermaking residues.
&#xA0;
In Portugal, 58% of road operations on motorway A24 now run on electric vehicles, while a full switch to LED lighting helps cutting electricity use by 20% year-on-year while electrifying our car fleet.
And we continue progressing toward a fully electric fleet worldwide.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
In aviation, 11 airports where Egis is a shareholder and operating partner are now ACA-certified, 3 of them (Larnaka, Paphos, Abidjan) already at the highest 4+ level.
&#xA0;
From design to daily operations, our integrated approach shows one thing:
 the most sustainable future is the one where we improve the world we have already built.
&#xA0;
Discover more projects in our iconic projects book: <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/48pgHhT?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/48pgHhT</a>","time":"3w","title":"Egis"}]

[{"date":"2026-01-01T02:00:22.145Z","likes_count":13,"post_id":"7412100673837858817","post_url":"https://pt.linkedin.com/posts/bemoldigital_feliz-ano-novo-activity-7412100673837858817-W6yR","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Com a chegada de um novo ano, é hora de traçar nossos objetivos e sonhos. Mas antes, vamos relembrar algumas das metas concluídas em 2025 e os momentos especiais que marcaram esse ano. ✨ A cada pessoa que esteve com a gente construindo essa história, fica o nosso muito obrigado. Vocês fizeram parte de cada conquista e de cada aprendizado ao longo dessa jornada! 💙 Agora queremos saber de você quais metas você conseguiu concluir em 2025 e quais já estão no radar para o próximo ano? Conta pra gente nos comentários 👇 #bemoldigital #retrospectiva #felizanonovo #2026","text_html":"Com a chegada de um novo ano, &#xE9; hora de tra&#xE7;ar nossos objetivos e sonhos. Mas antes, vamos relembrar algumas das metas conclu&#xED;das em 2025 e os momentos especiais que marcaram esse ano. &#x2728;
&#xA0;
A cada pessoa que esteve com a gente construindo essa hist&#xF3;ria, fica o nosso muito obrigado. Voc&#xEA;s fizeram parte de cada conquista e de cada aprendizado ao longo dessa jornada! &#x1F499;

