[{"comments_count":34,"date":"2025-06-06T14:24:42.334Z","likes_count":2966,"post_id":"7333515493087031296","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7333515493087031296/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Today, we’re proud to unveil our new identity: WPP Media. WPP Media unites the best platform, people, and partners to deliver innovative solutions and extraordinary growth for our clients. This is a promise to lead with ambition, creativity, and collaboration in the AI era — for every client, in every market, every day. The wait is over. This is the official start of something extraordinary. WPPMedia.com","text_html":"Today, we&#x2019;re proud to unveil our new identity: WPP Media. 

WPP Media unites the best platform, people, and partners to deliver innovative solutions and extraordinary growth for our clients. 

This is a promise to lead with ambition, creativity, and collaboration in the AI era &#x2014; for every client, in every market, every day. 

The wait is over. 

This is the official start of something extraordinary.

<a class="link" href="http://WPPMedia.com?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>WPPMedia.com</a>","time":"7mo Edited","title":"WPP Media","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5605AQG0pPLxQjSlwg/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B56ZcXbTh3GoBQ-/0/1748444744617?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Ki7pDbyF6VyEEVCSjV_6HwdAsuYe0oXPrFUtD8FGUSw","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5605AQG0pPLxQjSlwg/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B56ZcXbTh3GoBM-/0/1748444744626?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=2z-daOT2gmv9zirdC3mPulE-XWUu5AZiBPHl2g50FUc"]},{"date":"2025-06-06T14:24:42.340Z","likes_count":94,"post_id":"7332707553845358594","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/groupmworldwide_groupmchina-activity-7332707553845358594-jysA","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"GroupM China recently partnered with Zespri International , Bayer (Redoxon), Unilever (Knorr), Perfetti Van Melle , and De'Longhi Group to host "Running GroupM Joy Market" at WPP Campus Shanghai 👏 As part of our ongoing CSR initiative “Running GroupM”, the wellness-themed marketplace featured interactive brand stations where attendees participated in fitness activities, sampled healthy refreshments, and captured fun moments at a nature-themed photo booth 💪 GroupM China CEO, Rupert McPetrie , commented: “We are thrilled to collaborate with client partners—Zespri, Bayer (Redoxon), Unilever (Knorr), Perfetti Van Melle, and De’Longhi—to bring this initiative to life at the WPP Campus. This partnership represents our shared commitment to our clients’ values and our joint mission to inspire an active, vibrant lifestyle among Chinese consumers. The enthusiasm fuelling this collaboration is truly invaluable. "I am particularly proud of our CSR program, Running GroupM. Launched by GroupM in 2019, the initiative pledges to plant a tree in the sandy areas of Inner Mongolia for every 10,000 steps taken by our employees. Beyond promoting physical well-being, it is a journey where we turn our footsteps into tangible environmental impact.” #GroupMChina","text_html":"GroupM China recently partnered with <a class="link" href="https://nz.linkedin.com/company/zespri-international?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Zespri International</a>, <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/company/bayer?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Bayer</a> (Redoxon), <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/unilever?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Unilever</a> (Knorr), <a class="link" href="https://nl.linkedin.com/company/perfetti-van-melle?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Perfetti Van Melle</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://it.linkedin.com/company/de&apos;longhi?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>De&apos;Longhi Group</a> to host &quot;Running GroupM Joy Market&quot; at <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/wpp?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>WPP</a> Campus Shanghai &#x1F44F; 

As part of our ongoing CSR initiative &#x201C;Running GroupM&#x201D;, the wellness-themed marketplace featured interactive brand stations where attendees participated in fitness activities, sampled healthy refreshments, and captured fun moments at a nature-themed photo booth &#x1F4AA; 

GroupM China CEO, <a class="link" href="https://hk.linkedin.com/in/rupert-mcpetrie-75546919?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Rupert McPetrie</a>, commented: &#x201C;We are thrilled to collaborate with client partners&#x2014;Zespri, Bayer (Redoxon), Unilever (Knorr), Perfetti Van Melle, and De&#x2019;Longhi&#x2014;to bring this initiative to life at the WPP Campus. This partnership represents our shared commitment to our clients&#x2019; values and our joint mission to inspire an active, vibrant lifestyle among Chinese consumers. The enthusiasm fuelling this collaboration is truly invaluable.

&quot;I am particularly proud of our CSR program, Running GroupM. Launched by GroupM in 2019, the initiative pledges to plant a tree in the sandy areas of Inner Mongolia for every 10,000 steps taken by our employees. Beyond promoting physical well-being, it is a journey where we turn our footsteps into tangible environmental impact.&#x201D;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgroupmchina&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GroupMChina</a>","time":"7mo Edited","title":"GroupM","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQF1FSSo9UCrQA/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B56ZcMChYOHEA0-/0/1748253694617?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=BlCpFibx2Cju7QlH4igMwd_atB6RWMwtcq3OGyl5Wvg","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQF1FSSo9UCrQA/mp4-360p-30fp-crf28/B56ZcMChYOHEBs-/0/1748253700280?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ngrz5lck5MTI00I_zSVG3ku1LzOS3JXZiacl1qlAf5c","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQF1FSSo9UCrQA/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B56ZcMChYOHEBw-/0/1748253695616?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mLorm5m7SrJOQlbPfNn4qwlTvdUUq1hETWXvKbNfiao"]},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-06-06T14:24:42.343Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5610AQGhdEuxzu2itA/image-shrink_1280/B56ZcKv.S8HgAQ-/0/1748232038246?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=KD3vA35PWp6w5R3FkK5--1kcmPVaS_Ov9c3QnJEBmQQ"],"likes_count":59,"post_id":"7332616719074504705","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/groupmworldwide_groupmchina-activity-7332616719074504705-QbDd","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"What does it take to transform gaming from a niche hobby to mainstream youth culture in China? 🎮 EssenceMediacom China and PlayStation embarked on an ambitious cultural marketing campaign to bridge this gap. With console gaming representing only 2% of China's $47 billion gaming market in 2023, the initiative particularly resonated with a Gen Z audience navigating modern life's mounting pressures. Recognizing that nearly a quarter of Chinese youth aged 18-24 experience emotional wellness challenges, the team developed the "Play Is Right. And You Are Perfect" campaign, partnering with youth idol Wowkie Zhang to create a theme song that turned PS5's iconic button symbols into a cultural phenomenon. The initiative leveraged China's vibrant music scene, where 78.5% of Gen Z listens to music daily for stress relief. The campaign transformed from a marketing initiative into a cultural movement through AI-powered music creation tools, offline gaming events, and strategic Chinese New Year activations. By positioning PS5 as more than just a gaming device but as a tool for self-expression and emotional balance, the initiative successfully redefined gaming's role in Chinese youth culture, moving it from the periphery to the heart of their daily lives 👏 #GroupMChina","text_html":"What does it take to transform gaming from a niche hobby to mainstream youth culture in China? &#x1F3AE;

<a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/essencemediacom?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>EssenceMediacom</a> China and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/playstation1?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>PlayStation</a>  embarked on an ambitious cultural marketing campaign to bridge this gap. With console gaming representing only 2% of China&apos;s $47 billion gaming market in 2023, the initiative particularly resonated with a Gen Z audience navigating modern life&apos;s mounting pressures.

Recognizing that nearly a quarter of Chinese youth aged 18-24 experience emotional wellness challenges, the team developed the &quot;Play Is Right. And You Are Perfect&quot; campaign, partnering with youth idol Wowkie Zhang to create a theme song that turned PS5&apos;s iconic button symbols into a cultural phenomenon. The initiative leveraged China&apos;s vibrant music scene, where 78.5% of Gen Z listens to music daily for stress relief.

The campaign transformed from a marketing initiative into a cultural movement through AI-powered music creation tools, offline gaming events, and strategic Chinese New Year activations. By positioning PS5 as more than just a gaming device but as a tool for self-expression and emotional balance, the initiative successfully redefined gaming&apos;s role in Chinese youth culture, moving it from the periphery to the heart of their daily lives &#x1F44F;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgroupmchina&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GroupMChina</a>","time":"7mo Edited","title":"GroupM"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2019-09-06T14:24:42.348Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHBX8WNFjGzHw/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZbubKO.HIAs-/0/1747756825459?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=CbAe1emrJ-ysw18TBkRiaihXtIsSwR8Z08C9Oygb-gc"],"likes_count":181,"post_id":"7330937411209744387","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/groupmworldwide_infosum-now-part-of-the-groupm-family-activity-7330937411209744387-qbpA","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHBX8WNFjGzHw/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZbubKO.HIAs-/0/1747756825459?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=CbAe1emrJ-ysw18TBkRiaihXtIsSwR8Z08C9Oygb-gc"],"repost_date":"2025-06-06T14:24:42.348Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["15,367 followers"],"repost_id":"7330623450987778050","repost_text":"InfoSum is excited to announce a new set of integrations with Amazon Ads ! 🎉 Advertisers can seamlessly and securely activate their first-party data directly from InfoSum across Amazon’s inventory, including Twitch, Prime Video, and Fire TV, for enhanced audience reach, measurement, and media optimization. Valerie Mercurio , VP of Business Development at InfoSum , commented: “In 2025, it’s imperative that the media industry prioritizes privacy, and our new integration with Amazon Ads makes this even simpler, allowing advertisers to activate their customer insights in a privacy-first manner while benefiting from Amazon’s rich audience insights.” Read more: https://hubs.la/Q03njlkm0 #InfoSum #AmazonAds #FirstPartyData #DataCollaboration","repost_title":"InfoSum","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://uk.linkedin.com