From joining straight out of Law College to leading as MD &amp; CEO for 14 illustrious years, and continuing your stellar journey as a Board Member, Committee Chair, Chairman of Board of Management and Vice-Chairman &#x2014; your contribution is truly exemplary.

Wishing you good health, happiness, and many more inspiring years ahead.
