Heartiest congratulations to our MD &amp; CEO, Mrs. Arti Patil, on her prestigious nomination to the 1st Governing Board of &#x2018;Tribhuvan&#x2019; Sahkari University.

We&#x2019;re equally proud to share that she has also been recognised by ICMAI in &#x2018;The Inspired 100 &#x2013; Leadership, Lessons &amp; Legacy of India&#x2019;s Best CMAs&#x2019;.

She continues to inspire us all. &#x1F44F;

