Using the Intelligent Vegetation Management System from <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/aidash?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>AiDASH</a>, we can now more accurately predict growth, identify risks, and optimise pruning cycles. 

The impact:&#x202F;&#xA0;
&#x2022; 47% shorter outage duration&#x202F;post-pruning&#xA0;
