&#x2022; 26% fewer tree-related events 

This condition-based vegetation management is helping us to improve reliability, reduce costs, and strengthen grid resilience.&#x202F;&#xA0;","time":"1mo","title":"National Grid"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-12-03T14:42:57.722Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFsAqjvb_EcOA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqmiLqGHEAg-/0/1763730570757?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=kJorKnLcNEFmaOeL65lkIDg2rvjUEW5CIqArY3QK-yY","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGn6AMngL71UQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZqmiLpdIIAw-/0/1763730570391?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=f7SSYeOh2KuF15ZNaw7lzfGKeUzt-x6-MtrFVLnZnGQ","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFfGguzHl1-SQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqmiLqlIIAg-/0/1763730572748?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=2LKaqGZGoX6zik7AmF89iZC69QputvugkmiZBZDIT58","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFDB1uFjzrnqg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqmiLp_IoAk-/0/1763730570466?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=xUKFotNqTdiV5Eo0Zv5nLSjRCNffskEPENle162B6I0"],"likes_count":184,"post_id":"7397622207939616768","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/national-grid_cop30-activity-7397622207939616768-Z5WZ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"That’s a wrap on #COP30 ! 🌍 We’re leaving Belém energised by the exchange of ideas and the momentum built across sectors and borders to turn ambition into action. Highlight of the week? Steve Smith’s session on AI data centers and the power of collaboration to connect them at pace. It sparked fresh thinking on innovation and reinforced the critical need for affordability as we modernise our electricity systems. A huge thank you to our incredible team on the ground Louise Clark-White , Stephen Smith , Sandy Grace and Matt Hinde for representing us with insight and purpose. We’re also grateful to the Business Council for Sustainable Energy (BCSE) , We Mean Business Coalition , The Climate Registry and Department for Energy Security and Net Zero for their partnership and for convening such valuable events and discussions.","text_html":"That&#x2019;s a wrap on <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcop30&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#COP30</a>!&#xA0;&#x1F30D;

We&#x2019;re leaving Bel&#xE9;m energised by the exchange of ideas and the momentum built across sectors and borders to turn ambition into action.

Highlight of the week? Steve&#xA0;Smith&#x2019;s session on AI data centers and the power of collaboration to connect them at pace. It sparked fresh thinking on innovation and reinforced the critical need for affordability as we modernise our electricity systems.

A huge thank you to our incredible team on the ground <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/louise-clark-white-b48a0137?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Louise Clark-White</a>, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/stephen-smith-49251121?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stephen Smith</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sandy-grace-73123b204?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sandy Grace</a> and <a class="link" href="https://be.linkedin.com/in/matt-hinde-836a2bb2?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Matt Hinde</a> for representing us with insight and purpose.

We&#x2019;re also grateful to the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/bcse?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Business Council for Sustainable Energy (BCSE)</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/wemeanbusiness?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>We Mean Business Coalition</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/the-climate-registry?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Climate Registry</a> and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/energygovuk?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Department for Energy Security and Net Zero</a> for their partnership and for convening such valuable events and discussions.","time":"1mo Edited","title":"National Grid"},{"comments_count":223,"date":"2025-12-03T14:42:57.725Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEs4myOXswZ4Q/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqSV36XIwAg-/0/1763391800861?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jAfGfMIpcc1yhzOvprnzZmXQqoTnTfUPSJmfOXbMtXw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG1SNsSbsxuhQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqSV36bIQAg-/0/1763391800746?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=2BuIzp908kY6bopnpuCoOhv53Mom46DHbW7R9WdCs18","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGzT4CSMW9JjQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZqSV36JJ0Ag-/0/1763391800632?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=9VY2QG2_PYOt_1hzJ7t4x8h4sJZS6q1tNhPw_hK0UCk"],"likes_count":5372,"post_id":"7396202138210832384","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7396202138210832384/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Today is my first day as CEO of National Grid . In the run up, I’ve been lucky enough to spend time getting to know National Grid colleagues across many of our operational sites and offices on both sides of the Atlantic. I’ve had the opportunity to engage with energy leaders and stakeholders in both the UK and US, including UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer, UK Secretary of State Ed Miliband and US Energy Secretary Chris Wright, when he visited our Northport Power Station in Long Island. Three things that are clear to me: ▶️ National Grid colleagues have an incredibly strong sense of purpose and pride in their role to keep energy flowing for everyone we serve. ▶️ We're committed to our customers and putting them at the heart of all we do. ▶️ Whatever we do as a business; safety, reliability and resiliency are always at the absolute core. 📸: How many people can you fit into a selfie? I count 56 here so I think we did a great job.","text_html":"Today is my first day as CEO of <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/national-grid?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>National Grid</a>. 

In the run up, I&#x2019;ve been lucky enough to spend time getting to know National Grid colleagues across many of our operational sites and offices on both sides of the Atlantic.

I&#x2019;ve had the opportunity to engage with energy leaders and stakeholders in both the UK and US, including UK Prime Minister Keir Starmer, UK Secretary of State Ed Miliband and US Energy Secretary Chris Wright, when he visited our Northport Power Station in Long Island. 

Three things that are clear to me:&#xA0;
&#x25B6;&#xFE0F; National Grid colleagues have an incredibly strong sense of purpose and pride in their role to keep energy flowing for everyone we serve.&#xA0;
&#x25B6;&#xFE0F; We&apos;re committed to our customers and putting them at the heart of all we do.&#xA0;
&#x25B6;&#xFE0F; Whatever we do as a business; safety, reliability and resiliency are always at the absolute core.&#xA0; 

&#x1F4F8;: How many people can you fit into a selfie? I count 56 here so I think we did a great job.","time":"1mo","title":"Zoe Yujnovich"},{"comments_count":300,"date":"2025-12-03T14:42:57.728Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFQFYchnGwObw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZqD5s_6JgAw-/0/1763149534043?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qMhrCCqpKyWnEGkaE3B6cALzHc8Xcmi45FHQ9To7QBA"],"likes_count":5379,"post_id":"7395190331475914753","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7395185148591382528-aEds","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Today marks the end of an era. I joined National Grid as a graduate in 1991, moving from my hometown in South Wales to London. I never imagined that 12 roles and 35 years later, I’d be wrapping up my time at this fantastic organisation as Chief Executive. Thank you to everyone at National Grid for all the support you’ve given me over the years, but also for what you achieve every single day. The thousands of people behind every light you switch on and the heat in your homes, the astounding engineering and system in place that has made every day possible - this will stay with me forever. National Grid is a critical partner to an industry undergoing significant transformation. My time here has been a once in a generation opportunity, which I’m incredibly fortunate and proud to have been a part of. I have no doubt that National Grid will not only be in safe hands but will continue to go from strength to strength and thrive under Zoe Yujnovich ‘s leadership. 📸 A photo from my early days at National Grid.","text_html":"Today&#xA0;marks the end of an era.&#xA0;
