Working in partnership with National Grid, television presenter and proud Cumbrian, Helen Skelton, took a trip down memory lane to Borough Park, home of <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/workington-afc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Workington AFC</a>, to see how the stadium will be transformed into the Cumberland Sports Village in 2027. A space designed to better serve the whole community.

A bigger stadium means increased energy demand. Through The Great Grid Upgrade, we&#x2019;re strengthening local networks and bringing cleaner energy to homes, schools, and community spaces like the future Cumberland Sports Village.

Watch the full video over on Helen&#x2019;s Instagram account: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e5yy5cDv?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e5yy5cDv</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fthegreatgridupgrade&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TheGreatGridUpgrade</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcumbria&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Cumbria</a>","time":"1mo","title":"National Grid"}]

