nk you, everyone, for your donations! #LondonLuton #LondonLutonAirport KidsOut","text_html":"Airport colleagues supported the local community by taking part in The Giving Tree, donating dozens of new toys to children in need &#x1F381;

An alternative to Secret Santa, The Giving Tree encourages people to buy toys for disadvantaged children and children in refuges. Donating gifts makes a huge difference to families, and allows more parents to be able to give their child a present on Christmas morning.

In 2024, Kids Out gave more than 50,000 brand new toys, plus a further 22,000 toys to children who have life-limiting disabilities, are carers, or are affected by economic hardship. Thank you, everyone, for your donations! 

