s":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"It's not long to go, but we wish it could be Christmas every day at London Luton Airport 🎄 To get our passengers in the festive spirit, we’ve transformed the airport into a winter wonderland, complete with music, games and moments of delight. Highlights include: ☕Seasonal retail and restaurant offers 🎶Live performances from local school choirs ☃️Exclusive LLA merchandise, including hats, candy canes, and advent calendars 🏆Giveaways from easyJet , Wizz Air and Jet2.com and Jet2holidays From our cosy festive branding to a programme of interactive, heart-warming activities throughout the terminal, our passengers can feel the magic of the season from the moment they arrive. Step into the season at London Luton Airport 👉 https://orlo.uk/8A9k3 #LondonLuton #LondonLutonAirport","text_html":"It&apos;s not long to go, but we wish it could be Christmas every day at London Luton Airport &#x1F384; 

