Highlights include:

&#x2615;Seasonal retail and restaurant offers
&#x1F3B6;Live performances from local school choirs
&#x2603;&#xFE0F;Exclusive LLA merchandise, including hats, candy canes, and advent calendars
&#x1F3C6;Giveaways from <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/easyjet?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>easyJet</a>, <a class="link" href="https://hu.linkedin.com/company/wizzair?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Wizz Air</a> and <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/jet2?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jet2.com and Jet2holidays</a> 

