&#xA0;
Meet <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jennefer-taylor-015bb79b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jennefer Taylor</a>, our Vice President and Chief Accounting Officer based in Houston, Texas. With six years at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkbr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#KBR</a>, Jennefer is passionate about leading an exceptional team dedicated to accuracy and compliance in our financial reporting.
&#xA0;
Jennefer&apos;s journey to KBR began with an easy conversation that felt more like connecting with a friend than a job interview. Since then, she&apos;s been excited about the company&apos;s future, especially with the upcoming spinoff into two publicly traded companies!
&#xA0;
Outside of work, Jennefer embraces her role as a proud dance mom and a devoted Houston sports fan. When she&apos;s not cheering for the Texans and Rockets, you can find her enjoying good food, family and a good book.
&#xA0;
At KBR, we celebrate the incredible stories and talents of our people. Get to know the People of KBR &#xBB; <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/4pnJ3ix?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/4pnJ3ix</a>
&#xA0;
