s are at their best. From personal mentorship to supporting military readiness, Jason's story of purpose and passion is both inspiring and informative. Curious to learn more about his journey and the impact he's making? Read his full story » https://bit.ly/4iHFZuY #KBRcareers #HumanPerformance #Veterans #Mentorship","text_html":"After two decades of service as a U.S. Navy physical therapist, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jason-mcmillendpt?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jason McMillen</a> embarked on a new mission to empower others in their journey. Now at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkbr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#KBR</a>, he&apos;s connecting with the next generation of health and performance experts to ensure our service members are at their best. From personal mentorship to supporting military readiness, Jason&apos;s story of purpose and passion is both inspiring and informative.
&#xA0;
