&#xA0;
&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkbrcareers&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#KBRcareers</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhumanperformance&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#HumanPerformance</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fveterans&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Veterans</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmentorship&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Mentorship</a>","time":"3w","title":"KBR, Inc."},{"comments_count":30,"date":"2025-12-03T09:59:46.042Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEnUcs3t_SWDA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zra0532H8Ag-/0/1764607902442?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=QRLQmMPhg_QiTLQp7cV78aMEewb6LQvtkjiV8Jlks9s","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQH8ybwDcUMnbA/feedshare-shrink_1280/B56Zra05wzHAAs-/0/1764607893622?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eFTNA-xIgfYcNOepQFyDKdYApYIuL0onx4vdUcSKsbE","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFArOPTV94aBw/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56Zra05sgJsAw-/0/1764607893309?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=qe7UdIBBugcYGrK_ANqixbxB5j-yszVvS44yN0jmLd8","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFCeOAaddMmEA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zra05tIHIAg-/0/1764607893691?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=erOu8ACp7jZluEP3YzrBj7NgDXlCd1kmVPoTQun7EHg","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGz6RwjeWYbRw/feedshare-shrink_800/B56Zra053PIcAg-/0/1764607896751?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Av0ZWhDAXiCOHlCkiV6hdiXoqrZqBirFC0ar-W-dl-M"],"likes_count":344,"post_id":"7401309346606825472","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7401309346606825472/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"November was a month of connection, collaboration, and giving back. 🌟 Team members shared insights at global conferences 🌍, strengthened connections through office events, and brought our competitive spirit to the Newport office chili cook-off 🌶️🏆. Our teams rallied behind fundraisers and community initiatives, showing that giving back is just as important as driving innovation. Thank you to everyone who made this month special—let’s keep the momentum going into December! ❄️✨","text_html":"November was a month of connection, collaboration, and giving back. &#x1F31F; Team members shared insights at global conferences &#x1F30D;, strengthened connections through office events, and brought our competitive spirit to the Newport office chili cook-off &#x1F336;&#xFE0F;&#x1F3C6;. Our teams rallied behind fundraisers and community initiatives, showing that giving back is just as important as driving innovation. Thank you to everyone who made this month special&#x2014;let&#x2019;s keep the momentum going into December! &#x2744;&#xFE0F;&#x2728;","time":"4w","title":"KBR, Inc."},{"comments_count":6,"date":"2025-12-01T09:59:46.044Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQHICnAXBGxYzg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZqjvyUpHIAg-/0/1763683805130?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=nd6AoUO8F8N8iyxipxDos6I5cH9vy1mhYIQWolhGGaA","https://static.licdn.com/aero-v1/sc/h/dur0ryw0e9uscxa9b6zqvgvfs"],"likes_count":100,"post_id":"7397426042182856705","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/kbr-careers_kbr-kbrcareers-peopleofkbr-activity-7397426042182856705-sTxf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🌟 Celebrating the People of KBR! 🌟 Meet Blair Trett, KBR’s metrology senior program manager in Phoenix, Arizona. With over 22 years of experience in the field, Blair has dedicated his career to ensuring accuracy in measurement systems, emphasizing the critical role this plays in product quality. Since joining #KBR in 2016, he has been inspired by the company’s commitment to integrity and excellence. Blair is particularly excited about the upcoming launch of a new metrology laboratory in Phoenix, which will serve the commercial market and enhance internal operations across KBR. Outside work, he cherishes his new role as a grandparent and loves spending quality time with his family through skiing, hiking, fishing and golfing. Get to know the People of KBR » http://bit.ly/4nYujpv #KBRCareers #PeopleofKBR #WeDoThingsThatMatter","text_html":"&#x1F31F; Celebrating the People of KBR! &#x1F31F; 
&#xA0;
Meet Blair Trett, KBR&#x2019;s metrology senior program manager in Phoenix, Arizona. With over 22 years of experience in the field, Blair has dedicated his career to ensuring accuracy in measurement systems, emphasizing the critical role this plays in product quality. Since joining <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkbr&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#KBR</a> in 2016, he has been inspired by the company&#x2019;s commitment to integrity and excellence.
&#xA0;
Blair is particularly excited about the upcoming launch of a new metrology laboratory in Phoenix, which will serve the commercial market and enhance internal operations across KBR. Outside work, he cherishes his new role as a grandparent and loves spending quality time with his family through skiing, hiking, fishing and golfing.
&#xA0;
