As we roll into 2026, here&#x2019;s a very quick taste of 2025 &#x1F447;

&#x1F354; Most popular cuisine: Burgers
 - Stacked, saucy, and ordered on repeat! &#x1F501;

&#x1F355; Most popular food item: Mini pizzas
 - Slice slice, baby - in crust, we trust (puns intended! &#x1F440;)

&#x1F4A7; Most popular grocery item: Water
 - Over 560,000 litres - deep enough to reach the ocean&#x2019;s twilight zone. &#x1F30A;

&#x1F35A; Most popular dessert: Rice pudding
 - Comfort food of the year - it truly understood the assignment. &#x1F44F;

