Behind the scenes, multiple teams came together with sharp planning and strong creative execution to build Tarek&#x2019;s character and story. 

Watch the video below to meet Tarek and learn about all the talabat pro benefits &#x1F680;

A big thank you to everyone involved - from Brand and Marketing, to Product, Data, Engineering and beyond. &#x1F64C;

