bat, innovation isn’t the tech we test, it’s the convenience we deliver - one order at a time 🧡 And this is just the beginning - more to come! #talabat #DeliveryInnovation #SmartMobility #DroneDelivery","text_html":"&#x1F680; The future of delivery is ready for takeoff!

