This year marks the 19th anniversary of the Little Caesars Veterans Program.

In gratitude for their service, veterans and active-duty military members can enjoy a free HOT-N-READY&#xAE; Lunch Combo on Tuesday, November 11, from 11:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. Each combo includes four slices of our signature Detroit-style Deep Dish pizza and a 20-ounce Pepsi.

Since 2006, the Little Caesars Veterans Program has supported honorably discharged veterans as they transition to civilian life and pursue entrepreneurship. The program provides franchise fee discounts, equipment and supply assistance, financing support, and marketing resources to help veterans open and operate their own Little Caesars restaurants.

This Veterans Day, we celebrate our heroes&#x2014;thank you for your service.","time":"4w","title":"Little Caesars Pizza"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-11-10T20:26:35.832Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGX5EgYn2Wljg/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B56ZpQQX2cIYAw-/0/1762283061389?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=nP_mrsMvpyOf8xF91D8u7wKnzx_mzx5T-Ju0mD57ods"],"likes_count":124,"post_id":"7393656264968507392","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/little-caesars_littlecaesars-franchiseopportunity-rfdc2025-activity-7393656264968507392-wH7B","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Little Caesars is live at RFDC, one of the restaurant industry’s largest gatherings for franchise opportunities! Stop by Booth #407 this week to meet the Little Caesars team and learn how you can join our growing franchise family. From financing and marketing to site selection, training, and ongoing support, we provide the tools you need to succeed. We look forward to seeing you all this week! #LittleCaesars #FranchiseOpportunity #RFDC2025 #RestaurantFinanceDevelopmentConference #Franchising","text_html":"Little Caesars is live at RFDC, one of the restaurant industry&#x2019;s largest gatherings for franchise opportunities!

