ecting with team members across departments, these future business leaders brought curiosity, enthusiasm, and a whole lot of Spartan pride. A huge thank you to the DSP chapter for spending the day with us. We’re excited to see where your journeys take you next! 💚🤝","text_html":"We recently had the pleasure of welcoming members of Delta Sigma Pi from <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/msubroadcollege/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michigan State University - Eli Broad College of Business</a> to our headquarters! It was an energizing day filled with great conversations, insightful questions, and a shared passion for professional growth.

