redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhollyjollypeopletec&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#HollyJollyPeopleTec</a>  <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fholidayparty&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#HolidayParty</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgptw&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GPTW</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbptw&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BPTW</a>","time":"3w Edited","title":"PeopleTec, Inc."},{"date":"2025-12-12T14:14:09.431Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFRlkQbhfxYHQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZr.3h73GoAg-/0/1765212561795?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jzE_DBzb19tKC3Am9KfBITNcSUrJFU5_GuHvIhMftTk"],"likes_count":19,"post_id":"7404520310990872576","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/peopletec_tecstar-peopletec-peoplefirst-activity-7404520310990872576-7Fc4","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"👏 Meet Brandon Rogers , Senior Leader and December’s #TecStar ! 💻 Brandon has been part of #PeopleTec for 5 years where he serves as a Project Manager overseeing a team of data scientists developing a lightweight cyber defense and event-detection tool. His mission is to support his team in every way possible—through customer engagement, hardware and software acquisition, troubleshooting, and guiding technical implementation decisions—empowering his team to succeed and advance in their careers.⚙️ When asked about his proudest achievements, Brandon highlighted several efforts that have shaped his PeopleTec journey. His early work on an AI-development project supporting Information Operations, including traveling to the customer location to see how the technology supported warfighters, was especially meaningful. 🌍✨ He also contributed to an R&D project developing SWaP compatible AI/ML across multiple platforms and environments, and was honored as runner-up for the Stan Pruett Excellence Always Award. Brandon is also deeply involved in the PeopleTec community, serving as Co-Chair of the TARGET Employee Resource Group and supporting our CMMI accreditation efforts at the project level. Outside of work, he enjoys experimenting with Raspberry Pis, building computers, coding home-automation tools and websites, and creating unique projects with his 3D printer. 🛠️📷 📚 A proud graduate of The Ohio State University, Brandon earned his bachelor’s degree in Computer Science and Engineering, graduating summa cum laude. Thank you, Brandon, for your leadership and dedication to advancing PeopleTec’s mission! 💙 #PeopleFirst #TechnologyAlways #OwnIt #BPTW #GPTW #STEM #Defense","text_html":"&#x1F44F; Meet <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandon-rogers-66166190?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Brandon Rogers</a>, Senior Leader and December&#x2019;s <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftecstar&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TecStar</a>!

&#x1F4BB; Brandon has been part of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpeopletec&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#PeopleTec</a> for 5 years where he serves as a Project Manager overseeing a team of data scientists developing a lightweight cyber defense and event-detection tool. His mission is to support his team in every way possible&#x2014;through customer engagement, hardware and software acquisition, troubleshooting, and guiding technical implementation decisions&#x2014;empowering his team to succeed and advance in their careers.&#x2699;&#xFE0F;

When asked about his proudest achievements, Brandon highlighted several efforts that have shaped his PeopleTec journey. His early work on an AI-development project supporting Information Operations, including traveling to the customer location to see how the technology supported warfighters, was especially meaningful. &#x1F30D;&#x2728; He also contributed to an R&amp;D project developing SWaP compatible AI/ML across multiple platforms and environments, and was honored as runner-up for the Stan Pruett Excellence Always Award.

Brandon is also deeply involved in the PeopleTec community, serving as Co-Chair of the TARGET Employee Resource Group and supporting our CMMI accreditation efforts at the project level. Outside of work, he enjoys experimenting with Raspberry Pis, building computers, coding home-automation tools and websites, and creating unique projects with his 3D printer. &#x1F6E0;&#xFE0F;&#x1F4F7;

&#x1F4DA; A proud graduate of The Ohio State University, Brandon earned his bachelor&#x2019;s degree in Computer Science and Engineering, graduating summa cum laude.

Thank you, Brandon, for your leadership and dedication to advancing PeopleTec&#x2019;s mission! &#x1F499;

