<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fthetariffhomecompanion&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TheTariffHomeCompanion</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftradelaw&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TradeLaw</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finternationaltrade&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#InternationalTrade</a>","time":"1w","title":"Borden Ladner Gervais LLP (BLG)"},{"date":"2025-12-19T13:19:32.672Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGDigzx9YVKTw/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZso9GlNGcAw-/0/1765918665561?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=nvGCvenyYObRo51NcJvo9I5g8fqCYZvajk3HlDz--r0"],"likes_count":40,"post_id":"7406799726219522049","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blglaw_on-december-15-the-agreement-with-atb-financial-activity-7406799726219522049-lPlc","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"On December 15, the agreement with ATB Financial , the largest financial institution headquartered in Western Canada, to acquire all outstanding shares of Cormark Securities Inc. closed. The integration strategically brings Cormark’s longstanding institutional knowledge into ATB Capital Markets, providing enhanced product offerings and deeper industry expertise. BLG advised Cormark Securities Inc. on its acquisition with a team led by Andrew McLean , Laura Costen , Daniel Lang and Philippe Tardif . Look out for more information in the new year.","text_html":"On December 15, the agreement with <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/atbfinancial?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ATB Financial</a>, the largest financial institution headquartered in Western Canada, to acquire all outstanding shares of <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/cormark-securities?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Cormark Securities Inc.</a> closed. The integration strategically brings Cormark&#x2019;s longstanding institutional knowledge into ATB Capital Markets, providing enhanced product offerings and deeper industry expertise.
&#xA0;
BLG advised Cormark Securities Inc. on its acquisition with a team led by <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/andrew-mclean-53616389?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Andrew McLean</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/laura-costen-699b98107?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Laura Costen</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/daniel-lang-8b3a6474?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Daniel Lang</a> and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/philippe-tardif-5b7717b1?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philippe Tardif</a>.
&#xA0;
Look out for more information in the new year.","time":"2w","title":"Borden Ladner Gervais LLP (BLG)"},{"date":"2025-12-19T13:19:32.676Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHh1e9wOouB9A/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZsoIy_BJgAs-/0/1765904953793?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=O2MQfrQYQPLJflFxWkYey20yMlqKvEX2RwKqjAc5aj8"],"likes_count":16,"post_id":"7406742218180292608","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blglaw_thetariffhomecompanion-activity-7406742218180292608-YI14","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"How do you navigate trade diversification when 97 per cent of your oil exports go to one country? In this episode of The Tariff Home Companion, hosts Rambod Behboodi and Stephen de Boer explore Canada's need for economic and trade diversification, the realities of expanding beyond the U.S. market, and the complex negotiations shaping our trade future. They're joined by Adam Chambers , Vice Chair of the Standing Committee of International Trade, and Yasir Naqvi 🇨🇦 , Parliamentary Secretary to the Minister of International Trade, who share candid insights on Canada's diversification dilemma: new agreements with Indonesia and ongoing negotiations with Thailand and the Philippines, the untapped potential of existing trade deals, and whether Canadian businesses are ready to look beyond their closest neighbour. From LNG pipelines to AI services – they tackle the opportunities and obstacles facing Canadian exporters. Listen to Episode 4 on The Tariff Home Companion podcast page: https://lnkd.in/etJiGF3e #TheTariffHomeCompanion","text_html":"How do you navigate trade diversification when 97 per cent of your oil exports go to one country?

In this episode of The Tariff Home Companion, hosts <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/rambodbehboodi?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Rambod Behboodi</a> and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/stephen-de-boer-31877832?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stephen de Boer</a> explore Canada&apos;s need for economic and trade diversification, the realities of expanding beyond the U.S. market, and the complex negotiations shaping our trade future.

They&apos;re joined by <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/adamjchambers?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Adam Chambers</a>, Vice Chair of the Standing Committee of International Trade, and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/yasirnaqvicdn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Yasir Naqvi &#x1F1E8;&#x1F1E6;</a>, Parliamentary Secretary to the Minister of International Trade, who share candid insights on Canada&apos;s diversification dilemma: new agreements with Indonesia and ongoing negotiations with Thailand and the Philippines, the untapped potential of existing trade deals, and whether Canadian businesses are ready to look beyond their closest neighbour. From LNG pipelines to AI services &#x2013; they tackle the opportunities and obstacles facing Canadian exporters.

Listen to Episode 4 on The Tariff Home Companion podcast page: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/etJiGF3e?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/etJiGF3e</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fthetariffhomecompanion&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TheTariffHomeCompanion</a>","time":"2w Edited","title":"Borden Ladner Gervais LLP (BLG)"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-12T13:19:32.692Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFalaY0VMAzDg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZsKCM06GcAE-/0/1765399908274?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=yusfjvr-N6J4l7Y5VYqIJzJM-A1AYtrdXHtYPwf1Qn4"],"likes_count":40,"post_id":"7404623903010181120","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blglaw_mca-dental-group-limited-previously-an-ottawa-based-activity-7404623903010181120-_-fi","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"MCA Dental Group Limited, previously an Ottawa-based growing dental support organization with 27 locations across Ontario and Québec, has sold its business to 123Dentist, one of Canada's fastest growing dental support organizations. BLG advised MCA Dental Group on this significant transaction in Canada's dental services sector. Neil Hazan and Manon Gauthier led the BLG team which included Valérie Olivier , Claudie Fournier-Turmel , Matteo Grandillo , Carlos Cerqueira , Linda Varjan, Adriana Poloni (Corporate), Joseph (Hovsep) Takhmizdjian , Olivia Ruvo, Félix Picard-Mandeville (Tax), Catherine Pronovost , Noah Burshtein (Employment), James Fu (Pension & Benefits), Christine Laviolette (Health Regulatory), Pascale Dionne , Maxim Laganière, Nathalie Olivier (Financial Services), and Zev Smith (Disputes). This deal continues our long-standing relationship with MCA and its financial sponsor Persistence Capital Partners. Congratulations to all parties on this successful transaction. https://lnkd.in/eti-aBQP","text_html":"MCA Dental Group Limited, previously an Ottawa-based growing dental support organization with 27 locations across Ontario and Qu&#xE9;bec, has sold its business to 123Dentist, one of Canada&apos;s fastest growing dental support organizations.

BLG advised MCA Dental Group on this significant transaction in Canada&apos;s dental services sector.
&#xA0;
