racking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>F&#xE9;lix Picard-Mandeville</a> (Tax), <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/catherine-pronovost-97b33823?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Catherine Pronovost</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/noah-burshtein-620a4893?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Noah Burshtein</a> (Employment), <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/james-fu-91774542?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>James Fu</a> (Pension &amp; Benefits), <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/christine-laviolette?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Christine Laviolette</a> (Health Regulatory), <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/pascale-dionne-a636506?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Pascale Dionne</a>, Maxim Lagani&#xE8;re, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/nathalie-olivier-b85317157?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nathalie Olivier</a> (Financial Services), and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/zev-smith-17a67949?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Zev Smith</a> (Disputes).
