<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e-_fxVqg?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e-_fxVqg</a>","time":"3w","title":"Borden Ladner Gervais LLP (BLG)","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQE0xNmVmVBnMQ/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZr_xRcbHEBw-/0/1765227706757?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=L2_CZp1KBDUMWxg6cvmJ3l2glIabfOXFxCoVIbsnmJ4","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQE0xNmVmVBnMQ/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZr_xRcbHECI-/0/1765227709020?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=IYQokKUCiC9raX46lXvayfUHN08B8-4J4W41ZfrAqM4"]},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-12T13:19:32.697Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQH-cOMWnUjG_w/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZr_jPc5HoAk-/0/1765224020187?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=1GhzHk4b5DDoP1-MfqsureaeitmBswtnwOndyNt2EHU"],"likes_count":123,"post_id":"7403886173682761729","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blglaw_vwfc-mls-blgxwhitecaps-activity-7403886173682761729-zOjz","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"This year marked BLG’s debut as the Official Law Firm and jersey sleeve sponsor of Vancouver Whitecaps FC . When we entered into this partnership, we were excited about aligning with an organization that reflects our commitment to excellence, teamwork and performance. The Whitecaps demonstrated these values throughout the season by winning the Canadian Championship, competing in the Concacaf Champions Cup and, this past weekend, in the MLS Cup. Being there in person at the MLS Cup allowed us to support the club and celebrate a memorable season. It has been rewarding to follow the Whitecaps’ journey this season and to see our partnership come to life on and off the pitch. We are grateful for the support of our business and legal relationship from our many friends at the Whitecaps, including Claire Villet , Aditi Bhatt , and Manav D. Here’s to next season! #VWFC #MLS #BLGxWhitecaps","text_html":"This year marked BLG&#x2019;s debut as the Official Law Firm and jersey sleeve sponsor of <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/vancouver-whitecaps-fc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Vancouver Whitecaps FC</a>.
&#xA0;
When we entered into this partnership, we were excited about aligning with an organization that reflects our commitment to excellence, teamwork and performance. The Whitecaps demonstrated these values throughout the season by winning the Canadian Championship, competing in the Concacaf Champions Cup and, this past weekend, in the MLS Cup. Being there in person at the MLS Cup allowed us to support the club and celebrate a memorable season.
&#xA0;
It has been rewarding to follow the Whitecaps&#x2019; journey this season and to see our partnership come to life on and off the pitch. We are grateful for the support of our business and legal relationship from our many friends at the Whitecaps, including <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/clairevillet?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Claire Villet</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/aditi-bhatt-2b476615?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Aditi Bhatt</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/manav-deol-jd-mba-70435572?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Manav D.</a>
&#xA0;
Here&#x2019;s to next season!
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvwfc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#VWFC</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmls&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MLS</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fblgxwhitecaps&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BLGxWhitecaps</a>","time":"3w","title":"Borden Ladner Gervais LLP (BLG)"},{"date":"2025-12-05T13:19:32.700Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFaPMOSEkyXmQ/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZrqUUYJHoAk-/0/1764867786788?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=cDbqX7wFiBygO2vO77vb1__myBswO8wTH0AwnuxfLGY","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQF_w5MIUlS6ZQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZrqUUg4GoAg-/0/1764867788447?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=_A_2vUEuibQ6n1tZg0X7sbEoPcfQpUCNcixmIV5LTd0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEoLE6Dlklt7Q/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZrqUUfwKgAs-/0/1764867787199?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=UFyIFbBEUpFM1HHBn8qOsJUlYoSBF2ea5NZHIzbY164","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGwW-Nclx8yxA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZrqUUjbHgAk-/0/1764867787584?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=42WV4U0n1-sFuwZOxls930KQvjvYk4grnUzMzUdzMKY"],"likes_count":164,"post_id":"7402392030691340289","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blglaw_vwfc-mls-blgxwhitecaps-activity-7402392030691340289-LRbJ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"BLG joined the Vancouver Whitecaps FC at the Western Conference Final as they secured a 3–1 victory over San Diego FC, earning their first-ever trip to the MLS Cup. As the Official Law Firm and jersey sleeve sponsor, BLG is committed to supporting excellence on and off the field. Our partnership with the Whitecaps reflects shared values of teamwork, resilience, and community impact. This Saturday, the Whitecaps face Inter Miami CF for the league title in Fort Lauderdale, and we’ll be cheering them on every step of the way. Let’s make history together — Go Whitecaps! #VWFC #MLS #BLGxWhitecaps #WesternConferenceChamps","text_html":"BLG joined the <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/vancouver-whitecaps-fc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Vancouver Whitecaps FC</a> at the Western Conference Final as they secured a 3&#x2013;1 victory over San Diego FC, earning their first-ever trip to the MLS Cup.

As the Official Law Firm and jersey sleeve sponsor, BLG is committed to supporting excellence on and off the field. Our partnership with the Whitecaps reflects shared values of teamwork, resilience, and community impact.

This Saturday, the Whitecaps face Inter Miami CF for the league title in Fort Lauderdale, and we&#x2019;ll be cheering them on every step of the way.

Let&#x2019;s make history together &#x2014; Go Whitecaps! 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvwfc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#VWFC</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmls&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#MLS</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fblgxwhitecaps&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#BLGxWhitecaps</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwesternconferencechamps&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WesternConferenceChamps</a>","time":"4w","title":"Borden Ladner Gervais LLP (BLG)"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-12-05T13:19:32.701Z","likes_count":130,"post_id":"7402064647308382208","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/blglaw_blg-is-transforming-how-legal-work-gets-done-activity-7402064647308382208-oCLs","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"BLG is transforming how legal work gets done. We've partnered with Thomson Reuters for the firmwide rollout of CoCounsel – cutting-edge AI technology for legal research, drafting, and document analysis. As one of only two national, full-service Canadian law firms to adopt this technology, we're reimagining workflows to free our lawyers to focus on the creative and strategic work that delivers real value, positioning us to meet evolving client expectations. This positions us to attract forward-thinking talent and reinforces our commitment to being the law firm of the future. Read the full announcement here: https://lnkd.in/gpmvnrT4","text_html":"BLG is transforming how legal work gets done. We&apos;ve partnered with <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/thomson-reuters?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Thomson Reuters</a> for the firmwide rollout of CoCounsel &#x2013; cutting-edge AI technology for legal research, drafting, and document analysis.

As one of only two national, full-service Canadian law firms to adopt this technology, we&apos;re reimagining workflows to free our lawyers to focus on the creative and strategic work that delivers real value, positioning us to meet evolving client expectations.

This positions us to attract forward-thinking talent and reinforces our commitment to being the law firm of the future.

