 a donation; it's a promise to help young people unlock their potential and thrive. Each year, The BLG Foundation will champion a primary cause while supporting the charitable initiatives that matter most to our people, amplifying our collective commitment to giving back. Learn more about The BLG Foundation and our partnership with Big Brothers Big Sisters of Canada: https://lnkd.in/gY592dKa #GivingTuesday #GivingTuesday2025","text_html":"Today marks a new chapter in BLG&apos;s commitment to community: the launch of The BLG Foundation. Built on the belief that generosity and strategic action can shape healthier, more vibrant communities, our first major initiative is a national partnership with <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/big-brothers-big-sisters-of-canada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Big Brothers Big Sisters of Canada</a>. This organization has a proven track record of helping youth realize their full potential through life-changing mentorship.&quot;

