s="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/spirit-energy?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Spirit Energy</a> where the Well-Safe Protector delivered top quartile performance on the York platform in the UKCS - safely abandoning five wells, 35 days ahead of schedule, with zero safety or environmental incidents.
