s":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We’re pleased to share that Adrin Shafil , Country Manager - Malaysia, will join a panel on “Challenges and Solutions for High Volume P&A”, alongside speakers from NOPSEMA, Esso, Chevron, and SLB at the SPE Asia Pacific Decommissioning and Well P&A Symposium in Perth, Australia on 12 Novemeber. Adrin will present on a Probabilistic Design Approach for High-Volume Well Abandonment, showcasing how sampling and Monte Carlo simulations can enhance planning for large-scale campaigns. #WellSafeSolutions #Decommissioning #WellAbandonment #SPE #AsiaPacific #P &A #EnergyTransition #Collaboration #Innovation","text_html":"We&#x2019;re pleased to share that <a class="link" href="https://my.linkedin.com/in/adrinshafil?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Adrin Shafil</a>, Country Manager - Malaysia, will join a panel on &#x201C;Challenges and Solutions for High Volume P&amp;A&#x201D;, alongside speakers from NOPSEMA, Esso, Chevron, and SLB at the SPE Asia Pacific Decommissioning and Well P&amp;A Symposium in Perth, Australia on 12 Novemeber.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
Adrin will present on a Probabilistic Design Approach for High-Volume Well Abandonment, showcasing how&#xA0;sampling and&#xA0;Monte Carlo simulations can enhance planning for large-scale campaigns.

