es":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We're wrapping up 2025 with 242 reasons to celebrate! Congratulations to the 242 amazing graduates who achieved their dreams at Sentara College of Health Sciences this year: 🎓 31 graduates with a Master of Science in nursing 🎓 90 graduates with a Bachelor of Science in nursing 🎓 25 graduates with associate degrees (cardiovascular technology and surgical technology) 🎓 96 graduates from certificate programs (medical assistant, patient care technician, and more) Here’s to every patient you’ll care for, every life you’ll touch, and every goal you’ll crush next. 💛🥳","text_html":"We&apos;re wrapping up 2025 with 242 reasons to celebrate!

Congratulations to the 242 amazing graduates who achieved their dreams at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/sentara-college-of-health-sciences/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sentara College of Health Sciences</a> this year:

&#x1F393; 31 graduates with a Master of Science in nursing
