&#x1F393; 96 graduates from certificate programs (medical assistant, patient care technician, and more)

Here&#x2019;s to every patient you&#x2019;ll care for, every life you&#x2019;ll touch, and every goal you&#x2019;ll crush next. &#x1F49B;&#x1F973;","time":"3d","title":"Sentara Health"},{"comments_count":13,"date":"2025-12-27T11:28:49.009Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQEKIOSwAefdWw/image-shrink_800/B4EZtb3FLqGcAg-/0/1766772725206?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=DUQr83cc6ROQmbRNMt2T-VZHQ4BjJR_-FR1DTQlD8sc","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQFnqSOLcnaxog/image-shrink_800/B4EZtb3FdMGcAo-/0/1766772726186?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=4r81xYW9VGUl4tTrl9S-n-ajoRdKpeNBlBaxCQJ96us","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQG7lOPAhOVTsg/image-shrink_800/B4EZtb3FmQI0Ag-/0/1766772726770?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=R-P3YtYFdUNpwysCeEgbzGiRBI_d2Z6_3WDbdjSzMNU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQH2gZEkiKqHCw/image-shrink_800/B4EZtb3F6tKUAg-/0/1766772728448?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mh24U2yCZIPrduiKueFIqBSELdmjWfJOROmHVsGYR78","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQG0Nw_ZYY5s_A/image-shrink_800/B4EZtb3GH9IMAg-/0/1766772729018?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=IvibAgAk9uBIBsCX63AqsSUMMRZH9R-VX3cT-TyAAXs"],"likes_count":220,"post_id":"7410381946201214976","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sentara-health_sentaraproud-anccmagnet-nursingexcellence-activity-7410381946201214976-K0ZJ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Only 10.2% of hospitals nationwide hold Magnet designation, and just 1.65% have earned five or more. Sentara Martha Jefferson Hospital has now joined this elite group, earning its fifth consecutive Magnet designation and, for the first time, Magnet with Distinction. This recognition reflects nearly two decades of sustained excellence across the hospital. 🌟💙 Magnet designation is the gold standard for nursing excellence, and achieving it requires the collaboration of the entire hospital. Nurses, leaders, and support staff work together every day to deliver safe, compassionate, and evidence-based care, continuously improving processes and outcomes for patients and families. It's a designation that 11 Sentara hospitals hold, underscoring our system-wide commitment to excellence in nursing care. Congratulations to the entire team for this incredible accomplishment! 🎉 #SentaraProud #ANCCMagnet #NursingExcellence","text_html":"Only 10.2% of hospitals nationwide hold Magnet designation, and just 1.65% have earned five or more. Sentara Martha Jefferson Hospital has now joined this elite group, earning its fifth consecutive Magnet designation and, for the first time, Magnet with Distinction. This recognition reflects nearly two decades of sustained excellence across the hospital. &#x1F31F;&#x1F499;

Magnet designation is the gold standard for nursing excellence, and achieving it requires the collaboration of the entire hospital. Nurses, leaders, and support staff work together every day to deliver safe, compassionate, and evidence-based care, continuously improving processes and outcomes for patients and families. 

It&apos;s a designation that 11 Sentara hospitals hold, underscoring our system-wide commitment to excellence in nursing care. 

Congratulations to the entire team for this incredible accomplishment! &#x1F389;
