These celebrations reminded us just how powerful community can be, especially this time of year. Wishing you a holiday season full of joy, warmth, and light. &#x2728;","time":"1w","title":"Sentara Health"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-12-26T11:28:49.014Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQHWKqQWq1xt-A/image-shrink_1280/B4EZtMrApQKMAc-/0/1766517902254?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=uHxWyCspdIpX9X6bc8tNDyZnt65ogX-5zMAOk6cthrQ"],"likes_count":80,"post_id":"7409313112585224193","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sentara-health_were-proud-to-share-that-sentara-virginia-activity-7409313112585224193-TzBK","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We’re proud to share that Sentara Virginia Beach General Hospital’s Inpatient Rehabilitation program has been ranked #3 in Virginia on Newsweek & Statista’s 2025 list of America’s Best Physical Rehabilitation Centers. This recognition highlights the commitment of our multidisciplinary team to helping patients regain strength and independence after serious illness or injury.","text_html":"We&#x2019;re proud to share that Sentara Virginia Beach General Hospital&#x2019;s Inpatient Rehabilitation program has been ranked #3 in Virginia on Newsweek &amp; Statista&#x2019;s 2025 list of America&#x2019;s Best Physical Rehabilitation Centers. This recognition highlights the commitment of our multidisciplinary team to helping patients regain strength and independence after serious illness or injury.","time":"1w","title":"Sentara Health"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-12-26T11:28:49.016Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQGtXzMfX_wMdQ/image-shrink_1280/B4EZtLEPaTHUAg-/0/1766490961930?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mDNdXEv5_TCCqn_dSkmM0aVHdhBWPTpom-2qdoXclio","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQGb91MB6U_nCw/image-shrink_1280/B4EZtLEPlcHEAc-/0/1766490962709?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-h1Axg32CgQdTJXes-ZFHIes6QK0yW-aU2fJ4cWcXjM"],"likes_count":68,"post_id":"7409200111333007360","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/sentara-health_healthcare-cardiology-innovation-activity-7409200111333007360-lFPg","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A meaningful moment for Sentara's Health Research Center and Heart Valve & Structural Disease Center! Recently, our teams contributed key clinical trial data evaluating the Jenavalve Trilogy TAVR platform and an innovative heart valve procedure for patients who previously had no treatment options. The study was published last month in The Lancet, one of the world’s leading scientific journals. This work highlights Sentara’s growing standing as an internationally recognized heart valve center. But more importantly, we’ve seen firsthand how this procedure changes lives! Thank you to Dr. Summers, a co-author of the study, and the entire team bringing cutting-edge cardiology research and care to the communities we serve. #Healthcare #Cardiology #Innovation #MedicalResearch","text_html":"A meaningful moment for Sentara&apos;s Health Research Center and Heart Valve &amp; Structural Disease Center! 

Recently, our teams contributed key clinical trial data evaluating the Jenavalve Trilogy TAVR platform and an innovative heart valve procedure for patients who previously had no treatment options. The study was published last month in The Lancet, one of the world&#x2019;s leading scientific journals.  

This work highlights Sentara&#x2019;s growing standing as an internationally recognized heart valve center. But more importantly, we&#x2019;ve seen firsthand how this procedure changes lives! 

Thank you to Dr. Summers, a co-author of the study, and the entire team bringing cutting-edge cardiology research and care to the communities we serve.  

