nnection to the hospital community&#x2014;from serving five years as a junior volunteer to offering her insights as a member of the Patient Family Advisory Council. Through these experiences, she has seen firsthand the hospital&#x2019;s commitment to compassionate, high-quality care. 

Running for Team BILH is Taylor&#x2019;s way of giving back to the place that has provided her with so many opportunities and learning experiences, while pursuing her dream of running the Boston Marathon.

Learn more and support Taylor&#x2019;s fundraising efforts. &#x2935;&#xFE0F;
