[{"date":"2026-01-01T13:16:50.106Z","likes_count":14,"post_id":"7412210221516787712","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/onemain_teamonemain-teamonemain-activity-7412210221516787712-bTCf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Throughout 2025, #TeamOneMain has found meaningful ways to live our mission. Every day, we empower customers to get the loans and credit cards they need to reach their goals — including dreams of a secure financial future. We also help people take important next steps with life-changing free financial education and budgeting tools. By constantly looking for opportunities to lift up communities where we live and work, including giving time and financial support to nonprofits, 9,000+ team members work together to create lasting change. Below, share your favorite 2025 moments on #TeamOneMain .","text_html":"Throughout 2025, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fteamonemain&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TeamOneMain</a> has found meaningful ways to live our mission. Every day, we empower customers to get the loans and credit cards they need to reach their goals &#x2014; including dreams of a secure financial future. &#xA0;We also help people take important next steps with life-changing free financial education and budgeting tools. By constantly looking for opportunities to lift up communities where we live and work, including giving time and financial support to nonprofits, 9,000+ team members work together to create lasting change. Below, share your favorite 2025 moments on <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fteamonemain&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TeamOneMain</a>.&#xA0;","time":"1d","title":"OneMain Financial","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQFjxjYX7TzTjQ/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZt1151xIwBw-/0/1767208626164?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=37-FITnFTEpiEahGNFHbDrJZGdfUIIgqfCmMLnaHXBc","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQFjxjYX7TzTjQ/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZt1151xIwCI-/0/1767208626330?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=_33p3wCbLfvkZxVbIOBnltOIFDMHv225RF7lHy2Nm0M"]},{"date":"2025-12-27T13:16:50.111Z","likes_count":49,"post_id":"7410367553191100416","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/onemain_teamonemain-mostlovedworkplace-happyholidays-activity-7410367553191100416-JU6L","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Celebrating 2025 makes this the most wonderful time of the year for #TeamOneMain . Part of lifting up our communities is connecting with the 9,000+ team members who share a mission and see the results of their hard work. These moments are part of what has made us a #MostLovedWorkplace 4 years in a row. Together, we’re taking all that spirit into 2026. #HappyHolidays","text_html":"Celebrating 2025 makes this the most wonderful time of the year for <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fteamonemain&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-n