ng on Honor Flights to Washington, D.C., where they visit military and war memorials that commemorate their service and sacrifice. In 2025, #TeamOneMain proudly supported Honor Flight events across Georgia, Florida, Illinois, Indiana, Maryland, Minnesota, Missouri, North Carolina, New Jersey, New Mexico, Nevada, Oklahoma, Pennsylvania, Virginia and Wisconsin. Together, we honor their courage, celebrate their stories, and ensure veterans and military families feel appreciated today and always.","text_html":"Showing our nation&#x2019;s gratitude to veterans is the mission of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/operation-gratitude?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Operation Gratitude</a> and the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/honor-flight-network?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Honor Flight Network</a>&#x2014;and OneMain is proud to stand alongside them.
