","time":"1mo","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-03T14:00:35.412Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQELmgXdreKDug/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpZ4oaxKcAk-/0/1762444615488?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=fv-ZiUeZ81AjHodHl9fKjcyBdTQmlbhJB8U0oCeUOCw","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHbXq0jKPHj4w/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpZ4obtJ0Ak-/0/1762444613461?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=69EnmdMpsyCAF7FR5DRuHLLeGHNDYm1dlffx9hdpbts","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQEoVoRTuFZIKQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpZ4oYnKcAk-/0/1762444612214?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NrE0tTL9E7Wv8aty3vCjpbEUaexTyeg_bnduMKDyZ8Q","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHMcbsRKY8_Vg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpZ4od.KoAg-/0/1762444613370?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=YdZQtcNQZ_ZsiclIkWIMhl3zGb60Pt1IV_-7TYyk_CE","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFQk3QNwQ8WFA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZpZ4ogdKsAg-/0/1762444614135?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eIEnbtDGptnGp1nxFxQqbzaLPXQI7V1PKpYDDZsK8oU"],"likes_count":142,"post_id":"7392236908480843777","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/canadian-tire_ctc-theresaplaceforyouhere-ctcbelongingfest2025-activity-7392236908480843777-_rEd","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Belonging Fest 2025 was an unforgettable celebration! 🎉 On Tuesday, our colleagues in Toronto gathered for an afternoon of in-person connection, celebrating our diversity and deepening our community. Here are some highlights: 🍲 Food Bazaar: A delicious journey of diverse culinary delights from the communities we belong to at Canadian Tire Corporation (CTC) with Chefs from Highbell Hospitality Group. 🎤 Performances: Talented performers showcasing their culture and bringing us all together through music and dance. 🖼️ Humans of CTC Exhibit: Powerful stories and photographs highlighting the unique journeys of our team members. 👤 Professional Headshots: Fresh new photos for employees’ Viva Engage, Workday, and LinkedIn profiles. 🌿Quiet Corner: A place to acknowledge change, find comfort, and observe pause. 🐕 Ambassador Dogs: A wellness space for employees to interact with CNIB’s Ambassador dogs. 🎟️ Raffle Prizes: Exciting prizes that added an extra layer of fun to the day. This event wasn't just about activities. It brought people together, sparked meaningful conversations, and left participants feeling a greater sense of belonging. At CTC, there is a place for you to be celebrated, seen, heard, and valued. A big thank you to our partners who made this event possible: King Events Corex Creative Inc. Highbell Hospitality Group CNIB Blue Buffalo ___ La célébration de l’appartenance 2025 a été un événement inoubliable! 🎉 Le mardi, nos collègues de Toronto se sont réunis en après-midi pour prendre contact en personne, célébrer notre diversité et renforcer notre communauté. Voici quelques faits saillants : 🍲 Bazar gourmand : Un marché invitant à parcourir un monde de délices culinaires variés, le tout proposé par les diverses communautés qui composent la Société Canadian Tire, en collaboration avec des chefs du Highbell Hospitality Group. 🎤 Spectacles sur scène : Des artistes talentueux nous ont fait découvrir leur culture par le pouvoir rassembleur de leur musique et de leurs danses. 🖼️ Des gens à découvrir à la Société Canadian Tire : Des photographies et des récits percutants ont mis en lumière le parcours unique de membres de notre équipe. 👤 Portraits professionnels : De nouvelles photos ont été prises pour le profil de nos employés sur Viva Engage, Workday et LinkedIn. 🌿Espace de guérison : Un endroit permettant de reconnaître le changement, de trouver du réconfort et de guérir avec des collègues. 🎟️ Tirage de prix : La journée a également été agrémentée d’un tirage au sort de prix formidables. En plus des activités proposées, l’événement a donné lieu à des conversations significatives qui ont eu pour effet de rassembler les participants, leur procurant un plus grand sentiment d’appartenance. Il y a une place pour vous chez nous, à la Société Canadian Tire, où chacun peut se sentir reconnu, vu, entendu et valorisé. #CTC #TheresaPlaceForYouHere #CTCBelongingFest2025 #InclusionIsAMust #StrongerTogether","text_html":"Belonging Fest 2025 was an unforgettable celebration! &#x1F389;

On Tuesday, our colleagues in Toronto gathered for an afternoon of in-person connection, celebrating our diversity and deepening our community. 

Here are some highlights:
&#x1F372; Food Bazaar: A delicious journey of diverse culinary delights from the communities we belong to at Canadian Tire Corporation (CTC) with Chefs from Highbell Hospitality Group.
&#x1F3A4; Performances: Talented performers showcasing their culture and bringing us all together through music and dance.
&#x1F5BC;&#xFE0F; Humans of CTC Exhibit: Powerful stories and photographs highlighting the unique journeys of our team members.
&#x1F464; Professional Headshots: Fresh new photos for employees&#x2019; Viva Engage, Workday, and LinkedIn profiles.
&#x1F33F;Quiet Corner: A place to acknowledge change, find comfort, and observe pause.
&#x1F415; Ambassador Dogs: A wellness space for employees to interact with CNIB&#x2019;s Ambassador dogs.
&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F; Raffle Prizes: Exciting prizes that added an extra layer of fun to the day.

This event wasn&apos;t just about activities. It brought people together, sparked meaningful conversations, and left participants feeling a greater sense of belonging. At CTC, there is a place for you to be celebrated, seen, heard, and valued.

A big thank you to our partners who made this event possible: <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/king-events-inc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>King Events</a> <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/corexcreative?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Corex Creative Inc.</a> <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/highbell-hospitality-group?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Highbell Hospitality Group</a> <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/cnib?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>CNIB</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/bluebuffalo?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Blue Buffalo</a>   

___

La c&#xE9;l&#xE9;bration de l&#x2019;appartenance 2025 a &#xE9;t&#xE9; un &#xE9;v&#xE9;nement inoubliable! &#x1F389; 

Le mardi, nos coll&#xE8;gues de Toronto se sont r&#xE9;unis en apr&#xE8;s-midi pour prendre contact en personne, c&#xE9;l&#xE9;brer notre diversit&#xE9; et renforcer notre communaut&#xE9;.&#xA0; 

Voici quelques faits saillants :&#xA0;
&#x1F372; Bazar gourmand : Un march&#xE9; invitant &#xE0; parcourir un monde de d&#xE9;lices culinaires vari&#xE9;s, le tout propos&#xE9; par les diverses communaut&#xE9;s qui composent la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian Tire, en collaboration avec des chefs du Highbell Hospitality Group.&#xA0;
&#x1F3A4; Spectacles sur sc&#xE8;ne : Des artistes talentueux nous ont fait d&#xE9;couvrir leur culture par le pouvoir rassembleur de leur musique et de leurs danses.&#xA0;
&#x1F5BC;&#xFE0F; Des gens &#xE0; d&#xE9;couvrir &#xE0; la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian Tire : Des photographies et des r&#xE9;cits percutants ont mis en lumi&#xE8;re le parcours unique de membres de notre &#xE9;quipe.&#xA0;
&#x1F464; Portraits professionnels : De nouvelles photos ont &#xE9;t&#xE9; prises pour le profil de nos employ&#xE9;s sur Viva Engage, Workday et LinkedIn.&#xA0;
&#x1F33F;Espace de gu&#xE9;rison : Un endroit permettant de reconna&#xEE;tre le changement, de trouver du r&#xE9;confort et de gu&#xE9;rir avec des coll&#xE8;gues.&#xA0;
&#x1F39F;&#xFE0F; Tirage de prix : La journ&#xE9;e a &#xE9;galement &#xE9;t&#xE9; agr&#xE9;ment&#xE9;e d&#x2019;un tirage au sort de prix formidables. 

En plus des activit&#xE9;s propos&#xE9;es, l&#x2019;&#xE9;v&#xE9;nement a donn&#xE9; lieu &#xE0; des conversations significatives qui ont eu pour effet de rassembler les participants, leur procurant un plus grand sentiment d&#x2019;appartenance. Il y a une place pour vous chez nous, &#xE0; la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian Tire, o&#xF9; chacun peut se sentir reconnu, vu, entendu et valoris&#xE9;. 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fctc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CTC</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftheresaplaceforyouhere&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TheresaPlaceForYouHere</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fctcbelongingfest2025&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CTCBelongingFest2025</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finclusionisamust&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#InclusionIsAMust</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fstrongertogether&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#StrongerTogether</a>","time":"1mo Edited","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2024-03-13T14:00:35.451Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/sync/v2/D5627AQEOK5Lp2gG1Fw/articleshare-shrink_800/B56ZosV2hLIYAI-/0/1761680517653?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=P3YWac2B4e9Ub0HN_m7GZKM_uX3B3o2iQrKmKH7Lv5Q"],"likes_count":133,"post_id":"7390014624747929600","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/canadian-tire_the-2025-harris-poll-brand-reputation-rankings-activity-7390014624747929600-Et_-","repost":{"external_links":["https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcanadianbusiness%2Ecom%2Finsider%2F2025-harris-poll-survey-canada%2F&urlhash=Ca8d&trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare_feed-article-content"],"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/sync/v2/D5627AQEOK5Lp2gG1Fw/articleshare-shrink_800/B56ZosV2hLIYAI-/0/1761680517653?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=P3YWac2B4e9Ub0HN_m7GZKM_uX3B3o2iQrKmKH7Lv5Q"],"repost_date":"2025-11-03T14:00:35.452Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["2mo"],"repost_id":"7390011104388644864","repost_text":"Canadian retail is undergoing seismic transformation. The landscape is evolving faster than ever, and this year’s The Harris Poll 100 shows that Canadian retailers are rising to meet the moment with confidence and creativity. I’m proud to share that Canadian Tire Corporation is in excellent company – and that Canadians continue to place their trust in us. The 2025 Harris Poll measures how Canadians feel about leading brands across seven key dimensions, and we improved our standing in every single one. When we launched our True North strategy, our goal was clear: protect the strength of a brand that generations have relied on, while positioning ourselves for long-term prosperity. Guided by our Purpose – We Are Here to Make Life in Canada Better – we've been transforming how we serve Canadians. It’s rewarding to see that progress reflected through their confidence in us. Notably, our scores in “Vision” and “Growth” rose sharply, signalling that Canadians see CTC as a company ready to face today’s challenges and pursue tomorrow's opportunities. To everyone across our organization who brings our Purpose to life every day – thank you. To Canadians everywhere – your trust in us inspires us to keep raising the bar. https://lnkd.in/gZNZPAHM","repost_title":"Greg Hicks","repost_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/redir/redirect?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcanadianbusiness%2Ecom%2Finsider%2F2025-harris-poll-survey-canada%2F&urlhash=Ca8d&trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare_feed-article-content","tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://www.linkedin.com/company/harris-poll?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"The Harris Poll"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/canadian-tire?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Canadian Tire Corporation"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"The 2025 Harris Poll 100 results are out, and we’re thrilled to announce that Canadian Tire Corporation’s reputation score has surpassed last year’s. We've seen improvements across all seven measures, with notable gains in the vision and growth categories. These achievements highlight our continued commitment to prospering over the longer term through our True North strategy. Thank you to all our team members for your hard work in building and maintaining our strong reputation, and thank you to our customers for your continued trust and support! #CTC #RetailExcellence ___ Les résultats du palmarès des 100 de The Harris Poll ont été publiés et nous sommes enchantés d’annoncer que la cote de réputation de la Société Canadian Tire a surpassé celle de l’an dernier. Nous avons observé des améliorations à l’échelle des sept mesures, notamment des gains importants dans les catégories vision et croissance. Ces réalisations illustrent notre engagement à continuer de prospérer à plus long terme dans le cadre de notre stratégie Vrai Nord. Merci à tous les membres de notre équipe pour votre travail assidu nous permettant de conserver et de rehausser notre réputation solide, ainsi qu’à nos clients pour votre confiance! #SociétéCanadianTire #ExcellenceAuDétail","text_html":"The 2025 Harris Poll 100 results are out, and we&#x2019;re thrilled to announce that Canadian Tire Corporation&#x2019;s reputation score has surpassed last year&#x2019;s. We&apos;ve seen improvements across all seven measures, with notable gains in the vision and growth categories. These achievements highlight our continued commitment to prospering over the longer term through our True North strategy. Thank you to all our team members for your hard work in building and maintaining our strong reputation, and thank you to our customers for your continued trust and support! <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fctc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CTC</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fretailexcellence&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#RetailExcellence</a>&#xA0;
___

Les r&#xE9;sultats du palmar&#xE8;s des 100 de The Harris Poll ont &#xE9;t&#xE9; publi&#xE9;s et nous sommes enchant&#xE9;s d&#x2019;annoncer que la cote de r&#xE9;putation de la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian&#x202F;Tire a surpass&#xE9; celle de l&#x2019;an dernier. Nous avons observ&#xE9; des am&#xE9;liorations &#xE0; l&#x2019;&#xE9;chelle des sept mesures, notamment des gains importants dans les cat&#xE9;gories vision et croissance. Ces r&#xE9;alisations illustrent notre engagement &#xE0; continuer de prosp&#xE9;rer &#xE0; plus long terme dans le cadre de notre strat&#xE9;gie Vrai Nord. Merci &#xE0; tous les membres de notre &#xE9;quipe pour votre travail assidu nous permettant de conserver et de rehausser notre r&#xE9;putation solide, ainsi qu&#x2019;&#xE0; nos clients pour votre confiance! <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2FsociAeztAezcanadiantire&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9;CanadianTire</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2FexcellenceaudAeztail&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ExcellenceAuD&#xE9;tail</a>&#xA0;","time":"2mo 2mo","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2024-03-13T14:00:35.455Z","likes_count":127,"post_id":"7389721032766550016","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/canadian-tire_congratulations-to-martha-billes-oc-for-activity-7389721032766550016-Dq2M","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":"2025-11-03T14:00:35.455Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["8,121 followers"],"repost_id":"7389285268723269632","repost_text":"Since 2005, Martha Billes, Jumpstart's Founder and Chairman Emeritus, has worked tirelessly to remove barriers to sport and play in an effort to provide inclusive play for kids of all abilities. What’s especially remarkable is her dedication to getting - and keeping - girls in sport. With the knowledge that girls consistently drop out of sport at a significantly higher rate than boys, Martha has championed opportunities that help girls build skills, confidence, and lasting relationships through sport and play. For her extraordinary leadership in making sport more accessible, affordable, and equitable, Martha has been awarded the Order of Sport, marking her induction into Canada’s Sports Hall of Fame. Thank you, Martha, for your incredible vision and impact in helping every child thrive through the power of sport! -- Depuis 2005, Martha Billes, fondatrice et présidente émérite de Bon départ, travaille sans relâche pour supprimer les obstacles au sport et au jeu en vue d’offrir des jeux inclusifs aux enfants de toutes les habiletés. Sa volonté de motiver les filles à pratiquer un sport et à persévérer dans celui-ci est particulièrement remarquable. Sachant que les filles sont considérablement plus nombreuses à abandonner le sport que les garçons, Martha a généré des occasions pour aider les filles à développer des aptitudes, leur confiance en soi et des liens durables par le sport et le jeu. Pour son leadership remarquable ayant contribué à rendre le sport plus accessible, plus abordable et plus équitable, Martha a été intronisée au Panthéon des sports canadiens et a reçu l’Ordre du sport. Merci, Martha, de votre vision et de votre impact incroyables afin d’aider tous les enfants à s’épanouir grâce au pouvoir du sport!","repost_title":"Canadian Tire Jumpstart Charities","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQHljCZfWTwDjw/mp4-360p-30fp-crf28/B56ZowDldtH8B0-/0/1761742852874?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NQD4_hv0xAw5WZItNRnevpA7kkBS-dRNkdWFlFi-pN4","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQHljCZfWTwDjw/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B56ZowDldtH8B4-/0/1761742852875?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jmc55bPwnYvS3XFq5LucDC2DUAZMmqJ5v7OtoKWcw0I","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQHljCZfWTwDjw/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B56ZowDldtH8BY-/0/1761742869792?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-L_Bnb5Zw6iYG4R5hEZUDl88IDYs_G34wXX3eebAzfs"]},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Congratulations to Martha Billes, OC, for her induction into Canada’s Sports Hall of Fame and for being awarded the Order of Sport. Martha has carried on her father and our founder A.J. Billes’ spirit of giving through her work with Canadian Tire Jumpstart Charities , significantly leveling the playing field for Canadian youth and ensuring sports are accessible and inclusive for all. She has made a lasting impact on communities across the country and our company, and we are proud to celebrate her incredible achievements. ___ Félicitations à Martha Billes, O.C., qui a été intronisée au Panthéon des sports canadiens et a reçu l’Ordre du sport. Martha perpétue l’esprit de générosité de son père et de notre fondateur, A.J. Billes, grâce à son soutien à Bon départ, contribuant considérablement à favoriser l’égalité des chances et à rendre le sport accessible et inclusif pour tous les jeunes du pays. Elle a créé un impact durable sur les communautés à l’échelle du pays ainsi que sur notre entreprise, et nous sommes fiers de célébrer ses réalisations exceptionnelles.","text_html":"Congratulations to Martha Billes, OC, for her induction into Canada&#x2019;s Sports Hall of Fame and for being awarded the Order of Sport. Martha has carried on her father and our founder A.J. Billes&#x2019; spirit of giving through her work with <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/ctjumpstart?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Canadian Tire Jumpstart Charities</a>, significantly leveling the playing field for Canadian youth and ensuring sports are accessible and inclusive for all. She has made a lasting impact on communities across the country and our company, and we are proud to celebrate her incredible achievements.
___

F&#xE9;licitations &#xE0; Martha Billes, O.C., qui a &#xE9;t&#xE9; intronis&#xE9;e au Panth&#xE9;on des sports canadiens et a re&#xE7;u l&#x2019;Ordre du sport.&#xA0;Martha perp&#xE9;tue l&#x2019;esprit de g&#xE9;n&#xE9;rosit&#xE9; de son p&#xE8;re et de notre fondateur, A.J. Billes, gr&#xE2;ce &#xE0; son soutien &#xE0; Bon d&#xE9;part, contribuant consid&#xE9;rablement &#xE0; favoriser l&#x2019;&#xE9;galit&#xE9; des chances et &#xE0; rendre le sport accessible et inclusif pour tous les jeunes du pays. Elle a cr&#xE9;&#xE9; un impact durable sur les communaut&#xE9;s &#xE0; l&#x2019;&#xE9;chelle du pays ainsi que sur notre entreprise, et nous sommes fiers de c&#xE9;l&#xE9;brer ses r&#xE9;alisations exceptionnelles.","time":"2mo 2mo","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQHljCZfWTwDjw/mp4-360p-30fp-crf28/B56ZowDldtH8B0-/0/1761742852874?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=NQD4_hv0xAw5WZItNRnevpA7kkBS-dRNkdWFlFi-pN4","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQHljCZfWTwDjw/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B56ZowDldtH8B4-/0/1761742852875?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jmc55bPwnYvS3XFq5LucDC2DUAZMmqJ5v7OtoKWcw0I","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D5610AQHljCZfWTwDjw/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B56ZowDldtH8BY-/0/1761742869792?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=-L_Bnb5Zw6iYG4R5hEZUDl88IDYs_G34wXX3eebAzfs"]},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-11-03T14:00:35.464Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQFJtNxWOUD5bg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZomwEwPH8Ao-/0/1761586728683?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ZRR-eG4jM5cNJkj5GkKH1wM2ugfv2Y9zTFq0r8oOqGI","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEEha8KE7FZ4Q/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZomwEx5JoAg-/0/1761586728759?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=hiZU7OPq9wApgGFCFNwnQOfRlAEZP3e3Rnh-Xfs60L0","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQG-ZAdtbugMZw/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZomwEw9JQAg-/0/1761586728882?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=nphkQtt5kfWL7WG10JP9MOy8ccHwS6Nck9ohomD33IU","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEuOkTf-kXwBA/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZomwEwoI8Ao-/0/1761586729045?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=J5qRbqn3A2M5I_A4py4IQt960gNa6lcjHCJyQ98E1Lc"],"likes_count":365,"post_id":"7388630271773958144","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/canadian-tire_ctc-theresaplaceforyouhere-womenintech-activity-7388630271773958144-DkBk","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"As part of Canadian Tire Corporation ’s (CTC) ongoing Women in Tech (WiT) series, we were proud to host a meaningful session focused on the theme of Food Insecurity — Building Connection Through Community. This event explored the realities of food insecurity in our communities and the important role each of us can play in creating belonging, compassion, and collective action. 💡 We were honoured to welcome Judith Reda from North York Harvest Food Bank, who shared powerful insights about the growing need for food support and the impact of community partnerships in driving change. 💡 The discussion reminded us that while insecurities can take many forms, the one thing no one should be insecure about is food. 💡 Together, we reflected on how we can give back—through volunteering, advocacy, and awareness—to help build stronger, more connected communities. A special thank you to Judith and the Keran McGuire for leading this impactful and thought-provoking session, and to everyone who joined in the conversation. At CTC, we remain committed to fostering inclusion, compassion, and connection—both within our workplace and across the communities where we live and work. #CTC #TheresAPlaceForYouHere #WomenInTech #CommunityImpact #FoodSecurity #Inclusion #Belonging #GivingBack ________ Dans le cadre de la série Parlons techno au féminin de la Société Canadian Tire, nous avons été fiers de présenter une séance percutante sur le thème Insécurité alimentaire — tisser des liens par l’action communautaire. Cet événement a porté sur la réalité de l’insécurité alimentaire au sein de nos communautés et sur le rôle important que nous pouvons tous jouer pour favoriser un sentiment d’appartenance, un mouvement de compassion et une action collective. 💡 Ce fut un honneur d’accueillir Judith Reda de la North York Harvest Food Bank, qui a mis en évidence le besoin grandissant d’apporter un soutien alimentaire et l’impact des partenariats communautaires qui stimulent le changement. 💡 Cette discussion nous a rappelé que l’insécurité prend plusieurs formes, mais que personne ne devrait en souffrir lorsqu’il s’agit de se nourrir. 💡 Ensemble, nous avons réfléchi aux façons dont nous pouvons apporter une contribution, notamment le bénévolat, la revendication et la sensibilisation, afin d’aider à établir des communautés plus solides et plus solidaires. Nous tenons particulièrement à remercier Judith et Keran McGuire d’avoir animé une séance aussi percutante et révélatrice, ainsi que tous ceux et celles qui y ont participé. À la Société Canadian Tire, nous demeurons déterminés à favoriser l’inclusion, la compassion et l’établissement de liens, et ce, tant dans notre milieu de travail qu’à l’échelle des communautés dans lesquelles nous vivons et travaillons. #SociétéCanadianTire #IlyaUnePlacePourVousChezNous #ParlonsTechnoAuFéminin #ImpactCommunautaire #SécuritéAlimentaire #Inclusion #Appartenance #ApporterUneContribution","text_html":"As part of <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/canadian-tire?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Canadian Tire Corporation</a>&#x2019;s (CTC) ongoing Women in Tech (WiT) series, we were proud to host a meaningful session focused on the theme of Food Insecurity &#x2014; Building Connection Through Community.
This event explored the realities of food insecurity in our communities and the important role each of us can play in creating belonging, compassion, and collective action.
&#x1F4A1; We were honoured to welcome <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/judith-reda?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Judith Reda</a> from North York Harvest Food Bank, who shared powerful insights about the growing need for food support and the impact of community partnerships in driving change.
 &#x1F4A1; The discussion reminded us that while insecurities can take many forms, the one thing no one should be insecure about is food.
 &#x1F4A1; Together, we reflected on how we can give back&#x2014;through volunteering, advocacy, and awareness&#x2014;to help build stronger, more connected communities.
A special thank you to Judith and the <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/keran-mcguire-578b32?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Keran McGuire</a> for leading this impactful and thought-provoking session, and to everyone who joined in the conversation.
At CTC, we remain committed to fostering inclusion, compassion, and connection&#x2014;both within our workplace and across the communities where we live and work.
<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fctc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CTC</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ftheresaplaceforyouhere&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TheresAPlaceForYouHere</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwomenintech&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#WomenInTech</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcommunityimpact&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CommunityImpact</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffoodsecurity&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#FoodSecurity</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Finclusion&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Inclusion</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbelonging&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Belonging</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgivingback&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GivingBack</a>
________

Dans le cadre de la s&#xE9;rie Parlons techno au f&#xE9;minin&#xA0;de la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian Tire, nous avons &#xE9;t&#xE9; fiers de pr&#xE9;senter une s&#xE9;ance percutante sur le th&#xE8;me Ins&#xE9;curit&#xE9; alimentaire &#x2014; tisser des liens par l&#x2019;action communautaire.
Cet &#xE9;v&#xE9;nement a port&#xE9; sur la r&#xE9;alit&#xE9; de l&#x2019;ins&#xE9;curit&#xE9; alimentaire au sein de nos communaut&#xE9;s et sur le r&#xF4;le important que nous pouvons tous jouer pour favoriser un sentiment d&#x2019;appartenance, un mouvement de compassion et une action collective.
&#x1F4A1; Ce fut un honneur d&#x2019;accueillir <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/judith-reda?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Judith Reda</a> de la North York Harvest Food Bank, qui a mis en &#xE9;vidence le besoin grandissant d&#x2019;apporter un soutien alimentaire et l&#x2019;impact des partenariats communautaires qui stimulent le changement.
 &#x1F4A1; Cette discussion nous a rappel&#xE9; que l&#x2019;ins&#xE9;curit&#xE9; prend plusieurs formes, mais que personne ne devrait en souffrir lorsqu&#x2019;il s&#x2019;agit de se nourrir.
 &#x1F4A1; Ensemble, nous avons r&#xE9;fl&#xE9;chi aux fa&#xE7;ons dont nous pouvons apporter une contribution, notamment le b&#xE9;n&#xE9;volat, la revendication et la sensibilisation, afin d&#x2019;aider &#xE0; &#xE9;tablir des communaut&#xE9;s plus solides et plus solidaires.
Nous tenons particuli&#xE8;rement &#xE0; remercier Judith et <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/keran-mcguire-578b32?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Keran McGuire</a> d&#x2019;avoir anim&#xE9; une s&#xE9;ance aussi percutante et r&#xE9;v&#xE9;latrice, ainsi que tous ceux et celles qui y ont particip&#xE9;.
&#xC0; la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian Tire, nous demeurons d&#xE9;termin&#xE9;s &#xE0; favoriser l&#x2019;inclusion, la compassion et l&#x2019;&#xE9;tablissement de liens, et ce, tant dans notre milieu de travail qu&#x2019;&#xE0; l&#x2019;&#xE9;chelle des communaut&#xE9;s dans lesquelles nous vivons et travaillons. 
