card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Inclusion</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fappartenance&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Appartenance</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fapporterunecontribution&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ApporterUneContribution</a>","time":"2mo Edited","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation"},{"comments_count":21,"date":"2025-11-03T14:00:35.473Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQGmZfomU3uWjQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZntG260JwAg-/0/1760619622496?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3_uUZaFFPyDHBmyerkEJzareNcDLxU_5dkHHL24RdjY"],"likes_count":983,"post_id":"7384573928670691328","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/canadian-tire_communitycommitment-canadiantire-hudsonsbay-activity-7384573928670691328-Cbzf","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We are proud to announce an expanded partnership between Canadian Tire Corporation (CTC) and The Gord Downie & Chanie Wenjack Fund , an Indigenous-led charity dedicated to building cultural understanding and creating a path toward reconciliation between Indigenous and non-Indigenous peoples. Building on our existing relationship, CTC will now support Oshki Wupoowane | The Blanket Fund, a national initiative that empowers Indigenous-led cultural, artistic, and educational projects. CTC will donate 100% of the Corporation’s net proceeds from sales of the Hudson’s Bay Point Blanket, with a guaranteed minimum annual donation of $1 million, to support Indigenous initiatives. This partnership represents a powerful step forward in how we support Indigenous voices and stories across our corporate, retail, and community programs. More information about where and when customers can purchase the Hudson’s Bay Point Blanket will follow in the coming weeks. For more details on the partnership, read the news release here 🔗: https://lnkd.in/gHh3ayBZ #CommunityCommitment #CanadianTire #HudsonsBay #CTC #CanadianBrands ___ Nous sommes fiers d’annoncer un partenariat élargi entre la Société Canadian Tire et le Fonds Gord Downie & Chanie Wenjack, un organisme de bienfaisance dirigé par des Autochtones qui vise à favoriser la compréhension culturelle et à tracer une voie vers la réconciliation entre les Autochtones et les non-Autochtones du pays. Renforçant son partenariat existant avec celui-ci, la Société Canadian Tire soutiendra désormais Oshki Wupoowane | le Fonds des couvertures, une initiative nationale qui favorise les projets culturels, artistiques et éducatifs qui sont dirigés par des Autochtones. La Société Canadian Tire versera la totalité du produit net de la vente de la couverture à points de la Baie d’Hudson, à raison d’une somme minimale garantie de 1 million de dollars annuellement, afin de soutenir des initiatives autochtones. Ce partenariat représente un grand progrès dans notre soutien aux voix et aux histoires autochtones sur le plan de nos activités d’entreprise, de commerce de détail et à l’échelle communautaire. De plus amples renseignements indiquant où et quand les clients pourront faire l’achat de la couverture à points de la Baie d’Hudson vous seront communiqués au cours des prochaines semaines. Pour obtenir de plus amples détails sur ce partenariat, veuillez lire le communiqué de presse ici 🔗: https://lnkd.in/gs2uQEjV #EngagementCommunautaire #CanadianTire #BaiedHudson #MarquesCanadiennes","text_html":"We are proud to announce an expanded partnership between Canadian Tire Corporation (CTC) and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/downiewenjack?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Gord Downie &amp; Chanie Wenjack Fund</a>, an Indigenous-led charity dedicated to building cultural understanding and creating a path toward reconciliation between Indigenous and non-Indigenous peoples. 

Building on our existing relationship, CTC will now support Oshki Wupoowane | The Blanket Fund, a national initiative that empowers Indigenous-led cultural, artistic, and educational projects. 

CTC will donate 100% of the Corporation&#x2019;s net proceeds from sales of the Hudson&#x2019;s Bay Point Blanket, with a guaranteed minimum annual donation of $1 million, to support Indigenous initiatives. This partnership represents a powerful step forward in how we support Indigenous voices and stories across our corporate, retail, and community programs. 

More information about where and when customers can purchase the Hudson&#x2019;s Bay Point Blanket will follow in the coming weeks. 

For more details on the partnership, read the news release here &#x1F517;: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gHh3ayBZ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gHh3ayBZ</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcommunitycommitment&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CommunityCommitment</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcanadiantire&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CanadianTire</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhudsonsbay&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#HudsonsBay</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fctc&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CTC</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcanadianbrands&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CanadianBrands</a>&#xA0;
