"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"☕Something exciting is brewing!☕ Canadian Tire Corporation and Tim Hortons , two of Canada’s most iconic brands, have announced a new loyalty partnership! 🍁 Launching later in 2026, members will be able to link their Triangle Rewards and Tims Rewards accounts, unlocking exciting new benefits and rewards. By linking accounts, members will be able to earn Canadian Tire Money (CTM) on eligible Tim Hortons purchases and enjoy exclusive offers from both loyalty programs. Triangle Mastercard holders will have even more opportunities to earn CTM when visiting Tim Hortons locations. With nearly 12 million Triangle Rewards members and millions of Canadians visiting Tim Hortons daily, this collaboration significantly expands our Triangle ecosystem by allowing customers to earn and redeem rewards through their everyday activities, like picking up their morning coffee or shopping for essentials. For more details about this exciting new partnership, read the press release here 🔗: https://lnkd.in/gNTW7eQZ #CanadianTire #TimHortons #Loyalty #TriangleRewards #TimsRewards #CustomerExperience #TrianglePowered ___ ☕On vous prépare quelque chose d’excitant!☕ La Société Canadian Tire et Tim Hortons, deux des marques canadiennes les plus emblématiques, annoncent un nouveau partenariat de fidélisation! 🍁 À partir de 2026, les membres pourront lier leurs comptes Récompenses Triangle et FidéliTim pour obtenir de nouveaux avantages et des récompenses excitantes. En liant leurs comptes, les membres pourront obtenir de l'Argent Canadian Tire sur leurs achats admissibles chez Tim Hortons et recevoir des offres exclusives des deux programmes de fidélisation. Les titulaires de carte Triangle Mastercard auront encore plus d’occasions d’obtenir de l’Argent Canadian Tire dans les succursales Tim Hortons. Avec près de 12 millions de membres du programme Récompenses Triangle et des millions de Canadiens qui visitent Tim Hortons chaque jour, cette collaboration enrichit considérablement l’écosystème Triangle en permettant aux clients d’accumuler et d’échanger des récompenses dans le cadre de leurs activités quotidiennes, comme en allant chercher leur café ou en achetant des articles essentiels. Pour plus de détails sur ce nouveau partenariat passionnant, vous pouvez lire le communiqué de presse🔗: https://lnkd.in/gjPvKNKb #CanadianTire #TimHortons #Fidélité #RécompensesTriangle #FidéliTim #ExpérienceClient #PropulsionTriangle","text_html":"&#x2615;Something exciting is brewing!&#x2615;

Canadian Tire Corporation and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/tim-hortons?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Tim Hortons</a>, two of Canada&#x2019;s most iconic brands, have announced a new loyalty partnership! &#x1F341;

Launching later in 2026, members will be able to link their Triangle Rewards and Tims Rewards accounts, unlocking exciting new benefits and rewards.

By linking accounts, members will be able to earn Canadian Tire Money (CTM) on eligible Tim Hortons purchases and enjoy exclusive offers from both loyalty programs. Triangle Mastercard holders will have even more opportunities to earn CTM when visiting Tim Hortons locations. 

With nearly 12 million Triangle Rewards members and millions of Canadians visiting Tim Hortons daily, this collaboration significantly expands our Triangle ecosystem by allowing customers to earn and redeem rewards through their everyday activities, like picking up their morning coffee or shopping for essentials. 

For more details about this exciting new partnership, read the press release here &#x1F517;: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gNTW7eQZ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gNTW7eQZ</a>

