inkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fpropulsiontriangle&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#PropulsionTriangle</a>","time":"3mo Edited","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation"},{"comments_count":10,"date":"2025-09-04T14:00:35.482Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQF0X3GviWPlqg/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZifB4HmHkAg-/0/1755014726911?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=5LuyAA3XYFO8rUxCe1C5C0CjHghs61UOsKjFMJNoNxE","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D5622AQEVVXBkIgub2w/feedshare-shrink_800/B56ZifB4G0G0Ao-/0/1755014727122?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=A8hfLqS7OivzR9A-ni9Mew7PnzJurpSQCIJ_2QixpTQ"],"likes_count":164,"post_id":"7361065294590566400","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/canadian-tire_our-very-own-simone-lumsden-svp-of-triangle-activity-7361065294590566400-iiAd","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Our very own Simone Lumsden , SVP of Triangle Customer Loyalty and Triangle Retail Media (TRM), was recently featured in a special live episode of The Voice of Retail Podcast. This episode, recorded at the RCC STORE 2025 conference, includes an engaging conversation with Sandra Duff, Founder and Principal at Another Story Consulting, and host Michael LeBlanc. In this episode, they explore the evolution of our Triangle Rewards program from its humble beginnings as Canadian Tire Money to a sophisticated digital currency that personalizes shopping experiences for millions of Canadians and serves as key part of Canadian Tire Corporation’s True North strategy. Click below to listen to the interview and learn more about how we're innovating in the retail space through the power of customer loyalty! https://lnkd.in/gTbYdZSZ __ Notre chère Simone Lumsden, vice-présidente principale, Fidélisation de la clientèle et médias de vente au détail Triangle, a récemment participé à un épisode spécial en direct du balado The Voice of Retail. Enregistré lors de l’événement STORE 25 du CCCDC, cet épisode comprend une conversation captivante avec Sandra Duff, fondatrice et directrice, Another Story Consulting, et l’animateur Michael LeBlanc. Dans cet épisode, ils explorent l’évolution de notre programme Récompenses Triangle, de ses débuts modestes sous forme d’Argent Canadian Tire à une version numérique perfectionnée qui personnalise l’expérience de magasinage de millions de Canadiens et qui joue un rôle déterminant dans le cadre de la stratégie Vrai Nord de la Société Canadian Tire. Cliquez ci-dessous pour écouter l’entrevue et en apprendre davantage sur nos innovations en matière de vente au détail qui mettent à contribution le pouvoir de la fidélisation de la clientèle! https://lnkd.in/gTbYdZSZ","text_html":"Our very own <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/simone-lumsden9901?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Simone Lumsden</a>, SVP of Triangle Customer Loyalty and Triangle Retail Media (TRM), was recently featured in a special live episode of The Voice of Retail Podcast. This episode, recorded at the RCC STORE 2025 conference, includes an engaging conversation with Sandra Duff, Founder and Principal at Another Story Consulting, and host Michael LeBlanc. 

In this episode, they explore the evolution of our Triangle Rewards program from its humble beginnings as Canadian Tire Money to a sophisticated digital currency that personalizes shopping experiences for millions of Canadians and serves as key part of Canadian Tire Corporation&#x2019;s True North strategy. 

Click&#xA0;below&#xA0;to listen to the interview and learn more about how we&apos;re innovating in the retail space through the power of customer loyalty!

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gTbYdZSZ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gTbYdZSZ</a>
__

Notre ch&#xE8;re Simone Lumsden, vice-pr&#xE9;sidente principale, Fid&#xE9;lisation de la client&#xE8;le et m&#xE9;dias de vente au d&#xE9;tail Triangle, a r&#xE9;cemment particip&#xE9; &#xE0; un &#xE9;pisode sp&#xE9;cial en direct du balado The Voice of Retail. Enregistr&#xE9; lors de l&#x2019;&#xE9;v&#xE9;nement STORE 25 du CCCDC, cet &#xE9;pisode comprend une conversation captivante avec Sandra Duff, fondatrice et directrice, Another Story Consulting, et l&#x2019;animateur Michael LeBlanc. 

Dans cet &#xE9;pisode, ils explorent l&#x2019;&#xE9;volution de notre programme R&#xE9;compenses Triangle, de ses d&#xE9;buts modestes sous forme d&#x2019;Argent Canadian Tire &#xE0; une version num&#xE9;rique perfectionn&#xE9;e qui personnalise l&#x2019;exp&#xE9;rience de magasinage de millions de Canadiens et qui joue un r&#xF4;le d&#xE9;terminant dans le cadre de la strat&#xE9;gie Vrai Nord de la Soci&#xE9;t&#xE9; Canadian Tire. 

Cliquez&#xA0;ci-dessous&#xA0;pour &#xE9;couter l&#x2019;entrevue et en apprendre davantage sur nos innovations en mati&#xE8;re de vente au d&#xE9;tail qui mettent &#xE0; contribution le pouvoir de la fid&#xE9;lisation de la client&#xE8;le!

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/gTbYdZSZ?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/gTbYdZSZ</a>","time":"4mo Edited","title":"Canadian Tire Corporation"}]

