ll,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"✨ Powering Performance: Advancing Yard Excellence in Fabrication ✨ We’re pleased to mark a major milestone in our Yard Excellence in Fabrication Program. 🤩 ✅ In December, we signed three new charters - Digital Excellence, Sustainability Excellence, and Innovation Excellence - reinforcing our commitment to world‑class execution and continuous improvement across our yards. These build on the earlier HSSE Excellence and Quality Excellence charters, completing a holistic framework that strengthens consistency, speed, and impact. Thank you to our partners at CHI Qidong, CHI Dalian, BOMESC, and Yanda for their collaboration and commitment - and to all Charter Champions for their leadership. 🤝 These charters reflect our shared dedication to operational excellence and set a clear path for measurable improvements in the year ahead. 🚀 #PoweringPerformance #OperationalExcellence #Digital #Sustainability #Innovation #HSSE #Quality #Fabrication #ContinuousImprovement","text_html":"&#x2728; Powering Performance: Advancing Yard Excellence in Fabrication &#x2728;

We&#x2019;re pleased to mark a major milestone in our Yard Excellence in Fabrication Program. &#x1F929;

&#x2705; In December, we signed three new charters - Digital Excellence, Sustainability Excellence, and Innovation Excellence - reinforcing our commitment to world&#x2011;class execution and continuous improvement across our yards. These build on the earlier HSSE Excellence and Quality Excellence charters, completing a holistic framework that strengthens consistency, speed, and impact.

Thank you to our partners at CHI Qidong, CHI Dalian, BOMESC, and Yanda for their collaboration and commitment - and to all Charter Champions for their leadership. &#x1F91D;

These charters reflect our shared dedication to operational excellence and set a clear path for measurable improvements in the year ahead. &#x1F680;
