s de serviço que nos acompanham ou já fizeram parte dessa jornada de eficiência e segurança operacional! 🥳💙 . . 🎉 FPSO Cidade de Caraguatatuba MV27 celebrates 9 years in operation! 🚢🌊 Nine years ago, the 11th vessel delivered by MODEC to the Brazilian oil and gas sector produced its first oil in the Santos Basin, becoming our 5th FPSO in the pre-salt region. 📢Check out what Leonardo Veiga , Operations Coordinator, and Luiz Edgard Catarinozi , Maintenance Superintendent, shared about their journeys on the FPSO Cidade de Caraguatatuba MV27. Congratulations to the entire onshore team, the onboard professionals, all partners and service providers who accompany us or have been part of this journey of efficiency and operational safety! 🥳💙 #bemodec #fpso #oilandgas #offshore","text_html":"&#x1F389; FPSO Cidade de Caraguatatuba MV27 completa 9 anos em opera&#xE7;&#xE3;o!&#xA0;&#x1F6A2;&#x1F30A;&#x202F; 

H&#xE1; nove anos, a 11&#xAA; embarca&#xE7;&#xE3;o entregue pela MODEC ao setor de petr&#xF3;leo e g&#xE1;s brasileiro produzia o primeiro &#xF3;leo na Bacia de Santos, se tornando o nosso 5&#xBA; FPSO na regi&#xE3;o do pr&#xE9;-sal.

&#x1F4E2;&#x202F;Confira o que <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/leonardo-veiga-52b62b24?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Leonardo Veiga</a>, Coordenador de Opera&#xE7;&#xF5;es, e <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/luiz-edgard-catarinozi-5a212942?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Luiz Edgard Catarinozi</a>, Superintendente de Manuten&#xE7;&#xE3;o, compartilharam sobre as suas trajet&#xF3;rias no FPSO Cidade de Caraguatatuba MV27.  

Parab&#xE9;ns a toda a equipe&#x202F;onshore, aos profissionais de bordo, a todos os parceiros e prestadores de servi&#xE7;o que nos acompanham ou j&#xE1; fizeram parte dessa jornada de efici&#xEA;ncia e seguran&#xE7;a operacional! &#x1F973;&#x1F499; &#xA0;
.
.
&#x1F389; FPSO Cidade de Caraguatatuba MV27 celebrates 9 years in operation! &#x1F6A2;&#x1F30A;

Nine years ago, the 11th vessel delivered by MODEC to the Brazilian oil and gas sector produced its first oil in the Santos Basin, becoming our 5th FPSO in the pre-salt region.

&#x1F4E2;Check out what <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/leonardo-veiga-52b62b24?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Leonardo Veiga</a>, Operations Coordinator, and <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/luiz-edgard-catarinozi-5a212942?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Luiz Edgard Catarinozi</a>, Maintenance Superintendent, shared about their journeys on the FPSO Cidade de Caraguatatuba MV27.

Congratulations to the entire onshore team, the onboard professionals, all partners and service providers who accompany us or have been part of this journey of efficiency and operational safety! &#x1F973;&#x1F499;

