y (LTI) – celebrated on November 20 at MODEC in Vietnam – reflects the outstanding dedication, discipline, and teamwork of our offshore crew, onshore support teams, and leadership. 🤝 ✅ Katsuyuki Imaizumi, MODEC Group Chief Operating Officer, and Gary Kennedy, Head of Operations at MODEC in Africa and Asia/Pacific, praised MV17's exemplary safety culture and resilience, especially during extended rotations. They also shared their optimism for the journey ahead, including the recently confirmed contract extension through April 2027. 🚢🌊 💬 “17-year LTI-free. A milestone not only for MODEC, but for the entire oil and gas industry. Proudly celebrated on MV17, where 17 stands for safety discipline and teamwork. Thank you to everyone who made this possible, safety is our highest priority”, reinforced Gary. Congratulations to the entire team onshore, the professionals on board and FSO Rang Dong MV17 for this extraordinary achievement! 🎉 #bemodec #safetyfirst #hsse #oilandgas #offshore #vietnam #LTIfree","text_html":"&#x2728;17 years of a remarkable journey: every day, every choice, safety first. &#x2728;

&#x1F3AF;FSO Rang Dong MV17 celebrates 17 years of LTI-free! &#x1F389;

All these consecutive years without a Lost Time Injury (LTI) &#x2013; celebrated on November 20 at MODEC in Vietnam &#x2013; reflects the outstanding dedication, discipline, and teamwork of our offshore crew, onshore support teams, and leadership. &#x1F91D;

&#x2705; Katsuyuki Imaizumi, MODEC Group Chief Operating Officer, and Gary Kennedy, Head of Operations at MODEC in Africa and Asia/Pacific, praised MV17&apos;s exemplary safety culture and resilience, especially during extended rotations. They also shared their optimism for the journey ahead, including the recently confirmed contract extension through April 2027. &#x1F6A2;&#x1F30A;

&#x1F4AC; &#x201C;17-year LTI-free. A milestone not only for MODEC, but for the entire oil and gas industry. Proudly celebrated on MV17, where 17 stands for safety discipline and teamwork. Thank you to everyone who made this possible, safety is our highest priority&#x201D;, reinforced Gary.

Congratulations to the entire team onshore, the professionals on board and FSO Rang Dong MV17 for this extraordinary achievement! &#x1F389;

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbemodec&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#bemodec</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsafetyfirst&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#safetyfirst</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fhsse&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#hsse</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foilandgas&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#oilandgas</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foffshore&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#offshore</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvietnam&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#vietnam</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fltifree&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#LTIfree</a>","time":"1w","title":"MODEC"},{"comments_count":26,"date":"2025-12-13T17:18:03.688Z","likes_count":594,"post_id":"7404949115651964929","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/modec-group_new-office-in-portugal-activity-7404949115651964929-B4d-","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"✨Unveiling a New Strategic Hub in Europe ✨ MODEC has inaugurated its Lisbon office – an important hub that amplifies regional capability, accelerates client value, and positions the company at the forefront of West Africa’s offshore energy future. 🚢🌊 💡Lisbon now serves as MODEC's strategic engineering hub, bringing together multidisciplinary teams to accelerate engineering and controls, enhance risk management through scenario planning and data insights, improve client engagement with closer proximity and transparent governance, support engineering efforts focused on achieving operational excellence for FPSOs, and foster the development of regional talent and local content for long-term impact. 🚀 📍The opening ceremony, on November 4th, was hosted by David Filho , Technical Manager at MODEC in Portugal, and was honored by the distinguished presences of our guests and partners as the Representative of Economic Affairs (Embassy of Japan in Portugal) and our client Woodside, represented by Paul Stevens and Izac Mascall. We also welcomed MODEC leaders — Katsuyuki Imaizumi (Group Chief Operating Officer), Gary Kennedy (President of MODEC Operations in Australia, New Zealand, Singapore, Ghana, Senegal, Ivory Coast, Vietnam and Portugal), Malcolm Watson (Country Manager, MODEC in Senegal), and José Carlos Nascimento Jr. (Operations Manager, MODEC in Senegal) — contributing to a dynamic, forward-looking dialogue. This is another decisive step in our long-term strategy to integrate global expertise with regional execution and development. 🤝 #bemodec #oilandgas #newoffice #lisbon #portugal #westafrica","text_html":"&#x2728;Unveiling a New Strategic Hub in Europe &#x2728;

MODEC has inaugurated its Lisbon office &#x2013; an important hub that amplifies regional capability, accelerates client value, and positions the company at the forefront of West Africa&#x2019;s offshore energy future. &#x1F6A2;&#x1F30A;

&#x1F4A1;Lisbon now serves as MODEC&apos;s strategic engineering hub, bringing together multidisciplinary teams to accelerate engineering and controls, enhance risk management through scenario planning and data insights, improve client engagement with closer proximity and transparent governance, support engineering efforts focused on achieving operational excellence for FPSOs, and foster the development of regional talent and local content for long-term impact. &#x1F680;

&#x1F4CD;The opening ceremony, on November 4th, was hosted by <a class="link" href="https://pt.linkedin.com/in/david-filho-77653130?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>David Filho</a>, Technical Manager at MODEC in Portugal, and was honored by the distinguished presences of our guests and partners as the Representative of Economic Affairs (Embassy of Japan in Portugal) and our client Woodside, represented by Paul Stevens and Izac Mascall. We also welcomed MODEC leaders &#x2014; Katsuyuki Imaizumi (Group Chief Operating Officer), Gary Kennedy (President of MODEC Operations in Australia, New Zealand, Singapore, Ghana, Senegal, Ivory Coast, Vietnam and Portugal), <a class="link" href="https://gh.linkedin.com/in/malcolm-watson-1b57589b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Malcolm Watson</a> (Country Manager, MODEC in Senegal), and <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/josenascimentojr?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jos&#xE9; Carlos Nascimento Jr.</a>  (Operations Manager, MODEC in Senegal) &#x2014; contributing to a dynamic, forward-looking dialogue.

This is another decisive step in our long-term strategy to integrate global expertise with regional execution and development.&#xA0;&#x1F91D;

&#xA0;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbemodec&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#bemodec</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foilandgas&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#oilandgas</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fnewoffice&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#newoffice</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Flisbon&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#lisbon</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fportugal&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#portugal</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fwestafrica&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#westafrica</a>","time":"2w","title":"MODEC"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-12-13T17:18:03.692Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQGqm0G2gkcawg/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4DZsJo1D6LkAo-/0/1765393256935?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=06s4pElG7XAiTWqv0c2vGdlbVWikokhkbBycI32zaTE"],"likes_count":103,"post_id":"7404596005847003136","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/modec-group_bemodec-oilandgas-offshore-activity-7404596005847003136-fgSj","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🌎 “Global Leading Player in Connecting Ocean and Humanity” – This is our Vision 2034, that outlines MODEC's long-term aspirations and is the foundation on which Mid-Term Business Plan 2024-2026 was formulated. ✨ We have identified six material issues as important sustainability-related challenges, that are categorized according to their characteristics as either “solutions for social issues,” “value creation” or “reinforcement of business foundation”, as shown in the image below. In order to achieve this vision, we are dedicated to contributing to society through our core FPSO business by balancing the stable supply of energy with the reduction of carbon dioxide emissions. 🚢🌊 Furthermore, we aim to leverage our unique floating and digital solutions to advance floating offshore wind, alternative energy and digital businesses, thereby supporting the realization of an environmentally friendly world. 🤝 We will also focus on expanding and strengthening our human capital to support these initiatives, while continuously enhancing our corporate culture. 👉 If you want to learn more about our Vision 2034 and Mid-Term Business Plan 2024-2026, read our Integrated Report 2024: https://lnkd.in/dZJMW8WM . . 🌎 “Líder Global na Conexão entre o Oceano e a Humanidade” – Esta é a nossa Visão 2034, que define as aspirações de longo prazo da MODEC e serve de base para a formulação do Mid-Term Business Plan 2024-2026. ✨ Identificamos seis questões materiais como importantes desafios relacionados à sustentabilidade, categorizadas de acordo com suas características como “soluções para problemas sociais”, “criação de valor” ou “fortalecimento da base do negócio”, conforme ilustrado na imagem abaixo. Para alcançar essa visão, estamos nos dedicando a contribuir para a sociedade por meio do nosso negócio principal de FPSO, equilibrando o fornecimento estável de energia com a redução das emissões de dióxido de carbono. 🚢🌊 Além disso, pretendemos alavancar nossas soluções flutuantes e digitais exclusivas para impulsionar a energia eólica offshore flutuante, energias alternativas e negócios digitais, apoiando assim a construção de um mundo ecologicamente mais correto. 🤝 Também nos concentraremos na expansão e no fortalecimento do nosso capital humano para apoiar essas iniciativas, enquanto aprimoramos continuamente nossa cultura corporativa. 👉 Se você quiser saber mais sobre nossa Visão 2034 e Plano de Negócios de Médio Prazo 2024-2026, leia nosso Relatório Integrado 2024: https://lnkd.in/dZJMW8WM #bemodec #oilandgas #offshore #energy #fpso #integratedreport #vision2034","text_html":"&#x1F30E; &#x201C;Global Leading Player in Connecting Ocean and Humanity&#x201D; &#x2013; This is our Vision 2034, that outlines MODEC&apos;s long-term aspirations and is the foundation on which Mid-Term Business Plan 2024-2026 was formulated. &#x2728;

We have identified six material issues as important sustainability-related challenges, that are categorized according to their characteristics as either &#x201C;solutions for social issues,&#x201D; &#x201C;value creation&#x201D; or &#x201C;reinforcement of business foundation&#x201D;, as shown in the image below.

In order to achieve this vision, we are dedicated to contributing to society through our core FPSO business by balancing the stable supply of energy with the reduction of carbon dioxide emissions. &#x1F6A2;&#x1F30A;

Furthermore, we aim to leverage our unique floating and digital solutions to advance floating offshore wind, alternative energy and digital businesses, thereby supporting the realization of an environmentally friendly world. &#x1F91D;

We will also focus on expanding and strengthening our human capital to support these initiatives, while continuously enhancing our corporate culture.

&#x1F449; If you want to learn more about our Vision 2034 and Mid-Term Business Plan 2024-2026, read our Integrated Report 2024: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dZJMW8WM?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dZJMW8WM</a>
.
.
&#x1F30E; &#x201C;L&#xED;der Global na Conex&#xE3;o entre o Oceano e a Humanidade&#x201D; &#x2013; Esta &#xE9; a nossa Vis&#xE3;o 2034, que define as aspira&#xE7;&#xF5;es de longo prazo da MODEC e serve de base para a formula&#xE7;&#xE3;o do Mid-Term Business Plan 2024-2026. &#x2728;

Identificamos seis quest&#xF5;es materiais como importantes desafios relacionados &#xE0; sustentabilidade, categorizadas de acordo com suas caracter&#xED;sticas como &#x201C;solu&#xE7;&#xF5;es para problemas sociais&#x201D;, &#x201C;cria&#xE7;&#xE3;o de valor&#x201D; ou &#x201C;fortalecimento da base do neg&#xF3;cio&#x201D;, conforme ilustrado na imagem abaixo.

Para alcan&#xE7;ar essa vis&#xE3;o, estamos nos dedicando a contribuir para a sociedade por meio do nosso neg&#xF3;cio principal de FPSO, equilibrando o fornecimento est&#xE1;vel de energia com a redu&#xE7;&#xE3;o das emiss&#xF5;es de di&#xF3;xido de carbono. &#x1F6A2;&#x1F30A;

Al&#xE9;m disso, pretendemos alavancar nossas solu&#xE7;&#xF5;es flutuantes e digitais exclusivas para impulsionar a energia e&#xF3;lica offshore flutuante, energias alternativas e neg&#xF3;cios digitais, apoiando assim a constru&#xE7;&#xE3;o de um mundo ecologicamente mais correto. &#x1F91D;

Tamb&#xE9;m nos concentraremos na expans&#xE3;o e no fortalecimento do nosso capital humano para apoiar essas iniciativas, enquanto aprimoramos continuamente nossa cultura corporativa.

&#x1F449; Se voc&#xEA; quiser saber mais sobre nossa Vis&#xE3;o 2034 e Plano de Neg&#xF3;cios de M&#xE9;dio Prazo 2024-2026, leia nosso Relat&#xF3;rio Integrado 2024: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dZJMW8WM?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dZJMW8WM</a>

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fbemodec&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#bemodec</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foilandgas&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#oilandgas</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Foffshore&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#offshore</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fenergy&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#energy</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Ffpso&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#fpso</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fintegratedreport&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#integratedreport</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fvision2034&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#vision2034</a>","time":"2w Edited","title":"MODEC"},{"comments_count":20,"date":"2025-12-06T17:18:03.696Z","likes_count":263,"post_id":"7402764322520621056","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/modec-group_modec-run-activity-7402764322520621056-eomH","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🏃Mais quilômetros em terra – Mais conexão entre times 💪 Em novembro, a MODEC Run levou mais uma vez o nosso espírito de superação e colaboração para as ruas do Rio de Janeiro e de Macaé. 👟 🏅 Mais do que cruzar a linha de chegada, a iniciativa representa qualidade de vida, promoção de saúde e orgulho de fazer parte do nosso time. Nas quatro etapas de 2025, foram quase 400 inscrições e 140 empregados participantes. Além dos já praticantes do esporte, tivemos empregados que participaram pela primeira vez de uma corrida de rua e outros que, motivados pelo apoio dos colegas, retomaram a prática esportiva após anos parados, consolidando a MODEC Run como uma experiência de promoção à saúde e integração entre os times. 💬 “Correr sempre foi um desejo que adiei por anos. Achei que não conseguiria, mas consegui completar o percurso e simplesmente amei. Contei com a companhia de uma colega da empresa, a Melina Leite Monteiro , em sua primeira corrida também. Fizemos o percurso juntas! Agora, busquei uma consultoria para preparar meus treinos e voltarei para a academia. A interação com colegas durante a prova foi ótima e muito divertida”, relatou Michella Cruz , Engenheira de Controle e Garantia de Qualidade da MODEC no Brasil. 👏 Parabéns a todos que correram! A cada edição, novas histórias e a certeza de que somos um time que se apoia e corre junto. 🫶🏃♂️🏃♀️ . . 🏃More kilometers on land – More connection between teams 💪 In November, the MODEC Run once again took our spirit of overcoming challenges and collaboration to the streets of Rio de Janeiro and Macaé. 👟 🏅 More than just crossing the finish line, the initiative represents quality of life, health promotion, and pride in being part of our team. In the four stages of 2025, there were almost 400 registrations and 140 participating employees. In addition to those already practicing the sport, we had employees who participated in a road race for the first time and others who, motivated by the support of their colleagues, resumed sports practice after years of inactivity, consolidating the MODEC Run as an experience that promotes health and integration between teams. 💬 “Running has always been a desire I postponed for years. I thought I wouldn't be able to do it, but I managed to complete the course, and I simply loved it. I had the company of a colleague from the company, Melina Leite Monteiro , in her first race as well. We did the course together! Now, I sought consulting to prepare my training, and I will return to the gym. The interaction with colleagues during the race was great and very fun,” reported Michella Cruz , Quality Control and Assurance Engineer at MODEC in Brazil. 👏 Congratulations to everyone who ran! In each edition, new stories and the certainty that we are a team that supports each other and runs together. 🫶🏃♂️🏃♀️ #bemodec #modecrun #saudebemestar #superação #colaboração","text_html":"&#x1F3C3;Mais quil&#xF4;metros em terra &#x2013; Mais conex&#xE3;o entre times&#xA0;&#x1F4AA; 

Em novembro, a MODEC Run levou mais uma vez o nosso esp&#xED;rito de supera&#xE7;&#xE3;o e colabora&#xE7;&#xE3;o para as ruas do Rio de Janeiro e de Maca&#xE9;. &#x1F45F;

&#x1F3C5; Mais do&#xA0;que&#xA0;cruzar&#xA0;a&#xA0;linha&#xA0;de&#xA0;chegada, a iniciativa representa qualidade de vida, promo&#xE7;&#xE3;o de sa&#xFA;de e orgulho&#xA0;de&#xA0;fazer&#xA0;parte&#xA0;do nosso time.&#xA0;Nas quatro etapas de 2025, foram quase 400 inscri&#xE7;&#xF5;es e 140 empregados participantes.

Al&#xE9;m dos j&#xE1; praticantes do esporte, tivemos empregados que participaram pela primeira vez de uma corrida de rua e outros que, motivados pelo apoio dos colegas, retomaram a pr&#xE1;tica esportiva ap&#xF3;s anos parados, consolidando a MODEC Run como uma experi&#xEA;ncia de promo&#xE7;&#xE3;o &#xE0; sa&#xFA;de e integra&#xE7;&#xE3;o entre os times.

&#x1F4AC; &#x201C;Correr sempre foi um desejo que adiei por anos. Achei que n&#xE3;o conseguiria, mas consegui completar o percurso e simplesmente amei. Contei com a companhia de uma colega da empresa, a <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/melina-leite-monteiro-70562022?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Melina Leite Monteiro</a>, em sua primeira corrida tamb&#xE9;m. Fizemos o percurso juntas! &#xA0;Agora, busquei uma consultoria para preparar meus treinos e voltarei para a academia. A intera&#xE7;&#xE3;o com colegas durante a prova foi &#xF3;tima e muito divertida&#x201D;, relatou <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/michella-cruz-40b6433b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michella Cruz</a>, Engenheira de Controle e Garantia de Qualidade da MODEC no Brasil.

&#x1F44F;&#xA0;Parab&#xE9;ns&#xA0;a&#xA0;todos&#xA0;que&#xA0;correram! A cada edi&#xE7;&#xE3;o, novas hist&#xF3;rias e a certeza de que somos um time que se apoia e corre junto. &#x1FAF6;&#x1F3C3;&#x2642;&#xFE0F;&#x1F3C3;&#x2640;&#xFE0F;
.
.
&#x1F3C3;More kilometers on land &#x2013; More connection between teams &#x1F4AA;

In November, the MODEC Run once again took our spirit of overcoming challenges and collaboration to the streets of Rio de Janeiro and Maca&#xE9;. &#x1F45F;

&#x1F3C5; More than just crossing the finish line, the initiative represents quality of life, health promotion, and pride in being part of our team. In the four stages of 2025, there were almost 400 registrations and 140 participating employees.

In addition to those already practicing the sport, we had employees who participated in a road race for the first time and others who, motivated by the support of their colleagues, resumed sports practice after years of inactivity, consolidating the MODEC Run as an experience that promotes health and integration between teams.

&#x1F4AC; &#x201C;Running has always been a desire I postponed for years. I thought I wouldn&apos;t be able to do it, but I managed to complete the course, and I simply loved it. I had the company of a colleague from the company, <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/melina-leite-monteiro-70562022?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Melina Leite Monteiro</a>, in her first race as well. We did the course together! Now, I sought consulting to prepare my training, and I will return to the gym. The interaction with colleagues during the race was great and very fun,&#x201D; reported <a class="link" href="https://br.linkedin.com/in/michella-cruz-40b6433b?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michella Cruz</a>, Quality Control and Assurance Engineer at MODEC in Brazil.

&#x1F44F; Congratulations to everyone who ran! In each edition, new stories and the certainty that we are a team that supports each other and runs together. &#x1FAF6;&#x1F3C3;&#x2642;&#xFE0F;&#x1F3C3;&#x2640;&#xFE0F;

