The ACTS Fire Safety Forum marked the official launch of our Reaction-to-Fire Testing section, bringing together industry leaders, partners, and experts to exchange knowledge and explore advancements in fire safety and material performance.

Through keynote talks, technical sessions, and meaningful discussions, the forum highlighted the importance of integrated fire testing solutions in supporting safer, compliant, and future-ready construction.

A sincere thank you to our speakers, partners, and all attendees who contributed to making this event impactful and memorable. Your engagement and collaboration continue to drive progress across the fire safety community.

