otball match. A meaningful milestone that reflects our shared commitment to growth, excellence, and teamwork across ACTS KSA. #BuildOnOurCredentials 🌐 www.acts-int.com #ACTS #AdvancedConstructionTechnologyServices #ACTSksa #ACTSleaders #ACTSteam #EmployeesEngagement #EmployeeActivity #ACTSlifestyle #SaudiArabia","text_html":"ACTS KSA Management Day

The ACTS KSA leadership team came together in Riyadh for a strategic management meeting focused on reviewing achievements, aligning priorities, and shaping the roadmap for 2026 and beyond.

The day fostered open dialogue, collaboration, and forward-looking discussions that reflect the strength of our people and the unity of our vision. We concluded the gathering on a high note, reinforcing team spirit and connection through an engaging football match.

A meaningful milestone that reflects our shared commitment to growth, excellence, and teamwork across ACTS KSA.

