om/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Femployeeactivity&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#EmployeeActivity</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Factslifestyle&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#ACTSlifestyle</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fsaudiarabia&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#SaudiArabia</a>","time":"2w","title":"Advanced Construction Technology Services (ACTS)"},{"comments_count":2,"date":"2025-07-25T09:56:07.345Z","likes_count":11,"post_id":"7406662447421579268","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/acts-int_were-proud-to-support-professionals-who-activity-7406662447421579268-q2ct","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":"2025-12-12T09:56:07.345Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["3w"],"repost_id":"7404852854819037185","repost_text":"I’m happy to share that I’ve obtained a new certification: Quality Concrete and Related Field Practices from Advanced Construction Technology Services (ACTS) !","repost_title":"Rayan Sarwar, CAPM®","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://lb.linkedin.com/company/acts-int?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Advanced Construction Technology Services (ACTS)"}],"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We’re proud to support professionals who are committed to advancing their expertise in quality concrete practices.","text_html":"We&#x2019;re proud to support professionals who are committed to advancing their expertise in quality concrete practices.","time":"2w 3w","title":"Advanced Construction Technology Services (ACTS)"},{"comments_count":10,"date":"2025-12-19T09:56:07.354Z","likes_count":247,"post_id":"7406642130582089728","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/acts-int_acts-fire-safety-forum-activity-7406642130582089728-u3QG","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A Milestone for Fire Safety in the Kingdom We are proud to mark a significant milestone with the successful hosting of the acts Fire Safety Forum, alongside the official launch of the Reaction-to-Fire section at the acts Fire Testing Laboratory — the first of its kind in Saudi Arabia. The forum brought together industry leaders, experts, and practitioners to exchange knowledge, showcase advanced technologies, and discuss critical topics shaping the future of fire safety and compliance in the Kingdom. This achievement reflects acts’ ongoing commitment to advancing safety, compliance, innovation, and technical excellence within the construction and materials industry. A special thank you to Eng. Khaled Awad, Chairman & CEO of acts, for his inspiring opening remarks, and to our distinguished speakers for their valuable insights and contributions: * Eng. HUSSAIN ZANOON – Alian Industry | إليان للصناعة * Eng. Ali Musabih, MSc, CFPS®, CFPE, CFI-I, CFI-II – Jensen Hughes * Eng. Muhammad Asif Aslam – TechnoFiber | Technical Factory for FRP Products * Eng. Nawras Rimawi – Jazeera Paints We also extend our sincere appreciation to all partners, engineers, clients, and colleagues who joined us and contributed to making the acts Fire Safety Forum a remarkable success. Together, we continue to elevate fire safety standards across Saudi Arabia and the gcc. Thank you for being part of this journey. #BuildOnOurCredentials 🌐 www.acts-int.com #ACTS #AdvancedConstructionTechnologyServices #FireSafetyForum #FireTesting #ReactionToFire #SaudiArabia #SafetyStandards #ConstructionInnovation #EngineeringExcellence","text_html":"A Milestone for Fire Safety in the Kingdom

We are proud to mark a significant milestone with the successful hosting of the acts Fire Safety Forum, alongside the official launch of the Reaction-to-Fire section at the acts Fire Testing Laboratory &#x2014; the first of its kind in Saudi Arabia.

The forum brought together industry leaders, experts, and practitioners to exchange knowledge, showcase advanced technologies, and discuss critical topics shaping the future of fire safety and compliance in the Kingdom.

This achievement reflects acts&#x2019; ongoing commitment to advancing safety, compliance, innovation, and technical excellence within the construction and materials industry.

A special thank you to Eng. Khaled Awad, Chairman &amp; CEO of acts, for his inspiring opening remarks, and to our distinguished speakers for their valuable insights and contributions:

* Eng. HUSSAIN ZANOON &#x2013; Alian Industry | &#x625;&#x644;&#x64A;&#x627;&#x646; &#x644;&#x644;&#x635;&#x646;&#x627;&#x639;&#x629;
* Eng. Ali Musabih, MSc, CFPS&#xAE;, CFPE, CFI-I, CFI-II &#x2013; Jensen Hughes
* Eng. Muhammad Asif Aslam &#x2013; TechnoFiber | Technical Factory for FRP Products
* Eng. Nawras Rimawi &#x2013; Jazeera Paints

We also extend our sincere appreciation to all partners, engineers, clients, and colleagues who joined us and contributed to making the acts Fire Safety Forum a remarkable success.

Together, we continue to elevate fire safety standards across Saudi Arabia and the gcc.

Thank you for being part of this journey.

