company_description:
EQ Tech | 116 followers on LinkedIn. Serviços personalizados e soluções de qualidade para o seu negócio! | A EQ Tech assume o compromisso de entregar a melhor solução a cada um de seus clientes, oferecendo serviços personalizados de acordo com a necessidade do perfil, implementando melhorias e impulsionando o seu negócio através dos projetos que entregamos.

Nosso corpo de consultores é formado exclusivamente por alunos de graduação em Engenharia Química da Universidade Federal de Mato Grosso, e a Empresa Júnior conta com alguns diferenciais, como: 
• Preço inferior em relação ao do mercado sênior; 
• Escopos flexíveis às necessidades do cliente; 
• Conhecimento de curso multidisciplinar;
• Qualidade técnica de professores doutores da universidade.

Agende sua reunião conosco!

company_updates:
[{"date":"2021-06-27T12:34:51.359Z","likes_count":5,"post_id":"7355930648932425728","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/b-flexion_great-to-have-you-with-us-louis-activity-7355930648932425728-yf57","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":"2025-08-05T12:34:51.359Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["5mo"],"repost_id":"7355545007535050759","repost_text":"I recently completed an incredible 5 week internship experience with B-FLEXION that offered me exposure to a wide spectrum of investment strategies and operational functions within the firm. I had a flexible role whilst I was there, but I worked closely with the group accounting team under Steven, where I supported various tasks ranging from Excel-based financial analysis to document creation and reporting - a great opportunity for myself to build technical and operational skills. I developed and presented a liquidity event proposal, which allowed me to explore strategic financial planning and sharpen my presentation skills. Additionally, I gained hands-on exposure to Private Equity, Hedge Funds, Venture Capital, Real Estate and Principal Direct Investments, deepening my understanding of how capital is allocated across diverse asset classes. I also attended multiple meetings with investment partnerships, which provided valuable insights into how investment decisions are made and how relationships are managed across their financial services. This internship has not only broadened my knowledge of the firm’s hybrid structure but also helped me develop a more holistic view of how different teams collaborate to drive value. A huge thank you to the team at B-Flexion and Anu for the guidance, support, and opportunities throughout the internship. Excited to take these learnings forward into my next chapter!","repost_title":"Louis Kelly","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Great to have you with us Louis!","text_html":"Great to have you with us Louis!","time":"5mo 5mo","title":"B-FLEXION"},{"date":"2025-08-05T12:34:51.362Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFMHmNeY_cQkA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZhNxeyzHoAk-/0/1753651476843?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=yOixSyh_EDsNoivguTMzqZfvz2JI1MKfZMe8DefVo6Q"],"likes_count":51,"post_id":"7355347407418662912","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/b-flexion_our-b-flexion-team-in-jersey-were-recently-activity-7355347407418662912-5vhF","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Our B-FLEXION team in Jersey were recently delighted to welcome guests to a seminar – the first in a series of events – at which our Group CTO, Graham Kellen , presented on ‘An overview of AI and IT technological developments impacting the global Fund Industry.’ Thank you to Graham for providing his insights into the challenges the industry is facing globally (and what firms can do to address them), as well as, of course the wonderful audience, and the B-FLEXION team in Jersey for hosting.","text_html":"Our B-FLEXION team in Jersey were recently delighted to welcome guests to a seminar &#x2013; the first in a series of events &#x2013; at which our Group CTO, <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/graham-kellen-8302551?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Graham Kellen</a>, presented on &#x2018;An overview of AI and IT technological developments impacting the global Fund Industry.&#x2019;
&#xA0;
Thank you to Graham for providing his insights into the challenges the industry is facing globally (and what firms can do to address them), as well as, of course the wonderful audience, and the B-FLEXION team in Jersey for hosting.","time":"5mo Edited","title":"B-FLEXION"},{"comments_count":11,"date":"2025-08-05T12:34:51.366Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGoOoRVYVoc4g/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZgONKLcHEAo-/0/1752585002502?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=0t3ylVUDkvYdJzjc21-6rACPLM_1tEZWItwWyFjoRN4"],"likes_count":128,"post_id":"7351187308357816321","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7350895167916158978-sN6s","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🚀 Today, we’re proud to lead Datavations ’ $17M Series A, alongside Morpheus Ventures , as well as existing investors Sage Venture Partners , and NevCaut Ventures . 💡 From our very first conversation, it was clear Philip , Jacob and the Datavations team were tackling a massive and overlooked opportunity. 🏗️ With Datavations , they’ve built a category-defining #Data & #AI platform for the $2.3 trillion Building Materials industry — delivering real-time, actionable insights to sales, pricing, and supply chain teams by processing over 600GB of data every day. 👏 A big congratulations to the team — from all of us at Forestay Capital . We’re just getting started !!💥 🔗 Link to press release in comments below 👇","text_html":"&#x1F680; Today, we&#x2019;re proud to lead <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavations?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Datavations</a>&#x2019; $17M Series A, alongside <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/morpheus-ventures?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Morpheus Ventures</a>, as well as existing investors <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/sage-venture-partners?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Sage Venture Partners</a>, and <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/nevcaut-ventures?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>NevCaut Ventures</a>.

&#x1F4A1; From our very first conversation, it was clear <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/philipodelfelt?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Philip</a>, <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacob-r-rlucas?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Jacob</a> and the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavations?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Datavations</a> team were tackling a massive and overlooked opportunity.

&#x1F3D7;&#xFE0F; With <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/datavations?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Datavations</a>, they&#x2019;ve built a category-defining <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fdata&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Data</a> &amp; <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fai&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#AI</a> platform for the $2.3 trillion Building Materials industry &#x2014; delivering real-time, actionable insights to sales, pricing, and supply chain teams by processing over 600GB of data every day.

&#x1F44F; A big congratulations to the team &#x2014; from all of us at <a class="link" href="https://ch.linkedin.com/company/forestay-capital?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Forestay Capital</a>. 
We&#x2019;re just getting started !!&#x1F4A5;

&#x1F517; Link to press release in comments below &#x1F447; ","time":"5mo Edited","title":"Forestay Capital"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2019-09-06T12:34:51.369Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHymzo364l3Xw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZby_AXFHAAg-/0/1747833325376?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eKl1NsBjmKbyDcFS79pbQpxjirfcFcQkrdZCW9xlhp8"],"likes_count":38,"post_id":"7330949749887365121","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/b-flexion_fantastic-news-and-congratulations-to-the-activity-7330949749887365121-MdPU","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHymzo364l3Xw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZby_AXFHAAg-/0/1747833325376?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=eKl1NsBjmKbyDcFS79pbQpxjirfcFcQkrdZCW9xlhp8"],"repost_date":"2025-06-06T12:34:51.369Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["20,734 followers"],"repost_id":"7330944312135856129","repost_text":"Paratek’s acquisition of Optinose closed today. This is a pivotal first step in achieving our long-term vision to become a multi‑product specialty therapeutics company, focused on addressing significant unmet medical needs. Read today’s news here: https://bit.ly/4361pvO","repost_title":"Paratek Pharmaceuticals","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Fantastic news and congratulations to the team at Paratek Pharmaceuticals , a portfolio investment company of B-Flexion Life Sciences, as they deservedly celebrate today’s completion of the acquisition of Optinose, heralding the start of a new era as a multi-product company.","text_html":"Fantastic news and congratulations to the team at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/paratek-pharmaceuticals-inc-?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Paratek Pharmaceuticals</a>, a portfolio investment company of B-Flexion Life Sciences, as they deservedly celebrate today&#x2019;s completion of the acquisition of Optinose, heralding the start of a new era as a multi-product company.
&#xA0;
&#xA0;","time":"7mo 7mo","title":"B-FLEXION"},{"comments_count":17,"date":"2025-06-06T12:34:51.372Z","likes_count":204,"post_id":"7328410954663145472","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7328410954663145472/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We are proud to announce that today we have entered into an agreement with GSK to acquire our lead investigational asset, efimosfermin alfa, for the treatment of MASH. GSK will pay $1.2 billion upfront, with the potential for additional success-based milestone payments totaling up to $800 million. We are so grateful to the Boston Pharmaceuticals team, who focused on our mission to develop efimosfermin with a great sense of urgency. Read more: https://lnkd.in/eDzuPSCG","text_html":"We are proud to announce that today we have entered into an agreement with <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/gsk?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>GSK</a> to acquire our lead investigational asset, efimosfermin alfa, for the treatment of MASH. GSK will pay $1.2 billion upfront, with the potential for additional success-based milestone payments totaling up to $800 million.

We are so grateful to the Boston Pharmaceuticals team, who focused on our mission to develop efimosfermin with a great sense of urgency.

