","time":"9mo 9mo","title":"B-FLEXION"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-04-07T12:34:51.383Z","likes_count":159,"post_id":"7308423124293746688","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7308423124293746688/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"I’m excited to share a major milestone for Paratek with the announcement of the acquisition of Optinose! This transformative deal strengthens Paratek’s commercial footprint and, as a combined entity, builds a strong foundation for long-term growth. Congratulations to the entire Paratek team on your leadership and incredible success as we grew the organization to where it is today ensuring we are poised to support the momentum of this new opportunity. I look forward to what’s ahead as we continue this journey together! https://lnkd.in/eVNyW3Yt","text_html":"I&#x2019;m excited to share a major milestone for Paratek with the announcement of the acquisition of Optinose!&#xA0;This transformative deal strengthens Paratek&#x2019;s commercial footprint and, as a combined entity, builds a strong foundation for long-term growth.&#xA0;Congratulations to the entire Paratek team on your leadership and incredible success as we grew the organization to where it is today ensuring we are poised to support the momentum of this new opportunity.&#xA0;I look forward to what&#x2019;s ahead as we continue this journey together!

<a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eVNyW3Yt?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eVNyW3Yt</a>","time":"9mo Edited","title":"Nithya Desikan","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQGgPgfceyUHWw/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZWxPW.cHMBc-/0/1742435350377?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=MvEnvUSprr1V7VtIBuTpZljDw-7fKiwGu069_iF4itA"]},{"comments_count":8,"date":"2025-03-08T12:34:51.384Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQH7g84FFoF4mQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZVgPDSOGYB8-/0/1741076313928?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ch8C4Lh2Wo2MTaRBNP_PsaEEnEcPXXlKoOkiyiKMvro"],"likes_count":201,"post_id":"7302607653602578432","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7302603351605542914-DC2o","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Stallergenes Greer announces the appointment of Andreas Amrein as Chief Executive Officer, with effect from April 1, 2025. After more than 10 years with the company, Michele Antonelli is retiring and will step down from his role as Chief Executive Officer at the end of March 2025. “We are delighted to welcome Andreas Amrein as Chief Executive Officer of Stallergenes Greer. He joins our company at a time of strong opportunity for continued expansion and development within allergy therapeutics, building on the excellent platform of capabilities within the firm. Andreas is a dynamic business leader with a proven track record of driving growth. His strategic vision, strong focus on execution and delivery, and extensive international experience will be key in leading Stallergenes Greer and its people through its next stage of development. We look forward to working with Andreas to realise Stallergenes Greer’s full potential and deliver sustainable value for all our stakeholders,” said Cyrus Jilla, Chairman of the Board of Directors. “On behalf of the Board of Directors, I would like to extend my deepest thanks to Michele Antonelli for successfully steering Stallergenes Greer through a significant transformation period, while laying strong foundations for the future,” concluded Cyrus Jilla. Andreas Amrein has more than 25 years of experience in the pharmaceutical industry and, at companies such as Novartis, Abbott and Shire Takeda, has accrued significant expertise in commercial leadership, finance, strategic planning, and business development across a variety of therapeutic areas and geographies. Since 2021, he has been a member of the Global Leadership Team and Managing Director at Advanced Clinical, a global contract research organisation. “I am honoured to have the opportunity to lead Stallergenes Greer, a pioneer in allergen immunotherapy with a strong global footprint and an unwavering commitment to patient care. I thank the Board of Directors for the trust placed in me and am excited to start working with the company’s talented teams and build on their success as we embark on a new chapter,” stated Andreas Amrein. Read the full press release here: https://lnkd.in/e3ujg5DT","text_html":"Stallergenes Greer announces the appointment of Andreas Amrein as Chief Executive Officer, with effect from April 1, 2025. After more than 10 years with the company, Michele Antonelli is retiring and will step down from his role as Chief Executive Officer at the end of March 2025. 

&#xA0;&#x201C;We are delighted to welcome Andreas Amrein as Chief Executive Officer of Stallergenes Greer. He joins our company at a time of strong opportunity for continued expansion and development within allergy therapeutics, building on the excellent platform of capabilities within the firm. Andreas is a dynamic business leader with a proven track record of driving growth. His strategic vision, strong focus on execution and delivery, and extensive international experience will be key in leading Stallergenes Greer and its people through its next stage of development. We look forward to working with Andreas to realise Stallergenes Greer&#x2019;s full potential and deliver sustainable value for all our stakeholders,&#x201D; said Cyrus Jilla, Chairman of the Board of Directors. 
&#xA0;
&#x201C;On behalf of the Board of Directors, I would like to extend my deepest thanks to Michele Antonelli for successfully steering Stallergenes Greer through a significant transformation period, while laying strong foundations for the future,&#x201D; concluded Cyrus Jilla. 
&#xA0;
Andreas Amrein has more than 25 years of experience in the pharmaceutical industry and, at companies such as Novartis, Abbott and Shire Takeda, has accrued significant expertise in commercial leadership, finance, strategic planning, and business development across a variety of therapeutic areas and geographies. Since 2021, he has been a member of the Global Leadership Team and Managing Director at Advanced Clinical, a global contract research organisation. 
&#xA0;
&#x201C;I am honoured to have the opportunity to lead Stallergenes Greer, a pioneer in allergen immunotherapy with a strong global footprint and an unwavering commitment to patient care. I thank the Board of Directors for the trust placed in me and am excited to start working with the company&#x2019;s talented teams and build on their success as we embark on a new chapter,&#x201D; stated Andreas Amrein.
&#xA0;
Read the full press release here: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/e3ujg5DT?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/e3ujg5DT</a>","time":"10mo","title":"Stallergenes Greer"}]

[{"date":"2025-12-25T16:57:28.592Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E10AQGAZdjgrqWkzA/image-shrink_1280/B4EZtUhnZQJ0Ac-/0/1766649657187?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=4d_MhxBWGUU-l2nogjtNcRQH7yMnSnESnw6Mn7UIVjU"],"likes_count":5,"post_id":"7409865727450664960","post_url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/posts/curando-vzw_curando-kerstmis-kerstwensen-activity-7409865727450664960-uh4H","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Curando wenst jou en je dierbaren een Kerstmis vol warmte en verbondenheid, met veel licht en liefde en een diep gevoel van vrede. We willen jou in deze bijzondere tijd van het jaar danken voor wie je bent en wat je betekent. We wensen dat jij voor anderen steeds meer mag zijn: zoals de engelen die licht en troost brengen aan wie het moeilijk heeft, met een glimlach, een woord, een gebaar; zoals de herders, die met eenvoud en toewijding anderen nabij zijn en die zich verwonderen over de kleine goedheid van elke dag; zoals de wijzen, die met geduld en inzicht een (uit)weg vinden en die met zorg en liefde hun gaven delen; zoals Jozef, die beschermt, ondersteunt en in stilte present is; zoals Maria, die in vertrouwen en met overgave het leven omarmt, die liefde uitstraalt en die de hoop voedt; en ja, ook een beetje zoals Jezus, die Gods menslievendheid en barmhartigheid onder de mensen bracht. Zalig Kerstmis en een voorspoedig 2026. De illustratie werd gemaakt voor Elineveer #curando #kerstmis #kerstwensen #zorgdiejevoelt","text_html":"Curando wenst jou en je dierbaren een Kerstmis vol warmte en verbondenheid, met veel licht en liefde en een diep gevoel van vrede. We willen jou in deze bijzondere tijd van het jaar danken voor wie je bent en wat je betekent.

We wensen dat jij voor anderen steeds meer mag zijn:
zoals de engelen die licht en troost brengen aan wie het moeilijk heeft, met een glimlach, een woord, een gebaar;
zoals de herders, die met eenvoud en toewijding anderen nabij zijn en die zich verwonderen over de kleine goedheid van elke dag;
zoals de wijzen, die met geduld en inzicht een (uit)weg vinden en die met zorg en liefde hun gaven delen;
zoals Jozef, die beschermt, ondersteunt en in stilte present is;
zoals Maria, die in vertrouwen en met overgave het leven omarmt, die liefde uitstraalt en die de hoop voedt;
en ja, ook een beetje zoals Jezus, die Gods menslievendheid en barmhartigheid onder de mensen bracht.

Zalig Kerstmis en een voorspoedig 2026.

De illustratie werd gemaakt voor Elineveer <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcurando&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#curando</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkerstmis&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#kerstmis</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fkerstwensen&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#kerstwensen</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fzorgdiejevoelt&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#zorgdiejevoelt</a>","time":"5d","title":"vzw Curando"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-12-16T16:57:28.597Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG7uNwpLLuCZQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZsRsAqOIMAs-/0/1765528308904?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=jrDnwdigNj4HIi9Oei-letawVszvnq3x-33q8CyebVQ"],"likes_count":10,"post_id":"7405162452629217280","post_url":"https://nl.linkedin.com/posts/curando-vzw_curando-curando-watistplan-activity-7405162452629217280-99No","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🧶 Brei mee voor Wat is't plan? 🪢 Naast de nationale Koffieklets als protest op de besparingen van de Vlaamse regering in de ouderenzorg, nodigen we vandaag ook iedereen uit om samen te breien. Verschillende locaties van #Curando werken mee aan een lange sjaal als symbool dat we in de zorg elke dag de eindjes aan elkaar moeten knopen. 👉 Iedereen is welkom om een lapje van 35 steken breed mee te breien: bezoekers, familie, medewerkers, vrijwilligers, buren… 💛 Wie mee breit, krijgt een gratis koffie, thee of chocomelk! #Curando #WatIstPlan #BreienVoorDeZorg #Koffieklets #Protest #besparingen","text_html":"&#x1F9F6; Brei mee voor Wat is&apos;t plan? &#x1FAA2;

Naast de nationale Koffieklets als protest op de besparingen van de Vlaamse regering in de ouderenzorg, nodigen we vandaag ook iedereen uit om samen te breien.

Verschillende locaties van <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcurando&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#Curando</a> werken mee aan een lange sjaal als symbool dat we in de zorg elke dag de eindjes aan elkaar moeten knopen. 

&#x1F449; Iedereen is welkom om een lapje van 35 steken breed mee te breien: bezoekers, familie, medewerkers, vrijwilligers, buren&#x2026;

&#x1F49B; Wie mee breit, krijgt een gratis koffie, thee of chocomelk!

