t_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"This holiday season, members of our Talent Acquisition team took time to serve their communities, ringing bells for the The Salvation Army , volunteering at FOOD BANK OF THE ALBEMARLE , and sorting toys at ForKids, inc. in Chesapeake.🎄💙 Their volunteer work is a wonderful example of how giving back can bring joy and make a difference during the holiday season. ✨ #SentaraCares","text_html":"This holiday season, members of our Talent Acquisition team took time to serve their communities, ringing bells for the <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/salvationarmyus?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>The Salvation Army</a>, volunteering at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/food-bank-of-the-albemarle?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>FOOD BANK OF THE ALBEMARLE</a>, and sorting toys at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/forkidsva?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ForKids, inc.</a> in Chesapeake.&#x1F384;&#x1F499;

