d to celebrate the launch of our brand-new route linking Moncton to Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l'aéroport international d'Ottawa YOW . Business leaders, government partners, and leisure travellers now have a direct link between New Brunswick and Canada’s capital, daily, year-round. A huge thank‑you to our partners at Greater Moncton Roméo LeBlanc Int'l Airport / Aéroport int. Roméo-LeBlanc du Grand Moncton (YQM) and in the Moncton community for making this launch unforgettable!","text_html":"Nous sommes ravis d&apos;avoir c&#xE9;l&#xE9;br&#xE9; le lancement de notre nouvelle liaison reliant Moncton &#xE0; <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/yow-ottawa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l&apos;a&#xE9;roport international d&apos;Ottawa YOW</a>.
&#xA0;
Les voyageurs d&#x2019;affaires, les partenaires gouvernementaux et les voyageurs d&#x2019;agr&#xE9;ment profitent d&#xE9;sormais d&#x2019;un lien direct tous les jours de l&#x2019;ann&#xE9;e entre le Nouveau-Brunswick et la capitale du Canada.
&#xA0;
Un grand merci &#xE0; nos partenaires &#xE0; <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/monctonyqm?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Greater Moncton Rom&#xE9;o LeBlanc Int&apos;l Airport / A&#xE9;roport int. Rom&#xE9;o-LeBlanc du Grand Moncton (YQM)</a>) et &#xE0; ceux au sein de la collectivit&#xE9; de Moncton d&#x2019;avoir fait de ce lancement un moment inoubliable.

//

We were thrilled to celebrate the launch of our brand-new route linking Moncton to <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/yow-ottawa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l&apos;a&#xE9;roport international d&apos;Ottawa YOW</a>.
&#xA0;
Business leaders, government partners, and leisure travellers now have a direct link between New Brunswick and Canada&#x2019;s capital, daily, year-round.
&#xA0;
A huge thank&#x2011;you to our partners at <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/monctonyqm?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Greater Moncton Rom&#xE9;o LeBlanc Int&apos;l Airport / A&#xE9;roport int. Rom&#xE9;o-LeBlanc du Grand Moncton (YQM)</a> and in the Moncton community for making this launch unforgettable!","time":"2w","title":"Air Canada"},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-12-22T00:01:12.987Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHShAzMU4j-cQ/feedshare-shrink_1280/B4EZstne76HMAs-/0/1765996884064?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=L-3TaIZ66pScQnaQ2SIswtdzwo7U45WjjGJ_2prtDXs","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHJow_UJJtzXg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZstne7pGcAg-/0/1765996884093?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=7c0y_24lhCNT5LMgSUQ8VdRaB1lfuy7yeIGvGCbY-z8"],"likes_count":146,"post_id":"7407127802002710528","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/air-canada_earlier-this-week-we-celebrated-the-launch-activity-7407127802002710528-Vi8L","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Earlier this week, we celebrated the launch of our new service from Fredericton to Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l'aéroport international d'Ottawa YOW ! This new route connects New Brunswick’s capital to Canada’s capital daily, year-round, making travel for business, government, and leisure more convenient than ever. The launch event at Fredericton International Airport Authority was a wonderful way to mark this milestone, and we’re excited to continue strengthening connections across the country. // Plus tôt cette semaine, nous avons célébré le lancement de notre nouveau service de Fredericton à Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l'aéroport international d'Ottawa YOW . Cette nouvelle liaison relie tous les jours de l’année la capitale du Nouveau-Brunswick à celle du Canada, rendant le voyage professionnel et d’agrément plus facile que jamais. L’événement de lancement à Fredericton International Airport Authority était une merveilleuse façon de souligner cette étape importante, et nous sommes ravis de continuer à renforcer les liens partout au pays.","text_html":"Earlier this week, we celebrated the launch of our new service from Fredericton to <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/yow-ottawa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l&apos;a&#xE9;roport international d&apos;Ottawa YOW</a>!
&#xA0;
This new route connects New Brunswick&#x2019;s capital to Canada&#x2019;s capital daily, year-round, making travel for business, government, and leisure more convenient than ever.
&#xA0;
The launch event at <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/fredericton-international-airport-authority-inc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Fredericton International Airport Authority</a> was a wonderful way to mark this milestone, and we&#x2019;re excited to continue strengthening connections across the country.

//

Plus t&#xF4;t cette semaine, nous avons c&#xE9;l&#xE9;br&#xE9; le lancement de notre nouveau service de Fredericton &#xE0; <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/yow-ottawa?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ottawa International Airport Authority YOW / Administration de l&apos;a&#xE9;roport international d&apos;Ottawa YOW</a>.
&#xA0;
Cette nouvelle liaison relie tous les jours de l&#x2019;ann&#xE9;e la capitale du Nouveau-Brunswick &#xE0; celle du Canada, rendant le voyage professionnel et d&#x2019;agr&#xE9;ment plus facile que jamais.
&#xA0;
L&#x2019;&#xE9;v&#xE9;nement de lancement &#xE0; <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/fredericton-international-airport-authority-inc?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Fredericton International Airport Authority</a> &#xE9;tait une merveilleuse fa&#xE7;on de souligner cette &#xE9;tape importante, et nous sommes ravis de continuer &#xE0; renforcer les liens partout au pays.","time":"2w Edited","title":"Air Canada"},{"comments_count":10,"date":"2025-12-22T00:01:12.997Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFlWO2KYDedmw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZss0XWnKMAg-/0/1765983484961?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Lw5GOQZh9ymKzesKy_Kj5EpOskcvebqFxFium4TXLWM","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQESGfrvVIf02Q/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZss0XWIHgAg-/0/1765983485943?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=KOj1tW_cAdYqbdRCI0m7pTkeJzGISixOP0ZLjDrHkwA","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFgAz9YFi3IFQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZss0XX.IoAk-/0/1765983486680?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=mg4mNE9oWSnDg8KZ812tDCLoZW1xoVLR-ZZvnhG0MDo"],"likes_count":308,"post_id":"7407071608059670529","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/air-canada_toute-une-c%C3%A9l%C3%A9bration-hier-nous-avons-activity-7407071608059670529-H2hy","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Toute une célébration! Hier, nous avons souligné un important jalon lors d’une célébration à la porte d’embarquement d’ ADM Aéroports de Montréal d’où partait notre vol inaugural à destination de Aeropuerto Santiago de Chile . Passagers, invités de marque, partenaires et employés se sont joints aux célébrations, toutes en musique, en petites bouchées et en sourires à profusion. Nous tenons à remercier tout particulièrement Yves Beauchamp , président-directeur général d’Aéroports de Montréal, Soraya Martinez Ferrada , mairesse de Montréal, Son Excellence Juan Carlos García Pérez de Arce , ambassadeur de la République du Chili au Canada, Felipe Orellana , consul général du Chili à Montréal et Manuela Goya , Vice-présidente, Développement de la destination et affaires publiques chez Tourisme Montréal d’avoir accepté notre invitation. Ce nouvel itinéraire nous permettra de relier cultures et familles, en plus d’ouvrir la voie à de nouvelles aventures. De nous tous à Air Canada : bienvenido a bordo, bienvenue à bord, welcome on board! ADM Aéroports de Montréal , Chamber of Commerce of Metropolitan Montreal , Conseil du patronat du Québec , Tourisme Montréal , Erandi Motte Cortés , Michelle LLambías Meunier // What a celebration! Yesterday, we marked a special milestone with a lively gate event at ADM Aéroports de Montréal to inaugurate our very first flight to Aeropuerto Santiago de Chile . Our passengers, partners and employees gathered to celebrate with music, treats, and plenty of smiles. A special thank you to Yves Beauchamp , President and CEO of Montreal Airports, Soraya Martinez Ferrada , Montreal's mayor, His Excellency Juan Carlos García Pérez de Arce , Ambassador of the Republic of Chile in Canada, Felipe Orellana , Consulate General of Chile in Montreal and Manuela Goya , from Tourisme Montréal for accepting our invitation. Thanks to this new route, we’re connecting cultures, families, and adventures. And from all of us: bienvenido a bordo, welcome on board, bienvenue à bord! ADM Aéroports de Montréal , Chamber of Commerce of Metropolitan Montreal , Conseil du patronat du Québec , Tourisme Montréal , Erandi Motte Cortés , Michelle LLambías Meunier","text_html":"Toute une c&#xE9;l&#xE9;bration!

Hier, nous avons soulign&#xE9; un important jalon lors d&#x2019;une c&#xE9;l&#xE9;bration &#xE0; la porte d&#x2019;embarquement d&#x2019;<a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/adm-aeroports-de-montreal?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ADM A&#xE9;roports de Montr&#xE9;al</a> d&#x2019;o&#xF9; partait notre vol inaugural &#xE0; destination de <a class="link" href="https://cl.linkedin.com/company/aeropuerto-santiago?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Aeropuerto Santiago de Chile</a>.

Passagers, invit&#xE9;s de marque, partenaires et employ&#xE9;s se sont joints aux c&#xE9;l&#xE9;brations, toutes en musique, en petites bouch&#xE9;es et en sourires &#xE0; profusion.
&#xA0;
Nous tenons &#xE0; remercier tout particuli&#xE8;rement <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/yves-beauchamp-5ab82110/en?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Yves Beauchamp</a>, pr&#xE9;sident-directeur g&#xE9;n&#xE9;ral d&#x2019;A&#xE9;roports de Montr&#xE9;al, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/sorayamartinezferrada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Soraya Martinez Ferrada</a>, mairesse de Montr&#xE9;al, Son Excellence <a class="link" href="https://cl.linkedin.com/in/juan-carlos-garc%C3%ADa-p%C3%A9rez-de-arce-32a11b2a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Juan Carlos Garc&#xED;a P&#xE9;rez de Arce</a>, ambassadeur de la R&#xE9;publique du Chili au Canada, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/felipe-orellana-650344163?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Felipe Orellana</a>, consul g&#xE9;n&#xE9;ral du Chili &#xE0; Montr&#xE9;al et <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/manuela-goya-ab80b379?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Manuela Goya</a>, Vice-pr&#xE9;sidente, D&#xE9;veloppement de la destination et affaires publiques chez Tourisme Montr&#xE9;al d&#x2019;avoir accept&#xE9; notre invitation.

Ce nouvel itin&#xE9;raire nous permettra de relier cultures et familles, en plus d&#x2019;ouvrir la voie &#xE0; de nouvelles aventures. De nous tous &#xE0; Air Canada&#xA0;: bienvenido a bordo, bienvenue &#xE0; bord, welcome on board!
&#xA0;
<a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/adm-aeroports-de-montreal?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ADM A&#xE9;roports de Montr&#xE9;al</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/chambre-de-commerce-du-montreal-metropolitain?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Chamber of Commerce of Metropolitan Montreal</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/conseil-du-patronat-du-qu-bec?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Conseil du patronat du Qu&#xE9;bec</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/tourisme-montreal?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Tourisme Montr&#xE9;al</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/erandimottecortes/en?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Erandi Motte Cort&#xE9;s</a>, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/michelle-llamb%C3%ADas-meunier-03955835?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Michelle LLamb&#xED;as Meunier</a>

//

What a celebration!&#xA0;

Yesterday, we marked a special milestone with a lively gate event at <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/company/adm-aeroports-de-montreal?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>ADM A&#xE9;roports de Montr&#xE9;al</a> to inaugurate our very first flight to <a class="link" href="https://cl.linkedin.com/company/aeropuerto-santiago?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Aeropuerto Santiago de Chile</a>.&#xA0;

Our passengers, partners and employees gathered to celebrate with music, treats, and plenty of smiles.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
A special thank you to <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/yves-beauchamp-5ab82110/en?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Yves Beauchamp</a>, President and CEO of Montreal Airports, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/sorayamartinezferrada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Soraya Martinez Ferrada</a>, Montreal&apos;s mayor, His Excellency <a class="link" href="https://cl.linkedin.com/in/juan-carlos-garc%C3%ADa-p%C3%A9rez-de-arce-32a11b2a?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Juan Carlos Garc&#xED;a P&#xE9;rez de Arce</a>, Ambassador of the Republic of Chile in Canada, <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/felipe-orellana-650344163?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Felipe Orellana</a>, Consulate General of Chile in Montreal and <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/manuela-goya-ab80b379?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Manuela Goya</a>, from Tourisme Montr&#xE9;al for accepting our invitation.

Thanks to this new route, we&#x2019;re connecting cultures, families, and adventures. And from all of us: bienvenido a bordo, welcome on board, bienvenue &#xE0; bord!
&#xA0;
