En savoir plus: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/eqCpGdzu?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/eqCpGdzu</a>","time":"3w","title":"Air Canada","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQEZyowvTlnbog/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsPZJE0HgDU-/0/1765489820376?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ttm-9DuIBFfImbG0diL-9YD0qnkLu7uM0efFWQm7_yc","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQEZyowvTlnbog/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsPZJE0HgC8-/0/1765489820376?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=IVdr1EOjImRIFndcMye5ElmZb8GPMx98KRWmjgYmnXQ"]},{"comments_count":3,"date":"2025-05-19T00:01:13.010Z","likes_count":176,"post_id":"7404896205727739904","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/air-canada_a220-activity-7404896205727739904-P57l","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":"2025-12-15T00:01:13.010Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["3w"],"repost_id":"7404688541030567936","repost_text":"Here it is! Episode 3 of the #A220 mini-series with Air Canada ! 🚀 We are very honoured to have collaborated with Air Canada on this episode, which highlights their fleet and network strategy. Take note as Air Canada's Chief Commercial Officer Mark Galardo and VP of Network Planning Alexandre Lefèvre reveal their strategy for success. The key takeaway for me is how the #A220 has delivered the superior range, premium cabin offer and the exceptional economics required to revolutionise Air Canada's connecting flights across North America. Hear firsthand from the leadership team why the #A220 is the essential driver for versatile fleet profitability. Missed previous episodes? Catch up here 👇 https://lnkd.in/efDBnZX3 📅 Stay tuned for the last episode available next week on YouTube!","repost_title":"Joost van der Heijden","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/air-canada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Air Canada"}],"tagged_users":[{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/mark-galardo-7642477?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Mark Galardo"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/alexandrelefevre?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Alexandre Lefèvre"}],"videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQBw-/0/1765415300151?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=j0zsnaPq-Qe5-1iDNPppCNTG5g3WOucHwWlm0KKZ1C0","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQCI-/0/1765415318807?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3-2C6kWjiouK7RMI4IYpaiLRnNQQ0WjiyHlZWjR_tRo"]},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"The Airbus #A220 is the cornerstone of Air Canada’s narrowbody fleet renewal, and it’s an aircraft that has unlocked many opportunities for the airline. The A220 gives customers a widebody feel on a narrowbody aircraft and “it is one of the best narrowbody passenger experiences out there,” said Mark Galardo Executive Vice President and Chief Commercial Officer, and President, Cargo at Air Canada. Air Canada recently took possession of FIN 140, the 40th A220 to join the Air Canada fleet, with 25 more on the way.","text_html":"The <a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/airbusgroup?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Airbus</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fa220&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#A220</a> is the cornerstone of Air Canada&#x2019;s narrowbody fleet renewal, and it&#x2019;s an aircraft that has unlocked many opportunities for the airline. The A220 gives customers a widebody feel on a narrowbody aircraft and &#x201C;it is one of the best narrowbody passenger experiences out there,&#x201D; said <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/mark-galardo-7642477?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mark Galardo</a> Executive Vice President and Chief Commercial Officer, and President, Cargo at Air Canada.

Air Canada recently took possession of FIN 140, the 40th&#xA0;A220 to join the Air Canada fleet, with 25 more on the way.&#xA0;","time":"3w 3w","title":"Air Canada","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQBw-/0/1765415300151?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=j0zsnaPq-Qe5-1iDNPppCNTG5g3WOucHwWlm0KKZ1C0","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQCI-/0/1765415318807?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3-2C6kWjiouK7RMI4IYpaiLRnNQQ0WjiyHlZWjR_tRo"]},{"comments_count":6,"date":"2025-05-19T00:01:13.015Z","likes_count":328,"post_id":"7404896042988621824","post_url":"https://fr.linkedin.com/posts/air-canada_a220-activity-7404896042988621824-ldYC","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":"2025-12-15T00:01:13.015Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["3w"],"repost_id":"7404688541030567936","repost_text":"Here it is! Episode 3 of the #A220 mini-series with Air Canada ! 🚀 We are very honoured to have collaborated with Air Canada on this episode, which highlights their fleet and network strategy. Take note as Air Canada's Chief Commercial Officer Mark Galardo and VP of Network Planning Alexandre Lefèvre reveal their strategy for success. The key takeaway for me is how the #A220 has delivered the superior range, premium cabin offer and the exceptional economics required to revolutionise Air Canada's connecting flights across North America. Hear firsthand from the leadership team why the #A220 is the essential driver for versatile fleet profitability. Missed previous episodes? Catch up here 👇 https://lnkd.in/efDBnZX3 📅 Stay tuned for the last episode available next week on YouTube!","repost_title":"Joost van der Heijden","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/air-canada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Air Canada"}],"tagged_users":[{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/mark-galardo-7642477?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Mark Galardo"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/alexandrelefevre?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Alexandre Lefèvre"}],"videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQBw-/0/1765415300151?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=j0zsnaPq-Qe5-1iDNPppCNTG5g3WOucHwWlm0KKZ1C0","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQCI-/0/1765415318807?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3-2C6kWjiouK7RMI4IYpaiLRnNQQ0WjiyHlZWjR_tRo"]},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"L’ #A220 d' Airbus , qui a permis à notre entreprise de profiter de nombreuses occasions, est au cœur du renouvellement de la flotte de monocouloirs d’Air Canada. Cet appareil monocouloir procure aux clients la sensation d’être à bord d’un gros-porteur et constitue « l’une des meilleures expériences disponibles pour le passager à bord d’un monocouloir », commente Mark Galardo , vice-président général et chef des Affaires commerciales, et président – Fret à Air Canada. Air Canada a récemment réceptionné l’appareil numéro 140, le 40e A220 à se joindre à la flotte d’Air Canada, qui en attend 25 autres.","text_html":"L&#x2019;<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fa220&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#A220</a> d&apos;<a class="link" href="https://fr.linkedin.com/company/airbusgroup?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Airbus</a>, qui a permis &#xE0; notre entreprise de profiter de nombreuses occasions, est au c&#x153;ur du renouvellement de la flotte de monocouloirs d&#x2019;Air&#xA0;Canada. Cet appareil monocouloir procure aux clients la sensation d&#x2019;&#xEA;tre &#xE0; bord d&#x2019;un gros-porteur et constitue &#xAB;&#xA0;l&#x2019;une des meilleures exp&#xE9;riences disponibles pour le passager &#xE0; bord d&#x2019;un monocouloir&#xA0;&#xBB;, commente <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/mark-galardo-7642477?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Mark Galardo</a>, vice-pr&#xE9;sident g&#xE9;n&#xE9;ral et chef des Affaires commerciales, et pr&#xE9;sident&#xA0;&#x2013; Fret &#xE0; Air&#xA0;Canada.

Air&#xA0;Canada a r&#xE9;cemment r&#xE9;ceptionn&#xE9; l&#x2019;appareil num&#xE9;ro&#xA0;140, le 40e&#xA0;A220 &#xE0; se joindre &#xE0; la flotte d&#x2019;Air&#xA0;Canada, qui en attend 25&#xA0;autres.","time":"3w Edited 3w","title":"Air Canada","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQBw-/0/1765415300151?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=j0zsnaPq-Qe5-1iDNPppCNTG5g3WOucHwWlm0KKZ1C0","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4E05AQF_yNKiDQmK3g/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4EZsK8zvmGQCI-/0/1765415318807?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=3-2C6kWjiouK7RMI4IYpaiLRnNQQ0WjiyHlZWjR_tRo"]},{"comments_count":7,"date":"2025-12-15T00:01:13.017Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQFk95dTU6gqTA/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZsIuhZoKoAg-/0/1765377972197?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Sv3CMX_9K9M763KjmUd4MGah3RExGByUBYkrhOfsjl0"],"likes_count":100,"post_id":"7404565602339823616","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/air-canada_aircanada-releases-2024-sustainability-report-activity-7404565602339823616-9VUm","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Air Canada releases 2024 sustainability report Air Canada has released its 2024 edition of Citizens of the World and Climate-related financial disclosures (TCFD), detailing the airline’s approach, commitments and progress regarding its environmental, social and governance activities and performance throughout the year. Visit Air Canada’s new Responsibility site to download the report: https://lnkd.in/ewyfuXfd Commenting on the report, Michael Rousseau, President and Chief Executive Officer at Air Canada, said: “We are Canada’s flag carrier and take great pride in connecting people together safely and in pursuing initiatives to manage the environmental footprint of our operations. This report highlights our achievements during the year while outlining our ambitions forward. We are prioritizing key sustainability focus areas and working to achieve our goals and objectives, mindful of stakeholder expectations. “People are at the centre of our business. Our employees serve our customers with care and class, and we ensure they have the tools and resources to succeed and thrive. We strive to create a positive impact on the communities we serve and we are pursuing our long-term aspiration to reduce our environmental footprint with several initiatives.”","text_html":"Air&#xA0;Canada releases 2024 sustainability report

Air Canada has released its 2024 edition of Citizens of the World and Climate-related financial disclosures (TCFD), detailing the airline&#x2019;s approach, commitments and progress regarding its environmental, social and governance activities and performance throughout the year. 

Visit Air Canada&#x2019;s new Responsibility site to download the report: <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/ewyfuXfd?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/ewyfuXfd</a>

Commenting on the report, Michael Rousseau, President and Chief Executive Officer at Air Canada, said: &#x201C;We are Canada&#x2019;s flag carrier and take great pride in connecting people together safely and in pursuing initiatives to manage the environmental footprint of our operations. This report highlights our achievements during the year while outlining our ambitions forward. We are prioritizing key sustainability focus areas and working to achieve our goals and objectives, mindful of stakeholder expectations.

&#x201C;People are at the centre of our business. Our employees serve our customers with care and class, and we ensure they have the tools and resources to succeed and thrive. We strive to create a positive impact on the communities we serve and we are pursuing our long-term aspiration to reduce our environmental footprint with several initiatives.&#x201D;","time":"3w","title":"Air Canada"}]

[{"comments_count":18,"date":"2025-12-03T14:01:09.081Z","external_link":"https://www.linkedin.com/login?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Elinkedin%2Ecom%2Fvideo%2Flive%2Furn%3Ali%3AugcPost%3A7398737381237100545&trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_feed-live-video-content","likes_count":168,"post_id":"7398737383195619328","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cgi_harnessing-technology-for-nature-and-climate-activity-7398737383195619328-weR2","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Join us with Department for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs , UNIDO and United Nations Environment Programme Finance Initiative (UNEP FI) to unpack the innovations shaping the future of environmental action.","text_html":"Join us with <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/company/defra?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Department for Environment, Food and Rural Affairs</a>, <a class="link" href="https://at.linkedin.com/company/unido?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>UNIDO</a> and <a class="link" href="https://ch.linkedin.com/company/united-nations-environment-programme-finance-initiative?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>United Nations Environment Programme Finance Initiative (UNEP FI)</a> to&#xA0;unpack the innovations shaping the future of environmental action. ","time":"1mo Edited","title":"CGI"},{"comments_count":8,"date":"2017-11-15T14:01:09.087Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGLJSFkJwHMjg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZXLPNJzGgAg-/0/1742871516444?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=vW8k8LaPomwtTpetR7-lsEjbm_eYfCjn0pYMhSX9lpA"],"likes_count":101,"post_id":"7311075297221611521","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cgi_were-honored-to-sponsor-the-north-star-award-activity-7311075297221611521-JGyN","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGLJSFkJwHMjg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZXLPNJzGgAg-/0/1742871516444?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=vW8k8LaPomwtTpetR7-lsEjbm_eYfCjn0pYMhSX9lpA"],"repost_date":"2025-04-07T14:01:09.087Z","repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":["2,436 followers"],"repost_id":"7310132980423798784","repost_text":"The Policy Insights Forum (PIF) is pleased to announce that CGI Inc. will serve as ‘Title Sponsor, of the 2025 North Star Award Gala Dinner, taking place on May 22, 2025, at the Fairmont Château Laurier in Ottawa. This year, we are honoured to recognize Stephen Poloz , former Governor of the Bank of Canada , for his exceptional contributions to Canada’s economic growth and public policy leadership. As part of its sponsorship, CGI’s generous support will fund three prestigious internships established in honour of Mr. Poloz. These internships, administered by PIF in collaboration with select Government of Canada departments and agencies, are designed to empower the next generation of Canadian policy leaders—with Mr. Poloz personally serving as mentor. We are deeply grateful to CGI and Executive Chair Julie Godin for their shared commitment to nurturing Canadian talent and fostering future leadership in public service. Join us in celebrating this milestone event and Canada’s policy excellence: https://lnkd.in/eQMC2pfw #PolicyLeadership #NorthStarAward #StephenPoloz #CGI #PublicPolicy #Mentorship #Innovation #Canada #PolicyInsightsForum","repost_title":"Policy Insights Forum","repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":[{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/policy-insights?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Policy Insights Forum"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/cgi?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"CGI"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/fairmont-chateau-laurier?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Fairmont Château Laurier"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/bank-of-canada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Bank of Canada"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/company/government-of-canada?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Government of Canada"}],"tagged_users":[{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/stephen-poloz-b3072a210?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Stephen Poloz"},{"link":"https://ca.linkedin.com/in/julie-godin?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card_reshare-text","name":"Julie Godin"}],"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"We're honored to sponsor the North Star Award Gala, celebrating Stephen Poloz ’s lasting impact on Canada’s economy and his commitment to mentorship.","text_html":"We&apos;re honored to sponsor the North Star Award Gala, celebrating <a class="link" href="https://ca.linkedin.com/in/stephen-poloz-b3072a210?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Stephen Poloz</a>&#x2019;s lasting impact on Canada&#x2019;s economy and his commitment to mentorship.","time":"9mo 9mo","title":"CGI"},{"comments_count":1,"date":"2025-04-07T14:01:09.090Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D10AQHKt-zTuwPh4Q/image-shrink_1280/B4DZXRyZpUG8AM-/0/1742981405804?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=yIX9HUSlL7ZD9Ai3-C0JPMIS_ywczMm-_-wp8OIJNxc"],"likes_count":185,"post_id":"7310593889667575808","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/cgi_cgiseeds-cgiuk-sustainabletech-activity-7310593889667575808-mtP6","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Technology leaders have a powerful opportunity to make a difference by reducing carbon emissions from the ICT sector. In collaboration with the University of Leicester through our #CGISEEDS programme, we've developed a practical Green Software Guide to help drive sustainable software practices. The guide provides actionable steps covering everything from purchasing and development to optimisation and deployment—empowering organisations to align their tech strategies with global sustainability goals. Download the guide – https://bit.ly/3D9bE8q #CGIUK #SustainableTech #GreenSoftware #Sustainability","text_html":"Technology leaders have a powerful opportunity to make a difference by reducing carbon emissions from the ICT sector. In collaboration with the <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/school/university-of-leicester/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>University of Leicester</a> through our <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fcgiseeds&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#CGISEEDS</a> programme, we&apos;ve developed a practical Green Software Guide to help drive sustainable software practices.

The guide provides actionable steps covering everything from purchasing and development to optimisation and deployment&#x2014;empowering organisations to align their tech strategies with global sustainability goals.

Download the guide &#x2013; <a class="link" href="https://bit.ly/3D9bE8q?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://bit.ly/3D9bE8q</a>  

