o those who served our country. Their legacy serves as a powerful reminder of the importance of unity, respect, and service to others. Member FDIC","text_html":"On December 13th, Vantage Bank was honored to participate in Wreaths Across America events in San Antonio and the Rio Grande Valley. Our SA and RGV Impact Teams joined fellow community volunteers to lay wreaths in tribute to our nation&#x2019;s veterans&#x2014;honoring their service, sacrifice, and lasting legacy.&#xA0;
&#xA0;
This meaningful initiative, centered on remembrance and gratitude, reflects our continued commitment to community engagement and service. We are grateful to everyone who participated and helped us pay tribute to those who served our country. Their legacy serves as a powerful reminder of the importance of unity, respect, and service to others.&#xA0;
