on&#xA0;&#x1F6D2;&#x1F383;

This October, Lidl US is brewing up something&#xA0;&#x2014;our brand-new&#xA0;Herndon store is officially open!

As Lidl US Store Manager, Welly Aly said, &#x201C;We couldn&#x2019;t be more excited to open our new store in Herndon. We&#x2019;re so happy to be able to support this community!&#x201D;

From frightfully good deals to boo-tifully fresh produce, we&#x2019;ve got everything you need to stock up for spooky season and beyond. &#x1F47B;&#x1F34E;&#x1F36C;

A special thank you to Herndon Mayor Kevin LeBlanc for helping us celebrate!

&#x1F4CD;&#xA0;Now open in Herndon, VA!

