or a first-time Yonkers shopper, we can’t wait to welcome you in!” – Yonkers Lidl US Store Manager, Eddie Wheeler 🟡 “We are so proud to have opened today, and we’re excited to meet our new customers!” – Smoketown Station Lidl US Store Manager, Kevin Seneck 🔴 “West Midtown, we are ready for you!!” – West Midtown Lidl US Store Manager, Shatara Jackson A special thank you to everyone who joined us for the celebrations, especially Mayor Dickens in Atlanta and Mayor Spano in Yonkers! And finally, a massive thank you to our exceptional store teams for bringing these three locations to life! 💙❤️💛 #TeamLidlUS #GrandOpening","text_html":"&#x1F389;&#xA0;Yonkers, West Midtown and Woodbridge, Grab Your Carts!&#xA0;&#x1F6D2;&#x1F389;

We officially opened our doors in&#xA0;Yonkers, Atlanta&#x2019;s West Midtown and Woodbridge&#x2019;s Smoketown Station today&#x2014;and we couldn&#x2019;t be more excited to join these three amazing communities!

From fresh produce to unbeatable prices, our new Lidl US stores are stocked, staffed, and ready to serve. Just ask our store leaders!

&#x1F535; &#x201C;Whether you&apos;re a longtime fan or a first-time Yonkers shopper, we can&#x2019;t wait to welcome you in!&#x201D; &#x2013; Yonkers Lidl US Store Manager, Eddie Wheeler

&#x1F7E1; &#x201C;We are so proud to have opened today, and we&#x2019;re excited to meet our new customers!&#x201D; &#x2013; Smoketown Station Lidl US Store Manager, Kevin Seneck

&#x1F534; &#x201C;West Midtown, we are ready for you!!&#x201D; &#x2013; West Midtown Lidl US Store Manager, Shatara Jackson

A special thank you to everyone who joined us for the celebrations, especially Mayor Dickens in Atlanta and Mayor Spano in Yonkers! 

And finally, a massive thank you to our exceptional store teams for bringing these three locations to life! &#x1F499;&#x2764;&#xFE0F;&#x1F49B; 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fteamlidlus&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TeamLidlUS</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgrandopening&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GrandOpening</a>","time":"2mo","title":"Lidl US"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-11-03T14:03:21.713Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/sync/v2/D4E27AQFywRtRFF6EXQ/articleshare-shrink_800/B4EZnmyzgQIIAI-/0/1760513702335?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=d3EO57hN4A4EImjB_ouoYKyFvFAOWbmsPrY12gmP0yw"],"likes_count":55,"post_id":"7386066093397733376","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/lidl-us_progressive-grocer-reveals-the-2025-gennext-activity-7386066093397733376-x4Po","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"🎉 Congratulations Lidl US GenNext Winners! 🎉 We are thrilled to announce TWO winners of Progressive Grocer 's 2025 GenNext Awards, Sarwan Ebrahimkhel and Roy De Leon! 🛒 Sarwan, a Learning and Development Manager, was nominated for his reliability, organization and structure. 🛒 Roy, a Category Management Specialist, was nominated for his dedication, persistence and flexibility. Congratulations to you both on an incredible achievement. We are so proud to have you as part of Lidl US! 👏 👏 https://lnkd.in/eKm_Suc4 #TeamLidlUS","text_html":"&#x1F389; Congratulations Lidl US GenNext Winners! &#x1F389;

We are thrilled to announce TWO winners of <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/progressive-grocer?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Progressive Grocer</a>&apos;s 2025 GenNext Awards, Sarwan Ebrahimkhel and Roy De Leon!

&#x1F6D2; Sarwan, a Learning and Development Manager, was nominated for his reliability, organization and structure. 

&#x1F6D2; Roy, a Category Management Specialist, was nominated for his dedication, persistence and flexibility. 

Congratulations to you both on an incredible achievement. We are so proud to have you as part of Lidl US! &#x1F44F; &#x1F44F;

