<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fteamlidlus&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#TeamLidlUS</a>","time":"2mo","title":"Lidl US"},{"comments_count":5,"date":"2025-10-04T14:03:21.717Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHqAW1zkLYxkA/feedshare-shrink_2048_1536/B4EZmgETKEIMA0-/0/1759327110111?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=Zk3E90hAO5NvhtGXBczAwBfFwxRjv3ujSgX4Xc1GBcs","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQHn3NYNFS_gTg/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZmgETJFIwAg-/0/1759327109439?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=64moM5EQ8wWg_UjtDqdEEjf-aUliNLDjco_uQFiwWvs","https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQG4nCKZ2AEdBQ/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZmgETJtIkAg-/0/1759327109887?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=geTLbiwiCykF_o3PglyHLBO30C2XHUeePMbLKIWvUSQ"],"likes_count":249,"post_id":"7379153359083151360","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7379153359083151360/","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Thank you to Ben Miller and the entire Groceryshop team for the opportunity to speak at #GroceryShop2025 . It was a great chance to reflect on the progress we've made at Lidl US over the past few years and share where we're headed next. Our focus remains clear: delivering high-quality products at unbeatable prices, strengthening our supplier partnerships and continuing to enhance the in-store experience for our customers. All of which we couldn’t do without the dedication and determination of our Lidl US Team Members! #TeamLidlUS","text_html":"Thank you to <a class="link" href="https://uk.linkedin.com/in/benmillershoptalk?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Ben Miller</a> and the entire <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/groceryshop?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Groceryshop</a> team for the opportunity to speak at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fgroceryshop2025&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#GroceryShop2025</a>. It was a great chance to reflect on the progress we&apos;ve made at <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/lidl-us?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Lidl US</a> over the past few years and share where we&apos;re headed next. 
&#xA0;
Our focus remains clear: delivering high-quality products at unbeatable prices, strengthening our supplier partnerships and continuing to enhance the in-store experience for our customers. All of which we couldn&#x2019;t do without the dedication and determination of our Lidl US Team Members!
&#xA0;
