is move, as well as the planning, coordination and precision required throughout the operation. Learn more about our Project Cargo solutions → msc.com/project #msccargo #project","text_html":"Eight breakbulk packages. 364 tonnes. From India to the US. &#x1F3D7;&#xFE0F;&#x1F6A2;

We recently transported eight breakbulk units from New Mangalore to Baltimore. The units will be used for a modular distillation and dehydration plant in Michigan, a facility that converts feedstock into ethanol suitable for blending with gasoline.

The video captures the discharge in Baltimore and gives a sense of the scale of this move, as well as the planning, coordination and precision required throughout the operation.

