diterranean-shipping-co--s-a-_msccargo-trade-activity-7404540247377682432-VXAk","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"Strengthening Spain’s direct connection to Latin America and the Caribbean 🇪🇸→🌎 We are enhancing our NWC–USA–SAWC service with a new direct call at Bilbao, giving exporters in northern Spain seamless access to major markets in the Caribbean, Central America and the West Coast of South America. From Bilbao, customers can benefit from highly competitive transit times, including 16 days to Caucedo, 19 to Cartagena, 21 to Cristobal and 26 to Callao. The first vessel on the updated rotation will be MSC Carole, calling at Bilbao on 20 December. Learn more → https://lnkd.in/ekrWwhxp #msccargo #trade","text_html":"Strengthening Spain&#x2019;s direct connection to Latin America and the Caribbean &#x1F1EA;&#x1F1F8;&#x2192;&#x1F30E;

We are enhancing our NWC&#x2013;USA&#x2013;SAWC service with a new direct call at Bilbao, giving exporters in northern Spain seamless access to major markets in the Caribbean, Central America and the West Coast of South America.

From Bilbao, customers can benefit from highly competitive transit times, including 16 days to Caucedo, 19 to Cartagena, 21 to Cristobal and 26 to Callao.

The first vessel on the updated rotation will be MSC Carole, calling at Bilbao on 20 December.

