We recently moved a 211 tonne unit from Antwerp to Houston on board MSC Anshika VI.

The operation in Houston was impressive. After the discharge by floating crane, the cargo was moved by barge and then lifted again onto a railcar using the same crane for its final inland journey.

Each step required close coordination between our vessel team, terminal partners and project cargo specialists.

Well done to everyone involved &#x1F4AA;

