<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmsccargo&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#msccargo</a> <a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fproject&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#project</a>","time":"1mo","title":"MSC Mediterranean Shipping Company","videos":["https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQGBYeFEk6UULA/mp4-720p-30fp-crf28/B4DZrjb3IxIMCE-/0/1764752342020?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=g44Fq_6SNcyQmxjouscY0IiLVuge14bzOH4BF1Qbr8o","https://dms.licdn.com/playlist/vid/v2/D4D05AQGBYeFEk6UULA/mp4-640p-30fp-crf28/B4DZrjb3IxIMBs-/0/1764752331657?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=ySYISxmRk1uvueoZWROEadLI99tpvJo4-zVhQy2U0Z8"]},{"comments_count":17,"date":"2025-12-03T13:58:25.013Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQFiBbkdIDFNOw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4DZrLRwoIG8Ag-/0/1764347025222?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=f_1mP0xK3oI2dZVhIDIDTaNnOC4OWx2pmsmFc1cm3jk"],"likes_count":789,"post_id":"7400207791811891201","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/msc-mediterranean-shipping-co--s-a-_msccargo-activity-7400207791811891201-P6PJ","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A proud moment for MSC in Hamburg ⚓ 💛 On Thursday evening, MSC received the HANSA Maritime Excellence Award 2025 at the HANSA Forum, held at the International Maritime Museum. MSC Germany Managing Director Nils Kahn accepted the award on behalf of the company. This is the first time we have been honoured with this recognition. The award is decided by the editorial board of HANSA magazine based on their independent assessment of developments that have shaped the maritime sector. The jury highlighted MSC’s long-term investment strategy, including the continued expansion and modernisation of our fleet, which has helped us provide reliable service for customers during challenging market conditions. They also noted MSC Group’s investment in HHLA and our support for the future development of Germany’s largest seaport. We thank the HANSA team for this recognition. Read more → https://lnkd.in/dpy3TFqf #msccargo HANSA FORUM","text_html":"A proud moment for MSC in Hamburg &#x2693; &#x1F49B;

On Thursday evening, MSC received the HANSA Maritime Excellence Award 2025 at the HANSA Forum, held at the International Maritime Museum. MSC Germany Managing Director <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/in/nils-kahn?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Nils Kahn</a> accepted the award on behalf of the company.

This is the first time we have been honoured with this recognition. The award is decided by the editorial board of HANSA magazine based on their independent assessment of developments that have shaped the maritime sector.

The jury highlighted MSC&#x2019;s long-term investment strategy, including the continued expansion and modernisation of our fleet, which has helped us provide reliable service for customers during challenging market conditions. They also noted MSC Group&#x2019;s investment in HHLA and our support for the future development of Germany&#x2019;s largest seaport.

We thank the HANSA team for this recognition.

Read more &#x2192; <a class="link" href="https://lnkd.in/dpy3TFqf?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" rel="nofollow" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>https://lnkd.in/dpy3TFqf</a> 

<a class="link" href="https://www.linkedin.com/signup/cold-join?session_redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Ffeed%2Fhashtag%2Fmsccargo&amp;trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>#msccargo</a> <a class="link" href="https://de.linkedin.com/showcase/hansa-forum/?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>HANSA FORUM</a>","time":"1mo","title":"MSC Mediterranean Shipping Company"},{"comments_count":32,"date":"2025-12-03T13:58:25.016Z","images":["https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4D22AQHWOK2yjG0V4w/feedshare-shrink_800/B4DZq_dbSkGgAg-/0/1764148755477?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=WVKdH5bd9Gcz4-uway1Gn1g7aNJF3qJVAo8sbWVwCiw"],"likes_count":2725,"post_id":"7399376186587512832","post_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/msc-mediterranean-shipping-co--s-a-_msccargo-trade-activity-7399376186587512832-nv3U","repost":{"external_links":null,"images":null,"repost_date":null,"repost_followers":null,"repost_hangtags":null,"repost_id":null,"repost_text":null,"repost_title":null,"repost_url":null,"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_users":null,"videos":null},"tagged_companies":null,"tagged_people":null,"text":"A big step to boost Bangladesh’s trade connectivity 🇧🇩 ⚓ MEDLOG, part of the MSC Group, has signed a new concession agreement to operate the Pangaon Inland Container Terminal (PICT) near Dhaka. The terminal is located on the Buriganga River and will help shift cargo from congested roads to low emission inland waterways. Under the agreement, MEDLOG will expand capacity to 160,000 TEUs per year and strengthen barge links to other river terminals and seaports. During a recent visit to Geneva, His Excellency Mr. Hussain, Shipping Advisor for Bangladesh, met with CEO Soren Toft to discuss the importance of sustainable inland logistics. Read more → https://lnkd.in/dxeCTb42 #msccargo #trade","text_html":"A big step to boost Bangladesh&#x2019;s trade connectivity &#x1F1E7;&#x1F1E9; &#x2693;

MEDLOG, part of the MSC Group, has signed a new concession agreement to operate the Pangaon Inland Container Terminal (PICT) near Dhaka.

The terminal is located on the Buriganga River and will help shift cargo from congested roads to low emission inland waterways. Under the agreement, MEDLOG will expand capacity to 160,000 TEUs per year and strengthen barge links to other river terminals and seaports.

During a recent visit to Geneva, His Excellency Mr. Hussain, Shipping Advisor for Bangladesh, met with CEO <a class="link" href="https://ch.linkedin.com/in/soren-toft?trk=organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" target="_self" data-tracking-control-name="organization_guest_main-feed-card-text" data-tracking-will-navigate>Soren Toft</a> to discuss the importance of sustainable inland logistics.

